(10, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 994, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Saima Prestige Park by Saima Group\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Saima Prestige Park is an upcoming residential and commercial plotting project associated with Saima Group, located on Memon Goth Road near Malir 15, Gadap Town, Karachi. The development is planned across approximately 24 acres, with around 300 plots according to available project information.<\\\\\\/p><p>The project offers residential plot categories, including 120, 175, and 240 square yards, with commercial plots also indicated in the available layout information. Its proposed development focuses on residential planning, road infrastructure, green spaces, and community facilities.<\\\\\\/p><p>Saima Prestige Park Karachi is positioned for buyers interested in residential land ownership and property investment through an installment-based payment structure. However, buyers should verify the latest availability, approved layout, and official documentation directly through the developer\'s authorised sales channel before making a booking decision.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794223602_6af1adf222153.jpg\\\",\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Saima Prestige Park by Saima Group\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>\\\\u00a0test<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794223602_6af1adf222153.jpg\\\",\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'http://127.0.0.1:8000/admin/projects/58', '127.0.0.1', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-11 05:40:34', '2026-11-11 05:40:34'),
