\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Contact AA Builders & Developers at [phone\\\\\\/website] and ask to see the site, the plan approvals and the booking agreement.\\\"}]\"}', 'https://saimaprojects.com/admin/blogs/8', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-11 12:09:00', '2026-11-11 12:09:00'),
