icated safe space for children.<\\/li><li>Fully Equipped Gym \\u2013 Fitness facility for residents.<\\/li><li>40-Acre Gated Community \\u2013 Premium residential and commercial development.<\\/li><li>Dedicated Parking \\u2013 Four floors allocated for covered parking.<\\/li><li>Commercial Showrooms \\u2013 Commercial activity within the development.<\\/li><li>Exclusive Amenities Floor \\u2013 Dedicated lifestyle and recreational facilities.<\\/li><li>48-Months Payment Plan \\u2013 Flexible installment option.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"}', 'https://saimaprojects.com/admin/projects/35', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-12 14:32:43', '2026-11-12 14:32:43');
