(383, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 4, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Investment Potential\\\",\\\"location_badge\\\":\\\"Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>FS Real Estate Advisory offers real estate investment opportunities in Pakistan through its residential and commercial properties. With a range of properties designed for different buyer needs, FS Advisory may appeal to investors looking for long-term property value and potential rental income. Buyers should review each property\'s location, construction progress, payment plan, and legal status before investing<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"highlights_heading\\\":\\\"Key Investment Highlights:\\\",\\\"investment_highlights\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Residential and commercial property options in Karachi\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Multiple projects in different areas of the city\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Property options for homebuyers and investors\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Potential rental income from suitable properties\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Opportunity for long-term property value growth\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Options for different budgets and investment goals\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Convenient access to local facilities, depending on the project location\\\"}],\\\"cta\\\":\\\"Contact a Property Investment Consultant\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1793193748_6ae1f714366a5.webp\\\",\\\"image_alt\\\":\\\"Hudayriyat Island Investment Potential\\\",\\\"financing_highlights\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Investment Potential\\\",\\\"location_badge\\\":\\\"Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>FS Real Estate Advisory offers real estate investment opportunities in Pakistan through its residential and commercial properties. With a range of properties designed for different buyer needs, FS Advisory may appeal to investors looking for long-term property value and potential rental income. Buyers should review each property\'s location, construction progress, payment plan, and legal status before investing<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"highlights_heading\\\":\\\"Key Investment Highlights:\\\",\\\"investment_highlights\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Residential and commercial property options in Pakistan\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Multiple projects in different areas of the city\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Property options for homebuyers and investors\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Potential rental income from suitable properties\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Opportunity for long-term property value growth\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Options for different budgets and investment goals\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Convenient access to local facilities, depending on the project location\\\"}],\\\"cta\\\":\\\"Contact a Property Investment Consultant\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1793193748_6ae1f714366a5.webp\\\",\\\"image_alt\\\":\\\"Hudayriyat Island Investment Potential\\\",\\\"financing_highlights\\\":[]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/1', '151.123.246.100', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 19:32:13', '2026-11-13 19:32:13'),
(384, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 14, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Saima Builders and Developers Overview and Location\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1793193706_6ae1f6ea118b9.webp\\\",\\\"image_alt\\\":\\\"Hudayriyat Island Investment Potential\\\",\\\"paragraphs\\\":\\\"<p>Saima Builders and Developers offers residential and commercial property options across Karachi, Pakistan. Its projects provide opportunities for homebuyers and investors looking for properties in different parts of the city. Each project has its own location, facilities, and property options to suit different needs.<\\\\\\/p><p>Saima projects are located in various areas of Karachi, giving buyers options based on their preferred neighbourhood, budget, and daily travel needs. Depending on the project location, residents may have access to schools, hospitals, shopping centres, restaurants, public transport, and other essential facilities.<\\\\\\/p><p>Karachi offers access to major business districts, educational institutions, healthcare facilities, and shopping destinations. Buyers can compare individual Saima projects to find a property that suits their lifestyle or investment plans.<br><span style=\\\\\\\"font-family: inherit;\\\\\\\"><br>With a range of property options across Karachi, Saima Builders and Developers provides opportunities for people looking to buy a home or invest in real estate. Before making a decision, buyers should check the exact project location, nearby facilities, construction status, and available payment plans.<\\\\\\/span><\\\\\\/p>\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"heading\\\":\\\"About Fs Advisory\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1793193706_6ae1f6ea118b9.webp\\\",\\\"image_alt\\\":\\\"Hudayriyat Island Investment Potential\\\",\\\"paragraphs\\\":\\\"<p>FS Real Estate and Advisory offers residential and commercial property services across Karachi, Pakistan. Its team helps homebuyers, sellers, tenants and investors looking for properties in different parts of the city. Every client has their own goals, budget and timeline, so each piece of advice is shaped around individual needs.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>FS Real Estate and Advisory works with properties in various areas of Karachi, giving buyers options based on their preferred neighbourhood, budget, and daily travel needs. Depending on the location, residents may have access to schools, hospitals, shopping centres, restaurants, public transport, and other essential facilities.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Karachi offers access to major business districts, educational institutions, healthcare facilities, and shopping destinations. Buyers can compare individual areas and projects with the help of our advisors to find a property that suits their lifestyle or investment plans.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n<p>With a range of property options across Karachi, FS Real Estate and Advisory provides honest guidance for people looking to buy a home or invest in real estate. Before making a decision, buyers should check the exact location, nearby facilities, construction status, ownership documents, and available payment plans. Our team helps verify each of these before any money moves.<\\\\\\/p>\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/1', '151.123.246.100', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 19:37:02', '2026-11-13 19:37:02'),
(385, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 16, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Frequently Asked Questions\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What is Saima Builders and Developers?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Saima Builders and Developers is a real estate developer associated with residential and commercial projects in Karachi, Pakistan.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Where are Saima Builders and Developers projects located?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Saima Builders and Developers has projects in different areas of Karachi. Check each project\'s location to explore nearby facilities and road access.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What types of properties does Saima Builders offer?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Saima Builders offers residential and commercial property options. Available property types depend on the specific project and current inventory.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Are Saima Builders apartments available for sale in Karachi?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Buyers can explore Saima apartment projects in Karachi and confirm available units, prices, sizes, and booking details with the relevant project office.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What are the prices of Saima Builders properties?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Saima Builders property prices vary by project, location, unit size, and property type. Contact the relevant project office for current prices.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Does Saima Builders offer flexible payment plans?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Payment plans vary by project and may include booking payments and instalments. Confirm the current payment schedule with the project representatives.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Does Saima Builders have new projects in Karachi?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Buyers can check Saima Builders\' latest project announcements to explore new developments, available properties, and current booking opportunities.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Is Saima Builders a good option for property investment?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Saima properties may suit investors depending on location, price, rental demand, and market conditions. Review each project before investing.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"How can I book a property with Saima Builders?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Contact the relevant Saima project office to check availability, review payment terms, verify documents, and understand the booking process.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What should I check before buying a Saima Builders property?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Check the property\'s legal status, location, total price, payment plan, construction progress, and expected completion date before making a purchase.\\\"}],\\\"description\\\":null}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Frequently Asked Questions\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What services does FS Real Estate and Advisory offer?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"As real estate agents in Pakistan, we provide buying, selling and renting guidance, investment consultation, location comparison and document verification, including houses for sale in Pakistan and commercial properties.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What are the best areas to live in Karachi?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"DHA, Clifton, Bahria Town, KDA and PECHS are among the most popular choices. The best option depends on your budget, commute, family needs and preferred lifestyle.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"How do I choose between property dealers in Pakistan?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Ask for references, written terms and proof of who they represent. A good dealer or advisor explains risks openly and never pressures you to pay before documents are verified.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Is real estate in Pakistan a good investment?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Property has long been a popular store of value, especially in planned societies with strong demand. Returns vary by location and market conditions, so research and professional advice are important.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Where can I find real estate listings in Karachi that I can trust?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Use online listings as a starting point, then verify ownership, approvals and the seller\'s identity. We can check any listing for you before you pay a token amount on any property for sale in Pakistan.\\\"}],\\\"description\\\":null}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/1', '151.123.246.100', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 19:37:02', '2026-11-13 19:37:02'),
(386, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 5, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"pretitle\\\":\\\"LET\'S CONNECT\\\",\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Invest in Your Future\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Discover residential and commercial properties across Pakistan with Saima Builders and Developers. Connect with our team to explore available projects and find property options that suit your needs.\\\",\\\"form_small\\\":\\\"REQUEST\\\",\\\"form_large\\\":\\\"A CALL BACK\\\",\\\"submit_button\\\":\\\"REQUEST NOW\\\",\\\"bg_image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/form image.jpg\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"pretitle\\\":\\\"LET\'S CONNECT\\\",\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Invest in Your Future\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Discover residential and commercial properties across Pakistan with FS Real Estate and Advisory. Connect with our team to explore available properties and get honest guidance on options that suit your needs.\\\",\\\"form_small\\\":\\\"REQUEST\\\",\\\"form_large\\\":\\\"A CALL BACK\\\",\\\"submit_button\\\":\\\"REQUEST NOW\\\",\\\"bg_image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/form image.jpg\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/1', '151.123.246.100', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 19:37:37', '2026-11-13 19:37:37'),
