(433, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Developer', 7, '{\"tagline\":\"Discover Saima Builders, a trusted name in Pakistan\'s real estate development industry. Explore residential and commercial developments, established communities, ongoing projects and upcoming investment opportunities across Karachi and beyond.\",\"faqs\":\"[]\",\"faq_heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"faq_subtitle\":null}', '{\"tagline\":\"Saima Builders, a trusted name in Pakistan\'s real estate development industry. Explore residential and commercial developments, established communities, ongoing projects and upcoming investment opportunities across Karachi and beyond.\",\"faqs\":\"[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"2. How many years of experience does Saima Builders have?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Saima Builders has more than 40 years of experience in the real estate and construction industry, with a portfolio of residential and commercial developments.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"3. What types of projects does Saima Builders develop?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Saima Builders develops a range of residential and commercial properties, including apartment buildings, high-rise developments, commercial spaces and mixed-use projects.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"4. Where are Saima Builders projects located?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Saima Builders has a diverse property portfolio across Pakistan, with a significant presence in Karachi. Buyers can explore individual project pages to check exact locations and nearby facilities.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"5. How can I explore Saima Builders projects?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"You can explore Saima Builders projects through the developer profile page. Browse the available listings, check project details, review development status and visit individual project pages.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"6. Does Saima Builders have ongoing projects?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Yes, Saima Builders has ongoing real estate developments. You can browse the developer\'s project listings to explore current developments and their latest availability.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"7. Does Saima Builders offer upcoming projects?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Saima Builders has upcoming developments in its project portfolio. Contact a property advisor to learn about new launches, expected availability and project details.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"8. Can I invest in Saima Builders projects?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Yes, buyers and investors can explore residential and commercial investment opportunities offered through Saima Builders projects. Compare project locations, property types, prices and payment plans before making an investment decision.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"9. How can I check prices and payment plans for Saima Builders projects?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"You can visit individual project pages to review available property prices and payment plan details. For updated pricing and availability, contact the relevant property advisor.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"10. How can I contact an advisor about Saima Builders projects?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"You can submit the Register Interest form on the developer profile page. A property advisor can contact you to discuss available projects, property options, prices and investment opportunities.\\\"}]\",\"faq_heading\":\"1. Who is Saima Builders?\",\"faq_subtitle\":\"Saima Builders is an established real estate development and construction company in Pakistan. Founded in 1983, the company has developed residential and commercial properties and built a strong presence in the real estate industry.\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/developers/7', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 20:39:58', '2026-11-13 20:39:58'),
