(450, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1232, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Real Estate Development in Pakistan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>Pakistan\'s real estate development industry plays an important role in the country\'s residential, commercial, and infrastructure landscape. From planned housing societies and residential communities to high-rise apartment developments and commercial projects, developers contribute to the changing urban environment of major Pakistani cities.<\\\\\\/p><p>Real estate developers are responsible for planning, managing, and delivering different types of property development projects. Their work may involve land development, infrastructure planning, residential construction, commercial development, and the creation of integrated communities.<\\\\\\/p><p>Pakistan\'s property development market includes private development companies, construction groups, housing organisations, and public development authorities. Each operates under different responsibilities and regulatory frameworks.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794603115_6af7786b54eb0.jpg\\\",\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Real Estate Development in Pakistan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p><br><\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794603115_6af7786b54eb0.jpg\\\",\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/158', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 20:53:16', '2026-11-13 20:53:16');
