(482, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Developer', 8, '{\"faqs\":\"[]\"}', '{\"faqs\":\"[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"1. Who are AA Builders & Developers?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"AA Builders & Developers is a Karachi-based real estate development and construction company. It focuses on residential and commercial properties, including luxury apartments, high-rise towers and commercial developments.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"2. What types of properties does AA Builders & Developers develop?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"AA Builders & Developers develops various types of real estate projects, including luxury residential apartments, beachfront residences, commercial office spaces, retail developments and high-rise buildings.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"3. Which are the popular projects by AA Builders & Developers?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Some of its notable developments include AA Central, AA Beachfront, AA Waterfront, AA Beverly, AA Boulevard, AA Saffron, AA Tower, AA Residencia and AA Enclave.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"4. Where are AA Builders & Developers projects located?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"AA Builders & Developers has projects in different areas of Karachi, including DHA Phase 8, Clifton, Callachi Housing Society and New Challi. Each project has its own location and development details.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"5. What is AA Central by AA Builders & Developers?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"AA Central is a G+34-floor commercial development located on I.I. Chundrigar Road, New Challi, Karachi. It features commercial office spaces, dedicated parking floors, lifts and rooftop facilities.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"6. What is AA Beachfront by AA Builders & Developers?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"AA Beachfront is a premium residential development located along Karachi\'s beachfront in DHA Phase 8. It offers 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments, luxury duplex residences and lifestyle amenities.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"7. Does AA Builders & Developers offer commercial projects?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Yes, the company\'s commercial development portfolio includes AA Central and AA Saffron. These projects offer commercial office and retail property opportunities in Karachi.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"8. Does AA Builders & Developers have upcoming projects?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Yes, AA Builders & Developers has developments at different stages in its portfolio. AA Enclave is listed as an upcoming residential project, while buyers can explore the individual project listings for further updates.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"9. How can I check prices and payment plans for AA Builders & Developers projects?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"You can visit individual project pages to explore available property options, pricing information and payment plans. For updated prices and availability, contact a property advisor.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"10. How can I invest in AA Builders & Developers projects?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"You can explore the company\'s residential and commercial developments, compare locations and property options, and review available payment plans. You can also register your interest to receive assistance from a property advisor.\\\"}]\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/developers/8', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 21:17:19', '2026-11-13 21:17:19'),
