(484, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'created', 'App\\Models\\Developer', 9, '[]', '{\"name\":\"Emaar Pakistan\",\"slug\":\"emaar-pakistan\",\"h1\":\"Emaar Pakistan\",\"tagline\":\"Discover Emaar Pakistan, a leading name in premium real estate development and master-planned communities.\",\"logo\":\"uploads\\/developers\\/1794605094_logo_images-1-1.svg\",\"cover_image\":\"uploads\\/developers\\/1794605094_cover_60eea2a672859.jpg\",\"og_image\":\"uploads\\/developers\\/1794605094_cover_60eea2a672859.jpg\",\"short_content\":\"<p>Emaar Pakistan is a subsidiary of Emaar Properties PJSC, a globally recognized real estate development company headquartered in Dubai, UAE. The company brings international property development experience to Pakistan through premium residential communities, commercial developments and integrated lifestyle destinations.<\\/p>\",\"full_content\":\"<h2>About Emaar Pakistan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Emaar Pakistan focuses on developing master-planned communities that combine residential properties with essential lifestyle facilities, including shopping, healthcare, education, hospitality, dining and recreational spaces.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The company\'s development portfolio includes two major communities: Emaar Oceanfront in Karachi and Canyon Views in Islamabad. These developments reflect Emaar\'s approach to creating integrated residential environments with contemporary architecture, landscaped spaces and lifestyle amenities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>In Karachi, Emaar Oceanfront represents the company\'s vision of premium waterfront living. Located along the Arabian Sea in DHA Phase 8, this large-scale community features high-rise residential towers, luxury apartments, penthouses and retail opportunities. Its portfolio includes several residential developments designed to offer modern coastal living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>In Islamabad, Canyon Views offers a different residential experience through an expansive gated community featuring villas, townhomes, apartments and residential and commercial plots. The development combines architectural design, green open spaces, security and recreational facilities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Emaar Pakistan continues to introduce new developments and residential opportunities within its established communities. Through its focus on quality, thoughtful planning and integrated lifestyles, the company contributes to the development of Pakistan\'s premium real estate sector.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Project Locations<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Explore Emaar Pakistan\'s property developments across Karachi and Islamabad through our interactive project location map.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Discover Emaar Oceanfront and its residential developments in DHA Phase 8, Karachi. Explore Canyon Views in Islamabad and learn more about its residential and commercial property opportunities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>View project locations, explore surrounding facilities and discover the communities developed by Emaar Pakistan.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Interested in Emaar Pakistan Projects?<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Looking to purchase a luxury apartment, waterfront residence, villa or explore premium real estate investment opportunities?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Connect with our property experts to learn more about Emaar Pakistan developments, available properties, project details and current payment plans.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Register your interest today and receive professional assistance in exploring residential and commercial opportunities.<\\/p>\",\"meta_title\":\"Emaar Pakistan Projects | Luxury Properties in Karachi\",\"meta_description\":\"Emaar Pakistan projects including Emaar Oceanfront, Crescent Bay and Canyon Views. Discover luxury apartments, villas and investment opportunities.\",\"meta_keywords\":\"Emaar Pakistan Projects\",\"canonical_url\":null,\"featured_projects\":\"[]\",\"faqs\":\"[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"1. Who is Emaar Pakistan?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Emaar Pakistan is a subsidiary of Emaar Properties PJSC, a Dubai-based international real estate developer. The company develops premium residential communities, waterfront properties and commercial developments in Pakistan.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"2. Which are the major projects by Emaar Pakistan?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"The major developments by Emaar Pakistan include Emaar Oceanfront in Karachi and Canyon Views in Islamabad. Its portfolio also includes Park Grand, Park Edge, Panorama, The Views, Pearl Towers, Reef Towers and Coral Towers.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"3. Where are Emaar Pakistan projects located?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Emaar Pakistan has major developments in Karachi and Islamabad. Emaar Oceanfront is located in DHA Phase 8, Karachi, while Canyon Views is situated in Islamabad.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"4. What is Emaar Oceanfront in Karachi?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Emaar Oceanfront is a premium waterfront residential community located in DHA Phase 8, Karachi. It features luxury apartments, high-rise towers, penthouses and lifestyle facilities along the Arabian Sea.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"5. What is Canyon Views by Emaar Pakistan?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Canyon Views is a master-planned residential community in Islamabad. It offers villas, townhomes, apartments and residential and commercial plots within a gated environment featuring green spaces and recreational facilities.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"6. Does Emaar Pakistan offer luxury apartments?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Yes, Emaar Pakistan offers luxury apartment developments within Emaar Oceanfront in Karachi. Its residential portfolio includes projects such as Park Grand, Park Edge, Panorama and The Views, along with other developments at Crescent Bay.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"7. What is the difference between Crescent Bay and Emaar Oceanfront?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Crescent Bay is the landmark waterfront master-planned development in DHA Phase 8, Karachi, associated with Emaar\'s Oceanfront community. Emaar Oceanfront is the broader community and branding used for its waterfront residential developments.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"8. Does Emaar Pakistan offer commercial properties?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Yes, Emaar Pakistan\'s portfolio includes commercial and retail opportunities. These include retail developments within Emaar Oceanfront and commercial plots within Canyon Views, subject to current availability.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"9. How can I check Emaar Pakistan property prices and payment plans?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"You can explore individual project pages to review available property types, pricing information and payment plans. For updated prices, availability and booking details, contact an authorized property advisor or Emaar Pakistan.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"10. How can I invest in Emaar Pakistan projects?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"You can explore Emaar Pakistan\'s residential and commercial developments, compare project locations and property options, and review available payment plans. You can also register your interest to receive assistance from a property advisor.\\\"}]\",\"faq_heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"faq_subtitle\":null,\"status\":\"draft\",\"is_active\":false,\"order\":0,\"id\":9}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/developers', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 21:24:54', '2026-11-13 21:24:54'),
