(486, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'created', 'App\\Models\\Developer', 10, '[]', '{\"name\":\"HMR Waterfront\",\"slug\":\"hmr-waterfront\",\"h1\":\"HMR Waterfront Properties\",\"tagline\":\"Discover HMR Waterfront, a premium beachfront residential community in DHA Phase 8, Karachi.\",\"logo\":\"uploads\\/developers\\/1794605415_logo_download.svg\",\"cover_image\":\"uploads\\/developers\\/1794605415_cover_images-6.jpg\",\"og_image\":\"uploads\\/developers\\/1794605415_cover_images-6.jpg\",\"short_content\":\"<p>HMR Waterfront is a premium waterfront residential community developed by HMR Group, led by Haji Muhammad Rafiq Pardesi. Located along the Arabian Sea in DHA Phase 8, Karachi, the development represents a modern approach to luxury residential living, combining contemporary architecture, coastal surroundings and integrated lifestyle facilities.<\\/p>\",\"full_content\":\"<h2>About HMR Waterfront<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>HMR Group has a diverse business background spanning real estate, construction, trading, hospitality and retail. Its leadership traces its business journey to 1982, when Haji Muhammad Rafiq Pardesi joined his family\'s Dubai-based business. In 2015, he founded HMR Group to expand the group\'s diversified business operations and development activities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>HMR Waterfront is designed as a gated beachfront community featuring residential high-rise towers, a commercial business district, landscaped open spaces and recreational facilities. The master-planned development includes fourteen high-rise residential towers, complemented by modern infrastructure and community amenities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The community offers different residential options, including 1, 2, 3 and 4-bedroom apartments, townhouses and luxury penthouses. Its waterfront setting, architectural planning and lifestyle facilities aim to provide residents with a comfortable and connected living environment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>HMR Waterfront also brings together multiple established real estate development partners, including Saima Builders, AA Builders &amp; Developers, Giga Group, H&amp;S Properties, Metro Group and Shayan Iconic Builders. These developers contribute individual residential projects within the larger waterfront community.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>With its coastal location, premium residential developments and integrated commercial facilities, HMR Waterfront represents an important addition to Karachi\'s evolving luxury real estate landscape.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Project Location<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>HMR Waterfront is located along the Arabian Sea in DHA Phase 8, Karachi, Pakistan.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The waterfront community offers access to coastal surroundings and major areas of DHA Karachi. Its location makes it an attractive option for buyers exploring premium residential properties and beachfront apartments.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Explore the interactive map to discover HMR Waterfront, view individual residential developments and understand the location of different projects within the community.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Location Details<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<thead>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<th>Location Attribute<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/thead>\\r\\n<tbody>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Area<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>DHA Phase 8<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>City<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Country<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Pakistan<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Address<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Abdul Sattar Edhi Avenue, DHA Phase 8, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Interested in HMR Waterfront Projects?<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Looking to purchase a luxury apartment, beachfront residence, duplex or penthouse in Karachi?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Explore residential developments within HMR Waterfront and connect with our property experts to learn more about individual projects, available units, developers and payment plans.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Whether you are searching for a family residence or a real estate investment opportunity, our team can help you compare different projects and explore suitable property options.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Register your interest today to receive further information about HMR Waterfront developments.<\\/p>\",\"meta_title\":\"HMR Waterfront Karachi | Luxury Apartments & Residences\",\"meta_description\":\"HMR Waterfront Karachi projects in DHA Phase 8. Discover Saima Mangrove Residences, AA Waterfront, Goldcrest Bay Sands and luxury beachfront apartments.\",\"meta_keywords\":\"HMR Waterfront Karachi\",\"canonical_url\":null,\"featured_projects\":\"[]\",\"faqs\":\"[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"1. What is HMR Waterfront Karachi?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"HMR Waterfront is a premium gated beachfront residential community developed by HMR Group in DHA Phase 8, Karachi. The development features residential towers, luxury apartments, penthouses, commercial facilities and lifestyle amenities overlooking the Arabian Sea.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"2. Who is the developer of HMR Waterfront?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"HMR Waterfront is developed by HMR Group, led by Chairman Haji Muhammad Rafiq Pardesi. The community also features individual residential projects developed by partners such as Saima Builders, AA Builders & Developers, Giga Group, H&S Properties, Metro Group and Shayan Iconic Builders.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"3. Where is HMR Waterfront located?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"HMR Waterfront is located on Abdul Sattar Edhi Avenue, DHA Phase 8, Karachi, along the Arabian Sea. The location offers a premium coastal residential environment within one of Karachi\'s prominent residential areas.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"4. How many towers are in HMR Waterfront?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"According to the DHA Karachi listing, HMR Waterfront is planned as a gated community featuring fourteen high-rise residential towers. The wider development also includes a commercial business tower.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"5. Which projects are available in HMR Waterfront?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Some of the residential developments within HMR Waterfront include Saima Mangrove Residences, AA Waterfront, Goldcrest Bay Sands, Saima Marina Residence, Saima Waterfront, H1 Tower, H&S Residence, Beach Terraces by Metro, Goldcrest Bay Sands II and The Tilt.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"6. Which developers are building projects in HMR Waterfront?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"HMR Waterfront brings together multiple real estate development partners, including HMR Group, Saima Builders, AA Builders & Developers, Giga Group, H&S Properties, Metro Group and Shayan Iconic Builders.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"7. What types of apartments are available in HMR Waterfront?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"HMR Waterfront offers different residential options across its individual developments, including 1, 2, 3 and 4-bedroom apartments, larger 5-bedroom residences, duplex apartments, townhouses and luxury penthouses.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"8. What facilities and amenities does HMR Waterfront offer?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"HMR Waterfront features a range of lifestyle amenities, including an infinity swimming pool, gymnasium, reception lobby, community hall, children\'s play area, retail outlets, parking facilities and 24\\\\\\/7 security. The community also includes landscaped spaces and waterfront walkways.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"9. Is HMR Waterfront a good option for property investment?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"HMR Waterfront offers different residential property options in DHA Phase 8, Karachi. Buyers and investors can compare individual developments based on location, developer, property layout, payment plans and project progress before making an investment decision.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"10. How can I book an apartment in HMR Waterfront?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"You can explore individual residential projects within HMR Waterfront, select your preferred property type and contact a property advisor for current prices, availability, payment plans and booking procedures.\\\"}]\",\"faq_heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"faq_subtitle\":null,\"status\":\"draft\",\"is_active\":false,\"order\":0,\"id\":10}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/developers', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 21:30:15', '2026-11-13 21:30:15'),
