(515, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1251, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"AA Avenue\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"bg_image\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"AA Avenue Karachi \\\\u2013 Residential Apartments in Gulshan-e-Iqbal\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"AA Avenue Karachi \\\\u2013 Residential Apartments in Gulshan-e-Iqbal\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"bg_image\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"bg_image_alt\\\":\\\"AA Avenue Karachi \\\\u2013 Residential Apartments in Gulshan-e-Iqbal\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 21:45:52', '2026-11-13 21:45:52'),
(516, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1253, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"AA Avenue by AA Builders & Developers\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"AA Avenue is a residential apartment project by AA Builders & Developers, located in Block 13-E, Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi. The project is listed as a high-rise development offering 3-bedroom and 4-bedroom lounge apartments for families looking for residential options in an established part of the city.\\\\r\\\\nIts location on Sehba Akhtar Road provides access to the wider Gulshan-e-Iqbal area, including nearby commercial centres, educational institutions, healthcare facilities and major road connections. The project is currently being marketed at the pre-launch stage, with further development and booking details subject to official confirmation from the developer.\\\\r\\\\nFor buyers exploring AA Avenue Karachi, the project offers an opportunity to consider apartment living in a well-established neighbourhood. Interested buyers should obtain the latest project documents, approved plans, unit specifications and official payment schedule before making a booking decision.\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 21:45:52', '2026-11-13 21:45:52'),
(517, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 161, '{\"body\":null}', '{\"body\":\"<h2>About AA Avenue<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>AA Avenue is a residential development associated with AA Builders &amp; Developers in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi. Its location on Sehba Akhtar Road, Block 13-E, places it within an established residential and commercial area with access to everyday facilities and important city routes.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The project is listed with 3-bedroom and 4-bedroom lounge apartment options. These configurations are intended for families looking for additional living space, with separate areas for family activities and guest accommodation. Final layouts, covered areas and specifications should be confirmed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For people comparing residential projects in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, AA Avenue offers a location-focused option from an established Karachi developer. Buyers should review the latest construction status, approved building plans, unit availability and payment terms before proceeding.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<thead>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/thead>\\r\\n<tbody>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>AA Builders &amp; Developers<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Project Name<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>AA Avenue<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential Apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>3-Bedroom and 4-Bedroom Lounge (listed)<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Apartment Sizes<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Approximately 1,300\\u20131,650 sq. ft. (listed)<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Not officially disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Project Status<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Pre-launch information reported; confirm current status<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Target dates require developer confirmation<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Sehba Akhtar Road, Block 13-E, Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Obtain the latest authorised schedule<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential Apartment Living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The master plan for AA Avenue should be reviewed through the developer\'s official project documentation. Detailed information about the building layout, number of floors, apartment distribution, parking levels, common areas and other development features has not been independently confirmed in the available public information.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A complete master plan will help buyers understand how residential units are arranged within the building and how shared facilities, access points and parking areas are planned.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before selecting an apartment, buyers should request the approved building plan, floor-wise unit schedule and relevant development documents from AA Builders &amp; Developers or its authorised sales representatives.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers comparing AA Avenue with other AA Builders projects should also make sure that specifications and facilities from separate developments are not assumed to apply to this project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 3-Bedroom and 4-Bedroom Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>AA Avenue is listed with two main residential configurations: 3-bedroom lounge and 4-bedroom lounge apartments. These options provide different space arrangements for buyers depending on their household requirements.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The reported apartment sizes range from approximately 1,300 to 1,650 square feet. Final covered areas, room dimensions, layouts and unit availability should be confirmed through the latest official unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Apartments in AA Avenue<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The apartment options at AA Avenue are intended for buyers looking for family-oriented residential spaces in Gulshan-e-Iqbal. The available listings identify 3-bedroom and 4-bedroom lounge configurations, offering alternatives for different family sizes.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3-Bedroom Lounge Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 3-bedroom lounge option is listed at approximately 1,300 square feet. It is suitable for families looking for a multi-bedroom apartment with a separate lounge area. Buyers should request the official floor plan to review the room arrangement, kitchen, bathrooms, balcony and other specifications.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Bedroom Lounge Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 4-bedroom lounge option is listed at approximately 1,650 square feet. This configuration provides an additional bedroom compared with the 3-bedroom option and may suit larger households that require more residential space.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The final layout, covered area and included facilities should be confirmed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers searching for AA Avenue apartments for sale or flats for sale in AA Avenue Karachi should review the latest availability list before selecting a unit.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The official floor plans for AA Avenue should be obtained from AA Builders &amp; Developers or its authorised sales representatives. Buyers should request the floor plan for their preferred apartment category before making a booking decision.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A floor plan helps buyers understand the arrangement of bedrooms, lounge, kitchen, bathrooms, balconies and other internal spaces. It also allows them to compare the available apartment configurations and select a layout that meets their household requirements.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Anyone comparing an AA Avenue apartment price should review the relevant floor plan and unit schedule together, as apartment size, floor level and position may affect the final price.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>AA Avenue is being marketed as a pre-launch residential project in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi. Public property listings show different price figures and booking terms, so these should not be treated as a single confirmed developer price list.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The final price of an apartment may depend on its size, floor, position, orientation and availability. Buyers should request the latest authorised price list directly from AA Builders &amp; Developers or its verified sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before making a payment, buyers should confirm the following details:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Official booking procedure<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Verified payment recipient<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Allotment documentation<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Payment schedule and instalment terms<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Applicable terms and conditions<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Anyone searching for AA Avenue price, AA Avenue apartment price or AA Avenue booking details should verify the latest information instead of relying only on third-party advertisements.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A project-specific SBCA approval number or complete approval document for AA Avenue has not been confirmed in the available public information.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should request the relevant approval documents, sanctioned building plans and land-related records from the developer before booking an apartment. These documents should be checked with the relevant authority where applicable.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Approval information belonging to another AA Builders project should not be assumed to apply to AA Avenue. Buyers should verify that all documents clearly identify the AA Avenue project and its relevant site.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The final possession date for AA Avenue should be confirmed through the developer\'s official project documentation and booking agreement.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Some third-party property listings mention a target handover around 2031, but buyers should treat this as an indicative listing detail rather than a guaranteed possession commitment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before booking, request the following information:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Construction schedule<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Expected project completion date<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Possession terms and conditions<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Any conditions that may affect the handover timeline<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The agreed possession details should be clearly stated in the official documentation.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 21:45:52', '2026-11-13 21:45:52'),
(518, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1256, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"<h2>About AA Avenue<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>AA Avenue is a residential development associated with AA Builders &amp; Developers in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi. Its location on Sehba Akhtar Road, Block 13-E, places it within an established residential and commercial area with access to everyday facilities and important city routes.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The project is listed with 3-bedroom and 4-bedroom lounge apartment options. These configurations are intended for families looking for additional living space, with separate areas for family activities and guest accommodation. Final layouts, covered areas and specifications should be confirmed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>For people comparing residential projects in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, AA Avenue offers a location-focused option from an established Karachi developer. Buyers should review the latest construction status, approved building plans, unit availability and payment terms before proceeding.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<table>\\\\r\\\\n<thead>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<th>Feature<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n<th>Details<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/thead>\\\\r\\\\n<tbody>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>AA Builders &amp; Developers<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Project Name<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>AA Avenue<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Property Type<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Residential Apartments<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Unit Types<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>3-Bedroom and 4-Bedroom Lounge (listed)<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Apartment Sizes<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Approximately 1,300\\\\u20131,650 sq. ft. (listed)<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Not officially disclosed<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Project Status<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Pre-launch information reported; confirm current status<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Handover<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Target dates require developer confirmation<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Location<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Sehba Akhtar Road, Block 13-E, Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Obtain the latest authorised schedule<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Residential Apartment Living<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tbody>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/table>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The master plan for AA Avenue should be reviewed through the developer\'s official project documentation. Detailed information about the building layout, number of floors, apartment distribution, parking levels, common areas and other development features has not been independently confirmed in the available public information.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>A complete master plan will help buyers understand how residential units are arranged within the building and how shared facilities, access points and parking areas are planned.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Before selecting an apartment, buyers should request the approved building plan, floor-wise unit schedule and relevant development documents from AA Builders &amp; Developers or its authorised sales representatives.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers comparing AA Avenue with other AA Builders projects should also make sure that specifications and facilities from separate developments are not assumed to apply to this project.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Unit Types: 3-Bedroom and 4-Bedroom Apartments<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>AA Avenue is listed with two main residential configurations: 3-bedroom lounge and 4-bedroom lounge apartments. These options provide different space arrangements for buyers depending on their household requirements.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The reported apartment sizes range from approximately 1,300 to 1,650 square feet. Final covered areas, room dimensions, layouts and unit availability should be confirmed through the latest official unit schedule.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Apartments in AA Avenue<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The apartment options at AA Avenue are intended for buyers looking for family-oriented residential spaces in Gulshan-e-Iqbal. The available listings identify 3-bedroom and 4-bedroom lounge configurations, offering alternatives for different family sizes.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>3-Bedroom Lounge Apartments<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The 3-bedroom lounge option is listed at approximately 1,300 square feet. It is suitable for families looking for a multi-bedroom apartment with a separate lounge area. Buyers should request the official floor plan to review the room arrangement, kitchen, bathrooms, balcony and other specifications.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>4-Bedroom Lounge Apartments<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The 4-bedroom lounge option is listed at approximately 1,650 square feet. This configuration provides an additional bedroom compared with the 3-bedroom option and may suit larger households that require more residential space.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The final layout, covered area and included facilities should be confirmed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers searching for AA Avenue apartments for sale or flats for sale in AA Avenue Karachi should review the latest availability list before selecting a unit.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The official floor plans for AA Avenue should be obtained from AA Builders &amp; Developers or its authorised sales representatives. Buyers should request the floor plan for their preferred apartment category before making a booking decision.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>A floor plan helps buyers understand the arrangement of bedrooms, lounge, kitchen, bathrooms, balconies and other internal spaces. It also allows them to compare the available apartment configurations and select a layout that meets their household requirements.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Anyone comparing an AA Avenue apartment price should review the relevant floor plan and unit schedule together, as apartment size, floor level and position may affect the final price.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>AA Avenue is being marketed as a pre-launch residential project in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi. Public property listings show different price figures and booking terms, so these should not be treated as a single confirmed developer price list.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The final price of an apartment may depend on its size, floor, position, orientation and availability. Buyers should request the latest authorised price list directly from AA Builders &amp; Developers or its verified sales channel.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Before making a payment, buyers should confirm the following details:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Official booking procedure<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Verified payment recipient<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Allotment documentation<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Payment schedule and instalment terms<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Applicable terms and conditions<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>