(545, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1253, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"AA Avenue by AA Builders & Developers\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"AA Avenue is a residential apartment project by AA Builders & Developers, located in Block 13-E, Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi. The project is listed as a high-rise development offering 3-bedroom and 4-bedroom lounge apartments for families looking for residential options in an established part of the city.\\\\r\\\\nIts location on Sehba Akhtar Road provides access to the wider Gulshan-e-Iqbal area, including nearby commercial centres, educational institutions, healthcare facilities and major road connections. The project is currently being marketed at the pre-launch stage, with further development and booking details subject to official confirmation from the developer.\\\\r\\\\nFor buyers exploring AA Avenue Karachi, the project offers an opportunity to consider apartment living in a well-established neighbourhood. Interested buyers should obtain the latest project documents, approved plans, unit specifications and official payment schedule before making a booking decision.\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":null,\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"AA Avenue by AA Builders & Developers\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"AA Avenue is a residential apartment project by AA Builders & Developers, located in Block 13-E, Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi. The project is listed as a high-rise development offering 3-bedroom and 4-bedroom lounge apartments for families looking for residential options in an established part of the city.\\\\r\\\\nIts location on Sehba Akhtar Road provides access to the wider Gulshan-e-Iqbal area, including nearby commercial centres, educational institutions, healthcare facilities and major road connections. The project is currently being marketed at the pre-launch stage, with further development and booking details subject to official confirmation from the developer.\\\\r\\\\nFor buyers exploring AA Avenue Karachi, the project offers an opportunity to consider apartment living in a well-established neighbourhood. Interested buyers should obtain the latest project documents, approved plans, unit specifications and official payment schedule before making a booking decision.\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794606581_6af785f519c8f.jpg\\\",\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/59', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 21:49:41', '2026-11-13 21:49:41'),
