(584, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1273, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"AA Central Gallery\\\",\\\"images\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"AA Central Gallery\\\",\\\"images\\\":[{\\\"src\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794607384_6af78918dde12.jpg\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Exterior\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Project Photo\\\"},{\\\"src\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794607384_6af78918de382.jpg\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Exterior\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Project Photo\\\"},{\\\"src\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794607384_6af78918de5f4.jpg\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Exterior\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Project Photo\\\"},{\\\"src\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794607384_6af78918de838.jpg\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Exterior\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Project Photo\\\"},{\\\"src\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794607384_6af78918de960.jpg\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Exterior\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Project Photo\\\"},{\\\"src\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794607384_6af78918de9f7.jpg\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Exterior\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Project Photo\\\"},{\\\"src\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794607384_6af78918dea8f.jpg\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Exterior\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Project Photo\\\"}]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/60', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:03:04', '2026-11-13 22:03:04'),
(585, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 163, '{\"body\":\"\"}', '{\"body\":\"<h2>About AA Central<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>AA Central is a commercial high-rise development by AA Builders & Developers in New Challi, Karachi. Its location on I.I. Chundrigar Road places it within an established business district associated with corporate offices, financial activity and commercial services.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The project is planned as a Ground + 34-floor tower, with 24 floors dedicated to commercial office spaces. Office sizes are listed from approximately 629 to 1,060 square feet, allowing businesses to consider different workspace requirements. The development also includes ground-floor commercial shop payment-plan listings, providing a separate retail component alongside its office spaces.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For companies, a commercial office can provide a dedicated workplace and a professional business address. For investors, commercial property may offer opportunities related to business demand and potential rental income, although returns depend on factors such as purchase price, occupancy, location and market conditions.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>AA Central combines its business-focused location with planned parking, lift access and rooftop facilities. Buyers should evaluate the building\'s approved specifications, construction progress, legal documentation and financial terms before committing to a purchase.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>AA Builders & Developers<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Project Name<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>AA Central<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Commercial Office Tower<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Building Configuration<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Ground + 34 Floors<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Commercial Office Floors<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>24 Floors<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Office Sizes<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Approximately 629\\u20131,060 sq. ft.<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Commercial Shops<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Ground-floor shop options listed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Not officially disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Parking<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>11 Dedicated Parking Floors<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Passenger Lifts<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>6<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Cargo Lift<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>1<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Rooftop Facilities<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Mosque, Gym, Padel Court and Business Centre<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>I.I. Chundrigar Road, New Challi, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Delivery Year<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>2030, as listed by the developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Official unit-wise schedule to be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>AA Central is planned as a Ground + 34-floor commercial tower, with a development framework focused on office spaces, retail opportunities, parking and shared facilities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>According to the developer\'s published information, 24 floors are allocated to commercial office spaces. The building also incorporates 11 dedicated parking floors, providing parking capacity within the development. Six passenger lifts and one cargo lift are planned to support access and service movement throughout the building.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The commercial office inventory is listed with unit sizes ranging from approximately 629 to 1,060 square feet. This range gives businesses the opportunity to compare different workspace sizes according to their operational needs.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The master plan and approved building drawings should be requested from AA Builders & Developers for a complete understanding of the floor distribution, office layouts, shop locations, parking arrangements and shared facilities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should review the sanctioned plans and official specifications rather than relying only on marketing illustrations or third-party property listings.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Commercial Unit Types<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>AA Central is primarily designed for commercial use, with office spaces and ground-floor shop options listed in the developer\'s project information.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The office inventory is planned for businesses, corporate teams, professional firms and investors looking for commercial property in Karachi\'s central business district.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Commercial Offices in AA Central<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>AA Central offers commercial office spaces with listed sizes ranging from approximately 629 to 1,060 square feet. These spaces are intended to accommodate different business requirements, from smaller professional offices to larger corporate workspaces.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The available office size can help buyers assess how much space they need for employees, workstations, meeting areas and other business activities. Final office layouts, dimensions, floor positions and availability should be confirmed through the official unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Office Spaces for Businesses<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The office spaces at AA Central are designed for companies and professionals seeking a dedicated workplace in New Challi. Businesses can review available office configurations and select a unit according to their operational requirements.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before purchasing, buyers should examine the floor plan, usable area, access arrangements, utility provisions and applicable building management terms.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Commercial Shops at AA Central<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The developer\'s website also lists ground-floor commercial shop payment-plan options. These provide a separate retail component within the development, alongside its corporate office spaces.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The exact shop dimensions, availability, prices and permitted commercial uses should be confirmed through the latest authorised commercial inventory.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Businesses and investors searching for AA Central commercial shops or offices for sale in AA Central Karachi should request the official inventory before making a selection.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The office and commercial floor plans for AA Central should be obtained through AA Builders & Developers or its authorised sales representatives.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The floor plans can help buyers understand the arrangement of commercial offices, shop locations, building access points and shared areas. Reviewing the plans is important when comparing office sizes and selecting a suitable workspace.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should request the floor plan for their preferred office category along with its unit number, floor level, covered area and current availability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Anyone comparing an AA Central office price should review the relevant floor plan and official unit schedule together, as the floor position, size and configuration may affect the final price.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>AA Central is marketed as a commercial office development with separate office and ground-floor shop options. The developer\'s website provides commercial and office payment-plan sections, but the latest complete unit-wise price list should be obtained directly from its authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Commercial office prices may vary according to unit size, floor level, location within the building and availability. Retail shop prices and terms may follow a separate schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Some third-party listings have advertised starting prices and per-square-foot rates for AA Central offices. However, these figures should not be treated as a guaranteed current price because availability and sales terms can change.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers searching for AA Central price, AA Central office price or AA Central booking details should request the latest authorised price list before making a decision.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before booking, confirm the selected unit number, total price, booking amount, instalment schedule, possession payment, additional charges and official payment procedure. All payment terms should be documented in the booking agreement.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The complete project-specific approval and regulatory documentation for AA Central should be obtained and verified before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The developer\'s public project page provides project specifications and building details, but it does not establish the complete regulatory approval position. Buyers should request the relevant sanctioned building plans, applicable NOCs and other required approvals from AA Builders & Developers.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Where applicable, these documents should be independently checked with the relevant Karachi development and building control authorities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should also ensure that the documents identify AA Central and its exact project site. Approvals or documents belonging to another development should not be assumed to apply to this project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>AA Builders & Developers lists 2030 as the delivery year for AA Central on its official project page.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>However, buyers should confirm the contractual completion and possession schedule directly with the developer before booking. The expected handover date should be clearly stated in the official booking documents and purchase agreement.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before committing funds, buyers should also request the latest construction progress update, development schedule and details of any conditions that may affect possession.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The final possession terms should clarify the handover procedure, outstanding payments, applicable charges and documentation required to receive the commercial unit.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/60', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:03:04', '2026-11-13 22:03:04'),
