regulatory approval position. Buyers should request the relevant sanctioned building plans, applicable NOCs and other required approvals from AA Builders & Developers.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Where applicable, these documents should be independently checked with the relevant Karachi development and building control authorities.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers should also ensure that the documents identify AA Central and its exact project site. Approvals or documents belonging to another development should not be assumed to apply to this project.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>AA Builders & Developers lists 2030 as the delivery year for AA Central on its official project page.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>However, buyers should confirm the contractual completion and possession schedule directly with the developer before booking. The expected handover date should be clearly stated in the official booking documents and purchase agreement.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Before committing funds, buyers should also request the latest construction progress update, development schedule and details of any conditions that may affect possession.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The final possession terms should clarify the handover procedure, outstanding payments, applicable charges and documentation required to receive the commercial unit.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/60', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:03:04', '2026-11-13 22:03:04'),
(587, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1275, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"AA Central Payment Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>AA Central has separate commercial shop and office payment-plan sections on the developer\'s official website. This indicates that buyers can enquire about payment arrangements for the different commercial unit categories.<\\\\\\/p><p>The exact instalment amounts, booking requirements, payment frequency and possession balance should be confirmed through the latest authorised payment schedule.<\\\\\\/p><p>Buyers should review the complete payment structure before making a booking. The schedule should clearly identify the total unit price, initial payment, subsequent instalments, final possession payment and any additional charges.<\\\\\\/p><p>Do not rely on an outdated or unofficial payment schedule. Always confirm the selected unit\'s current price and payment terms directly with AA Builders & Developers or its authorised sales representatives.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/60', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:03:04', '2026-11-13 22:03:04'),
(588, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1276, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"AA Central Master Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794607384_6af78918e4685.jpg\\\",\\\"badge\\\":null}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/60', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:03:04', '2026-11-13 22:03:04');
