ent older inventory or previous sales schedules and should not be treated as the current official price list.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers searching for H1 Tower price, H1 Tower apartment price or H1 Tower booking details should request the latest authorised inventory and price schedule from HMR Waterfront\'s sales centre.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Before making a booking, confirm the following details:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Selected unit number and category.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Covered area and floor position.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Total purchase price.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Booking amount.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Instalment schedule.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Possession payment.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Additional charges and applicable fees.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>All payments should be made through the developer\'s authorised payment channels and supported by official documentation and receipts.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers interested in H1 Tower should request the project-specific regulatory and approval documents from HMR Group or its authorised sales representatives.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The relevant documentation should identify H1 Tower, its project site and the applicable building approvals. Buyers should review the sanctioned building plans, relevant NOCs and land-related records before making a purchase decision.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Where applicable, the documents should be independently verified with the relevant authorities, including DHA Karachi and other concerned regulatory bodies.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Approval information belonging to another project within HMR Waterfront should not automatically be assumed to apply to H1 Tower. Buyers should confirm that the documents specifically relate to the selected tower and its development.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The expected possession timeline for H1 Tower should be confirmed through the latest official construction update and booking agreement.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Older marketing materials and third-party property listings have mentioned different handover dates. These dates should not be treated as a confirmed current possession commitment without verification from HMR Group.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Before booking, buyers should request the latest construction progress, expected completion date, handover schedule and relevant contractual conditions.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The booking agreement should clearly state the expected possession date, payment obligations, handover procedure and any conditions that may affect the completion timeline.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers should rely on the latest official documentation rather than outdated advertisements or previous payment schedules.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/61', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:16:45', '2026-11-13 22:16:45'),
(639, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1293, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"H1 Tower Payment Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>H1 Tower has been marketed with instalment-based payment options for its residential units. However, payment terms can vary according to the apartment category, unit size, booking date and available inventory.<\\\\\\/p><p>Older third-party marketing material has mentioned a payment structure of 50% down payment at booking, 40% in monthly instalments and 10% at handover. This schedule should be treated as historical marketing information, not as a confirmed current payment plan.<\\\\\\/p><p>Buyers should obtain the latest authorised payment schedule directly from HMR Waterfront\'s sales centre.<\\\\\\/p><p>The official schedule should clearly identify the booking amount, down payment, monthly or quarterly instalments, possession payment and any additional charges.<\\\\\\/p><p>Before making a payment, confirm the selected unit, total purchase price, instalment deadlines, authorised payment recipient and applicable booking conditions.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/61', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:16:45', '2026-11-13 22:16:45'),
(640, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1294, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"H1 Tower Master Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794608205_6af78c4d8ebde.jpg\\\",\\\"badge\\\":null}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/61', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:16:45', '2026-11-13 22:16:45'),
(641, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1295, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"H1 Tower Location at HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"categories\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Nearby Areas and Attractions\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Arabian Sea\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"1\\\\u20133 min\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"HMR Waterfront\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"1\\\\u20133 min\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"DHA Phase 8\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"0\\\\u20132 min\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Abdul Sattar Edhi Avenue\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"0\\\\u20132 min\\\"}]}],\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"H1 Tower is located within HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi, along Abdul Sattar Edhi Avenue. Its waterfront setting provides a residential environment overlooking the Arabian Sea, with access to the wider DHA Phase 8 area.\\\\r\\\\nThe location allows residents to explore the surrounding coastal district, established residential areas and commercial facilities. Buyers can consider the area\'s road connections and proximity to their workplaces, educational institutions, healthcare facilities and everyday destinations when evaluating the property.\\\\r\\\\nThe tower is part of the larger HMR Waterfront development, which is designed around residential buildings, shared facilities and a waterfront lifestyle.\\\\r\\\\nFor buyers exploring luxury apartments in DHA Phase 8, H1 Tower offers an opportunity to consider different residential configurations within a premium coastal development.\\\\r\\\\nBuyers should confirm the exact tower entrance, unit location and site access details before arranging a project visit.\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794608205_6af78c4d8fad0.jpg\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/61', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:16:45', '2026-11-13 22:16:45'),
(642, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1296, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Where is H1 Tower Karachi located?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"H1 Tower is located within HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi, along Abdul Sattar Edhi Avenue. Its location offers a waterfront residential setting near the Arabian Sea.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Who is developing H1 Tower?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"H1 Tower is developed by HMR Group and is the flagship residential tower of HMR Waterfront. The project is part of the group\'s waterfront residential development in DHA Phase 8, Karachi.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"How many floors does H1 Tower have?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"H1 Tower is planned as a Ground + 34-floor residential development. Its published specifications also include eight parking floors and a dedicated services floor on the 15th floor.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What types of apartments are available in H1 Tower?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"H1 Tower offers townhouses, 1-bedroom, 2-bedroom, 3-bedroom and 4-bedroom apartments, along with penthouses. Buyers should confirm the current availability and specifications of each unit category.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What is the H1 Tower apartment price?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The price depends on the apartment category, covered area, floor level, orientation and current availability. Buyers should request the latest official price list from HMR Waterfront\'s authorised sales centre.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What is the H1 Tower payment plan?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"H1 Tower has been marketed with instalment-based payment options. However, older payment schedules may no longer be current. Buyers should obtain the latest authorised payment plan and confirm the booking amount and instalment terms before proceeding.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What amenities are available at H1 Tower?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"H1 Tower\'s published features include a 20 \\\\u00d7 80-foot swimming pool, eight parking floors, a dedicated services floor on the 15th floor and fire-life-safety lifts. The wider HMR Waterfront development also offers lifestyle and recreational facilities.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Does H1 Tower offer sea-facing apartments?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Yes. The official project information identifies both sea-facing and boulevard-facing apartment orientations. Buyers should confirm the actual view and orientation of their selected unit.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"When is the expected possession of H1 Tower?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The current contractual possession date should be confirmed directly with HMR Group. Older marketing materials mention previous handover schedules, which should not be treated as current commitments without verification.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Is H1 Tower approved by DHA?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Buyers should request the project-specific approval documents and sanctioned building plans and verify them with the relevant authorities before booking. Approval claims should be supported by documents specifically identifying H1 Tower.\\\"}],\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/61', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:16:45', '2026-11-13 22:16:45'),
