(682, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Developer', 10, '{\"name\":\"HMR Waterfront\",\"slug\":\"hmr-waterfront\",\"h1\":\"HMR Waterfront Properties\",\"tagline\":\"Discover HMR Waterfront, a premium beachfront residential community in DHA Phase 8, Karachi.\",\"short_content\":\"<p>HMR Waterfront is a premium waterfront residential community developed by HMR Group, led by Haji Muhammad Rafiq Pardesi. Located along the Arabian Sea in DHA Phase 8, Karachi, the development represents a modern approach to luxury residential living, combining contemporary architecture, coastal surroundings and integrated lifestyle facilities.<\\/p>\",\"full_content\":\"<h2>About HMR Waterfront<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>HMR Group has a diverse business background spanning real estate, construction, trading, hospitality and retail. Its leadership traces its business journey to 1982, when Haji Muhammad Rafiq Pardesi joined his family\'s Dubai-based business. In 2015, he founded HMR Group to expand the group\'s diversified business operations and development activities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>HMR Waterfront is designed as a gated beachfront community featuring residential high-rise towers, a commercial business district, landscaped open spaces and recreational facilities. The master-planned development includes fourteen high-rise residential towers, complemented by modern infrastructure and community amenities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The community offers different residential options, including 1, 2, 3 and 4-bedroom apartments, townhouses and luxury penthouses. Its waterfront setting, architectural planning and lifestyle facilities aim to provide residents with a comfortable and connected living environment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>HMR Waterfront also brings together multiple established real estate development partners, including Saima Builders, AA Builders &amp; Developers, Giga Group, H&amp;S Properties, Metro Group and Shayan Iconic Builders. These developers contribute individual residential projects within the larger waterfront community.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>With its coastal location, premium residential developments and integrated commercial facilities, HMR Waterfront represents an important addition to Karachi\'s evolving luxury real estate landscape.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Project Location<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>HMR Waterfront is located along the Arabian Sea in DHA Phase 8, Karachi, Pakistan.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The waterfront community offers access to coastal surroundings and major areas of DHA Karachi. Its location makes it an attractive option for buyers exploring premium residential properties and beachfront apartments.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Explore the interactive map to discover HMR Waterfront, view individual residential developments and understand the location of different projects within the community.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Location Details<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<thead>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<th>Location Attribute<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/thead>\\r\\n<tbody>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Area<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>DHA Phase 8<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>City<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Country<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Pakistan<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Address<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Abdul Sattar Edhi Avenue, DHA Phase 8, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Interested in HMR Waterfront Projects?<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Looking to purchase a luxury apartment, beachfront residence, duplex or penthouse in Karachi?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Explore residential developments within HMR Waterfront and connect with our property experts to learn more about individual projects, available units, developers and payment plans.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Whether you are searching for a family residence or a real estate investment opportunity, our team can help you compare different projects and explore suitable property options.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Register your interest today to receive further information about HMR Waterfront developments.<\\/p>\"}', '{\"name\":\"HMR Group\",\"slug\":\"hmr-group\",\"h1\":\"HMR Group\",\"tagline\":\"Discover HMR HMR Group, a premium beachfront residential community in DHA Phase 8, Karachi.\",\"short_content\":\"<p>HMR Groupis a premium waterfront residential community developed by HMR Group, led by Haji Muhammad Rafiq Pardesi. Located along the Arabian Sea in DHA Phase 8, Karachi, the development represents a modern approach to luxury residential living, combining contemporary architecture, coastal surroundings and integrated lifestyle facilities.<\\/p>\",\"full_content\":\"<h2>About HMR Group<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>HMR Group has a diverse business background spanning real estate, construction, trading, hospitality and retail. Its leadership traces its business journey to 1982, when Haji Muhammad Rafiq Pardesi joined his family\'s Dubai-based business. In 2015, he founded HMR Group to expand the group\'s diversified business operations and development activities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>HMR Group is designed as a gated beachfront community featuring residential high-rise towers, a commercial business district, landscaped open spaces and recreational facilities. The master-planned development includes fourteen high-rise residential towers, complemented by modern infrastructure and community amenities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The community offers different residential options, including 1, 2, 3 and 4-bedroom apartments, townhouses and luxury penthouses. Its waterfront setting, architectural planning and lifestyle facilities aim to provide residents with a comfortable and connected living environment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>HMR Group also brings together multiple established real estate development partners, including Saima Builders, AA Builders &amp; Developers, Giga Group, H&amp;S Properties, Metro Group and Shayan Iconic Builders. These developers contribute individual residential projects within the larger waterfront community.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>With its coastal location, premium residential developments and integrated commercial facilities, HMR Group represents an important addition to Karachi\'s evolving luxury real estate landscape.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Project Location<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>HMR Group is located along the Arabian Sea in DHA Phase 8, Karachi, Pakistan.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The waterfront community offers access to coastal surroundings and major areas of DHA Karachi. Its location makes it an attractive option for buyers exploring premium residential properties and beachfront apartments.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Explore the interactive map to discover HMR Group, view individual residential developments and understand the location of different projects within the community.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Location Details<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<thead>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<th>Location Attribute<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/thead>\\r\\n<tbody>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Area<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>DHA Phase 8<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>City<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Country<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Pakistan<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Address<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Abdul Sattar Edhi Avenue, DHA Phase 8, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Interested in HMR Group Projects?<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Looking to purchase a luxury apartment, beachfront residence, duplex or penthouse in Karachi?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Explore residential developments within HMR Group and connect with our property experts to learn more about individual projects, available units, developers and payment plans.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Whether you are searching for a family residence or a real estate investment opportunity, our team can help you compare different projects and explore suitable property options.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Register your interest today to receive further information about HMR Group developments.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/developers/10', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:32:36', '2026-11-13 22:32:36'),
