or an AA Waterfront apartment price or AA Waterfront booking amount should contact the authorized sales team for the latest price list, available inventory, and booking requirements.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Before making a payment, buyers should verify the following details:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Selected apartment or penthouse category.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Unit size and covered area.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Floor level and residential orientation.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Latest official selling price.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Booking amount and payment schedule.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Additional charges and applicable fees.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Official booking and sale documentation.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>AA Waterfront is located within the HMR Waterfront master community in DHA Phase 8, Karachi. However, buyers should distinguish between the approval status of the wider master community and the project-specific documentation for the AA Waterfront tower.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Before booking an apartment, buyers should request the relevant NOC, approved building plans, land documentation, and other applicable approvals from the developer or the relevant authority.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers should independently verify that the documentation applies to AA Waterfront and their selected unit rather than relying only on general approval claims or third-party property listings.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The advertised handover target for AA Waterfront is 2028. However, buyers should confirm the latest construction progress, contractual possession schedule, and handover conditions directly with the developer.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The actual handover timeline may depend on construction progress, regulatory requirements, and completion of the relevant development work.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Anyone considering an investment in AA Waterfront Karachi should review the possession terms mentioned in the official booking and sale documentation before making a financial commitment.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/62', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:38:17', '2026-11-13 22:38:17'),
(691, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1305, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":null,\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p><br><\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"AA Waterfront Payment Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p>AA Waterfront has been marketed with installment-based purchasing options to make its residential units accessible through scheduled payments.<\\\\\\/p><p>A third-party project information page advertises a 66-month payment plan, including a 5% initial booking payment, three consecutive monthly payments of 5% each, and the remaining amount through 62 monthly installments.<\\\\\\/p><p>However, payment schedules may vary by apartment category, booking date, and available inventory. Buyers should request the latest authorized AA Waterfront payment plan, including the booking amount, installment dates, possession payment, and any additional charges.<\\\\\\/p><p>Do not rely on an old or unofficial installment schedule when making a booking decision.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/62', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:38:17', '2026-11-13 22:38:17'),
(692, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1306, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":null,\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image\\\":null,\\\"badge\\\":null}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"AA Waterfront Master Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794609497_6af791599780b.webp\\\",\\\"badge\\\":null}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/62', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:38:17', '2026-11-13 22:38:17'),
(693, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1307, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":null,\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"image\\\":null}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"AA Waterfront Location in DHA Phase 8, Karachi\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"AA Waterfront is located at Plot #08, HMR Waterfront, Abdul Sattar Edhi Avenue, DHA Phase 8, Karachi. Its waterfront setting places the development along the Arabian Sea, within a planned residential community.\\\\r\\\\nThe location provides connectivity to important parts of DHA and other major destinations across Karachi. Residents can access shopping, dining, recreational, and healthcare facilities within the surrounding areas.\\\\r\\\\nThe project\'s location is particularly relevant for buyers searching for sea view apartments in Karachi and luxury residential developments in DHA Phase 8.\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794609497_6af7915998889.webp\\\",\\\"categories\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Nearby Landmarks and Attractions\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Arabian Sea\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"1\\\\u20133 minutes\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"HMR Private Beach\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"2\\\\u20135 minutes\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Abdul Sattar Edhi Avenue\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"1\\\\u20132 minutes\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Do Darya\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"5 minutes\\\"}]}]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/62', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:38:17', '2026-11-13 22:38:17'),
(694, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1308, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Where is AA Waterfront Karachi located?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"AA Waterfront is located at Plot #08, HMR Waterfront, Abdul Sattar Edhi Avenue, DHA Phase 8, Karachi. The residential tower is part of the HMR Waterfront community, positioned along the Arabian Sea.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What is AA Waterfront price?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"AA Waterfront prices depend on apartment size, floor level, unit category, and views. Some market listings have advertised starting prices around PKR 4.5 Crore. Buyers should request the latest authorized price list for confirmed rates and availability.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What apartment types are available in AA Waterfront?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"AA Waterfront offers 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, along with 4-bedroom duplex and 6-bedroom triplex penthouses. Buyers can request the latest floor plans and unit availability through the authorized sales team.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What is AA Waterfront payment plan?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"A third-party project listing advertises a 66-month installment plan with an initial 5% booking payment, three monthly payments of 5% each, and the remaining amount through 62 installments. Buyers should confirm the current official schedule before booking.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Is AA Waterfront DHA approved?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"AA Waterfront is situated within the DHA Phase 8 HMR Waterfront community. Buyers should request and independently verify the project-specific NOC and approved building documentation before making a purchase.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"How many floors does AA Waterfront have?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"AA Waterfront is advertised by AA Builders & Developers as a Ground + 37-storey residential tower.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Does AA Waterfront offer sea-facing apartments?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Yes. The project brochure includes sea-facing apartment layouts and residential options designed to provide views of the Arabian Sea. Actual views depend on the selected unit and floor position.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What amenities are available at AA Waterfront?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Advertised facilities include a swimming pool, gymnasium, sauna, steam room, mosque, meeting room, community hall, lounge, gaming zone, children\'s play area, and parking facilities.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What is the possession date of AA Waterfront?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The advertised handover target is 2028. Buyers should confirm the current possession schedule and contractual handover terms directly with the developer.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Can overseas Pakistanis buy apartments in AA Waterfront?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Overseas Pakistanis interested in AA Waterfront can contact the developer or authorized sales representatives to discuss booking procedures, payment methods, documentation, and applicable purchase requirements.\\\"}],\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/62', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:38:17', '2026-11-13 22:38:17'),
(695, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1309, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"button_text\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"email\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pretitle\\\":\\\"LET\'S CONNECT\\\",\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Invest in Your Future\\\",\\\"form_small\\\":\\\"REQUEST\\\",\\\"form_large\\\":\\\"A CALL BACK\\\",\\\"submit_button\\\":\\\"REQUEST NOW\\\",\\\"bg_image\\\":null}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"button_text\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"email\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pretitle\\\":\\\"LET\'S CONNECT\\\",\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Invest in Your Future\\\",\\\"form_small\\\":\\\"REQUEST\\\",\\\"form_large\\\":\\\"A CALL BACK\\\",\\\"submit_button\\\":\\\"REQUEST NOW\\\",\\\"bg_image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794609497_6af791599a8b9.webp\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/62', '103.31.100.10', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:38:17', '2026-11-13 22:38:17'),
