(719, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 14, '{\"body\":\"<h2>1. Information Collection<\\/h2>\\n<p>We collect information when you interact with our website or contact us regarding properties and real estate opportunities on Hudayriyat Island and in Abu Dhabi.<\\/p>\\n<p>You may provide information when you submit an enquiry, request property information, or contact our advisory team via phone, email, or WhatsApp.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>2. How We Use Information<\\/h2>\\n<p>We use the information we collect to understand your requirements, provide relevant property details, contact you regarding updates, and facilitate viewings and advisory services.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>3. Information Sharing &amp; Disclosure<\\/h2>\\n<p>We respect your privacy and take reasonable steps to protect your personal information. We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties for marketing purposes.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>4. Data Security &amp; Integrity<\\/h2>\\n<p>We use reasonable technical and organizational measures to help protect your personal information from unauthorized access, use, alteration, or disclosure.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>5. Your Rights &amp; Choices<\\/h2>\\n<p>You have the right to request access, correction, or deletion of your personal data held by us, or withdraw consent to receive marketing updates at any time.<\\/p>\\n\\n<h2>6. Updates to This Policy<\\/h2>\\n<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in legal, regulatory, or operational requirements. Any revisions will be published on this page.<\\/p>\\n\"}', '{\"body\":\"<h1>Privacy Policy<\\/h1><p>At FS Advisory Pakistan, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your information when you visit our website, explore property projects, submit enquiries, or use our real estate advisory services in Pakistan.<\\/p><p>By using our website, you acknowledge the practices described in this Privacy Policy.<\\/p><h2>1. Information Collection<\\/h2><p>We may collect personal information when you interact with our website or contact us regarding real estate projects, property listings, and investment opportunities across Pakistan.<\\/p><p>You may provide information when you:<\\/p><ul><li>Submit a property enquiry or contact form.<\\/li><li>Request details about residential or commercial projects.<\\/li><li>Register your interest in a property or development.<\\/li><li>Contact our advisory team through phone, email, or WhatsApp.<\\/li><li>Submit a property listing through our website.<\\/li><li>Request assistance regarding property prices, payment plans, or investment opportunities.<\\/li><\\/ul><p>The information collected may include your name, phone number, email address, property preferences, and other details you voluntarily provide.<\\/p><p>We may also collect certain technical information, such as browser type, device information, website usage data, and IP address, where applicable.<\\/p><h2>2. How We Use Your Information<\\/h2><p>We use the information collected to understand your property requirements and provide relevant real estate information and advisory assistance.<\\/p><p>Your information may be used to:<\\/p><ul><li>Respond to property enquiries and customer requests.<\\/li><li>Share relevant residential and commercial project details.<\\/li><li>Provide information about property prices, availability, and payment plans.<\\/li><li>Connect you with relevant property advisors.<\\/li><li>Arrange property consultations and viewing requests.<\\/li><li>Process property listing submissions.<\\/li><li>Communicate important service updates and requested information.<\\/li><li>Improve our website, services, and customer experience.<\\/li><\\/ul><p>We aim to use your personal information only for relevant business and service-related purposes.<\\/p><h2>3. Information Sharing & Disclosure<\\/h2><p>FS Advisory Pakistan respects your privacy and takes reasonable steps to protect your personal information.<\\/p><p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties for their independent marketing purposes.<\\/p><p>Your information may be shared where necessary with relevant property developers, authorised representatives, or service providers to respond to your enquiries, provide requested property information, or facilitate real estate-related services.<\\/p><p>We may also disclose information where required by applicable laws, legal processes, or regulatory authorities.<\\/p><p>Any information shared is intended to support the services you request and should be handled responsibly.<\\/p><h2>4. Data Security & Integrity<\\/h2><p>We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to help protect your personal information against unauthorised access, misuse, alteration, loss, or disclosure.<\\/p><p>We aim to maintain appropriate safeguards when collecting, processing, and storing customer information.<\\/p><p>However, no method of internet transmission or electronic storage is completely secure. While we take reasonable precautions, we cannot guarantee absolute security of information transmitted through our website or other online communication channels.<\\/p><h2>5. Your Rights & Choices<\\/h2><p>You have the right to make requests regarding the personal information you provide to FS Advisory Pakistan.<\\/p><p>Depending on applicable legal requirements, you may request to:<\\/p><ul><li>Access the personal information held about you.<\\/li><li>Correct inaccurate or incomplete personal information.<\\/li><li>Request deletion of your personal information, where applicable.<\\/li><li>Withdraw consent for receiving promotional or marketing communications.<\\/li><li>Request clarification about how your information is collected and used.<\\/li><\\/ul><p>If you no longer wish to receive marketing-related updates, you may contact us to request that such communications be stopped.<\\/p><p>Requests relating to personal information can be submitted through our website\'s contact page or available communication channels.<\\/p><h2>6. Updates to This Policy<\\/h2><p>FS Advisory Pakistan may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our business operations, website functionality, data handling practices, or applicable legal and regulatory requirements.<\\/p><p>Any updates or revisions will be published on this page.<\\/p><p>We encourage visitors to review this Privacy Policy periodically to stay informed about how their personal information is handled.<\\/p><p>Your continued use of our website after policy updates are published will be subject to the revised policy, to the extent permitted by applicable law.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/14', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 06:54:27', '2026-11-16 06:54:27'),
