ion, where applicable.<\\\\\\/li><li>Withdraw consent for receiving promotional or marketing communications.<\\\\\\/li><li>Request clarification about how your information is collected and used.<\\\\\\/li><\\\\\\/ul><p>If you no longer wish to receive marketing-related updates, you may contact us to request that such communications be stopped.<\\\\\\/p><p>Requests relating to personal information can be submitted through our website\'s contact page or available communication channels.<\\\\\\/p><h2>6. Updates to This Policy<\\\\\\/h2><p>FS Advisory Pakistan may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our business operations, website functionality, data handling practices, or applicable legal and regulatory requirements.<\\\\\\/p><p>Any updates or revisions will be published on this page.<\\\\\\/p><p>We encourage visitors to review this Privacy Policy periodically to stay informed about how their personal information is handled.<\\\\\\/p><p>Your continued use of our website after policy updates are published will be subject to the revised policy, to the extent permitted by applicable law.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"<p><br><\\\\\\/p>\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/14', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 06:54:27', '2026-11-16 06:54:27'),
