(909, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 169, '{\"body\":\"\"}', '{\"body\":\"<h2>Kings Dream Villas North Karachi: Gated Plots Near 4-K Chowrangi<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Kings Dream Villas is positioned for buyers who want to build their own home on a 120 square yard plot inside a secure, planned community. Because the project is sold as plots rather than ready-built villas, owners can design their home to suit their own needs.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source and confirm any figure seen on third-party listings, including price and availability, directly with Kings Group before making a payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n    <tbody><tr>\\r\\n        <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n        <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Kings Group<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Residential Plots<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Plot Size<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>120 Sq. Yards<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Not Disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Not Published<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>North Karachi, Near 4-K Chowrangi<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Not Published<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Gated Community Living<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No detailed master plan has been published on the project page. Buyers should request the layout and plot map from Kings Group\\u2019s authorised sales channel and should not rely on figures from third-party listings alone.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Plot Sizes in Kings Dream Villas<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Kings Dream Villas offers 120 square yard residential plots. This size gives owners the flexibility to build a compact or a spacious home, depending on their needs. Buyers seeking residential plots for sale in Kings Dream Villas should request the current availability from the developer.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Kings Dream Villas is a plot project, so no floor plan is attached to the plots. Buyers who want a house design should consult an architect and confirm any building rules or bylaws with the developer.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No official Kings Dream Villas price list is published on the project page. Buyers searching for a Kings Dream Villas plot price or booking amount should request the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt from Kings Group. They should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Kings Dream Villas are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession date has been published for Kings Dream Villas. Any date quoted in a listing should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer\\u2019s official documentation.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/64', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 08:09:56', '2026-11-16 08:09:56'),
(910, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1349, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"<h2>Kings Dream Villas North Karachi: Gated Plots Near 4-K Chowrangi<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Kings Dream Villas is positioned for buyers who want to build their own home on a 120 square yard plot inside a secure, planned community. Because the project is sold as plots rather than ready-built villas, owners can design their home to suit their own needs.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source and confirm any figure seen on third-party listings, including price and availability, directly with Kings Group before making a payment.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<table>\\\\r\\\\n    <tbody><tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <th>Feature<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n        <th>Details<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Kings Group<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Property Type<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Residential Plots<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Plot Size<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>120 Sq. Yards<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Total Land Size<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Not Disclosed<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Handover<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Not Published<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Location<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>North Karachi, Near 4-K Chowrangi<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Payment Plan<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Not Published<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Lifestyle<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Gated Community Living<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tbody><\\\\\\/table>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No detailed master plan has been published on the project page. Buyers should request the layout and plot map from Kings Group\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel and should not rely on figures from third-party listings alone.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Plot Sizes in Kings Dream Villas<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Kings Dream Villas offers 120 square yard residential plots. This size gives owners the flexibility to build a compact or a spacious home, depending on their needs. Buyers seeking residential plots for sale in Kings Dream Villas should request the current availability from the developer.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Kings Dream Villas is a plot project, so no floor plan is attached to the plots. Buyers who want a house design should consult an architect and confirm any building rules or bylaws with the developer.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No official Kings Dream Villas price list is published on the project page. Buyers searching for a Kings Dream Villas plot price or booking amount should request the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt from Kings Group. They should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Kings Dream Villas are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No possession date has been published for Kings Dream Villas. Any date quoted in a listing should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer\\\\u2019s official documentation.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/64', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 08:09:56', '2026-11-16 08:09:56'),
(911, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1350, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":null,\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p><br><\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Kings Dream Villas Payment Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"No payment plan has been published on the official project page. Buyers should obtain the booking amount, installment schedule and duration in writing from Kings Group\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel. Any plan quoted by a third party should be treated as unverified.\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/64', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 08:09:56', '2026-11-16 08:09:56'),
