(938, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 171, '{\"is_published\":1,\"meta_title\":\"Kings Nadir Tower | Luxury Properties\",\"meta_description\":\"Explore Kings Nadir Tower. Discover luxury residences, pricing, master plan, and world-class amenities.\"}', '{\"is_published\":false,\"meta_title\":\"Kings Nadir Tower Karachi: 3 Bed Apartments on Jinnah Avenue\",\"meta_description\":\"Kings Nadir Tower by Kings Group offers 3-bedroom lounge apartments on Main Jinnah Avenue, opposite Malir Cantt. See amenities, location and how to enquire.\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/65', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 08:20:13', '2026-11-16 08:20:13'),
(939, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1362, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Kings Nadir Tower\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"bg_image\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"bg_image_alt\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Kings Nadir Tower at Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"badge\\\":null,\\\"bg_image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794817213_6afabcbd1f6c8.jfif\\\",\\\"bg_image_alt\\\":\\\"Kings Nadir Tower at Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi\\\",\\\"image_alt\\\":\\\"Kings Nadir Tower at Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/65', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 08:20:13', '2026-11-16 08:20:13'),
(940, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1364, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Kings Nadir Tower by Kings Group\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Kings Nadir Tower is a residential apartment project by Kings Group on Main Jinnah Avenue, Karachi, opposite Malir Cantt Check Post No. 6 and McDonald\\\\u2019s. The official project page describes spacious 3-bedroom lounge apartments and mentions pre-booking discounts ahead of the official launch. Price, payment plan, approvals and possession have not been published on that page, so buyers should confirm them directly with Kings Group.\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794817213_6afabcbd21774.jfif\\\",\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/65', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 08:20:13', '2026-11-16 08:20:13'),
(941, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1365, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Kings Nadir Tower Amenities\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"The official project page lists the following features:\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/65', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 08:20:13', '2026-11-16 08:20:13'),
(942, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1366, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"images\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Kings Nadir Tower Project Gallery\\\",\\\"images\\\":[]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/65', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 08:20:13', '2026-11-16 08:20:13'),
(943, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 171, '{\"body\":\"\"}', '{\"body\":\"<h2>Kings Nadir Tower: Premium Apartments on Main Jinnah Avenue, Karachi<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Kings Nadir Tower is positioned for families who want a spacious apartment on Main Jinnah Avenue with parking, a gym and children\\u2019s facilities inside the project. The official page presents it as a pre-launch project, so the final specifications, pricing and handover terms may change once Kings Group announces the launch.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should rely on the developer\\u2019s official documentation and confirm any figure seen on third-party listings, including price and plan, before making a payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n    <tbody><tr>\\r\\n        <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n        <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Kings Group<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Residential Apartments with a Commercial Area<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>3-Bedroom Lounge Apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Not Disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Not Published<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Main Jinnah Avenue, Opposite Malir Cantt Check Post No. 6, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Not Published, Confirm with Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>High-Rise Family Living<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No detailed master plan has been published on the project page. Details such as the number of floors and the tower layout should be confirmed through Kings Group\\u2019s authorised sales channel. Buyers should not rely on third-party listings alone for these figures.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Apartments in Kings Nadir Tower<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The official page lists 3-bedroom lounge apartments with contemporary layouts. Apartment sizes have not been published, and sizes in third-party listings are unverified. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Kings Nadir Tower or flats for sale in Kings Nadir Tower Karachi should request the official unit schedule before deciding.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Floor plans for the apartments should be requested from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel together with the unit schedule. A project brochure is offered for download on the official page.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No official Kings Nadir Tower price list is published on the project page. The page mentions pre-booking discounts before the official launch, but the terms are not stated. Buyers searching for a Kings Nadir Tower apartment price or booking amount should request the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt from Kings Group. They should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Kings Nadir Tower are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession date has been published for Kings Nadir Tower. Any date quoted in a listing should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer\\u2019s official documentation.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/65', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 08:20:13', '2026-11-16 08:20:13');
