should confirm them in writing with Kings Group.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Is Kings Nadir Tower the same as Kings JS Tower?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"No. They are separate Kings Group projects listed separately on the developer\\\\u2019s website. Buyers should confirm which project any payment or document refers to before proceeding.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Who is developing Kings Nadir Tower?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Kings Group is the developer named on the official project page.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Can overseas buyers book in Kings Nadir Tower?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Overseas buyers should deal only through Kings Group\\\\u2019s authorised channels and should not send funds against unverified offers.\\\"}],\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/65', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 08:20:13', '2026-11-16 08:20:13'),
