(1152, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 176, '{\"body\":\"\"}', '{\"body\":\"<p>Peace Apartments is positioned for families who want a modern apartment inside the master-planned Naya Nazimabad community, with parking, a gym and a community hall in the building. The official page also shows floor plans for shops and showrooms on the lower and upper ground floors.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source and confirm any figure seen on third-party listings, including price and plan, with the developer before making a payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Key Project Highlights<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n  <tbody><tr>\\r\\n    <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n    <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Residential apartments with shops and showrooms<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Not disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Not published<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Plan sheets published on the official page, confirm with developer<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>High-rise living in a master-planned community<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Peace Apartments is part of the wider Naya Nazimabad community. The official page shows a location map but no detailed tower layout. The number of towers, floors and handover phases should be confirmed through the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Apartments in Peace Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The official page lists 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments in high-rise towers, with virtual tours for the 2 bedroom and 3 bedroom units. Apartment sizes are shown on the plan sheets, and sizes in third-party listings vary, so buyers seeking apartments for sale in Peace Apartments should confirm them with the developer.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Floor Plan<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The official page publishes floor plan images for the apartment types, along with floor plans for shops and showrooms. A project brochure is also offered for download. Buyers should request the latest unit schedule together with the floor plan.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Price and Booking Status<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Pricing appears on the official page only as part of the payment plan sheets, and no separate price list is published as text. Prices in third-party listings differ. Buyers searching for a Peace Apartments price or booking amount should request the current authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt from the developer. They should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Peace Apartments are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Possession Timeline<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession date has been published on the official page. Any date quoted in a listing should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer\\u2019s official documentation.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/68', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 11:14:00', '2026-11-16 11:14:00'),
(1153, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1415, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"<p>Peace Apartments is positioned for families who want a modern apartment inside the master-planned Naya Nazimabad community, with parking, a gym and a community hall in the building. The official page also shows floor plans for shops and showrooms on the lower and upper ground floors.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source and confirm any figure seen on third-party listings, including price and plan, with the developer before making a payment.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Key Project Highlights<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<table>\\\\r\\\\n  <tbody><tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <th>Feature<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n    <th>Details<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Property Type<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Residential apartments with shops and showrooms<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Unit Types<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Total Land Size<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Not disclosed<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Handover<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Not published<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Location<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Payment Plan<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Plan sheets published on the official page, confirm with developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Lifestyle<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>High-rise living in a master-planned community<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tbody><\\\\\\/table>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Peace Apartments is part of the wider Naya Nazimabad community. The official page shows a location map but no detailed tower layout. The number of towers, floors and handover phases should be confirmed through the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Apartments in Peace Apartments<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The official page lists 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments in high-rise towers, with virtual tours for the 2 bedroom and 3 bedroom units. Apartment sizes are shown on the plan sheets, and sizes in third-party listings vary, so buyers seeking apartments for sale in Peace Apartments should confirm them with the developer.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Floor Plan<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The official page publishes floor plan images for the apartment types, along with floor plans for shops and showrooms. A project brochure is also offered for download. Buyers should request the latest unit schedule together with the floor plan.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Price and Booking Status<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Pricing appears on the official page only as part of the payment plan sheets, and no separate price list is published as text. Prices in third-party listings differ. Buyers searching for a Peace Apartments price or booking amount should request the current authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt from the developer. They should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>NOC and Approval Status<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Peace Apartments are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Possession Timeline<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No possession date has been published on the official page. Any date quoted in a listing should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer\\\\u2019s official documentation.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/68', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 11:14:00', '2026-11-16 11:14:00'),
(1154, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1416, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Peace Apartments Payment Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The official project page publishes several payment plan sheets for apartments and a separate plan sheet for shops and showrooms. The plans differ by unit type, so buyers should ask which plan applies to their unit and get the booking amount, installment schedule and duration in writing from the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel. Any plan quoted by a third party should be treated as unverified.\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/68', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 11:14:00', '2026-11-16 11:14:00'),
(1155, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1417, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Peace Apartments Master Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image\\\":null,\\\"badge\\\":null}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/68', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 11:14:00', '2026-11-16 11:14:00'),
(1156, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1418, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Peace Apartments Location in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"categories\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Nearby Landmarks and Attractions:\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Naya Nazimabad\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"2\\\\u20135 minutes\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"North Nazimabad\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"5\\\\u201310 minutes\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Naya Nazimabad Gymkhana\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"2\\\\u20134 minutes\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Grand Jama Masjid\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"2\\\\u20133 minutes\\\"}]}],\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Peace Apartments is located inside Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, as stated on the official project page. The page also mentions a flyover that connects North Nazimabad to Naya Nazimabad. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location and approach route with the developer before visiting.\\\",\\\"image\\\":null}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/68', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 11:14:00', '2026-11-16 11:14:00'),
(1157, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1419, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Where is Peace Apartments Naya Nazimabad located?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Peace Apartments is located inside Naya Nazimabad, Karachi. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location with the developer.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What is Peace Apartments price?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"No separate price list is published as text on the official page, and prices appear on the plan sheets. Buyers should request the current authorised price schedule and treat any figure in third-party listings as unverified.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"How many bedrooms in Peace Apartments?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The official page lists 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments. Sizes are shown on the plan sheets and should be confirmed with the developer.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What is Peace Apartments payment plan?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The official page publishes payment plan sheets for apartments and for shops and showrooms. Buyers should confirm the plan that applies to their unit and get the terms in writing before paying any amount.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Is Peace Apartments NOC approved?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"No project-specific approval documents are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the NOC and approval details and verify them with the relevant authority.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What amenities are available in Peace Apartments?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The official page lists a community hall, a gaming room, a senior citizen lounge, a male and female gym, a co-working space, a library, a community garden and a children\\\\u2019s play area, along with parking, lifts, a standby generator and a fire fighting system.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Are shops and showrooms available in Peace Apartments?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The official page shows floor plans and a payment plan sheet for shops and showrooms. Buyers should confirm availability with the developer.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Are Peace Apartments the same as Rahat Residency or Globe Residency?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"No. They are separate projects listed separately on the Naya Nazimabad website. Buyers should confirm which project any payment or document refers to before proceeding.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Can overseas buyers book in Peace Apartments?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Overseas buyers should deal only through the developer\\\\u2019s authorised channels and should not send funds against unverified offers.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Why consider Peace Apartments Naya Nazimabad?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"It may suit families who want a 2, 3 or 4 bedroom apartment inside a master-planned community with in-building amenities. The sensible step is to verify the price, payment plan and approvals with the developer before booking.\\\"}],\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/68', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/156.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-16 11:14:00', '2026-11-16 11:14:00'),
