(1439, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1482, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Vision Tower\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"bg_image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/projects\\\\\\/1794898860_hero_1.jpg\\\",\\\"bg_image_alt\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Vision Tower at Naya Nazimabad Karachi\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"badge\\\":null,\\\"bg_image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/projects\\\\\\/1794898860_hero_1.jpg\\\",\\\"bg_image_alt\\\":\\\"Vision Tower at Naya Nazimabad Karachi\\\",\\\"image_alt\\\":\\\"Vision Tower at Naya Nazimabad Karachi\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/74', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:09:35', '2026-11-17 07:09:35'),
(1440, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1484, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/projects\\\\\\/1794898860_poster_1.jpg\\\",\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Vision Tower by Naya Nazimabad\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Vision Tower is a commercial project inside Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, a gated, master-planned township developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). Listings from the real estate agency S.S Enterprises describe high-footfall ground-floor showrooms, four floors (full or half) for corporate offices, ballrooms, restaurants and event halls, and an exclusive rooftop. Prices and plans differ by unit, so buyers should confirm them directly with the developer before booking.\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/projects\\\\\\/1794898860_poster_1.jpg\\\",\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/74', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:09:35', '2026-11-17 07:09:35'),
(1441, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1485, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Vision Tower Amenities\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"No full amenity schedule is published on the source page. The listing mentions the following features:\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/74', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:09:35', '2026-11-17 07:09:35'),
(1442, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1486, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"images\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Vision Tower Project Gallery\\\",\\\"images\\\":[{\\\"src\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794899375_6afbfdafd5b6b.jpg\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Exterior\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Project Photo\\\"}]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/74', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:09:35', '2026-11-17 07:09:35'),
(1443, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 182, '{\"body\":\"\"}', '{\"body\":\"<p>Vision Tower is positioned for business owners and investors who want a shop, an office or a large hall inside a gated township with a residential population. The mix of showrooms, office space and event space suits retail, corporate and hospitality use.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Because the listing data comes from a real estate agency, buyers should treat prices, sizes and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n  <tbody><tr>\\r\\n    <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n    <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad (Javedan Corporation Limited, Arif Habib Group)<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Commercial<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Shops, offices, restaurant and hall spaces<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Unit Sizes<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>About 404 to 2,160 sq. ft, as listed<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Price Range (listed)<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>PKR 1.62 crore to PKR 5.4 crore, subject to change<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Not published<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Installments available, confirm schedule with developer<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Commercial tower in a master-planned community<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Vision Tower is part of the wider Naya Nazimabad community. The listing describes ground-floor showrooms, four upper floors for offices and event space, and a rooftop. The tower layout and the number of units should be confirmed through the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Commercial Units in Vision Tower<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The listing shows the following layouts:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li>Commercial office or space: about 648 to 790 sq. ft, listed at PKR 1.62 to 1.97 crore.<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Commercial shop: about 404 to 621 sq. ft, listed at PKR 2.57 to 3.98 crore.<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Restaurant or hall: about 2,160 sq. ft, listed at PKR 4.43 to 4.54 crore.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers seeking shops for sale in Vision Tower or offices for sale in Naya Nazimabad should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No floor plan is published on the source page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Listings show commercial units at about PKR 1.62 crore to PKR 5.4 crore, or roughly PKR 20,500 to PKR 64,000 per square foot, depending on the unit type and floor. Shops on the lower floors are priced much higher per square foot than office space.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>These are agency listings and not an official developer price list. Buyers should request the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt, and should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Vision Tower are published on the source page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession date has been published for Vision Tower. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer\\u2019s official documentation.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/74', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:09:35', '2026-11-17 07:09:35'),
(1444, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1487, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"<p>Vision Tower is positioned for business owners and investors who want a shop, an office or a large hall inside a gated township with a residential population. The mix of showrooms, office space and event space suits retail, corporate and hospitality use.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Because the listing data comes from a real estate agency, buyers should treat prices, sizes and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<table>\\\\r\\\\n  <tbody><tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <th>Feature<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n    <th>Details<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad (Javedan Corporation Limited, Arif Habib Group)<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Property Type<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Commercial<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Unit Types<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Shops, offices, restaurant and hall spaces<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Unit Sizes<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>About 404 to 2,160 sq. ft, as listed<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Price Range (listed)<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>PKR 1.62 crore to PKR 5.4 crore, subject to change<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Handover<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Not published<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Location<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Payment Plan<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Installments available, confirm schedule with developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Lifestyle<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Commercial tower in a master-planned community<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tbody><\\\\\\/table>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Vision Tower is part of the wider Naya Nazimabad community. The listing describes ground-floor showrooms, four upper floors for offices and event space, and a rooftop. The tower layout and the number of units should be confirmed through the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Commercial Units in Vision Tower<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The listing shows the following layouts:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n  <li>Commercial office or space: about 648 to 790 sq. ft, listed at PKR 1.62 to 1.97 crore.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n  <li>Commercial shop: about 404 to 621 sq. ft, listed at PKR 2.57 to 3.98 crore.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n  <li>Restaurant or hall: about 2,160 sq. ft, listed at PKR 4.43 to 4.54 crore.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers seeking shops for sale in Vision Tower or offices for sale in Naya Nazimabad should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No floor plan is published on the source page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Listings show commercial units at about PKR 1.62 crore to PKR 5.4 crore, or roughly PKR 20,500 to PKR 64,000 per square foot, depending on the unit type and floor. Shops on the lower floors are priced much higher per square foot than office space.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>These are agency listings and not an official developer price list. Buyers should request the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt, and should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Vision Tower are published on the source page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No possession date has been published for Vision Tower. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer\\\\u2019s official documentation.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/74', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:09:35', '2026-11-17 07:09:35'),
(1445, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1488, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Vision Tower Payment Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Vision Tower units are listed as available on installments, and the source page offers a payment plan document for download. One listing mentions a 9 month installment plan for a 3rd floor unit. Plans differ by unit, so buyers should get the booking amount, installment schedule and duration in writing from the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel. Any plan quoted by a third party should be treated as unverified.\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/74', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:09:35', '2026-11-17 07:09:35'),
(1446, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1489, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Vision Tower Master Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794899375_6afbfdafdb68d.jpg\\\",\\\"badge\\\":null}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/74', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:09:35', '2026-11-17 07:09:35'),
(1447, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1490, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Vision Tower Location in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"categories\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Nearby Landmarks and Attractions:\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Manghopir Road\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"2\\\\u20135 min\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"North Nazimabad\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"6\\\\u201310 min\\\"}]}],\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Vision Tower is located inside Naya Nazimabad, a township of roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road in Karachi, about 2 km from North Nazimabad. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location and approach route with the developer before visiting.\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794899375_6afbfdafdcd70.jpg\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/74', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:09:35', '2026-11-17 07:09:35'),
(1448, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1491, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Where is Vision Tower Naya Nazimabad located?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Vision Tower is located inside Naya Nazimabad, near Manghopir Road in Karachi. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location with the developer.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What is Vision Tower price?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Listings show commercial units from about PKR 1.62 crore to PKR 5.4 crore, depending on the type and floor. These are agency listings, so buyers should request the authorised price schedule from the developer.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What type of units are available in Vision Tower?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Listings show commercial offices, shops, restaurant spaces and halls. Buyers should confirm sizes and availability with the developer.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What is Vision Tower payment plan?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Units are listed as available on installments, with plans that differ by unit. Buyers should get the complete schedule in writing before paying any amount.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Is Vision Tower NOC approved?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"No project-specific approval documents are published on the source page. Buyers should ask the developer for the NOC and approval details and verify them with the relevant authority.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What can Vision Tower be used for?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The listing describes showrooms, corporate offices, ballrooms, restaurants and event halls. Buyers should confirm the permitted use of a specific unit with the developer.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Does Vision Tower have a rooftop?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Yes, the listing mentions an exclusive rooftop. Buyers should confirm its use and access with the developer.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Is Vision Tower the same as Voco Tower or S.S Vision Enclave?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"No. They are separate commercial projects in Naya Nazimabad. Buyers should confirm which project any payment or document refers to before proceeding.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Can overseas buyers book in Vision Tower?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"S.S Enterprises states that overseas Pakistanis can buy through a Special Power of Attorney and a Roshan Digital Account. Buyers should confirm the process and required documents with the developer and should not send funds against unverified offers.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Why consider Vision Tower Naya Nazimabad?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"It may suit business owners and investors who want a shop, office or hall inside a master-planned township, with installment options. The sensible step is to verify the unit type, price, payment plan and approvals with the developer before booking.\\\"}],\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/74', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:09:35', '2026-11-17 07:09:35'),
