(1512, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1508, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"S.S Vision Enclave Naya Nazimabad\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"S.S Vision Enclave is a planned commercial project in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, described as a ground plus 7 tower. Its status is \\\\u201cto be announced\\\\u201d, and bookings have not opened. No official unit schedule, price list, payment plan or possession date has been published, so location details, unit mix, price and timeline beyond the basics remain unconfirmed.\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794900882_6afc03926eb0e.jpg\\\",\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/76', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:34:42', '2026-11-17 07:34:42'),
(1513, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1509, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"S.S Vision Enclave Amenities\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"No amenity schedule has been published for S.S Vision Enclave. Any facility list seen in third-party material should be treated as unverified until project documentation is released.\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/76', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:34:42', '2026-11-17 07:34:42'),
(1514, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1510, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"images\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"S.S Vision Enclave Project Gallery\\\",\\\"images\\\":[{\\\"src\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794900882_6afc039271108.jpg\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Exterior\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Project Photo\\\"}]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/76', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:34:42', '2026-11-17 07:34:42'),
(1515, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 184, '{\"body\":\"\"}', '{\"body\":\"<p>At present, S.S Vision Enclave exists as an announced concept rather than an open project. It is described as a flagship commercial tower of ground plus 7 floors inside Naya Nazimabad, a gated, master-planned township of roughly 1,300 acres developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). That makes it different from a project buyers can inspect, price or book today.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Until official launch documentation is published, the accurate position is that buyers can register interest and wait for confirmed details. Nothing more should be promised, and no payment should change hands against this project name.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n  <tbody><tr>\\r\\n    <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n    <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Not published<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Commercial<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Building Height<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Ground + 7 floors<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>To be announced<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Not disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>To be announced<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>To be announced<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Status<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>To be announced, bookings not open<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No master plan has been published for S.S Vision Enclave. The tower layout, floor allocation and unit mix will only become clear if and when official documentation is released. Buyers should not assume that details of any other Naya Nazimabad commercial project apply to this one.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Commercial Units in S.S Vision Enclave<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No unit schedule has been published. Unit types, sizes and floor allocation are not confirmed, so buyers seeking shops, offices or commercial floors in S.S Vision Enclave should register interest and wait for the official unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No floor plan has been published. Floor plans for each unit category should be requested once the project is formally launched.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>There is no official S.S Vision Enclave price, because no price list has been published. Bookings have not opened. Buyers searching for an S.S Vision Enclave price or booking amount should register interest only, and should not pay any amount to any party claiming to collect bookings before an official launch.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents specific to S.S Vision Enclave have been published. Buyers should verify the position directly with the developer or the relevant authority once the project is formally launched.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession timeline exists for S.S Vision Enclave, because the project has not been formally launched. Any date quoted today would be speculation.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/76', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:34:42', '2026-11-17 07:34:42'),
(1516, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1511, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"<p>At present, S.S Vision Enclave exists as an announced concept rather than an open project. It is described as a flagship commercial tower of ground plus 7 floors inside Naya Nazimabad, a gated, master-planned township of roughly 1,300 acres developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). That makes it different from a project buyers can inspect, price or book today.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Until official launch documentation is published, the accurate position is that buyers can register interest and wait for confirmed details. Nothing more should be promised, and no payment should change hands against this project name.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<table>\\\\r\\\\n  <tbody><tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <th>Feature<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n    <th>Details<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Not published<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Property Type<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Commercial<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Building Height<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Ground + 7 floors<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Unit Types<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>To be announced<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Total Land Size<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Not disclosed<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Handover<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>To be announced<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Location<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Payment Plan<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>To be announced<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n  <tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>Status<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <td>To be announced, bookings not open<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n  <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tbody><\\\\\\/table>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No master plan has been published for S.S Vision Enclave. The tower layout, floor allocation and unit mix will only become clear if and when official documentation is released. Buyers should not assume that details of any other Naya Nazimabad commercial project apply to this one.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Commercial Units in S.S Vision Enclave<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No unit schedule has been published. Unit types, sizes and floor allocation are not confirmed, so buyers seeking shops, offices or commercial floors in S.S Vision Enclave should register interest and wait for the official unit schedule.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No floor plan has been published. Floor plans for each unit category should be requested once the project is formally launched.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>There is no official S.S Vision Enclave price, because no price list has been published. Bookings have not opened. Buyers searching for an S.S Vision Enclave price or booking amount should register interest only, and should not pay any amount to any party claiming to collect bookings before an official launch.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents specific to S.S Vision Enclave have been published. Buyers should verify the position directly with the developer or the relevant authority once the project is formally launched.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No possession timeline exists for S.S Vision Enclave, because the project has not been formally launched. Any date quoted today would be speculation.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/76', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:34:42', '2026-11-17 07:34:42'),
(1517, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1512, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"S.S Vision Enclave Payment Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"No payment plan has been released for S.S Vision Enclave. If the project launches, the schedule should be published through the authorised sales channel at that time. Until then, any payment plan or booking amount quoted under this name should be treated as unverified.\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/76', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:34:42', '2026-11-17 07:34:42'),
