pages\\\\\\/1794834328_6afaff98cac32.jpg\\\"}],\\\"unselected_ids\\\":[76,74,73,69,68,67,66,65,64,63,62,61,60,59,58,57,56,55,54,53,52,51,50,49,48,47,46,45,44,43,42,41,40,39,38,37,36,35,34]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/185', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:59:39', '2026-11-17 07:59:39'),
(1553, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1520, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"<p><br><\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"For buyers searching for a Naya Nazimabad 120 yard house for sale, the 120 sq yd villa is the size most families ask about. It gives a ground plus one home with three or four bedrooms inside a gated township. This page covers where 120 yard houses are found, what they cost in recent listings, and what to confirm in writing before you pay.\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/185', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:59:39', '2026-11-17 07:59:39'),
(1554, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1521, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"q\\\":\\\"1. What is the price of a 120 yard house in Naya Nazimabad?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Recent listings show asking prices from about PKR 2.84 crore to PKR 4.5 crore. The price depends on the block, road width, view and construction quality.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"2. Where are 120 yard houses for sale in Naya Nazimabad?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Recent listings come from Blocks A, B, C, D and M of Naya Nazimabad, Karachi.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"3. How many bedrooms does a 120 yard house have?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Most listings show three or four bedrooms, usually in a ground plus one layout with a drawing room and lounge.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"4. Which block is best for a 120 yard house in Naya Nazimabad?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"It depends on your priorities. Block A listings stress closeness to the Gymkhana, Block C listings often mention parks and masjids, and Block D and M listings are generally lower priced. Visit the blocks and compare before deciding.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"5. Are 120 yard houses in Naya Nazimabad brand new or pre-owned?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Both are listed. Some houses are described as brand new or built in 2025 to 2026, while others are pre-owned and well maintained.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"6. Is a park facing 120 yard house more expensive?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Park facing, corner and west-open houses are often listed at higher asking prices than standard ones, but the final price is negotiated with the seller.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"7. Can I buy a 120 yard house in Naya Nazimabad on installments?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Most 120 yard houses are resale properties, so payment terms are agreed with the seller. Ask for any installment or bank financing option in writing before booking.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"8. What documents should I check before buying a 120 yard house?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Check the owner\\\\u2019s identity, the property documents, the lease or transfer status with the society office, and any pending dues. Verify every document independently before paying.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"9. What facilities are near Naya Nazimabad 120 yard houses?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The Naya Nazimabad website lists the Gymkhana, a Jama Masjid, Ali Habib Medical Center and a cricket stadium. Distance from a specific house depends on its block.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"10. Is a 120 yard house in Naya Nazimabad a good option for families?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"It suits families who want a private ground plus one home with three or four bedrooms in a gated community. Check the block, road width and documents before deciding, and compare more than one house.\\\"}],\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/185', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:59:39', '2026-11-17 07:59:39'),
