ads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794898151_6afbf8e734ace.jpg\\\"}],\\\"unselected_ids\\\":[76,75,74,71,69,67,66,65,64,63,62,61,60,59,58,57,56,55,54,53,52,51,50,49,48,47,46,45,44,43,42,41,40,39,38,37,36,35,34]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/186', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 09:16:20', '2026-11-17 09:16:20'),
(1578, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1528, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"q\\\":\\\"1. What is the price of apartments in Naya Nazimabad?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Recent listings show 2 bedroom apartments from roughly PKR 1.35 to 2.15 crore and 3 bedroom apartments from roughly PKR 2 to 3.3 crore. The price depends on the tower, floor, size and view.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"2. Which are the main apartment projects in Naya Nazimabad?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Projects include Peace Apartments, Signature Tower, Rahat Residency, Globe Residency, Stadium View Residencia and Grace Tower.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"3. How many bedrooms do Naya Nazimabad apartments have?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Apartments are offered with 2, 3 and 4 bedrooms, and some towers also offer duplexes. Common layouts are 2 bed lounge, 2 bed DD and 3 bed lounge.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"4. What size are apartments in Naya Nazimabad?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Listings show sizes from about 900 sq. ft for a 2 bed lounge to about 1,960 sq. ft for a large 3 bed. Sizes differ by tower, so confirm them on the unit schedule.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"5. Can I buy Naya Nazimabad apartments on installments?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Yes. Several projects and listings mention installment plans of about four to six years. The terms differ by project, so get the full schedule in writing before booking.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"6. Are there ready apartments in Naya Nazimabad?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Some units are listed as ready for possession, while others are under construction or at the pre-launch stage. Confirm the possession date for your specific unit in writing.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"7. What amenities do Naya Nazimabad apartments offer?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Depending on the tower, the township\\\\u2019s project pages list reserved parking, lifts, a standby generator, a gym, a community hall, a children\\\\u2019s play area and an amenities floor.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"8. Are there park-facing or corner apartments in Naya Nazimabad?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Yes. Rahat Residency describes park-facing units, and Signature Tower describes corner apartments with parks on two sides. These units are often priced higher.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"9. Are there shops or commercial units in Naya Nazimabad towers?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Yes. Some towers, such as Grace Tower and Stadium View Residencia, include retail shops or showrooms alongside apartments, and separate commercial towers are also listed.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"10. How do I choose the right apartment in Naya Nazimabad?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Compare two or three towers on size, view, parking, payment plan and handover date. Visit the site, ask for the unit schedule and floor plan, and verify every figure with the developer before paying.\\\"}],\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/186', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 09:16:20', '2026-11-17 09:16:20'),
