(1598, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 187, '{\"body\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\"}', '{\"body\":\"<p>Naya Nazimabad is a gated, master-planned township covering roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road in Karachi, approximately 2 km from North Nazimabad. It is developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). The township\'s website lists community facilities such as the Gymkhana, Jama Masjid, Ali Habib Medical Center and a cricket stadium. A villa in Naya Nazimabad offers families a private home with its own entrance, parking and terrace within a secure residential community.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Facts: Villas in Naya Nazimabad<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>This table summarises the key details available in recent listings for villas for sale in Naya Nazimabad.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Detail<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Information<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Villa Sizes<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>120, 160, 240 and 400 sq. yards<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Blocks Seen in Listings<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>A, B, C, D, K, L, M, N and P<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Typical Construction<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Ground plus one floor<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Bedrooms<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>3 to 4 in smaller villas, and up to 6 or more in larger properties<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Condition<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Brand new and pre-owned villas<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Listed Prices<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Approximately PKR 3.5 crore for 120 sq. yards to PKR 13 crore for 400 sq. yards<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Prices vary depending on the block, road width, property view and construction condition. These figures should be treated as general market estimates.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Villa Sizes and Price Ranges<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Recent property listings indicate the following asking prices for villas in Naya Nazimabad, depending on their size and features:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><strong>120 sq. yard villa:<\\/strong> Approximately PKR 3.5 to 4.5 crore, generally featuring 3 to 4 bedrooms.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>160 sq. yard villa:<\\/strong> Approximately PKR 4 to 5.9 crore, generally featuring 4 bedrooms.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>240 sq. yard villa or bungalow:<\\/strong> Approximately PKR 6 to 7.8 crore, with 4 to 6 bedrooms.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>400 sq. yard house:<\\/strong> A recent listing indicates an asking price of approximately PKR 13 crore, with 4 to 8 bedrooms.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A 120 sq. yard villa can suit a family looking for a compact private home, while a 240 sq. yard bungalow offers more space for larger families or joint-family living, including additional bedrooms and lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Villas by Block<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Recent listings for villas in Naya Nazimabad cover several residential blocks, each offering different property features and locations.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Block A<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Villas in Block A are often advertised as being near the Gymkhana, park-facing or west-open. Asking prices are generally among the higher ones in the township.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Block B<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Block B features listings for park-facing villas, particularly in the 120 sq. yard category.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Block C<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Block C offers several brand-new and ready-to-move-in villas. Listings often highlight locations near a mosque, park or football ground, with property sizes including 120, 160 and 240 sq. yards.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Block D and Other Blocks<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Block D features listings for brand-new villas and corner bungalows. Residential plots and houses are also available in Blocks K, L, M, N and P.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Layout and Features of a Naya Nazimabad Villa<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Most villas in Naya Nazimabad follow a ground-plus-one-floor layout, providing separate living and sleeping spaces for families.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><strong>Ground Floor:<\\/strong> Generally includes a drawing room, dining area, lounge, kitchen and, in some villas, one bedroom.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>First Floor:<\\/strong> Usually features the remaining bedrooms, an additional lounge and a terrace or balcony.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Car Parking:<\\/strong> Dedicated parking space within the property plot.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Property Options:<\\/strong> Some villas offer west-open, corner or park-facing locations, while selected listings feature a one-unit design.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Corner, west-open and park-facing villas are often advertised at higher asking prices than standard properties of similar sizes.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Payment<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Most villas for sale in Naya Nazimabad are resale properties offered by individual owners. Therefore, prices are generally negotiable, and payment terms are agreed upon between the buyer and seller. Some property listings also mention the possibility of bank financing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers comparing a Naya Nazimabad bungalow for sale should evaluate properties with similar plot sizes, locations and construction standards. Before paying any token amount, request written confirmation of the complete payment terms, including:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Final agreed property price<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Token or booking amount<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Payment schedule and remaining balance<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Transfer and documentation charges<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Expected possession and transfer date<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Checks Before You Buy<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before purchasing a villa in Naya Nazimabad, complete the following checks to reduce the risk of property disputes or unexpected expenses:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Confirm that the seller is the registered owner and verify that all property documents are genuine and complete.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Check the lease or transfer status with the relevant society office.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Confirm whether the villa is brand new or pre-owned and inspect its construction quality.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Verify the exact block, plot number, plot size and road width during an on-site visit.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Inspect the property\'s structure, plumbing, electrical systems and finishing.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Make payments only through traceable banking channels and obtain a written receipt for every transaction.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Final Thoughts<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Naya Nazimabad villa for sale can be a suitable option for families looking for a private ground-plus-one-floor home within a gated residential community. With different property sizes, residential blocks and price ranges, buyers can compare options according to their family requirements and budget.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before exploring other houses for sale in Karachi, visit your shortlisted blocks, inspect the villa, verify its ownership documents and obtain the final price and payment terms in writing. Taking these steps can help you make a more informed property purchase decision.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/187', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 09:43:37', '2026-11-17 09:43:37'),
(1599, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1534, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"<p><br><\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"<p><br><\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"<p><br><\\\\\\/p>\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"For buyers searching for a Naya Nazimabad villa for sale, the township offers ground plus one villas and bungalows in 120, 160, 240 and 400 square yard sizes. This page explains the sizes, the price ranges seen in recent listings, the blocks where villas are found, and what to confirm in writing before you buy.\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"<p>Naya Nazimabad is a gated, master-planned township covering roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road in Karachi, approximately 2 km from North Nazimabad. It is developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). The township\'s website lists community facilities such as the Gymkhana, Jama Masjid, Ali Habib Medical Center and a cricket stadium. A villa in Naya Nazimabad offers families a private home with its own entrance, parking and terrace within a secure residential community.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Key Facts: Villas in Naya Nazimabad<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>This table summarises the key details available in recent listings for villas for sale in Naya Nazimabad.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<table>\\\\r\\\\n<tbody><tr>\\\\r\\\\n<th>Detail<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n<th>Information<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Location<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Villa Sizes<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>120, 160, 240 and 400 sq. yards<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Blocks Seen in Listings<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>A, B, C, D, K, L, M, N and P<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Typical Construction<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Ground plus one floor<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Bedrooms<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>3 to 4 in smaller villas, and up to 6 or more in larger properties<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Condition<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Brand new and pre-owned villas<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Listed Prices<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Approximately PKR 3.5 crore for 120 sq. yards to PKR 13 crore for 400 sq. yards<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tbody><\\\\\\/table>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Prices vary depending on the block, road width, property view and construction condition. These figures should be treated as general market estimates.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Villa Sizes and Price Ranges<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Recent property listings indicate the following asking prices for villas in Naya Nazimabad, depending on their size and features:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n<li><strong>120 sq. yard villa:<\\\\\\/strong> Approximately PKR 3.5 to 4.5 crore, generally featuring 3 to 4 bedrooms.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><strong>160 sq. yard villa:<\\\\\\/strong> Approximately PKR 4 to 5.9 crore, generally featuring 4 bedrooms.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><strong>240 sq. yard villa or bungalow:<\\\\\\/strong> Approximately PKR 6 to 7.8 crore, with 4 to 6 bedrooms.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><strong>400 sq. yard house:<\\\\\\/strong> A recent listing indicates an asking price of approximately PKR 13 crore, with 4 to 8 bedrooms.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>A 120 sq. yard villa can suit a family looking for a compact private home, while a 240 sq. yard bungalow offers more space for larger families or joint-family living, including additional bedrooms and lounges.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Villas by Block<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Recent listings for villas in Naya Nazimabad cover several residential blocks, each offering different property features and locations.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Block A<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Villas in Block A are often advertised as being near the Gymkhana, park-facing or west-open. Asking prices are generally among the higher ones in the township.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Block B<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Block B features listings for park-facing villas, particularly in the 120 sq. yard category.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Block C<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Block C offers several brand-new and ready-to-move-in villas. Listings often highlight locations near a mosque, park or football ground, with property sizes including 120, 160 and 240 sq. yards.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Block D and Other Blocks<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n<p>Block D features listings for brand-new villas and corner bungalows. Residential plots and houses are also available in Blocks K, L, M, N and P.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Layout and Features of a Naya Nazimabad Villa<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Most villas in Naya Nazimabad follow a ground-plus-one-floor layout, providing separate living and sleeping spaces for families.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n<li><strong>Ground Floor:<\\\\\\/strong> Generally includes a drawing room, dining area, lounge, kitchen and, in some villas, one bedroom.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><strong>First Floor:<\\\\\\/strong> Usually features the remaining bedrooms, an additional lounge and a terrace or balcony.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><strong>Car Parking:<\\\\\\/strong> Dedicated parking space within the property plot.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><strong>Property Options:<\\\\\\/strong> Some villas offer west-open, corner or park-facing locations, while selected listings feature a one-unit design.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Corner, west-open and park-facing villas are often advertised at higher asking prices than standard properties of similar sizes.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Price and Payment<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Most villas for sale in Naya Nazimabad are resale properties offered by individual owners. Therefore, prices are generally negotiable, and payment terms are agreed upon between the buyer and seller. Some property listings also mention the possibility of bank financing.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers comparing a Naya Nazimabad bungalow for sale should evaluate properties with similar plot sizes, locations and construction standards. Before paying any token amount, request written confirmation of the complete payment terms, including:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Final agreed property price<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Token or booking amount<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Payment schedule and remaining balance<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Transfer and documentation charges<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Expected possession and transfer date<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Checks Before You Buy<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Before purchasing a villa in Naya Nazimabad, complete the following checks to reduce the risk of property disputes or unexpected expenses:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Confirm that the seller is the registered owner and verify that all property documents are genuine and complete.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Check the lease or transfer status with the relevant society office.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Confirm whether the villa is brand new or pre-owned and inspect its construction quality.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Verify the exact block, plot number, plot size and road width during an on-site visit.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Inspect the property\'s structure, plumbing, electrical systems and finishing.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li>Make payments only through traceable banking channels and obtain a written receipt for every transaction.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Final Thoughts<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>A Naya Nazimabad villa for sale can be a suitable option for families looking for a private ground-plus-one-floor home within a gated residential community. With different property sizes, residential blocks and price ranges, buyers can compare options according to their family requirements and budget.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Before exploring other houses for sale in Karachi, visit your shortlisted blocks, inspect the villa, verify its ownership documents and obtain the final price and payment terms in writing. Taking these steps can help you make a more informed property purchase decision.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"<p><br><\\\\\\/p>\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/187', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 09:43:37', '2026-11-17 09:43:37'),
(1600, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1535, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"q\\\":\\\"1. What is the price of a villa in Naya Nazimabad?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Recent listings show asking prices from roughly PKR 3.5 crore for a 120 yard villa to PKR 7.8 crore for a 240 yard bungalow, and about PKR 13 crore for a 400 yard house. The price depends on the block, size, view and condition.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"2. What villa sizes are available in Naya Nazimabad?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Listings show 120, 160, 240 and 400 square yard villas and bungalows.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"3. In which blocks are villas for sale in Naya Nazimabad?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Recent listings come from Blocks A, B, C and D, and the township also has Blocks K, L, M, N and P.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"4. How many bedrooms does a Naya Nazimabad villa have?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"A 120 yard villa usually has three or four bedrooms, a 160 yard villa usually has four, and 240 yard villas are listed with four to six bedrooms.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"5. Are the villas in Naya Nazimabad brand new?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Both brand new and pre-owned villas are listed. Some are described as built in 2025 or 2026, while others are used and well maintained.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"6. What is a one unit villa in Naya Nazimabad?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Listings use \\\\u201cone unit\\\\u201d for a villa designed as a single home on the plot, rather than a portion-wise layout. Buyers should confirm the layout and construction on site.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"7. Can I buy a villa in Naya Nazimabad on installments?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Most villas are resale properties, so payment terms are agreed with the seller. Some listings mention bank finance, so ask for any installment or finance option in writing before booking.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"8. Is a park facing or west open villa more expensive?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Park facing, corner and west-open villas are often listed at higher asking prices than standard ones, but the final price is negotiated with the seller.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"9. What documents should I check before buying a villa?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Check the owner\\\\u2019s identity, the property documents, the lease or transfer status with the society office, and any pending dues. Verify every document independently before paying.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"10. Is a villa in Naya Nazimabad suitable for a big family?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"A 240 or 400 yard villa offers more bedrooms and lounges for a larger family, while a 120 or 160 yard villa suits a smaller family. Check the block, road width and layout before deciding.\\\"}],\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/187', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 09:43:37', '2026-11-17 09:43:37'),
(1601, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1536, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"button_text\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"email\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":null,\\\"button_text\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"email\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pretitle\\\":\\\"LET\'S CONNECT\\\",\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Invest in Your Future\\\",\\\"form_small\\\":\\\"REQUEST\\\",\\\"form_large\\\":\\\"A CALL BACK\\\",\\\"submit_button\\\":\\\"REQUEST NOW\\\",\\\"bg_image\\\":null}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/187', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 09:43:37', '2026-11-17 09:43:37'),
(1602, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1538, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":null,\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p><br><\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":null,\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/pages/187', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 09:43:37', '2026-11-17 09:43:37'),
