(1654, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1550, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"images\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Goldcrest Bay Sands Project Gallery\\\",\\\"images\\\":[{\\\"src\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794920015_6afc4e4f65855.jpg\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Exterior\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Project Photo\\\"},{\\\"src\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794920015_6afc4e4f65db5.jpg\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Exterior\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Project Photo\\\"},{\\\"src\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794920015_6afc4e4f66248.jpg\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Exterior\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Project Photo\\\"},{\\\"src\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794920015_6afc4e4f6659e.jpg\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Exterior\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Project Photo\\\"}]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/77', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 12:53:35', '2026-11-17 12:53:35'),
(1655, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 189, '{\"body\":\"\"}', '{\"body\":\"<p>Goldcrest Bay Sands is positioned for buyers who want a sea-view apartment inside a waterfront community in DHA Phase 8. The project offers compact 1-bedroom units as well as large 2- and 3-bedroom apartments, with customisable interiors described for Goldcrest Bay Sands 2.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Because the available information comes from project material rather than a single official price list, buyers should treat prices, sizes, and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr><th>Feature<\\/th><th>Details<\\/th><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Developer<\\/td><td>To be confirmed<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Property Type<\\/td><td>Residential apartments and duplex townhouses<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Unit Types<\\/td><td>1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Unit Sizes<\\/td><td>About 862 sq. ft. to over 2,700 sq. ft., as quoted<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Price Range (Quoted)<\\/td><td>From about PKR 3.45 crore to over PKR 8 crore, subject to change<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Handover<\\/td><td>Not published<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Location<\\/td><td>HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8 Extension, Karachi<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Payment Plan<\\/td><td>About 10% down payment with 3- to 5-year installment plans; confirm with developer<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Lifestyle<\\/td><td>Waterfront high-rise living<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Goldcrest Bay Sands is part of the wider HMR Waterfront community. Goldcrest Bay Sands 2 is described as a 33-storey development. Different material gives different tower counts for the project, so the number of towers and the layout should be confirmed through the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Apartments in Goldcrest Bay Sands<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The project material shows the following layouts:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><p><strong>1-bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> About 862 to 896 sq. ft., with partial sea views, quoted from about PKR 3.45 to 3.6 crore.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p><strong>2-bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> About 1,581 sq. ft., with a private plunge pool in Goldcrest Bay Sands 2.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p><strong>3-bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> About 2,739 sq. ft. and larger, with plunge pools and ocean views in Goldcrest Bay Sands 2.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p><strong>Duplex townhouses:<\\/strong> Quoted on a four-year plan with 10% down.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Goldcrest Bay Sands should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No floor plan is published in the material reviewed here. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Quoted prices include about PKR 3.45 crore for an 862 sq. ft. 1-bedroom apartment (about PKR 40,000 per sq. ft.) and over PKR 8 crore for larger plunge-pool apartments, for example, about PKR 8.09 crore for a 2-bedroom unit.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>DHA allotment and utility connection charges are mentioned as extra in at least one source. These are not an official developer price list, so buyers should:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><p>Request a written rate sheet.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p>Obtain a complete list of additional charges.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p>Ask for an official booking receipt.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p>Avoid paying any amount to an unverified agent.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Goldcrest Bay Sands are published in the material reviewed here. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession date has been published for Goldcrest Bay Sands. Any date quoted should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer\\u2019s official documentation.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/77', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 12:53:35', '2026-11-17 12:53:35'),
(1656, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1551, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"<p>Goldcrest Bay Sands is positioned for buyers who want a sea-view apartment inside a waterfront community in DHA Phase 8. The project offers compact 1-bedroom units as well as large 2- and 3-bedroom apartments, with customisable interiors described for Goldcrest Bay Sands 2.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Because the available information comes from project material rather than a single official price list, buyers should treat prices, sizes, and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<table>\\\\r\\\\n<tbody><tr><th>Feature<\\\\\\/th><th>Details<\\\\\\/th><\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr><td>Developer<\\\\\\/td><td>To be confirmed<\\\\\\/td><\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr><td>Property Type<\\\\\\/td><td>Residential apartments and duplex townhouses<\\\\\\/td><\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr><td>Unit Types<\\\\\\/td><td>1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments<\\\\\\/td><\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr><td>Unit Sizes<\\\\\\/td><td>About 862 sq. ft. to over 2,700 sq. ft., as quoted<\\\\\\/td><\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr><td>Price Range (Quoted)<\\\\\\/td><td>From about PKR 3.45 crore to over PKR 8 crore, subject to change<\\\\\\/td><\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr><td>Handover<\\\\\\/td><td>Not published<\\\\\\/td><\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr><td>Location<\\\\\\/td><td>HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8 Extension, Karachi<\\\\\\/td><\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr><td>Payment Plan<\\\\\\/td><td>About 10% down payment with 3- to 5-year installment plans; confirm with developer<\\\\\\/td><\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr><td>Lifestyle<\\\\\\/td><td>Waterfront high-rise living<\\\\\\/td><\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tbody><\\\\\\/table>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Goldcrest Bay Sands is part of the wider HMR Waterfront community. Goldcrest Bay Sands 2 is described as a 33-storey development. Different material gives different tower counts for the project, so the number of towers and the layout should be confirmed through the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Apartments in Goldcrest Bay Sands<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The project material shows the following layouts:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p><strong>1-bedroom apartments:<\\\\\\/strong> About 862 to 896 sq. ft., with partial sea views, quoted from about PKR 3.45 to 3.6 crore.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p><strong>2-bedroom apartments:<\\\\\\/strong> About 1,581 sq. ft., with a private plunge pool in Goldcrest Bay Sands 2.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p><strong>3-bedroom apartments:<\\\\\\/strong> About 2,739 sq. ft. and larger, with plunge pools and ocean views in Goldcrest Bay Sands 2.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p><strong>Duplex townhouses:<\\\\\\/strong> Quoted on a four-year plan with 10% down.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Goldcrest Bay Sands should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No floor plan is published in the material reviewed here. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Quoted prices include about PKR 3.45 crore for an 862 sq. ft. 1-bedroom apartment (about PKR 40,000 per sq. ft.) and over PKR 8 crore for larger plunge-pool apartments, for example, about PKR 8.09 crore for a 2-bedroom unit.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>DHA allotment and utility connection charges are mentioned as extra in at least one source. These are not an official developer price list, so buyers should:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p>Request a written rate sheet.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p>Obtain a complete list of additional charges.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p>Ask for an official booking receipt.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p>Avoid paying any amount to an unverified agent.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Goldcrest Bay Sands are published in the material reviewed here. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No possession date has been published for Goldcrest Bay Sands. Any date quoted should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer\\\\u2019s official documentation.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/77', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 12:53:35', '2026-11-17 12:53:35'),
(1657, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1552, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Goldcrest Bay Sands Payment Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The project material mentions a 10% down payment with installment plans of three to five years. A four-year plan is quoted for several apartments and townhouses, and a five-year plan for Goldcrest Bay Sands 2 units. One quote for a plunge-pool apartment shows an initial amount of about PKR 40.45 lakh. Plans differ by unit, so buyers should get the booking amount, installment schedule, possession payments and total price in writing from the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel.\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/77', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-17 12:53:35', '2026-11-17 12:53:35'),
