(1694, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 190, '{\"body\":\"\"}', '{\"body\":\"<p>Saima Marina Residence is positioned for buyers who want a sea-view apartment or penthouse inside a gated waterfront community in DHA Phase 8. Smaller apartments suit individuals, couples and small families, while 3-bedroom apartments and 4-bedroom penthouses give larger families more space.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Because most of the pricing information comes from third-party quotes rather than a published price list, buyers should treat prices, sizes and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential apartments and penthouses<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments, 4-bedroom penthouses<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Not disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Price Range (Quoted)<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>From about PKR 3.4 crore (1 bed) to about PKR 11 crore (4 bed), subject to change<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Not confirmed, confirm with developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Flexible plan described, quoted installments of about 56 to 60 months, confirm with developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Waterfront high-rise living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Marina Residence is part of the wider HMR Waterfront community, beside the Emaar development. Some material describes the project as a 40-storey tower, but this has not been confirmed on the project page, so the floor count, layout and number of units should be confirmed through the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Apartments and Penthouses in Saima Marina Residence<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The project page lists four residence types:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><p><strong>1-bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> Quoted at about PKR 3.4 to 3.75 crore, some west open with partial sea views.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p><strong>2-bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> From about 1,100 sq. ft., quoted at about PKR 4.34 to 5.8 crore.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p><strong>3-bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> About 2,346 sq. ft. in one quote, with 4 bathrooms.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p><strong>4-bedroom penthouses:<\\/strong> Spacious penthouse units, quoted at about PKR 11 crore for a corner seafront unit.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Saima Marina Residence should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Floor plans are available for the 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments and for the 4-bedroom penthouse, together with a project brochure. Buyers should request them from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel along with the unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No official Saima Marina Residence price list is published on the project page. Quoted prices range from about PKR 3.4 crore for a 1-bedroom apartment to about PKR 11 crore for a 4-bedroom penthouse, depending on size, floor and view.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should take the following precautions before booking:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><p>Request a written and updated rate sheet.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p>Confirm the total price and all additional charges.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p>Obtain an official booking receipt.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p>Verify the authorised sales representative.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p>Do not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Saima Marina Residence are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession date is published on the project page. One quote mentions immediate possession for a 2-bedroom unit, while another lists balloon payments between October 2026 and 2029.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Possession differs by unit, so buyers should get the possession date for their specific unit in writing from the developer before making a booking or payment.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/78', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 05:29:11', '2026-11-18 05:29:11'),
(1695, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1563, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"<p>Saima Marina Residence is positioned for buyers who want a sea-view apartment or penthouse inside a gated waterfront community in DHA Phase 8. Smaller apartments suit individuals, couples and small families, while 3-bedroom apartments and 4-bedroom penthouses give larger families more space.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Because most of the pricing information comes from third-party quotes rather than a published price list, buyers should treat prices, sizes and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<table>\\\\r\\\\n<tbody><tr>\\\\r\\\\n<th>Feature<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n<th>Details<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Property Type<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Residential apartments and penthouses<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Unit Types<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments, 4-bedroom penthouses<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Not disclosed<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Price Range (Quoted)<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>From about PKR 3.4 crore (1 bed) to about PKR 11 crore (4 bed), subject to change<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Handover<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Not confirmed, confirm with developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Location<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Flexible plan described, quoted installments of about 56 to 60 months, confirm with developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Waterfront high-rise living<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tbody><\\\\\\/table>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Saima Marina Residence is part of the wider HMR Waterfront community, beside the Emaar development. Some material describes the project as a 40-storey tower, but this has not been confirmed on the project page, so the floor count, layout and number of units should be confirmed through the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Apartments and Penthouses in Saima Marina Residence<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The project page lists four residence types:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p><strong>1-bedroom apartments:<\\\\\\/strong> Quoted at about PKR 3.4 to 3.75 crore, some west open with partial sea views.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p><strong>2-bedroom apartments:<\\\\\\/strong> From about 1,100 sq. ft., quoted at about PKR 4.34 to 5.8 crore.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p><strong>3-bedroom apartments:<\\\\\\/strong> About 2,346 sq. ft. in one quote, with 4 bathrooms.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p><strong>4-bedroom penthouses:<\\\\\\/strong> Spacious penthouse units, quoted at about PKR 11 crore for a corner seafront unit.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Saima Marina Residence should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Floor plans are available for the 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments and for the 4-bedroom penthouse, together with a project brochure. Buyers should request them from the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel along with the unit schedule.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No official Saima Marina Residence price list is published on the project page. Quoted prices range from about PKR 3.4 crore for a 1-bedroom apartment to about PKR 11 crore for a 4-bedroom penthouse, depending on size, floor and view.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers should take the following precautions before booking:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p>Request a written and updated rate sheet.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p>Confirm the total price and all additional charges.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p>Obtain an official booking receipt.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p>Verify the authorised sales representative.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p>Do not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Saima Marina Residence are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No possession date is published on the project page. One quote mentions immediate possession for a 2-bedroom unit, while another lists balloon payments between October 2026 and 2029.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Possession differs by unit, so buyers should get the possession date for their specific unit in writing from the developer before making a booking or payment.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/78', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 05:29:11', '2026-11-18 05:29:11'),
(1696, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1564, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Saima Marina Residence Payment Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The project page describes a flexible payment plan, but does not publish the figures. Quoted plans combine an initial amount, monthly installments of about 56 to 60 months and, in some units, balloon payments. For example, one 1 bedroom unit quoted at about PKR 3.75 crore lists 37 monthly installments of PKR 3 lakh and four balloon payments of about PKR 17.25 lakh each. These figures apply to specific units and are not a standard plan, so buyers should get the booking amount, installments, balloon payments and total price in writing from the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel.\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/78', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 05:29:11', '2026-11-18 05:29:11'),
(1697, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1565, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Saima Marina Residence Master Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image\\\":null,\\\"badge\\\":null}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/78', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 05:29:11', '2026-11-18 05:29:11'),
(1698, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1566, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Saima Marina Residence Location at HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8 Karachi\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"categories\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Nearby Landmarks and Attractions\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"DHA Phase 8\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"HMR Waterfront\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Emaar Crescent Bay\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Arabian Sea waterfront\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"\\\"}]}],\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Saima Marina Residence is located at HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi, on the coast of the Arabian Sea, beside the Emaar development. The project page mentions easy connectivity to important areas of Karachi. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location and approach route with the developer before visiting.\\\",\\\"image\\\":null}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/78', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 05:29:11', '2026-11-18 05:29:11'),
(1699, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1567, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Where is Saima Marina Residence located?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Saima Marina Residence is located at HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi, beside the Emaar development. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location with the developer.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What is Saima Marina Residence price?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"No official price list is published on the project page. Quoted prices range from about PKR 3.4 crore for a 1 bedroom apartment to about PKR 11 crore for a 4 bedroom penthouse. Buyers should request a written rate sheet from the developer.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"How many bedrooms in Saima Marina Residence?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The project offers 1, 2 and 3 bedroom apartments and 4 bedroom penthouses. Sizes should be confirmed on the unit schedule.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What is Saima Marina Residence payment plan?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The project page describes a flexible payment plan without figures. Quoted plans combine an initial amount, monthly installments and, in some cases, balloon payments. Buyers should get the full schedule in writing before paying any amount.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Is Saima Marina Residence NOC approved?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"No project-specific approval documents are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the NOC and approval details and verify them with the relevant authority.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Who is developing Saima Marina Residence?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Saima Builders is named as the developer on the project page.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What amenities does Saima Marina Residence offer?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The project page lists an infinity pool, gym, kids\\\\u2019 play area, clubhouse, beach access, sports facilities, bicycling tracks, a meditation area, lounge areas and 24\\\\\\/7 security.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Does Saima Marina Residence have penthouses?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Yes, the project page lists spacious 4 bedroom penthouses. Buyers should request the penthouse floor plan and price from the developer.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Marina Residence?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Overseas buyers should deal only through the developer\\\\u2019s authorised channels and should not send funds against unverified offers.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Why consider Saima Marina Residence DHA Phase 8?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"It may suit buyers who want a sea view apartment or penthouse in a gated waterfront community in DHA Phase 8, with a choice of unit sizes. The sensible step is to verify the price, payment plan, possession date and approvals with the developer before booking.\\\"}],\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/78', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 05:29:11', '2026-11-18 05:29:11'),
(1700, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1568, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"button_text\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"email\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Register your interest in Saima Marina Residence DHA Phase 8. Contact our advisory team for personalised guidance on Saima Marina Residence, the current unit availability and private updates. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale in Saima Marina Residence or want to buy a flat in Saima Marina Residence Karachi, our consultants can keep you informed as verified details are released.\\\",\\\"button_text\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"email\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pretitle\\\":\\\"LET\'S CONNECT\\\",\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Invest in Your Future\\\",\\\"form_small\\\":\\\"REQUEST\\\",\\\"form_large\\\":\\\"A CALL BACK\\\",\\\"submit_button\\\":\\\"REQUEST NOW\\\",\\\"bg_image\\\":null}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/78', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 05:29:11', '2026-11-18 05:29:11'),
(1701, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1569, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"heading\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"selected_ids\\\":[],\\\"project_ids\\\":[],\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"heading\\\":null,\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"selected_ids\\\":[],\\\"project_ids\\\":[],\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"unselected_ids\\\":[78,77,76,75,74,73,72,71,70,69,68,67,66,65,64,63,62,61,60,59,58,57,56,55,54,53,52,51,50,49,48,47,46,45,44,43,42,41,40,39,38,37,36,35,34]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/78', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 05:29:11', '2026-11-18 05:29:11'),
