(1752, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1566, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Saima Marina Residence Location at HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8 Karachi\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"categories\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Nearby Landmarks and Attractions\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"DHA Phase 8\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"HMR Waterfront\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Emaar Crescent Bay\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Arabian Sea waterfront\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"\\\"}]}],\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Saima Marina Residence is located at HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi, on the coast of the Arabian Sea, beside the Emaar development. The project page mentions easy connectivity to important areas of Karachi. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location and approach route with the developer before visiting.\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794979830_6afd37f63cd12.webp\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Saima Marina Residence Location at HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8 Karachi\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"categories\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Nearby Landmarks and Attractions\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"DHA Phase 8\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"0\\\\u20135 minutes\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"HMR Waterfront\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"0\\\\u20132 minutes\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Emaar Crescent Bay\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"3\\\\u20135 minutes\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Arabian Sea waterfront\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"1\\\\u20133 minutes\\\"}]}],\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Saima Marina Residence is located at HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi, on the coast of the Arabian Sea, beside the Emaar development. The project page mentions easy connectivity to important areas of Karachi. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location and approach route with the developer before visiting.\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1794979830_6afd37f63cd12.webp\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/78', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 05:50:44', '2026-11-18 05:50:44'),
(1753, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1569, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Projects\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"selected_ids\\\":[],\\\"project_ids\\\":[],\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"unselected_ids\\\":[78,77,76,75,74,73,72,71,70,69,68,67,66,65,64,63,62,61,60,59,58,57,56,55,54,53,52,51,50,49,48,47,46,45,44,43,42,41,40,39,38,37,36,35,34]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Projects\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"selected_ids\\\":[],\\\"project_ids\\\":[],\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"unselected_ids\\\":[79,78,77,76,75,74,73,72,71,70,69,68,67,66,65,64,63,62,61,60,59,58,57,56,55,54,53,52,51,50,49,48,47,46,45,44,43,42,41,40,39,38,37,36,35,34]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/78', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 05:50:44', '2026-11-18 05:50:44'),
(1754, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 191, '{\"body\":\"\"}', '{\"body\":\"<p>Saima Waterfront is positioned for buyers who want a waterfront home with quick access to Clifton, Shahrah-e-Faisal and the business district. The project page lists South City Hospital, Dolmen Mall Clifton and Clifton Beach as a short drive away, and describes proximity to Shahrah-e-Faisal and I.I. Chundrigar Road for business and commercial travellers.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Because the available information comes from project material rather than a published price list, buyers should treat prices, sizes and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential apartments and penthouses<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments, 4-bedroom penthouses<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Not disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Price Range (Quoted)<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Varies widely by unit, from about PKR 3.3 crore for a 1-bedroom, subject to change<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Not confirmed, confirm with developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>HMR Waterfront, Karachi, adjacent to Emaar Oceanfront<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Flexible plan described, quoted 10% down with about 53 to 60 monthly installments, confirm with developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Waterfront high-rise living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Waterfront is part of the wider HMR Waterfront community. Some material describes it as a 40-storey tower, but this has not been confirmed on the project page, so the floor count, layout and number of units should be confirmed through the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Apartments and Penthouses in Saima Waterfront<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The project page lists four residence types:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><p><strong>1-bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> Quoted at about 1,020 sq. ft. in one listing.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p><strong>2-bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> With sea views in some listings.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p><strong>3-bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> Quoted as full sea-facing in some listings.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p><strong>4-bedroom penthouses:<\\/strong> Quoted at about 3,500 sq. ft. in one listing.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Saima Waterfront should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes and quoted sizes differ.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Floor plans are available for the 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments and the 4-bedroom penthouse, together with a project brochure. Buyers should request them from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel along with the unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No official Saima Waterfront price list is published on the project page. Quoted prices differ widely by size, floor and view. A 1-bedroom unit is quoted from about PKR 3.3 crore, and a full sea-facing 3-bedroom unit is quoted at about PKR 7.7 crore.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before booking, buyers should take the following precautions:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><p>Request a written and updated rate sheet.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p>Confirm the total price and all additional charges.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p>Obtain an official booking receipt.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p>Verify the authorised sales representative.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p>Avoid paying any amount to an unverified agent.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Saima Waterfront are published on the project page. The project is described as offering freehold properties, which buyers should confirm with the developer along with the title documents.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should ask for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession date is published on the project page. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer\\u2019s official documentation and should get the possession date for their specific unit in writing.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/79', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 05:51:46', '2026-11-18 05:51:46'),
(1755, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1575, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"<p>Saima Waterfront is positioned for buyers who want a waterfront home with quick access to Clifton, Shahrah-e-Faisal and the business district. The project page lists South City Hospital, Dolmen Mall Clifton and Clifton Beach as a short drive away, and describes proximity to Shahrah-e-Faisal and I.I. Chundrigar Road for business and commercial travellers.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Because the available information comes from project material rather than a published price list, buyers should treat prices, sizes and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<table>\\\\r\\\\n<tbody><tr>\\\\r\\\\n<th>Feature<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n<th>Details<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Property Type<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Residential apartments and penthouses<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Unit Types<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments, 4-bedroom penthouses<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Not disclosed<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Price Range (Quoted)<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Varies widely by unit, from about PKR 3.3 crore for a 1-bedroom, subject to change<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Handover<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Not confirmed, confirm with developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Location<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>HMR Waterfront, Karachi, adjacent to Emaar Oceanfront<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Flexible plan described, quoted 10% down with about 53 to 60 monthly installments, confirm with developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Waterfront high-rise living<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tbody><\\\\\\/table>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Saima Waterfront is part of the wider HMR Waterfront community. Some material describes it as a 40-storey tower, but this has not been confirmed on the project page, so the floor count, layout and number of units should be confirmed through the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Apartments and Penthouses in Saima Waterfront<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The project page lists four residence types:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p><strong>1-bedroom apartments:<\\\\\\/strong> Quoted at about 1,020 sq. ft. in one listing.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p><strong>2-bedroom apartments:<\\\\\\/strong> With sea views in some listings.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p><strong>3-bedroom apartments:<\\\\\\/strong> Quoted as full sea-facing in some listings.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p><strong>4-bedroom penthouses:<\\\\\\/strong> Quoted at about 3,500 sq. ft. in one listing.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Saima Waterfront should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes and quoted sizes differ.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Floor plans are available for the 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments and the 4-bedroom penthouse, together with a project brochure. Buyers should request them from the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel along with the unit schedule.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No official Saima Waterfront price list is published on the project page. Quoted prices differ widely by size, floor and view. A 1-bedroom unit is quoted from about PKR 3.3 crore, and a full sea-facing 3-bedroom unit is quoted at about PKR 7.7 crore.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Before booking, buyers should take the following precautions:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p>Request a written and updated rate sheet.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p>Confirm the total price and all additional charges.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p>Obtain an official booking receipt.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p>Verify the authorised sales representative.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<li><p>Avoid paying any amount to an unverified agent.<\\\\\\/p><\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Saima Waterfront are published on the project page. The project is described as offering freehold properties, which buyers should confirm with the developer along with the title documents.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers should ask for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No possession date is published on the project page. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer\\\\u2019s official documentation and should get the possession date for their specific unit in writing.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/79', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 05:51:46', '2026-11-18 05:51:46'),
