(1762, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1573, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Saima Waterfront Amenities\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"The project page lists the following amenities\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"24\\\\\\/7 security\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Parking\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"High-speed lifts\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Landscaped parks\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Gym and fitness club\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Clubhouse\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Sports facilities\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Jogging track\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null}]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Saima Waterfront Amenities\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"The project page lists the following amenities: A full amenity schedule has not been confirmed here, so buyers should request it from the developer.\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"24\\\\\\/7 security\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Parking\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"High-speed lifts\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Landscaped parks\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Gym and fitness club\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Clubhouse\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Sports facilities\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Jogging track\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null}]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/79', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 05:55:41', '2026-11-18 05:55:41'),
(1763, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Developer', 15, '{\"h1\":null,\"tagline\":null,\"short_content\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\",\"full_content\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\",\"featured_projects\":\"[]\",\"faqs\":\"[]\",\"faq_subtitle\":null}', '{\"h1\":\"Ashaab Builders & Developers\",\"tagline\":\"Ashaab Builders & Developers, a Karachi builder active in Naya Nazimabad, with apartment and commercial development in a gated township.\",\"short_content\":\"Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers is a Karachi-based builder and developer with its office in Naya Nazimabad. The company appears on the member list of the Association of Builders &amp; Developers of Pakistan (ABAD), and is associated with Stadium View Residencia, a high-rise project with apartments and commercial space overlooking the Naya Nazimabad Cricket Stadium.\",\"full_content\":\"<h2>About Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers works in the residential and commercial segment of Karachi\\u2019s high-rise market, with its base inside Naya Nazimabad. The company\\u2019s office is listed at Shop #1 &amp; 2, Com 50, Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, and it is included in the ABAD member list published in September 2026.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Its best-known project is Stadium View Residencia, a high-rise tower inside Naya Nazimabad. Project material describes 2-bed lounge and 3-bed lounge apartments, a commercial basement and ground-floor showrooms, with views of the Naya Nazimabad Cricket Stadium and many units facing the main road. The tower is described as having 18 floors, and apartments are offered with installment plans of about 48 months.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Naya Nazimabad itself is a gated, master-planned township of roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road in Karachi, developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). The township\\u2019s website lists community facilities such as the Gymkhana, a Jama Masjid, Ali Habib Medical Center and a cricket stadium. Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers builds within this community, so its projects sit alongside the township\\u2019s roads, parks and amenities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should treat project details from third-party sources as unverified until confirmed by the builder, and should ask for the unit schedule, price list, payment plan and approval documents for each project in writing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Project Locations<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Explore Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers\\u2019 project in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, through our project location details.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Stadium View Residencia is located inside Naya Nazimabad, near the Cricket Stadium, close to the township\\u2019s main entrance and on a wide main road. The township is about 2 km from North Nazimabad and has direct access to Manghopir Road.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>View the project location, explore the surrounding facilities and discover the community developed around the project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Interested in Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers Projects?<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Looking to buy an apartment, a shop or a commercial unit in Naya Nazimabad, or want to compare Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers with other builders in the township?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Connect with our property experts to learn more about Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers projects, available units, project details and current payment plans.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Register your interest today and receive professional assistance in exploring residential and commercial opportunities.<\\/p>\",\"featured_projects\":\"[73]\",\"faqs\":\"[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"1. Who is Ashaab Builders & Developers?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Ashaab Builders & Developers is a Karachi-based builder and developer with its office in Naya Nazimabad. It appears on the ABAD member list and is associated with the Stadium View Residencia project.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"2. Which is the major project by Ashaab Builders & Developers?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"The best-known project is Stadium View Residencia in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, a high-rise tower with apartments, a commercial basement and ground-floor showrooms.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"3. Where is Ashaab Builders & Developers located?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"The company\\\\u2019s office is listed at Shop #1 & 2, Com 50, Naya Nazimabad, Karachi. Buyers should confirm the current address with the company before visiting.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"4. What is Stadium View Residencia?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Stadium View Residencia is a high-rise project inside Naya Nazimabad with views of the Cricket Stadium. Project material describes 2 bed lounge and 3 bed lounge apartments, many facing the main road.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"5. Does Ashaab Builders & Developers offer apartments?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Yes, Stadium View Residencia offers 2 bed lounge and 3 bed lounge apartments. Sizes and prices should be confirmed on the unit schedule.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"6. Does Ashaab Builders & Developers offer commercial properties?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Project material for Stadium View Residencia mentions a commercial basement and ground-floor showrooms, subject to availability. Buyers should request the commercial unit schedule from the builder.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"7. Is Ashaab Builders & Developers the same as Naya Nazimabad\\\\u2019s developer?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"No. Naya Nazimabad is developed by Javedan Corporation Limited, while Ashaab Builders & Developers is a separate builder that works within the township. Buyers should confirm which company is responsible for the project they are buying.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"8. Is Ashaab Builders & Developers registered with ABAD?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"The company appears on the ABAD member list published in September 2026. Buyers should verify the membership and the project\\\\u2019s approvals directly before booking.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"9. How can I check Ashaab Builders & Developers property prices and payment plans?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"You can review the project details to see the available property types and plans. For updated prices, availability and booking details, ask the builder\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel for a written rate sheet and payment schedule.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"10. How can I buy a property from Ashaab Builders & Developers?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"You can compare the project\\\\u2019s location, unit types and payment plans, and register your interest to receive assistance from a property advisor. Always get the price, payment schedule and approval documents in writing before paying any amount.\\\"}]\",\"faq_subtitle\":\"Got questions about Ashaab Builders & Developers? Find helpful answers below.\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/developers/15', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 06:06:24', '2026-11-18 06:06:24'),
(1764, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Developer', 15, '{\"full_content\":\"<h2>About Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers works in the residential and commercial segment of Karachi\\u2019s high-rise market, with its base inside Naya Nazimabad. The company\\u2019s office is listed at Shop #1 &amp; 2, Com 50, Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, and it is included in the ABAD member list published in September 2026.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Its best-known project is Stadium View Residencia, a high-rise tower inside Naya Nazimabad. Project material describes 2-bed lounge and 3-bed lounge apartments, a commercial basement and ground-floor showrooms, with views of the Naya Nazimabad Cricket Stadium and many units facing the main road. The tower is described as having 18 floors, and apartments are offered with installment plans of about 48 months.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Naya Nazimabad itself is a gated, master-planned township of roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road in Karachi, developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). The township\\u2019s website lists community facilities such as the Gymkhana, a Jama Masjid, Ali Habib Medical Center and a cricket stadium. Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers builds within this community, so its projects sit alongside the township\\u2019s roads, parks and amenities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should treat project details from third-party sources as unverified until confirmed by the builder, and should ask for the unit schedule, price list, payment plan and approval documents for each project in writing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Project Locations<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Explore Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers\\u2019 project in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, through our project location details.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Stadium View Residencia is located inside Naya Nazimabad, near the Cricket Stadium, close to the township\\u2019s main entrance and on a wide main road. The township is about 2 km from North Nazimabad and has direct access to Manghopir Road.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>View the project location, explore the surrounding facilities and discover the community developed around the project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Interested in Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers Projects?<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Looking to buy an apartment, a shop or a commercial unit in Naya Nazimabad, or want to compare Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers with other builders in the township?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Connect with our property experts to learn more about Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers projects, available units, project details and current payment plans.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Register your interest today and receive professional assistance in exploring residential and commercial opportunities.<\\/p>\"}', '{\"full_content\":\"<h2>About Ashaab Builders & Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers works in the residential and commercial segment of Karachi\\u2019s high-rise market, with its base inside Naya Nazimabad. The company\\u2019s office is listed at Shop #1 &amp; 2, Com 50, Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, and it is included in the ABAD member list published in September 2026.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Its best-known project is Stadium View Residencia, a high-rise tower inside Naya Nazimabad. Project material describes 2-bed lounge and 3-bed lounge apartments, a commercial basement and ground-floor showrooms, with views of the Naya Nazimabad Cricket Stadium and many units facing the main road. The tower is described as having 18 floors, and apartments are offered with installment plans of about 48 months.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Naya Nazimabad itself is a gated, master-planned township of roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road in Karachi, developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). The township\\u2019s website lists community facilities such as the Gymkhana, a Jama Masjid, Ali Habib Medical Center and a cricket stadium. Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers builds within this community, so its projects sit alongside the township\\u2019s roads, parks and amenities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should treat project details from third-party sources as unverified until confirmed by the builder, and should ask for the unit schedule, price list, payment plan and approval documents for each project in writing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Project Locations<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Explore Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers\\u2019 project in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, through our project location details.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Stadium View Residencia is located inside Naya Nazimabad, near the Cricket Stadium, close to the township\\u2019s main entrance and on a wide main road. The township is about 2 km from North Nazimabad and has direct access to Manghopir Road.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>View the project location, explore the surrounding facilities and discover the community developed around the project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Interested in Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers Projects?<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Looking to buy an apartment, a shop or a commercial unit in Naya Nazimabad, or want to compare Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers with other builders in the township?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Connect with our property experts to learn more about Ashaab Builders &amp; Developers projects, available units, project details and current payment plans.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Register your interest today and receive professional assistance in exploring residential and commercial opportunities.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/developers/15', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 06:08:44', '2026-11-18 06:08:44'),
