(1766, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Developer', 17, '{\"h1\":null,\"tagline\":null,\"short_content\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\",\"full_content\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\",\"featured_projects\":\"[]\",\"faqs\":\"[]\",\"faq_subtitle\":null}', '{\"h1\":\"S.S Enterprises\",\"tagline\":\"S.S Enterprises, a real estate agency and authorised property dealer specialising in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi.\",\"short_content\":\"S.S Enterprises is a real estate agency established in 2014, with its office inside Naya Nazimabad. It offers plots, houses, apartments and commercial units for local buyers and overseas Pakistanis, along with investment consultancy, construction, rental and property management services.\",\"full_content\":\"<h2>About S.S Enterprises<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>S.S Enterprises began in 2014 as a local agency and has grown with Naya Nazimabad, a gated, master-planned township of roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road in Karachi, developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). The company is led by its CEO and Founder, Muhammad Sarim, and describes itself as the authorised dealer for Naya Nazimabad.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The company works on trust, honesty, transparency, integrity and commitment. It says it deals only in inventory verified against the developer\\u2019s records, matches the seller\\u2019s identity to the ownership record and accepts payments through banks.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>S.S Enterprises is an agency and dealer, not the developer of Naya Nazimabad or of the projects it markets. Buyers should confirm the developer, approvals and payment terms of each project directly before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>What S.S Enterprises Does<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><p>Property sales of residential and commercial properties.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p>Investment consultancy for plots, apartments and commercial units.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p>Property construction.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p>Property purchasing from sellers.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p>Rental services.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p>Property management, including maintenance and tenant handling.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Properties and Projects<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>S.S Enterprises lists the following property types in Naya Nazimabad:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><p><strong>Plots:<\\/strong> 120, 160, 240 and 400 sq. yard residential plots across blocks A to P, plus commercial plots.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p><strong>Houses and bungalows:<\\/strong> Ready 120, 160 and 240 sq. yard houses, including one-unit and double-storey designs.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p><strong>Apartments:<\\/strong> Globe Residency, Peace Apartments, Rahat Residency, Signature Tower and Stadium View Residencia, ready and on installment plans.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<li><p><strong>Commercial:<\\/strong> Vision Tower, Voco Tower (pre-booking), S.S Vision Enclave and ready showrooms and shops at Rahat Residency.<\\/p><\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Availability and prices change quickly, so buyers should ask for the current rate sheet and payment schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Project Locations<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Explore the projects offered by S.S Enterprises across Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, through our project location details.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The projects are located inside Naya Nazimabad, about 2 km from North Nazimabad, with access to Manghopir Road. The company\\u2019s office is at Shop #2, Rahat Residency 1, near Horse Roundabout, Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, open 11 am to 10 pm, Saturday to Thursday.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>View project locations, explore surrounding facilities and discover the community around each project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Interested in S.S Enterprises Projects?<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Looking to buy a plot, house, apartment or commercial unit in Naya Nazimabad, or to invest from abroad?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Connect with our property experts to learn more about the projects offered by S.S Enterprises, available properties, project details and current payment plans.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Register your interest today and receive professional assistance in exploring residential and commercial opportunities.<\\/p>\",\"featured_projects\":\"[76]\",\"faqs\":\"[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"1. Who is S.S Enterprises?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"S.S Enterprises is a real estate agency and authorised property dealer in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, established in 2014. It handles property sales, investment consultancy, construction, purchasing, rentals and property management.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"2. Is S.S Enterprises a developer?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"No. The company describes itself as a real estate agency and authorised dealer. Naya Nazimabad is developed by Javedan Corporation Limited, and buyers should confirm the developer of each individual project.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"3. Where is the S.S Enterprises office?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"The office is at Shop #2, Rahat Residency 1, near Horse Roundabout, Naya Nazimabad, Karachi. It is open 11 am to 10 pm, Saturday to Thursday, and closed on Friday.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"4. Which projects does S.S Enterprises offer?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"The company lists Globe Residency, Peace Apartments, Rahat Residency, Signature Tower and Stadium View Residencia for apartments, and Vision Tower, Voco Tower and S.S Vision Enclave for commercial units.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"5. What types of property can I buy through S.S Enterprises?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"The company lists residential plots, houses and bungalows, apartments, and commercial units such as showrooms, shops and offices in Naya Nazimabad.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"6. Can I buy property in Naya Nazimabad on installments?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Several apartment projects and commercial units are offered on installment plans, with a down payment and monthly installments. Terms differ by project and unit, so ask for the current schedule in writing.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"7. Can overseas Pakistanis buy through S.S Enterprises?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"The company states that overseas buyers can sign a Special Power of Attorney at their local Pakistan mission and pay through a Roshan Digital Account, with the property verified and transferred in Karachi. Buyers should confirm the process and documents before sending funds.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"8. How can I verify a property before paying?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Verify the file with the developer, match the seller\\\\u2019s identity to the ownership record, check for dues or disputes, and pay only through a bank with a written receipt.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"9. What services does S.S Enterprises offer besides property sales?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"It offers investment consultancy, construction, property purchasing, rental services and property management.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"10. How can I contact S.S Enterprises?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"You can visit the office in Naya Nazimabad or contact the company through its official website. Always confirm contact details on the official channels before sharing documents or making a payment.\\\"}]\",\"faq_subtitle\":\"Got questions about S.S Enterprises? Find helpful answers below.\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/developers/17', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 06:30:25', '2026-11-18 06:30:25'),
(1767, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Developer', 17, '{\"meta_title\":null,\"meta_description\":null,\"meta_keywords\":null}', '{\"meta_title\":\"S.S Enterprises: Real Estate Agency in Naya Nazimabad Karachi\",\"meta_description\":\"S.S Enterprises is an authorised property dealer in Naya Nazimabad since 2014. Explore plots, houses, apartments and commercial projects on installments.\",\"meta_keywords\":\"S.S Enterprises, S.S Enterprises Naya Nazimabad, S.S Enterprises real estate Karachi, Authorised dealer Naya Nazimabad\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/developers/17', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 06:31:42', '2026-11-18 06:31:42'),
(1768, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Developer', 18, '{\"h1\":null,\"tagline\":null,\"short_content\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\",\"full_content\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\",\"featured_projects\":\"[]\",\"faqs\":\"[]\",\"faq_subtitle\":null}', '{\"h1\":\"Giga Group\",\"tagline\":\"Discover Giga Group, a leading name in vertical development and master-planned communities in Pakistan.\",\"short_content\":\"Giga Group of Companies is a Pakistani group with real estate development, construction and other business interests in Pakistan, the Middle East and Africa. The group is known for Giga City DHA in Islamabad, which includes Giga Mall and Goldcrest Views, and for its role in Crescent Bay, the oceanfront development in DHA Phase 8, Karachi.\",\"full_content\":\"<h2>About Giga Group<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Giga Group comprises several companies owned independently and jointly by the Giga family. Its business activities include real estate development and construction, along with textile, gold refining and bullion trade. The group has developed projects in Dubai, including Goldcrest Views I, II and Executive in Jumeirah Lake Towers, and says it applies the same approach to planning and quality in Pakistan.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>In Islamabad, the group\\u2019s flagship is Giga City in DHA Phase 2, a mixed-use development that includes Giga Mall, Giga Boutique Mall, Giga Mall Extension, Goldcrest Views, Defence Executive, Lignum Tower and a World Trade Center. Giga Mall was conceived in 2013 and delivered in 2016, and Giga Boutique Mall connects to it through the Sky Walk Bridge. Its CEO and Vice Chairman is Najeeb Amin Pardesi.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>In Karachi, Giga Group is associated with Crescent Bay, a 108-acre oceanfront development in DHA Phase 8, described as a joint venture with Emaar. Land reclamation for the project was carried out by Mazyood Giga International, a Giga Group subsidiary. Some listings also connect the Goldcrest name to Goldcrest Bay Sands at HMR Waterfront in the same area, but the developer of that project should be confirmed directly before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>In 2026, Giga Group was reported to have received three awards at the Luxury Lifestyle Awards, including Best Luxury Real Estate Developer in Pakistan, Best Luxury High Rise Living for Goldcrest Views and Best Luxury Commercial Development for Giga Mall.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should treat project details from third-party sources as unverified until confirmed by the developer, and should ask for the unit schedule, price list, payment plan and approval documents for each project in writing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Project Locations<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Explore Giga Group\\u2019s developments across Islamabad and Karachi through our project location details.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Giga City is located in DHA Phase 2, Islamabad, and includes Giga Mall, Giga Boutique Mall and Goldcrest Views. Crescent Bay is located in DHA Phase 8 on the Karachi coast along the Arabian Sea. The group\\u2019s earlier projects include Goldcrest Views in Jumeirah Lake Towers, Dubai.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>View project locations, explore surrounding facilities and discover the communities developed by Giga Group.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Interested in Giga Group Projects?<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Looking to buy a luxury apartment, a commercial unit or a seafront residence, or compare Giga Group with other vertical developers in Pakistan?<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Connect with our property experts to learn more about Giga Group developments, available properties, project details and current payment plans.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Register your interest today and receive professional assistance in exploring residential and commercial opportunities.<\\/p>\",\"featured_projects\":\"[77]\",\"faqs\":\"[{\\\"question\\\":\\\"1. Who is Giga Group?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Giga Group of Companies is a Pakistani group with real estate development, construction and other businesses in Pakistan, the Middle East and Africa. It is known for vertical developments such as Giga Mall and Goldcrest Views in Islamabad.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"2. Which are the major projects by Giga Group?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Major projects include Giga City DHA Islamabad, Giga Mall, Giga Boutique Mall, Giga Mall Extension, Goldcrest Views and Defence Executive in Islamabad, and Crescent Bay in Karachi. The group has also developed Goldcrest Views in Dubai.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"3. Where are Giga Group projects located?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Giga Group projects are located mainly in DHA Phase 2, Islamabad, and DHA Phase 8, Karachi, with earlier developments in Jumeirah Lake Towers, Dubai.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"4. What is Giga City DHA Islamabad?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Giga City is a mixed-use development in DHA Phase 2, Islamabad, with residential towers, malls and commercial buildings, including Giga Mall, Goldcrest Views and Giga Boutique Mall.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"5. What is Goldcrest Views?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Goldcrest Views is a luxury high-rise residential development within Giga City, Islamabad. It was reported to have received the Best Luxury High Rise Living award at the Luxury Lifestyle Awards 2026.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"6. What is Giga Mall?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Giga Mall is a commercial and retail development in Giga City, Islamabad, conceived in 2013 and delivered in 2016. It connects to Giga Boutique Mall through the Sky Walk Bridge.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"7. What is Giga Group\\\\u2019s role in Crescent Bay, Karachi?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Crescent Bay is a 108-acre oceanfront development in DHA Phase 8, described as a joint venture between Emaar and Giga Group. Land reclamation was carried out by Giga Group\\\\u2019s subsidiary, Mazyood Giga International.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"8. Is Goldcrest Bay Sands developed by Giga Group?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Some listings name Giga Group as the developer, while others credit different developers. Buyers should confirm the developer and the approvals directly before booking.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"9. How can I check Giga Group property prices and payment plans?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"You can review individual project pages to see available property types and plans. For updated prices, availability and booking details, ask an authorised property advisor or the developer for a written rate sheet and payment schedule.\\\"},{\\\"question\\\":\\\"10. How can I invest in Giga Group projects?\\\",\\\"answer\\\":\\\"You can compare project locations, property types and payment plans, and register your interest to receive help from a property advisor. Returns are not guaranteed, so verify the price, payment schedule and approvals in writing before paying any amount.\\\"}]\",\"faq_subtitle\":\"Got questions about Giga Group? Find helpful answers below.\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/developers/18', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 06:38:00', '2026-11-18 06:38:00'),
(1769, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'created', 'App\\Models\\Page', 192, '[]', '{\"title\":\"H&S Residence\",\"slug\":\"hs-residence\",\"in_navbar\":true,\"show_in_projects\":true,\"show_in_commercial\":false,\"navbar_order\":123,\"status\":\"draft\",\"is_published\":true,\"meta_title\":\"H&S Residence | Luxury Properties\",\"meta_description\":\"Explore H&S Residence. Discover luxury residences, pricing, master plan, and world-class amenities.\",\"meta_keywords\":\"H&S Residence, luxury villas, properties\",\"og_image\":null,\"id\":192}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 06:41:48', '2026-11-18 06:41:48'),
