(1835, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 193, '{\"body\":\"\"}', '{\"body\":\"<p>Beach Terraces is positioned for buyers who want a resort-style apartment with a private plunge pool inside a gated waterfront community in DHA Phase 8. The project offers partial and full sea views, large terraces and west-open units, with amenities placed on the same floor for easy access.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Because the available information comes from project material rather than a single published price list, buyers should treat prices, sizes and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Key Project Highlights<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n    <tbody><tr>\\r\\n        <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n        <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Metro Group Builders and Developers (as named in project material)<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Residential apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Building<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Ground + 39 floors<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Price Range (quoted)<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>From about PKR 3.45 crore to over PKR 20 crore, subject to change<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Quoted as December 2030, confirm with developer<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Plot 12, HMR Waterfront, Zone D, DHA Phase 8, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>5-year flexible plan quoted (about 50 months), confirm with developer<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Waterfront high-rise living<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Beach Terraces is part of the wider HMR Waterfront community. The tower is described as Ground + 39 floors, with amenities placed on the same floor for easy access. The tower layout and the number of units should be confirmed through the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Apartments in Beach Terraces<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Project material shows the following layouts, with a private plunge pool in each unit:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li><strong>1 bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> About 1,079 to 1,292 sq. ft, with partial sea views, quoted from about PKR 3.45 to 4.8 crore.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li><strong>2 bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> About 1,265 sq. ft and larger, quoted from about PKR 4.34 crore, with partial and full sea view options.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li><strong>3 bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> About 2,345 to 2,897 sq. ft, quoted from about PKR 8.9 to 11 crore.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li><strong>4 bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> About 3,641 to 5,513 sq. ft, quoted from about PKR 13.8 to 20.9 crore.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Quoted sizes and prices differ between sources, so buyers seeking apartments for sale in Beach Terraces should request the official unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Floor Plan<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No floor plan is published in the material reviewed here. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Price and Booking Status<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Quoted prices range from about PKR 3.45 crore for a 1 bedroom apartment to over PKR 20 crore for a large 4 bedroom unit, depending on size, floor and view. These are not an official developer price list.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should request the following before booking:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li>A written and updated price list.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>A detailed list of all additional charges.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>An official payment plan.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>A verified booking receipt.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Do not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Beach Terraces are published in the material reviewed here. Some listings make approval claims, but these are unverified. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Possession Timeline<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The quoted handover date is December 2030. This is an expected date, and buyers should confirm the date for their unit in writing before relying on it.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/81', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 12:15:06', '2026-11-18 12:15:06'),
(1836, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1599, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"<p>Beach Terraces is positioned for buyers who want a resort-style apartment with a private plunge pool inside a gated waterfront community in DHA Phase 8. The project offers partial and full sea views, large terraces and west-open units, with amenities placed on the same floor for easy access.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Because the available information comes from project material rather than a single published price list, buyers should treat prices, sizes and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Key Project Highlights<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<table>\\\\r\\\\n    <tbody><tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <th>Feature<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n        <th>Details<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Metro Group Builders and Developers (as named in project material)<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Property Type<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Residential apartments<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Unit Types<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Building<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Ground + 39 floors<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Price Range (quoted)<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>From about PKR 3.45 crore to over PKR 20 crore, subject to change<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Handover<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Quoted as December 2030, confirm with developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Location<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Plot 12, HMR Waterfront, Zone D, DHA Phase 8, Karachi<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Payment Plan<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>5-year flexible plan quoted (about 50 months), confirm with developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Lifestyle<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <td>Waterfront high-rise living<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tbody><\\\\\\/table>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Beach Terraces is part of the wider HMR Waterfront community. The tower is described as Ground + 39 floors, with amenities placed on the same floor for easy access. The tower layout and the number of units should be confirmed through the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Apartments in Beach Terraces<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Project material shows the following layouts, with a private plunge pool in each unit:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n    <li><strong>1 bedroom apartments:<\\\\\\/strong> About 1,079 to 1,292 sq. ft, with partial sea views, quoted from about PKR 3.45 to 4.8 crore.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n    <li><strong>2 bedroom apartments:<\\\\\\/strong> About 1,265 sq. ft and larger, quoted from about PKR 4.34 crore, with partial and full sea view options.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n    <li><strong>3 bedroom apartments:<\\\\\\/strong> About 2,345 to 2,897 sq. ft, quoted from about PKR 8.9 to 11 crore.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n    <li><strong>4 bedroom apartments:<\\\\\\/strong> About 3,641 to 5,513 sq. ft, quoted from about PKR 13.8 to 20.9 crore.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Quoted sizes and prices differ between sources, so buyers seeking apartments for sale in Beach Terraces should request the official unit schedule.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Floor Plan<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No floor plan is published in the material reviewed here. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Price and Booking Status<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Quoted prices range from about PKR 3.45 crore for a 1 bedroom apartment to over PKR 20 crore for a large 4 bedroom unit, depending on size, floor and view. These are not an official developer price list.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers should request the following before booking:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n    <li>A written and updated price list.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n    <li>A detailed list of all additional charges.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n    <li>An official payment plan.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n    <li>A verified booking receipt.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Do not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>NOC and Approval Status<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Beach Terraces are published in the material reviewed here. Some listings make approval claims, but these are unverified. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h3>Possession Timeline<\\\\\\/h3>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The quoted handover date is December 2030. This is an expected date, and buyers should confirm the date for their unit in writing before relying on it.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/81', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 12:15:06', '2026-11-18 12:15:06'),
(1837, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1600, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Beach Terraces Payment Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Project material quotes a five-year flexible payment plan, and one listing for a 2 bedroom unit mentions a 50-month plan. Plans differ by unit, so buyers should get the booking amount, installment schedule, any possession payments and the total price in writing from the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel.\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/81', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 12:15:06', '2026-11-18 12:15:06'),
(1838, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1601, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Beach Terraces Master Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1795004106_6afd96cab0add.webp\\\",\\\"badge\\\":null}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/81', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 12:15:06', '2026-11-18 12:15:06'),
(1839, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1602, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Beach Terraces Location at HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8 Karachi\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"categories\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"New Category\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Do Darya Sea View Point\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"15\\\\u201320 minutes\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Dolmen Mall Clifton\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"3\\\\u20137 minutes\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Clifton Beach\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"5\\\\u201310 minutes\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"South City Hospital\\\",\\\"time\\\":\\\"23\\\\u201337 minutes\\\"}]}],\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Beach Terraces is located at Plot 12, HMR Waterfront, Zone D, DHA Phase 8, Karachi, on the Arabian Sea. The project material lists Do Darya, Dolmen Mall Clifton, Clifton Beach, South City Hospital and DHA Golf Club as nearby. Buyers should confirm travel times and the exact tower location with the developer before visiting.\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1795004106_6afd96cab1feb.webp\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/81', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 12:15:06', '2026-11-18 12:15:06'),
(1840, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1603, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Where is Beach Terraces located?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Beach Terraces is located at Plot 12, HMR Waterfront, Zone D, DHA Phase 8, Karachi. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location with the developer.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What is Beach Terraces price?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Quoted prices range from about PKR 3.45 crore for a 1 bedroom apartment to over PKR 20 crore for a large 4 bedroom unit. Buyers should request a written rate sheet from the developer.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"How many bedrooms in Beach Terraces?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The tower offers 1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments. Sizes should be confirmed on the unit schedule.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What is Beach Terraces payment plan?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"A five-year flexible plan (about 50 months) is quoted. Buyers should get the full schedule in writing before paying any amount.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Is Beach Terraces NOC approved?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"No project-specific approval documents are published in the material reviewed here. Buyers should ask the developer for the NOC and approval details and verify them with the relevant authority.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Who is developing Beach Terraces?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Metro Group Builders and Developers is named as the developer in project material. Buyers should confirm this directly with the company.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Do all Beach Terraces apartments have a plunge pool?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Project material states that every unit has a private plunge pool. Buyers should confirm this for the specific unit they are buying.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"How many floors does Beach Terraces have?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The tower is described as Ground + 39 floors. Buyers should confirm the floor count with the developer.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"When is the Beach Terraces handover date?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The quoted handover date is December 2030. Buyers should confirm the date for their unit in writing.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Why consider Beach Terraces DHA Phase 8?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"It may suit buyers who want a waterfront apartment with a private plunge pool in a gated community, with a long payment plan. The sensible step is to verify the price, payment plan, handover date and approvals with the developer before booking.\\\"}],\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/81', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 12:15:06', '2026-11-18 12:15:06'),
(1841, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1604, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"button_text\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"email\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"Register your interest in Beach Terraces DHA Phase 8. Contact our advisory team for personalised guidance on Beach Terraces, the current unit availability and private updates. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale in Beach Terraces or want to buy a flat in Beach Terraces Karachi, our consultants can keep you informed as verified details are released.\\\",\\\"button_text\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"phone\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"email\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"pretitle\\\":\\\"LET\'S CONNECT\\\",\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Invest in Your Future\\\",\\\"form_small\\\":\\\"REQUEST\\\",\\\"form_large\\\":\\\"A CALL BACK\\\",\\\"submit_button\\\":\\\"REQUEST NOW\\\",\\\"bg_image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1795004106_6afd96cab4625.webp\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/81', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-18 12:15:06', '2026-11-18 12:15:06');
