s and the exact tower location with Emaar before visiting.\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1795070843_6afe9b7b4c6d0.jpg\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/84', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-19 06:47:23', '2026-11-19 06:47:23'),
