(2021, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1644, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Panorama by Emaar Pakistan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Panorama is a residential tower by Emaar at Emaar Oceanfront, in the heart of DHA Phase 8, Karachi. The official project page describes limited inventory of 1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom sea-facing apartments with premium finishing and a beachfront location. Emaar states that Panorama is on track to become Pakistan\\\\u2019s tallest waterfront tower. Prices start from PKR 7.9 crore*, and the scheduled completion is listed as occupancy in 2026. Terms marked with an asterisk are subject to the developer\\\\u2019s conditions, so buyers should confirm them directly with Emaar before booking.\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":null,\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Panorama by Emaar Pakistan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Panorama is a residential tower by Emaar at Emaar Oceanfront, in the heart of DHA Phase 8, Karachi. The official project page describes limited inventory of 1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom sea-facing apartments with premium finishing and a beachfront location. Emaar states that Panorama is on track to become Pakistan\\\\u2019s tallest waterfront tower. Prices start from PKR 7.9 crore*, and the scheduled completion is listed as occupancy in 2026. Terms marked with an asterisk are subject to the developer\\\\u2019s conditions, so buyers should confirm them directly with Emaar before booking.\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1795071845_6afe9f65efa3a.jpg\\\",\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/85', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-19 07:04:05', '2026-11-19 07:04:05'),
