(2060, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 198, '{\"body\":\"\"}', '{\"body\":\"<p>Creek Vista is positioned as a premium residential development for buyers seeking spacious apartments in DHA Phase 8 Karachi. Its location within Creek City offers access to the wider DHA community, commercial facilities and recreational destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The project features residential towers with different apartment layouts, designed to accommodate varying family requirements. Three-bedroom and four-bedroom apartments are among the commonly marketed property options.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The development also benefits from its setting near Karachi Creek and DHA Golf Club, offering selected apartments attractive surrounding views.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers exploring apartments for sale in Creek Vista, factors such as apartment size, tower, floor level, orientation, condition and view should be considered before making a purchase.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n    <thead>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n            <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <\\/thead>\\r\\n    <tbody>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Project Name<\\/td><td>Creek Vista \\/ Creek Vistas Apartments<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Development Authority<\\/td><td>DHA Karachi<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Project Category<\\/td><td>Residential apartments<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Location<\\/td><td>Khayaban-e-Shaheen and 16th Street, DHA Phase 8<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Community<\\/td><td>Creek City<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Total Land Area<\\/td><td>Approximately 16 acres<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Number of Towers<\\/td><td>12<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Tower Height<\\/td><td>16 floors each<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Total Residential Units<\\/td><td>720<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Unit Types<\\/td><td>3 and 4-bedroom apartments, penthouses<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Architecture and Consultancy<\\/td><td>Meinhardt<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Parking<\\/td><td>Two-level covered parking<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Elevators<\\/td><td>Private high-speed lifts and service elevator<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Facilities<\\/td><td>Clubhouse, swimming pool, gym and landscaped areas<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Project Status<\\/td><td>Listed among DHA completed projects<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Payment Plan<\\/td><td>Resale transactions; confirm individual seller terms<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Ownership \\/ Transfer<\\/td><td>Verify through DHA Karachi<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr><td>Lifestyle<\\/td><td>Premium community living<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n    <\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Creek Vista is part of Creek City, a larger residential development planned under the DHA Karachi framework. The community was designed around the concept of combining horizontal and vertical development with modern residential facilities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>According to DHA Karachi, Creek Vista covers approximately 16 acres. Around one-quarter of the land is allocated to building structures, while the remaining area is used for water bodies, gardens and public amenities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The development comprises 12 residential towers, each featuring 16 floors. Every tower has 56 apartments and four penthouses, bringing the total residential inventory to 720 units.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The project was designed with input from Meinhardt, an international engineering and consultancy firm. Its planning emphasizes residential comfort, open spaces, security and access to shared recreational facilities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The overall development framework makes Creek Vista a prominent residential component of Creek City in DHA Phase 8.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Apartments in Creek Vista<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Creek Vista offers spacious residential apartments designed for families looking for premium living in DHA Phase 8 Karachi.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The commonly marketed apartment categories include:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li><strong>3-Bedroom Apartments:<\\/strong> Suitable for families seeking spacious bedrooms, living areas and practical residential layouts.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li><strong>4-Bedroom Apartments:<\\/strong> Designed for larger families requiring additional bedrooms, generous living spaces and more accommodation.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li><strong>Penthouses:<\\/strong> Exclusive upper-level residential units offering an alternative to standard apartment layouts.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Available property listings indicate approximate apartment sizes of 3,249 to 3,760 sq. ft. for commonly marketed three and four-bedroom units. Actual covered areas depend on the specific apartment and its approved layout.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers considering Creek Vista apartments for sale should request the relevant floor plan, covered area, title documents and current availability before proceeding.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Creek Vista Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Creek Vista features multiple residential layouts designed to accommodate different family sizes and lifestyle requirements.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The project offers three-bedroom and four-bedroom apartments, alongside penthouse residences. Layouts may include bedrooms with attached bathrooms, drawing and dining areas, family lounges, kitchens, balconies and servant quarters, depending on the unit.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Apartment layouts and covered areas can differ between towers and individual units.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should request the original floor plan and approved unit details before purchasing. They should also compare the usable area, bedroom arrangement, ventilation, orientation and views of available apartments.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Creek Vista Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Creek Vista is an established residential development listed among DHA Karachi\'s completed projects. Buyers generally explore available apartments through the resale market rather than a new developer launch.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Published property portal information has listed indicative prices of approximately PKR 4.7 crore to PKR 5.4 crore for selected three and four-bedroom apartments. However, individual resale advertisements also show higher asking prices, depending on size, floor, renovation, condition and view.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Therefore, these figures should be treated as indicative market advertisements, not fixed or official project prices.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers interested in purchasing an apartment in Creek Vista should request:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li>Current asking price and final negotiated price.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Exact apartment size and floor plan.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Tower and floor details.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Ownership and title documentation.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>DHA transfer requirements and applicable charges.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Outstanding maintenance or utility dues.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Confirmation of vacant possession, where applicable.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>All property documents should be verified through the relevant DHA Karachi channels before making a payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Creek Vista NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Creek Vista is listed on the official DHA Karachi website under its completed projects in Phase 8. The DHA website identifies Creek Vistas as part of Creek City and provides details about its residential development.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>DHA Karachi\'s published fee schedule also contains specific administrative provisions for Creek Vista, including mortgage NOC charges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should nevertheless obtain and verify the relevant property-specific approval, allotment, ownership and transfer documents through DHA Karachi before purchasing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The applicable documentation should be checked against the particular apartment rather than relying solely on general project information.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Creek Vista Possession and Project Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Creek Vista is listed by DHA Karachi as a completed residential project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Unlike newly launched apartment developments, Creek Vista is an established residential community where buyers can explore available resale apartments.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Possession and occupancy conditions depend on the specific unit. Buyers should confirm whether an apartment is vacant, occupied or rented, and whether any outstanding dues or transfer requirements remain.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before completing a transaction, buyers should arrange a physical inspection and obtain written confirmation of the possession and transfer arrangements.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/86', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-19 09:26:28', '2026-11-19 09:26:28'),
