es multiple residential layouts designed to accommodate different family sizes and lifestyle requirements.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The project offers three-bedroom and four-bedroom apartments, alongside penthouse residences. Layouts may include bedrooms with attached bathrooms, drawing and dining areas, family lounges, kitchens, balconies and servant quarters, depending on the unit.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Apartment layouts and covered areas can differ between towers and individual units.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers should request the original floor plan and approved unit details before purchasing. They should also compare the usable area, bedroom arrangement, ventilation, orientation and views of available apartments.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Creek Vista Price and Booking Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Creek Vista is an established residential development listed among DHA Karachi\'s completed projects. Buyers generally explore available apartments through the resale market rather than a new developer launch.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Published property portal information has listed indicative prices of approximately PKR 4.7 crore to PKR 5.4 crore for selected three and four-bedroom apartments. However, individual resale advertisements also show higher asking prices, depending on size, floor, renovation, condition and view.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Therefore, these figures should be treated as indicative market advertisements, not fixed or official project prices.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers interested in purchasing an apartment in Creek Vista should request:<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<ul>\\\\r\\\\n    <li>Current asking price and final negotiated price.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n    <li>Exact apartment size and floor plan.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n    <li>Tower and floor details.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n    <li>Ownership and title documentation.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n    <li>DHA transfer requirements and applicable charges.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n    <li>Outstanding maintenance or utility dues.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n    <li>Confirmation of vacant possession, where applicable.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>All property documents should be verified through the relevant DHA Karachi channels before making a payment.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Creek Vista NOC and Approval Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Creek Vista is listed on the official DHA Karachi website under its completed projects in Phase 8. The DHA website identifies Creek Vistas as part of Creek City and provides details about its residential development.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>DHA Karachi\'s published fee schedule also contains specific administrative provisions for Creek Vista, including mortgage NOC charges.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers should nevertheless obtain and verify the relevant property-specific approval, allotment, ownership and transfer documents through DHA Karachi before purchasing.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The applicable documentation should be checked against the particular apartment rather than relying solely on general project information.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Creek Vista Possession and Project Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Creek Vista is listed by DHA Karachi as a completed residential project.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Unlike newly launched apartment developments, Creek Vista is an established residential community where buyers can explore available resale apartments.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Possession and occupancy conditions depend on the specific unit. Buyers should confirm whether an apartment is vacant, occupied or rented, and whether any outstanding dues or transfer requirements remain.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Before completing a transaction, buyers should arrange a physical inspection and obtain written confirmation of the possession and transfer arrangements.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"body\\\":