(2065, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1663, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Where is Creek Vista located?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Creek Vista is located at Khayaban-e-Shaheen and 16th Street in DHA Phase 8, Karachi. It is part of the larger Creek City residential development.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What is the price of Creek Vista apartments?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Published property portal information has listed selected three and four-bedroom apartments at approximately PKR 4.7 crore to PKR 5.4 crore. Actual asking prices vary according to apartment size, floor, condition and view. Buyers should confirm current availability and prices with property sellers.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"How many bedrooms are available in Creek Vista?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Creek Vista features commonly marketed three-bedroom and four-bedroom apartments, as well as penthouse residences. Buyers should confirm the available layouts and sizes for individual units.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What is the size of Creek Vista apartments?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Published listings indicate apartment sizes of approximately 3,249 to 3,760 sq. ft. for selected units. Exact covered areas depend on the apartment and its layout.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Does Creek Vista have a payment plan?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Creek Vista is an established completed project, and apartments are generally available through resale transactions. Payment terms depend on the individual seller rather than a standard new-booking installment plan.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Is Creek Vista a completed project?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Yes. DHA Karachi lists Creek Vistas Apartments among its completed projects in Phase 8. Buyers should independently verify the possession status of their selected apartment.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What amenities does Creek Vista offer?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The project features a clubhouse, swimming pool, gymnasium, snooker room, card room, community hall, landscaped gardens, children\'s play area, coffee shop and other recreational facilities.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Is Creek Vista under DHA Karachi?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Yes. DHA Karachi identifies Creek Vistas as part of Creek City and lists the apartments under its Phase 8 completed projects.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"How many towers are in Creek Vista?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"According to DHA Karachi, Creek Vista comprises 12 residential towers, each with 16 floors.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"How many apartments are in Creek Vista?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"The development has a total of 720 residential units, including apartments and penthouses.\\\"}],\\\"heading\\\":\\\"Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/86', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-19 09:26:28', '2026-11-19 09:26:28'),
