(2224, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1704, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Al Ghafoor Business Avenue by Al Ghafoor Group\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Al Ghafoor Business Avenue is a commercial project by Al Ghafoor Group at Plot No. B-104, Block H, Sector No. 2, North Nazimabad, Karachi. The official project page describes premium showrooms, modern office spaces and other commercial spaces in one contemporary development. The page shows booking as closed. Price, unit sizes, payment plan and handover have not been published, so buyers should confirm everything directly with Al Ghafoor Group before taking any step.\\\",\\\"video_poster\\\":null,\\\"video_src\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/89', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-20 05:51:54', '2026-11-20 05:51:54'),
(2225, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1705, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Al Ghafoor Business Avenue Features\\\",\\\"subtitle\\\":\\\"The official project page lists the following features. A full amenity schedule has not been published, so buyers should request it from the developer.\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Modern showrooms\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Premium office spaces\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Contemporary architecture\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Prime location\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Modern and elegant commercial design\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surrounded by established residential and commercial areas\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Easy access to main roads and key locations\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Parking\\\",\\\"icon\\\":null}]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/89', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-20 05:51:54', '2026-11-20 05:51:54'),
(2226, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1706, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"images\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Al Ghafoor Business Project Gallery\\\",\\\"images\\\":[{\\\"src\\\":\\\"\\\\\\/uploads\\\\\\/pages\\\\\\/1795153914_6affdffa8aeec.jpg\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"Exterior\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Project Photo\\\"}]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/89', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-20 05:51:54', '2026-11-20 05:51:54'),
(2227, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\Page', 203, '{\"body\":\"\"}', '{\"body\":\"<p>Al Ghafoor Business Avenue is positioned for brands, entrepreneurs, professionals and investors who want a well-placed commercial space in North Nazimabad. The project page describes a modern, professional setting designed around today\'s business requirements, with showrooms, offices and other commercial spaces.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Because booking is closed, buyers should treat this page as a guide to what the developer has published, not as an offer. Any unit offered by a third party should be treated as a resale and verified before payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n    <thead>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n            <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <\\/thead>\\r\\n    <tbody>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Al Ghafoor Group<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Commercial<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Showrooms and offices (other commercial spaces mentioned)<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Not disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Not published<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Plot No. B-104, Block H, Sector No. 2, North Nazimabad, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Not published<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Booking Status<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Closed (as shown on the official page)<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Commercial tower in an established neighbourhood<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No master plan or building layout has been published on the project page. The number of floors, showrooms and offices has not been announced, so buyers should confirm the layout through the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Showrooms and Offices in Al Ghafoor Business Avenue<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The official page lists premium showrooms and modern offices, along with other thoughtfully designed commercial spaces. Unit types, sizes and floor allocation have not been published. Buyers seeking showrooms or offices for sale in North Nazimabad should ask the developer whether any units remain, and should not assume that availability shown by a third party is confirmed.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No floor plan is published on the project page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel, together with any available unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No official Al Ghafoor Business Avenue price list is published, and the project page shows booking as closed. Buyers should not pay any amount to a party claiming to take bookings for this project. If a resale unit is offered, they should request the seller\\u2019s allotment documents and the developer\\u2019s confirmation of the transfer, a written receipt and a payment made through a bank.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Al Ghafoor Business Avenue are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Al Ghafoor Group for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before any payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession date has been published for Al Ghafoor Business Avenue. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer\\u2019s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.<\\/p>\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/89', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-20 05:51:54', '2026-11-20 05:51:54'),
(2228, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1707, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"<p>Al Ghafoor Business Avenue is positioned for brands, entrepreneurs, professionals and investors who want a well-placed commercial space in North Nazimabad. The project page describes a modern, professional setting designed around today\'s business requirements, with showrooms, offices and other commercial spaces.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Because booking is closed, buyers should treat this page as a guide to what the developer has published, not as an offer. Any unit offered by a third party should be treated as a resale and verified before payment.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<table>\\\\r\\\\n    <thead>\\\\r\\\\n        <tr>\\\\r\\\\n            <th>Feature<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n            <th>Details<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n        <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/thead>\\\\r\\\\n    <tbody>\\\\r\\\\n        <tr>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Al Ghafoor Group<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <tr>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Property Type<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Commercial<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <tr>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Unit Types<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Showrooms and offices (other commercial spaces mentioned)<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <tr>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Total Land Size<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Not disclosed<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <tr>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Handover<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Not published<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <tr>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Location<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Plot No. B-104, Block H, Sector No. 2, North Nazimabad, Karachi<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <tr>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Payment Plan<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Not published<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <tr>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Booking Status<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Closed (as shown on the official page)<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n        <tr>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Lifestyle<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n            <td>Commercial tower in an established neighbourhood<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n        <\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n    <\\\\\\/tbody>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/table>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No master plan or building layout has been published on the project page. The number of floors, showrooms and offices has not been announced, so buyers should confirm the layout through the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Showrooms and Offices in Al Ghafoor Business Avenue<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The official page lists premium showrooms and modern offices, along with other thoughtfully designed commercial spaces. Unit types, sizes and floor allocation have not been published. Buyers seeking showrooms or offices for sale in North Nazimabad should ask the developer whether any units remain, and should not assume that availability shown by a third party is confirmed.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No floor plan is published on the project page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer\\\\u2019s authorised sales channel, together with any available unit schedule.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No official Al Ghafoor Business Avenue price list is published, and the project page shows booking as closed. Buyers should not pay any amount to a party claiming to take bookings for this project. If a resale unit is offered, they should request the seller\\\\u2019s allotment documents and the developer\\\\u2019s confirmation of the transfer, a written receipt and a payment made through a bank.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Al Ghafoor Business Avenue are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Al Ghafoor Group for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before any payment.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No possession date has been published for Al Ghafoor Business Avenue. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer\\\\u2019s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/89', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-20 05:51:54', '2026-11-20 05:51:54'),
(2229, 'App\\Models\\User', 2, 'updated', 'App\\Models\\PageSection', 1708, '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Al Ghafoor Business Avenue Payment Plan\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"No payment plan is published on the project page, and booking is closed. Any payment plan or booking amount quoted under this project name should be treated as unverified until the developer confirms it in writing.\\\",\\\"down_payment\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"during_construction\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"on_handover\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"items\\\":[],\\\"rows\\\":[]}\"}', 'https://fsadvisory.pk/admin/projects/89', '203.101.188.87', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/157.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', NULL, '2026-11-20 05:51:54', '2026-11-20 05:51:54'),
