.<\\\\\\/li>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/ul>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Panorama are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Emaar for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>The official page lists the scheduled completion as occupancy in 2026, and shows a gallery of construction updates. No exact handover date is published, so buyers should rely only on dates given in Emaar\\\\u2019s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.<\\\\\\/p>\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"\\\"}\"}', '{\"content\":\"{\\\"title\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"intro\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"html\\\":\\\"<p>Panorama is positioned for families who want a sea-facing apartment in a high-rise within a gated seafront community. The page describes contemporary d\\\\u00e9cor, expansive amenities and residences designed with the family in mind. The tower is strategically located in the heart of <a href=\\\\\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/fsadvisory.pk\\\\\\/area\\\\\\/dha-phase-8\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\">DHA Phase 8<\\\\\\/a>, minutes away from Karachi\\\\u2019s top hotspots.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source, and confirm sizes, prices and plans with <a href=\\\\\\\"https:\\\\\\/\\\\\\/fsadvisory.pk\\\\\\/developer\\\\\\/emaar-pakistan\\\\\\\" target=\\\\\\\"_blank\\\\\\\">Emaar<\\\\\\/a> before making a payment.<\\\\\\/p>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\\\\\/h2>\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n<table>\\\\r\\\\n<tbody><tr>\\\\r\\\\n<th>Feature<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n<th>Details<\\\\\\/th>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Developer<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<td>Emaar Pakistan<\\\\\\/td>\\\\r\\\\n<\\\\\\/tr>\\\\r\\\\n<tr>\\\\