risks openly and never pressures you to pay before documents are verified.\"},{\"q\":\"Is real estate in Pakistan a good investment?\",\"a\":\"Property has long been a popular store of value, especially in planned societies with strong demand. Returns vary by location and market conditions, so research and professional advice are important.\"},{\"q\":\"Where can I find real estate listings in Karachi that I can trust?\",\"a\":\"Use online listings as a starting point, then verify ownership, approvals and the seller\'s identity. We can check any listing for you before you pay a token amount on any property for sale in Pakistan.\"}],\"description\":null}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-10-21 04:41:00\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-13 19:37:02\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:10:{s:2:\"id\";i:16;s:7:\"page_id\";i:1;s:11:\"section_key\";s:3:\"faq\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:13:\"FAQ Accordion\";s:5:\"order\";i:7;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:1383:\"{\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":null,\"items\":[{\"q\":\"What services does FS Real Estate and Advisory offer?\",\"a\":\"As real estate agents in Pakistan, we provide buying, selling and renting guidance, investment consultation, location comparison and document verification, including houses for sale in Pakistan and commercial properties.\"},{\"q\":\"What are the best areas to live in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"DHA, Clifton, Bahria Town, KDA and PECHS are among the most popular choices. The best option depends on your budget, commute, family needs and preferred lifestyle.\"},{\"q\":\"How do I choose between property dealers in Pakistan?\",\"a\":\"Ask for references, written terms and proof of who they represent. A good dealer or advisor explains risks openly and never pressures you to pay before documents are verified.\"},{\"q\":\"Is real estate in Pakistan a good investment?\",\"a\":\"Property has long been a popular store of value, especially in planned societies with strong demand. Returns vary by location and market conditions, so research and professional advice are important.\"},{\"q\":\"Where can I find real estate listings in Karachi that I can trust?\",\"a\":\"Use online listings as a starting point, then verify ownership, approvals and the seller\'s identity. We can check any listing for you before you pay a token amount on any property for sale in Pakistan.\"}],\"description\":null}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-10-21 04:41:00\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-13 19:37:02\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:4:{s:7:\"content\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"is_active\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:10:\"is_visible\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:5:\"order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:7:{i:0;s:7:\"page_id\";i:1;s:11:\"section_key\";i:2;s:12:\"section_name\";i:3;s:5:\"order\";i:4;s:9:\"is_active\";i:5;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:6;s:7:\"content\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:21:\"\0*\0excludedAttributes\";a:0:{}s:10:\"auditEvent\";N;s:14:\"auditCustomOld\";N;s:14:\"auditCustomNew\";N;s:13:\"isCustomEvent\";b:0;s:21:\"preloadedResolverData\";a:0:{}}i:7;O:22:\"App\\Models\\PageSection\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:13:\"page_sections\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastin