list is published on the project page. Buyers should request a written rate sheet from Al Ghafoor Group and treat any figure quoted by a third party as unverified.\"},{\"q\":\"What type of units are available in Al Ghafoor Business Avenue?\",\"a\":\"The official page lists premium showrooms and modern offices, along with other commercial spaces. Unit sizes and floors are not published.\"},{\"q\":\"Is booking open in Al Ghafoor Business Avenue?\",\"a\":\"No. The official project page shows booking as closed. Buyers should not pay any amount to a party claiming to take bookings, and should confirm the status with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Al Ghafoor Business Avenue payment plan?\",\"a\":\"No payment plan is published on the project page. Any plan quoted by a third party should be treated as unverified until the developer confirms it in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Al Ghafoor Business Avenue NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"No project-specific approval documents are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the NOC and approval details and verify them with the relevant authority.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Al Ghafoor Business Avenue?\",\"a\":\"Al Ghafoor Business Avenue is a project by Al Ghafoor Group.\"},{\"q\":\"Can I buy a resale unit in Al Ghafoor Business Avenue?\",\"a\":\"Resale units may be offered by existing owners, but buyers should verify the seller\\u2019s allotment documents with the developer, confirm the transfer process and pay only through a bank against a written receipt.\"},{\"q\":\"How can I register my interest?\",\"a\":\"Contact our advisory team or the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel to register your interest and ask whether any units are available or will be released.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Al Ghafoor Business Avenue North Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"It may suit businesses looking for a showroom or office in an established neighbourhood with access to main roads. Because booking is closed, the sensible step is to co