('laravel-cache-page_data_al-ghafoor-empire', 'O:15:\"App\\Models\\Page\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:5:\"pages\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:204;s:5:\"title\";s:17:\"Al Ghafoor Empire\";s:4:\"slug\";s:17:\"al-ghafoor-empire\";s:4:\"body\";s:3562:\"<p>Al Ghafoor Empire is positioned for larger families who want a spacious apartment in the established neighbourhood of North Nazimabad, with recreation placed on the rooftop and in an elevated garden. The project page highlights an iconic modern design, a prime and well-connected location, and landscaped surroundings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source and confirm sizes, prices, and plans with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <thead>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <th>Feature</th>\r\n      <th>Details</th>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </thead>\r\n  <tbody>\r\n    <tr><td>Developer</td><td>Al Ghafoor Group</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Property Type</td><td>Residential apartments</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Unit Types</td><td>5 and 6 room luxury apartments</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Layouts</td><td>4 apartment types: Signature A, Signature B, Prestige, Elite</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Total Land Size</td><td>Not disclosed</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Handover</td><td>Not published; confirm with developer</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Location</td><td>Plot # D-12, Block A, North Nazimabad, Karachi</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Payment Plan</td><td>Payment schedules published as images; confirm with developer</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Status</td><td>On booking</td></tr>\r\n  </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The project page describes high-speed elevators serving every tower, so Al Ghafoor Empire is planned as a multi-tower development. The number of towers, floors, and units has not been published, so buyers should confirm the layout through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Al Ghafoor Empire</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists 5 room and 6 room luxury apartments in four layouts: Signature A, Signature B, Prestige, and Elite. Apartment sizes and bedroom counts are shown on the plan sheets and should be confirmed with the developer.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The page says that apartments are corner units with open views and that only a limited number of residences are planned per floor. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Al Ghafoor Empire should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page publishes a type plan for each of the four layouts, along with a payment schedule for each. Buyers should ask the developer’s sales team which layout matches their requirement and request the latest unit schedule with the floor plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No separate price list is published as text on the official page, and pricing appears only in the payment schedule sheets. The project is shown as on booking through the “Book Now” option.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should request the following before booking:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>A written rate sheet</li>\r\n  <li>A list of all additional charges</li>\r\n  <li>An official booking receipt</li>\r\n  <li>Confirmation of payment terms from the developer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Do not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Al Ghafoor Empire are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Al Ghafoor Group for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published on the project page. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer’s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:0;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:135;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:56:\"Al Ghafoor Empire North Nazimabad: 5 & 6 Room Apartments\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:154:\"Al Ghafoor Empire by Al Ghafoor Group offers 5 and 6 room luxury corner apartments in Block A, North Nazimabad. See amenities, layouts and how to enquire.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:44:\"Al Ghafoor Empire, luxury villas, properties\";s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-20 06:02:41\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-20 06:54:03\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:204;s:5:\"title\";s:17:\"Al Ghafoor Empire\";s:4:\"slug\";s:17:\"al-ghafoor-empire\";s:4:\"body\";s:3562:\"<p>Al Ghafoor Empire is positioned for larger families who want a spacious apartment in the established neighbourhood of North Nazimabad, with recreation placed on the rooftop and in an elevated garden. The project page highlights an iconic modern design, a prime and well-connected location, and landscaped surroundings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source and confirm sizes, prices, and plans with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <thead>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <th>Feature</th>\r\n      <th>Details</th>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </thead>\r\n  <tbody>\r\n    <tr><td>Developer</td><td>Al Ghafoor Group</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Property Type</td><td>Residential apartments</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Unit Types</td><td>5 and 6 room luxury apartments</td></tr>\r\n    <tr><td>Layouts</td><td>4 apartment types: Signature A,