itten rate sheet</li>\r\n  <li>A list of all additional charges</li>\r\n  <li>An official booking receipt</li>\r\n  <li>Confirmation of payment terms from the developer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Do not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Al Ghafoor Empire are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Al Ghafoor Group for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published on the project page. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer’s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:0;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:135;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:56:\"Al Ghafoor Empire North Nazimabad: 5 & 6 Room Apartments\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:154:\"Al Ghafoor Empire by Al Ghafoor Group offers 5 and 6 room luxury corner apartments in Block A, North Nazimabad. See amenities, layouts and how to enquire.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:44:\"Al Ghafoor Empire, luxury villas, properties\";s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-20 06:02:41\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-20 06:54:03\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:5:{s:9:\"in_navbar\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:16:\"show_in_projects\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:12:\"is_published\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:12:\"navbar_order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:1:{s:8:\"sections\";O:39:\"Illuminate\\Database\\Eloquent\\Collection\":2:{s:8:\"\0*\0items\";a:13:{i:0;O:2