pire?\",\"a\":\"The page lists four layouts named Signature A, Signature B, Prestige and Elite. Buyers should request the plan sheet for each layout.\"},{\"q\":\"Are all apartments in Al Ghafoor Empire corner apartments?\",\"a\":\"The page highlights corner apartments with expansive open views. Buyers should confirm the position and view of a specific unit with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Al Ghafoor Empire open for booking?\",\"a\":\"The official page shows the project as on booking. Buyers should confirm the current availability and booking terms with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Al Ghafoor Empire?\",\"a\":\"Al Ghafoor Empire is a project by Al Ghafoor Group\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-20 06:02:41\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-20 12:56:05\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:10:{s:2:\"id\";i:1723;s:7:\"page_id\";i:204;s:11:\"section_key\";s:3:\"faq\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:13:\"FAQ Accordion\";s:5:\"order\";i:11;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:2173:\"{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Al Ghafoor Empire located?\",\"a\":\"Al Ghafoor Empire is located at Plot # D-12, Block A, North Nazimabad, Karachi. Buyers should confirm the exact address with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Al Ghafoor Empire price?\",\"a\":\"No separate price list is published as text on the official page, and prices appear on the payment schedule sheets. Buyers should request a written rate sheet from Al Ghafoor Group.\"},{\"q\":\"How many rooms in Al Ghafoor Empire?\",\"a\":\"The project offers 5 room and 6 room luxury apartments in four layouts. Bedroom counts and sizes should be confirmed on the unit schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Al Ghafoor Empire payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The official page publishes a payment schedule for each apartment type as an image. Buyers should get the full schedule in writing before paying any amount.\"},{\