('laravel-cache-page_data_al-ghafoor-sky-rise', 'O:15:\"App\\Models\\Page\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:5:\"pages\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:202;s:5:\"title\";s:19:\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise\";s:4:\"slug\";s:19:\"al-ghafoor-sky-rise\";s:4:\"body\";s:3745:\"<p>Al Ghafoor Sky Rise is positioned for families who want a spacious apartment in the established neighbourhood of North Nazimabad, with facilities placed on the rooftop and on an elevated garden level. The project page highlights an iconic modern design, spacious apartments and a sophisticated lifestyle-oriented community.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source, and confirm sizes, prices and plans with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Feature</th>\r\n            <th>Details</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Developer</td>\r\n            <td>Al Ghafoor Group</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Property Type</td>\r\n            <td>Residential apartments</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n            <td>4 and 5 room luxury apartments</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Floor Plans</td>\r\n            <td>7 apartment types: Saffron, Sapphire, Scarlet, Emerald, Pearl, Coral and Aqua</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n            <td>Not disclosed</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Handover</td>\r\n            <td>Not published, confirm with developer</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Location</td>\r\n            <td>Plot No. SF-14, Block B, North Nazimabad, Karachi</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n            <td>Payment schedules published as images, confirm with developer</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n            <td>Urban high-rise living</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The project page describes elevators serving every tower, so Al Ghafoor Sky Rise is planned as a multi-tower development. The number of towers, floors and units has not been published, so buyers should confirm the layout through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Al Ghafoor Sky Rise</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists 4 room and 5 room luxury apartments in seven layouts: Saffron, Sapphire, Scarlet, Emerald, Pearl, Coral and Aqua. Apartment sizes and bedroom counts are shown on the plan sheets and should be confirmed with the developer. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Al Ghafoor Sky Rise should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page publishes an internal floor plan for each of the seven apartment types, along with a payment schedule for each. Buyers should ask the developer’s sales team which layout matches their requirement, and request the latest unit schedule with the floor plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No separate price list is published as text on the official page, and pricing appears only in the payment schedule sheets. The project is shown as open for booking through the “Book Now” option. Buyers should request a written rate sheet, a list of all extra charges and a booking receipt, and should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Al Ghafoor Sky Rise are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Al Ghafoor Group for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published on the project page. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer’s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:0;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:133;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:58:\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise North Nazimabad: 4 & 5 Room Apartments\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:153:\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise by Al Ghafoor Group offers 4 and 5 room luxury apartments in Block B, North Nazimabad. See amenities, floor plans and how to enquire.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:103:\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise, Al Ghafoor Sky Rise North Nazimabad, Al Ghafoor Sky Rise Karachi, Al Ghafoor Group\";s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 11:23:07\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 11:53:55\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:202;s:5:\"title\";s:19:\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise\";s:4:\"slug\";s:19:\"al-ghafoor-sky-rise\";s:4:\"body\";s:3745:\"<p>Al Ghafoor Sky Rise is positioned for families who want a spacious apartment in the established neighbourhood of North Nazimabad, with facilities placed on the rooftop and on an elevated garden level. The project page highlights an iconic modern design, spacious apartments and a sophisticated lifestyle-oriented community.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source, and confirm sizes, prices and plans with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Feature</th>\r\n            <th>Details</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Developer</td>\r\n            <td>Al Ghafoor Group</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Property Type</td>\r\n            <td>Residential apartments</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n            <td>4 and 5 room luxury apartments</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Floor Plans</td>\r\n            <td>7 apartment types: Saffron, Sapphire, Scarlet, Emerald, Pearl, Coral and Aqua</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n            <td>Not disclosed</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Handover</td>\r\n            <td>Not published, confirm with developer</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Location</td>\r\n            <td>Plot No. SF-14, Block B, North Nazimabad, Karachi</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n            <td>Payment schedules published as images, confirm with developer</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n            <td>Urban high-rise living</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The project page describes elevators serving every tower, so Al Ghafoor Sky Rise is planned as a multi-tower development. The number of towers, floors and units has not been published, so buyers should confirm the layout through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Al Ghafoor Sky Rise</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists 4 room and 5 room luxury apartments in seven layouts: Saffron, Sapphire, Scarlet, Emerald, Pearl, Coral and Aqua. Apartment sizes and bedroom counts are shown on the plan sheets and should be confirmed with the developer. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Al Ghafoor Sky Rise should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page publishes an internal floor plan for each of the seven apartment types, along with a payment schedule for each. Buyers should ask the developer’s sales team which layout matches their requirement, and request the latest unit schedule with the floor plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No separate price list is published as text on the official page, and pricing appears only in the payment schedule sheets. The project is shown as open for booking through the “Book Now” option. Buyers should request a written rate sheet, a list of all extra charges and a booking receipt, and should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Al Ghafoor Sky Rise are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Al Ghafoor Group for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published on the project page. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer’s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:0;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:133;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:58:\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise North Nazimabad: 4 & 5 Room Apartments\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:153:\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise by Al Ghafoor Group offers 4 and 5 room luxury apartments in Block B, North Nazimabad. See amenities, floor plans and how to enquire.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:103:\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise, Al Ghafoor Sky Rise North Nazimabad, Al Ghafoor Sky Rise Karachi, Al Ghafoor Group\";s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 11:23:07\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 11:53:55\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0: