cial project page describes 4 and 5 room luxury apartments with contemporary layouts, set in a development that combines modern architecture, a well-connected location and community spaces. The project is shown as open for booking. Price, sizes, handover and approvals have not been published as text on the page, so buyers should confirm them directly with Al Ghafoor Group before booking.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795089180_6afee31c8799c.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 11:23:08\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 11:53:00\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:10:{s:2:\"id\";i:1692;s:7:\"page_id\";i:202;s:11:\"section_key\";s:5:\"about\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:15:\"About Community\";s:5:\"order\";i:3;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:672:\"{\"title\":\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise by Al Ghafoor Group\",\"description\":\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise is a premium residential project by Al Ghafoor Group at Plot No. SF-14, Block B, North Nazimabad, Karachi. The official project page describes 4 and 5 room luxury apartments with contemporary layouts, set in a development that combines modern architecture, a well-connected location and community spaces. The project is shown as open for booking. Price, sizes, handover and approvals have not been published as text on the page, so buyers should confirm them directly with Al Ghafoor Group before booking.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795089180_6afee31c8799c.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 11:23:08\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 11:53:00\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:4:{s:7:\"content\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"is_active\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:10:\"is_visible\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:5:\"order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14: