\",\"a\":\"The official page publishes a payment schedule for each apartment type as an image. Buyers should get the full schedule in writing before paying any amount.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Al Ghafoor Sky Rise NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"No project-specific approval documents are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the NOC and approval details and verify them with the relevant authority.\"},{\"q\":\"What amenities does Al Ghafoor Sky Rise offer?\",\"a\":\"The official page lists an elevated landscaped garden with a jogging track, a rooftop multipurpose court, a rooftop cafeteria, high-speed elevators, and safety features such as 24\\/7 security, CCTV and fire safety systems.\"},{\"q\":\"What are the apartment types in Al Ghafoor Sky Rise?\",\"a\":\"The page lists seven layouts named Saffron, Sapphire, Scarlet, Emerald, Pearl, Coral and Aqua. Buyers should request the plan sheet for each layout.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Al Ghafoor Sky Rise open for booking?\",\"a\":\"The official page shows the project as open for booking. Buyers should confirm the current availability and booking terms with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Al Ghafoor Sky Rise?\",\"a\":\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise is a project by Al Ghafoor Group.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Al Ghafoor Sky Rise?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers should deal only through the developer\\u2019s authorised channels and should not send funds against unverified offers.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 11:23:08\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-20 12:50:46\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:10:{s:2:\"id\";i:1699;s:7:\"page_id\";i:202;s:11:\"section_key\";s:3:\"faq\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:13:\"FAQ Accordion\";s:5:\"order\";i:11;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:2149:\"{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Al Ghafoor Sky Rise located?\",\"a\":\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise is located at Plot No. SF-14, Bloc