('laravel-cache-page_data_panorama-emaar', 'O:15:\"App\\Models\\Page\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:5:\"pages\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:197;s:5:\"title\";s:14:\"Panorama Emaar\";s:4:\"slug\";s:14:\"panorama-emaar\";s:4:\"body\";s:3689:\"<p>Panorama is positioned for families who want a sea-facing apartment in a high-rise within a gated seafront community. The page describes contemporary décor, expansive amenities and residences designed with the family in mind. The tower is strategically located in the heart of <a href=\"https://fsadvisory.pk/area/dha-phase-8\" target=\"_blank\">DHA Phase 8</a>, minutes away from Karachi’s top hotspots.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source, and confirm sizes, prices and plans with <a href=\"https://fsadvisory.pk/developer/emaar-pakistan\" target=\"_blank\">Emaar</a> before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Emaar Pakistan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom sea-facing apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Inventory</td>\r\n<td>Limited</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Starting Size</td>\r\n<td>From 1,547 sq. ft</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Starting Price</td>\r\n<td>From PKR 7.9 crore*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Scheduled occupancy 2026, confirm with developer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Emaar Oceanfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Not published, confirm with developer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Gated seafront community living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Panorama is part of Emaar Oceanfront, a seafront gated community of about 75 acres in Karachi, inspired by Dubai Marina. Emaar states that the community is home to more than 1,000 families, with new projects ready for occupancy starting 2026. The tower layout and unit allocation within Panorama should be confirmed through Emaar’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Panorama</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Panorama offers 1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom sea-facing apartments, in limited inventory. The official page quotes a starting size of 1,547 sq. ft, and individual unit sizes and layouts should be confirmed on the unit schedule. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Panorama should request the current availability from the developer, since only limited inventory is offered.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A project brochure is available for download on the official page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from Emaar’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists prices from PKR 7.9 crore* and states that booking is open through the “Book Now” and “Register Interest” options. The asterisk indicates that terms apply, so buyers should request the following before booking:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A written rate sheet.</li>\r\n<li>A list of all additional charges.</li>\r\n<li>A booking receipt.</li>\r\n<li>Confirmation of payment terms.</li>\r\n<li>Verification of the authorised sales agent.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Panorama are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Emaar for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists the scheduled completion as occupancy in 2026, and shows a gallery of construction updates. No exact handover date is published, so buyers should rely only on dates given in Emaar’s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:0;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:128;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:56:\"Panorama Emaar Oceanfront Karachi: Sea-Facing Apartments\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:142:\"Panorama by Emaar at Oceanfront, DHA Phase 8: 1 to 4 bed sea-facing apartments from PKR 7.9 crore. See amenities, occupancy 2026 and location.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:14:\"Panorama Emaar\";s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 06:52:34\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-20 13:00:18\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:197;s:5:\"title\";s:14:\"Panorama Emaar\";s:4:\"slug\";s:14:\"panorama-emaar\";s:4:\"body\";s:3689:\"<p>Panorama is positioned for families who want a sea-facing apartment in a high-rise within a gated seafront community. The page describes contemporary décor, expansive amenities and residences designed with the family in mind. The tower is strategically located in the heart of <a href=\"https://fsadvisory.pk/area/dha-phase-8\" target=\"_blank\">DHA Phase 8</a>, minutes away from Karachi’s top hotspots.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source, and confirm sizes, prices and plans with <a href=\"https://fsadvisory.pk/developer/emaar-pakistan\" target=\"_blank\">Emaar</a> before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Emaar Pakistan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom sea-facing apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Inventory</td>\r\n<td>Limited</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Starting Size</td>\r\n<td>From 1,547 sq. ft</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Starting Price</td>\r\n<td>From PKR 7.9 crore*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Scheduled occupancy 2026, confirm with developer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Emaar Oceanfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Not published, confirm with developer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Gated seafront community living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Panorama is part of Emaar Oceanfront, a seafront gated community of about 75 acres in Karachi, inspired by Dubai Marina. Emaar states that the community is home to more than 1,000 families, with new projects ready for occupancy starting 2026. The tower layout and unit allocation within Panorama should be confirmed through Emaar’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Panorama</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Panorama offers 1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom sea-facing apartments, in limited inventory. The official page quotes a starting size of 1,547 sq. ft, and individual unit sizes and layouts should be confirmed on the unit schedule. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Panorama should request the current availability from the developer, since only limited inventory is offered.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A project brochure is available for download on the official page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from Emaar’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists prices from PKR 7.9 crore* and states that booking is open through the “Book Now” and “Register Interest” options. The asterisk indicates that terms apply, so buyers should request the following before booking:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A written rate sheet.</li>\r\n<li>A list of all additional charges.</li>\r\n<li>A booking receipt.</li>\r\n<li>Confirmation of payment terms.</li>\r\n<li>Verification of the authorised sales agent.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Panorama are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Emaar for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists the scheduled completion as occupancy in 2026, and shows a gallery of construction updates. No exact handover date is published, so buyers should rely only on dates given in Emaar’s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:0;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:128;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:56:\"Panorama Emaar Oceanfront Karachi: Sea-Facing Apartments\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:142:\"Panorama by Emaar at Oceanfront, DHA Phase 8: 1 to 4 bed sea-facing apartments from PKR 7.9 crore. See amenities, occupancy 2026 and location.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:14:\"Panorama Emaar\";s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 06:52:34\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-20 13:00:18\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:5:{s:9:\"in_navbar\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:16:\"show_in_projects\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:12:\"is_published\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:12:\"navbar_order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13