s<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The official page lists prices from PKR 7.9 crore* and states that booking is open through the \\u201cBook Now\\u201d and \\u201cRegister Interest\\u201d options. The asterisk indicates that terms apply, so buyers should request the following before booking:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>A written rate sheet.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>A list of all additional charges.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>A booking receipt.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Confirmation of payment terms.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Verification of the authorised sales agent.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Panorama are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Emaar for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The official page lists the scheduled completion as occupancy in 2026, and shows a gallery of construction updates. No exact handover date is published, so buyers should rely only on dates given in Emaar\\u2019s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 06:52:34\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-20 13:00:18\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:4:{s:7:\"content\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"is_active\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:10:\"is_visible\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:5:\"order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}