lists an infinity swimming pool, kids\\u2019 play areas, a fully equipped gym, a cinema screen, a business centre and a residents\\u2019 lounge, along with a promenade for dining and retail.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Panorama the tallest waterfront tower in Pakistan?\",\"a\":\"Emaar states that Panorama is on track to become Pakistan\\u2019s tallest waterfront tower. Buyers should confirm the final height and floor count with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Does Panorama have a cinema?\",\"a\":\"Yes, the official page lists a cinema screen among the amenities. Buyers should confirm its details with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Panorama?\",\"a\":\"Panorama is a project by Emaar at Emaar Oceanfront, Karachi.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 06:52:34\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-20 12:57:12\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:10:{s:2:\"id\";i:1651;s:7:\"page_id\";i:197;s:11:\"section_key\";s:3:\"faq\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:13:\"FAQ Accordion\";s:5:\"order\";i:11;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:1986:\"{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Panorama located?\",\"a\":\"Panorama is located in the heart of DHA Phase 8, within Emaar Oceanfront, Karachi. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location with Emaar.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Panorama price?\",\"a\":\"The official page lists prices from PKR 7.9 crore*, with starting sizes from 1,547 sq. ft. Buyers should request a written rate sheet from Emaar for specific units.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Panorama?\",\"a\":\"Panorama offers 1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom sea-facing apartments. Unit sizes should be confirmed on the unit schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Panorama payment plan?\",\"a\":\"No payment plan is published on the official page. Buyers should ask Emaar for the full schedule in writing before paying any amount.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Panorama NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"No project-specific app