('laravel-cache-page_data_park-edge', 'O:15:\"App\\Models\\Page\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:5:\"pages\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:195;s:5:\"title\";s:9:\"Park Edge\";s:4:\"slug\";s:9:\"park-edge\";s:4:\"body\";s:3492:\"<p>Park Edge is positioned for buyers who want an apartment with park and sea views inside a gated seafront community. The project focuses on landscape and community living, and is located at the heart of Emaar Oceanfront. Emaar says the community is home to more than 1,000 families, with new projects ready for occupancy starting 2026.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source, and confirm sizes, prices and plans with Emaar before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Emaar Pakistan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential apartments and penthouse</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>1 to 4 bedroom apartments and penthouse</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Building</td>\r\n<td>Twin tower project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Starting Size</td>\r\n<td>From 1,400 sq. ft*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Starting Price</td>\r\n<td>From PKR 5.9 crore*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Scheduled completion 30 May 2028</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Emaar Oceanfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Flexible 3 year plan: 10% down payment, 14 installments of 6.42% each</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Gated seafront community living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Park Edge is a twin tower project at the heart of Emaar Oceanfront, a seafront gated community of about 75 acres in Karachi, inspired by Dubai Marina. The official page describes a design that focuses on landscape and community living, with two green parks at the project’s periphery. The tower layout and unit allocation should be confirmed through Emaar’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Park Edge</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Park Edge offers 1 to 4 bedroom apartments and a penthouse. The official page quotes a starting size of 1,400 sq. ft*, and individual unit sizes and layouts should be confirmed on the unit schedule. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Park Edge should request the current availability from the developer.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A project brochure is available for download on the official page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from Emaar’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists prices from PKR 5.9 crore* and states that booking is open through the “Book Now” and “Register Interest” options. The asterisk indicates that terms apply, so buyers should request the following before booking:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A written rate sheet.</li>\r\n<li>A list of all additional charges.</li>\r\n<li>A booking receipt.</li>\r\n<li>Confirmation of payment terms.</li>\r\n<li>Verification of the authorised sales agent.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Park Edge are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Emaar for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists a scheduled completion date of 30 May 2028, and shows construction updates through photographs. This is a scheduled date, and buyers should confirm the handover date for their unit in writing from Emaar.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:0;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:126;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:61:\"Park Edge Emaar Oceanfront: Apartments Karachi from 5.9 Crore\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:156:\"Park Edge by Emaar at Oceanfront, DHA Phase 8 offers 1 to 4 bed apartments and penthouses from PKR 5.9 crore on a 3-year plan. See completion and amenities.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:36:\"Park Edge, luxury villas, properties\";s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 06:10:03\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 06:25:24\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:195;s:5:\"title\";s:9:\"Park Edge\";s:4:\"slug\";s:9:\"park-edge\";s:4:\"body\";s:3492:\"<p>Park Edge is positioned for buyers who want an apartment with park and sea views inside a gated seafront community. The project focuses on landscape and community living, and is located at the heart of Emaar Oceanfront. Emaar says the community is home to more than 1,000 families, with new projects ready for occupancy starting 2026.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source, and confirm sizes, prices and plans with Emaar before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Emaar Pakistan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential apartments and penthouse</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>1 to 4 bedroom apartments and penthouse</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Building</td>\r\n<td>Twin tower project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Starting Size</td>\r\n<td>From 1,400 sq. ft*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Starting Price</td>\r\n<td>From PKR 5.9 crore*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Scheduled completion 30 May 2028</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Emaar Oceanfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Flexible 3 year plan: 10% down payment, 14 installments of 6.42% each</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Gated seafront community living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Park Edge is a twin tower project at the heart of Emaar Oceanfront, a seafront gated community of about 75 acres in Karachi, inspired by Dubai Marina. The official page describes a design that focuses on landscape and community living, with two green parks at the project’s periphery. The tower layout and unit allocation should be confirmed through Emaar’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Park Edge</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Park Edge offers 1 to 4 bedroom apartments and a penthouse. The official page quotes a starting size of 1,400 sq. ft*, and individual unit sizes and layouts should be confirmed on the unit schedule. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Park Edge should request the current availability from the developer.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A project brochure is available for download on the official page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from Emaar’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists prices from PKR 5.9 crore* and states that booking is open through the “Book Now” and “Register Interest” options. The asterisk indicates that terms apply, so buyers should request the following before booking:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A written rate sheet.</li>\r\n<li>A list of all additional charges.</li>\r\n<li>A booking receipt.</li>\r\n<li>Confirmation of payment terms.</li>\r\n<li>Verification of the authorised sales agent.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Park Edge are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Emaar for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists a scheduled completion date of 30 May 2028, and shows construction updates through photographs. This is a scheduled date, and buyers should confirm the handover date for their unit in writing from Emaar.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:0;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:126;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:61:\"Park Edge Emaar Oceanfront: Apartments Karachi from 5.9 Crore\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:156:\"Park Edge by Emaar at Oceanfront, DHA Phase 8 offers 1 to 4 bed apartments and penthouses from PKR 5.9 crore on a 3-year plan. See completion and amenities.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:36:\"Park Edge, luxury villas, properties\";s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 06:10:03\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 06:25:24\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:5:{s:9:\"in_navbar\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:16:\"show_in_projects\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:12:\"is_published\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:12:\"navbar_order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:1:{s:8:\"sections\";O:39:\"Illuminate\\Database\\Eloquent\\Collection\":2:{s:8:\"\0*\0items\";a:13:{i:0;O:22:\"App\\Models\\PageSection\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:13: