l schedule in writing before paying any amount.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Park Edge NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"No project-specific approval documents are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Emaar for the NOC and approval details and verify them with the relevant authority.\"},{\"q\":\"When is the Park Edge completion date?\",\"a\":\"The official page lists a scheduled completion date of 30 May 2028. Buyers should confirm the handover date for their unit in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"What amenities does Park Edge offer?\",\"a\":\"The official page lists a swimming pool, a kids\\u2019 play and recreational area, a fully equipped gym, a business centre and a residents\\u2019 lounge, along with a central park\"},{\"q\":\"Is Park Edge a twin tower project?\",\"a\":\"Yes, the official page describes Park Edge as a twin tower project at the heart of Emaar Oceanfront.\"},{\"q\":\"Does Park Edge have a penthouse?\",\"a\":\"The official page lists a penthouse among the available units. Buyers should request the penthouse floor plan and price from the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Park Edge?\",\"a\":\"Park Edge is a project by Emaar at Emaar Oceanfront, Karachi.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 06:10:03\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-20 12:50:46\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:10:{s:2:\"id\";i:1627;s:7:\"page_id\";i:195;s:11:\"section_key\";s:3:\"faq\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:13:\"FAQ Accordion\";s:5:\"order\";i:11;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:1928:\"{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Park Edge located?\",\"a\":\"Park Edge is located at the heart of Emaar Oceanfront in DHA Phase 8, Karachi. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location with Emaar.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Park Edge price?\",\"a\":\"The official page lists prices from PKR 5.9 crore*, with starting sizes from 1,400 sq. ft*. Buyers should request a written rate sheet from Emaar for specific units.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Park Edge?\",\"a\":\"Park Edge offers 1 to 4 bedroom apartments and a penthouse. Unit sizes should be confirmed on the unit schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Park Edge payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The official page lists a flexible three year plan, with a 10% down payment and 14 installments of 6.42% each. Buyers should get the full schedule in writing before paying any amount.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Park Edge NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"No project-specific approval documents are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Emaar for the NOC and approval details and verify them with the relevant authority.\"},{\"q\":\"When is the Park Edge completion date?\",\"a\":\"The official page lists a scheduled completion date of 30 May 2028. Buyers should confirm the handover date for their unit in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"What amenities does Park Edge offer?\",\"a\":\"The official page lists a swimming pool, a kids\\u2019 play and recreational area, a fully equipped gym, a business centre and a residents\\u2019 lounge, along with a central park\"},{\"q\":\"Is Park Edge a twin tower project?\",\"a\":\"Yes, the official page describes Park Edge as a twin tower project at the heart of Emaar Oceanfront.\"},{\"q\":\"Does Park Edge have a penthouse?\",\"a\":\"The official page lists a penthouse among the available units. Buyers should request the penthouse floor plan and price from the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Park Edge?\",\"a\":\"Park Edge is a project by Emaar at Emaar Oceanfront, Karachi.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 06:10:03\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-20 12:50:46\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:4:{s:7:\"content\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"is_active\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:10:\"is_visible\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:5:\"order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s