('laravel-cache-page_data_park-grand-emaar', 'O:15:\"App\\Models\\Page\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:5:\"pages\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:194;s:5:\"title\";s:16:\"Park Grand Emaar\";s:4:\"slug\";s:16:\"park-grand-emaar\";s:4:\"body\";s:3925:\"<p>Park Grand is positioned for buyers who want the space and privacy of a villa within a high-rise. Homes open to horizon views of the sea, with generous layouts, natural light, elegant finishes and a seamless indoor-outdoor flow. The architecture is described as having clean lines, powerful proportions and enduring materials. Park Grand sits within a gated, controlled environment at Emaar Oceanfront, which Emaar says is home to more than 1,000 families.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source, and confirm sizes, prices and plans with Emaar before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Project Highlights</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n    <tbody><tr>\r\n        <th>Feature</th>\r\n        <th>Details</th>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Developer</td>\r\n        <td>Emaar Pakistan</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Property Type</td>\r\n        <td>Vertical villas (residential)</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n        <td>2 to 5 bedroom villas in the sky</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Number of Residences</td>\r\n        <td>158</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Starting Size</td>\r\n        <td>From 2,575 sq. ft*</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Starting Price</td>\r\n        <td>From PKR 12.2 crore*</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Handover</td>\r\n        <td>Not published, confirm with developer</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Location</td>\r\n        <td>Emaar Oceanfront, Karachi</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n        <td>10% down payment, 65% in 10 quarterly installments, 25% on handover</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n        <td>Oceanfront gated community living</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h3>Master Plan and Development Framework</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Park Grand is part of Emaar Oceanfront, a seafront gated community spread over 75 acres in Karachi, inspired by Dubai Marina. Emaar states that new projects at the community are set to be ready for occupancy starting 2026. The tower layout and unit allocation within Park Grand should be confirmed through Emaar’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Vertical Villas in Park Grand</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Park Grand offers 2 to 5 bedroom vertical villas, each with its own service entrance and expansive layouts. The official page quotes a starting size of 2,575 sq. ft*, and individual unit sizes, bedroom counts and floor plans should be confirmed on the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers seeking vertical villas in Karachi should request the current availability, since only 158 residences are planned.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Floor Plan</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>A project brochure is available for download on the official page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from Emaar’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Price and Booking Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists prices from PKR 12.2 crore* and states that booking is open through the \"Book Now\" and \"Register Interest\" options. The asterisk indicates that terms apply.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before booking, buyers should request the following:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li>A written and updated price list.</li>\r\n    <li>A detailed list of all additional charges.</li>\r\n    <li>Confirmation of the official payment plan.</li>\r\n    <li>An official booking receipt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>NOC and Approval Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Park Grand are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Emaar for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Possession Timeline</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No handover date is published on the project page. The page shows a construction update dated October 2026, but buyers should rely only on dates given in Emaar’s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:0;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:125;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:51:\"Park Grand Emaar Oceanfront Vertical Villas Karachi\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:149:\"Park Grand by Emaar at Oceanfront Karachi offers 158 vertical villas, 2 to 5 bedrooms, from PKR 12.2 crore. See payment plan, amenities and location.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:43:\"Park Grand Emaar, luxury villas, properties\";s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 05:52:26\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 06:02:05\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:194;s:5:\"title\";s:16:\"Park Grand Emaar\";s:4:\"slug\";s:16:\"park-grand-emaar\";s:4:\"body\";s:3925:\"<p>Park Grand is positioned for buyers who want the space and privacy of a villa within a high-rise. Homes open to horizon views of the sea, with generous layouts, natural light, elegant finishes and a seamless indoor-outdoor flow. The architecture is described as having clean lines, powerful proportions and enduring materials. Park Grand sits within a gated, controlled environment at Emaar Oceanfront, which Emaar says is home to more than 1,000 families.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source, and confirm sizes, prices and plans with Emaar before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Project Highlights</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n    <tbody><tr>\r\n        <th>Feature</th>\r\n        <th>Details</th>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Developer</td>\r\n        <td>Emaar Pakistan</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Property Type</td>\r\n        <td>Vertical villas (residential)</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n        <td>2 to 5 bedroom villas in the sky</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Number of Residences</td>\r\n        <td>158</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Starting Size</td>\r\n        <td>From 2,575 sq. ft*</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Starting Price</td>\r\n        <td>From PKR 12.2 crore*</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Handover</td>\r\n        <td>Not published, confirm with developer</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Location</td>\r\n        <td>Emaar Oceanfront, Karachi</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n        <td>10% down payment, 65% in 10 quarterly installments, 25% on handover</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n        <td>Oceanfront gated community living</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h3>Master Plan and Development Framework</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Park Grand is part of Emaar Oceanfront, a seafront gated community spread over 75 acres in Karachi, inspired by Dubai Marina. Emaar states that new projects at the community are set to be ready for occupancy starting 2026. The tower layout and unit allocation within Park Grand should be confirmed through Emaar’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Vertical Villas in Park Grand</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Park Grand offers 2 to 5 bedroom vertical villas, each with its own service entrance and expansive layouts. The official page quotes a starting size of 2,575 sq. ft*, and individual unit sizes, bedroom counts and floor plans should be confirmed on the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers seeking vertical villas in Karachi should request the current availability, since only 158 residences are planned.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Floor Plan</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>A project brochure is available for download on the official page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from Emaar’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Price and Booking Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists prices from PKR 12.2 crore* and states that booking is open through the \"Book Now\" and \"Register Interest\" options. The asterisk indicates that terms apply.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before booking, buyers should request the following:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li>A written and updated price list.</li>\r\n    <li>A detailed list of all additional charges.</li>\r\n    <li>Confirmation of the official payment plan.</li>\r\n    <li>An official booking receipt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>NOC and Approval Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Park Grand are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Emaar for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Possession Timeline</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No handover date is published on the project page. The page shows a construction update dated October 2026, but buyers should rely only on dates given in Emaar’s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:0;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:125;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:51:\"Park Grand Emaar Oceanfront Vertical Villas Karachi\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:149:\"Park Grand by Emaar at Oceanfront Karachi offers 158 vertical villas, 2 to 5 bedrooms, from PKR 12.2 crore. See payment plan, amenities and location.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:43:\"Park Grand Emaar, luxury villas, properties\";s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 05:52:26\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 06:02:05\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:5:{s:9:\"in_navbar\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:16:\"show_in_projects\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:12:\"is_published\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:12:\"navbar_order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:1:{s:8:\"sections\";O:39:\"Illuminate\\Database\\Eloquent\\Collection\":2:{s:8:\"\0*\0items\";a:13:{i:0;O:22:\"App\\Models\\PageSection\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:13:\"page_sections\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:10:{s:2:\"id\";i:1606;s:7:\"page_id\";i:194;s:11:\"section_key\";s:4:\"hero\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:18:\"Hero Banner & Form\";s:5:\"order\";i:1;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:248:\"{\"title\":\"Park Grand at Emaar Oceanfront Karachi\",\"subtitle\":null,\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795068104_6afe90c836705.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Park Grand at Emaar Oceanfront Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Park Grand at Emaar Oceanfront Karachi\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 05:52:26\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 06:01:44\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:10:{s:2:\"id\";i:1606;s:7:\"page_id\";i:194;s:11:\"section_key\";s:4:\"hero\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:18:\"Hero Ban