y Emaar Pakistan\",\"description\":\"Park Grand is a residential project by Emaar at Emaar Oceanfront, Karachi. Emaar describes it as a collection of vertical villas rather than conventional apartments, with only 158 expansive residences in 2 to 5 bedroom layouts. Prices start from PKR 12.2 crore*, and the official page lists a payment plan and a construction update dated October 2026. Terms marked with an asterisk are subject to the developer\\u2019s conditions, so buyers should confirm them directly with Emaar before booking.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795068104_6afe90c83b5bd.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 05:52:26\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 06:01:44\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:10:{s:2:\"id\";i:1608;s:7:\"page_id\";i:194;s:11:\"section_key\";s:5:\"about\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:15:\"About Community\";s:5:\"order\";i:3;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:631:\"{\"title\":\"Park Grand by Emaar Pakistan\",\"description\":\"Park Grand is a residential project by Emaar at Emaar Oceanfront, Karachi. Emaar describes it as a collection of vertical villas rather than conventional apartments, with only 158 expansive residences in 2 to 5 bedroom layouts. Prices start from PKR 12.2 crore*, and the official page lists a payment plan and a construction update dated October 2026. Terms marked with an asterisk are subject to the developer\\u2019s conditions, so buyers should confirm them directly with Emaar before booking.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795068104_6afe90c83b5bd.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 05:52:26\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-19 06:01:44\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:4:{s:7:\"content\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"is_active\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:10:\"is_visible\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:5:\"order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";