i, which works as the main access point and directional landmark for the society. It borders Surjani Town closely and is easily reachable from Gulshan-e-Maymar and New Karachi, in a comparatively quieter part of the city away from the busiest commercial stretches.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693117_6ae995bd4330a.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions:\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"4K Chowrangi\",\"time\":\"2\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Surjani Town\",\"time\":\"5\\u201310 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Gulshan-e-Maymar\",\"time\":\"10\\u201315 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"New Karachi\",\"time\":\"7\\u201312 minutes\"}]}]}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-03 07:53:47\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-20 12:50:46\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:4:{s:7:\"content\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"is_active\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:10:\"is_visible\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:5:\"order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:7:{i:0;s:7:\"page_id\";i:1;s:11:\"section_key\";i:2;s:12:\"section_name\";i:3;s:5:\"order\";i:4;s:9:\"is_active\";i:5;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:6;s:7:\"content\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:21:\"\0*\0excludedAttributes\";a:0:{}s:10:\"auditEvent\";N;s:14:\"auditCustomOld\";N;s:14:\"auditCustomNew\";N;s:13:\"isCustomEvent\";b:0;s:21:\"preloadedResolverData\";a:0:{}}i:10;O:22:\"App\\Models\\PageSection\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:13:\"page_sections\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:10:{s:2:\"id\";i:828;s:7:\"page_id\";i:104;s:11:\"section_key\";s:3:\"faq\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:13:\"FAQ Accordion\";s:5:\"order\";i:11;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:2662:\"{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Arabian Villas Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Villas is located in Sector 5-A, Gadap Town, North Karachi, near 4K Chowrangi. The Saima Arabian Villas Karachi location is reachable from Surjani Town, Gulshan-e-Maymar, and New Karachi, with 4K Chowrangi as the main reference point.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Arabian Villas price?\",\"a\":\"There is no single Saima Arabian Villas price: figures vary significantly by plot size, block, position, and whether the unit is a plot or a built house, and most current figures come from resale listings rather than fixed developer pricing. Buyers should obtain a current, unit-specific quote in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Arabian Villas?\",\"a\":\"Bedroom counts vary by plot size and construction type: listings show 2-bed and 4-bed houses on 120 sq. yd. plots and larger 3-bed units on 240 sq. yd. plots, in single-storey and ground-plus-one formats. The exact configuration should be confirmed for the specific unit.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Arabian Villas payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Payment terms now vary by unit: selected plots and villas are offered on a cash-only basis, while limited installment options may still be available on others. The Saima Arabian Villas payment plan for a specific unit should be confirmed in writing before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Arabian Villas NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Villas Saima Builders as a whole is stated to be SBCA-approved, but buyers should still independently check the NOC and legal documentation for the specific unit and block they are buying into before paying.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Arabian Villas?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Villas is developed by Saima Group, which has been delivering real estate projects across Karachi since the 1980s.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Arabian Villas part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Villas is the main society, organised into Blocks A through H. Its premium extension, Saima Arabian Ranches, sits within the wider society and is covered separately.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Arabian Villas?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Arabian Villas sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Arabian Villas Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because it offers actual ground-level houses and plots in a gated, established society with a real resale and rental market, rather than launch-stage promises. Saima Arabian Villas Karachi also gives buyers their own boundary wall and land, with the option to extend later.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-03 07:53:47\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-20 12:50:46\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:10:{s:2:\"id\";i:828;s:7:\"page_id\";i:104;s:11:\"section_key\";s:3:\"faq\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:13:\"FAQ Accordion\";s:5:\"order\";i:11;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:2662:\"{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Arabian Villas Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Villas is located in Sector 5-A, Gadap Town, North Karachi, near 4K Chowrangi. The Saima Arabian Villas Karachi location is reachable from Surjani Town, Gulshan-e-Maymar, and New Karachi, with 4K Chowrangi as the main reference point.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Arabian Villas price?\",\"a\":\"There is no single Saima Arabian Villas price: figures vary significantly by plot size, block, position, and whether the unit is a plot or a built house, and most current figures come from resale listings rather than fixed developer pricing. Buyers should obtain a current, unit-specific quote in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Arabian Villas?\",\"a\":\"Bedroom counts vary by plot size and construction type: listings show 2-bed and 4-bed houses on 120 sq. yd. plots and larger 3-bed units on 240 sq. yd. plots, in single-storey and ground-plus-one formats. The exact configuration should be confirmed for the specific unit.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Arabian Villas payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Payment terms now vary by unit: selected plots and villas are offered on a cash-only basis, while limited installment options may still be available on others. The Saima Arabian Villas payment plan for a specific unit should be confirmed in writing before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Arabian Villas NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Villas Saima Builders as a whole is stated to be SBCA-approved, but buyers should still independently check the NOC and legal documentation for the specific unit and block they are buying into before paying.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Arabian Villas?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Villas is developed by Saima Group, which has been delivering real estate projects across Karachi since the 1980s.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Arabian Villas part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Villas is the main society, organised into Blocks A through H. Its premium extension, Saima Arabian Ranches, sits within the wider society and is covered separately.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Arabian Villas?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Arabian Villas sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Arabian Villas Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because it offers actual ground-level houses and plots in a gated, established society with a real resale and rental market, rather than launch-stage promises. Saima Arabian Villas Karachi also gives buyers their own boundary wall and land, with the option to extend later.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-03 07:53:47\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-20 12:50:46\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:4:{s:7:\"content\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"is_active\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:10:\"is_visible\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:5:\"order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:7:{i:0;s:7:\"page_id\";i:1;s:11:\"section_key\";i:2;s:12:\"section_name\";i:3;s:5:\"order\";i:4;s:9:\"is_active\";i:5;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:6;s:7:\"content\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:21:\"\0*\0excludedAttributes\";a:0:{}s:10:\"auditEvent\";N;s:14:\"auditCustomOld\";N;s:14:\"auditCustomNew\";N;s:13:\"isCustomEvent\";b:0;s:21:\"preloadedResolverData\";a:0:{}}i:11;O:22:\"App\\Models\\PageSection\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:13:\"page_sections\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:10:{s:2:\"id\";i:829;s:7:\"page_id\";i:104;s:11:\"section_key\";s:7:\"c