r under more than one status on its site.\"},{\"q\":\"10. How do I verify Saima coming soon projects in Karachi before booking?\",\"a\":\"Ask for the NOC, ownership documents, approved layout and written booking terms, and use only Saima\'s official contacts.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 06:58:39\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 07:03:29\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:10:{s:2:\"id\";i:1069;s:7:\"page_id\";i:138;s:11:\"section_key\";s:3:\"faq\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:13:\"FAQ Accordion\";s:5:\"order\";i:3;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:2123:\"{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"1. What are the Saima coming soon projects in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Saima\'s site lists ZSZ Midtown Farms, Saima One Residence, Saima Ace Residency, Saima Mangroves, Saima Corporate Center, Saima Business Park and Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence as upcoming projects.\"},{\"q\":\"2. Which Saima upcoming projects in Karachi suit homebuyers?\",\"a\":\"By name and listing, the residential entries are the best starting point, but confirm unit types and current status with Saima first.\"},{\"q\":\"3. Are there Saima coming soon apartments in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Some residential projects may include apartments, but unit types vary, so ask the sales team and confirm sizes and floor plans.\"},{\"q\":\"4. What are Saima new launch projects in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"These are recently introduced developments, and some have held launch events while still listed as upcoming, so check current status.\"},{\"q\":\"5. Are there Saima pre launch projects in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Projects marked Coming Soon are at the pre-launch stage, so you can register interest, but don\'t pay before an official launch.\"},{\"q\":\"6. What is the Saima coming soon projects price?\",\"a\":\"It depends on location, property type and unit size, and public price lists are limited, so request a written schedule\"},{\"q\":\"7.