\n    <td>Easy installments, to be confirmed in writing</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Saima Premium Apartments in Saima Projects on Main Jinnah Avenue: Layouts and Amenities</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The homes and units are:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>3 and 4-bed apartments</li>\r\n  <li>Shops</li>\r\n  <li>Showrooms</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Saima Jinnah Icon</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>5 and 6-room apartments above the mall</li>\r\n  <li>Mall shops, food court and cinema as listed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3>Planned Amenities</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Dedicated parking between mall and residential floors at Icon</li>\r\n  <li>24/7 security with CCTV at Icon</li>\r\n  <li>Reception lobby and waiting area at Icon</li>\r\n  <li>Gymnasium and lounge or recreational space at Icon</li>\r\n  <li>Facilities for Mall and Residence to be confirmed in its brochure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price, Installments and Booking</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No public price list is quoted here for Saima projects on Main Jinnah Avenue, so confirm the price of each project in writing. Payment terms differ by project, so request the schedule for the exact project in writing before booking. Buyers asking about Saima projects on installment should request the schedule and booking amount.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For Main Jinnah Avenue apartments for sale, note that the Saima offering in this location includes apartments. Confirm the exact unit type and availability in writing before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals Before You Book</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Approvals are project-specific, so verify the NOC and building approvals independently for the exact project before booking. Anyone comparing Saima new projects in Karachi Main Jinnah Avenue should verify every document independently.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima projects on Main Jinnah Avenue are worth considering among Saima new projects in Karachi Main Jinnah Avenue. Before booking, get the price, payment schedule and approvals in writing for the specific project.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:0;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:78;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:65:\"Saima Projects on Main Jinnah Avenue | Saima New Projects Karachi\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:147:\"Saima projects on Main Jinnah Avenue, including Jinnah Mall and Residence and Jinnah Icon. Check apartment layouts, prices and installment details.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:161:\"saima new projects in karachi Main Jinnah Avenue, saima projects in Main Jinnah Avenue, saima projects in Main Jinnah Avenue price, saima projects on installment\";s:8:\"og_image\";s:24:\"/images/hero/slide-1.jpg\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 06:14:30\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 06:26:53\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:133;s:5:\"title\";s:48:\"Saima New Projects in Karachi Main Jinnah Avenue\";s:4:\"slug\";s:48:\"saima-new-projects-in-karachi-main-jinnah-avenue\";s:4:\"body\";s:3208:\"<h2>Why Saima Projects in Main Jinnah Avenue Stand Out</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Main Jinnah Avenue places buyers near Malir Cantonment, Askari 5 and Jinnah International Airport, with residential living above retail malls in both Saima projects on this corridor.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Facts: Saima Projects on Main Jinnah Avenue</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>This table summarises the Saima new projects on Main Jinnah Avenue.</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <th>Detail</th>\r\n    <th>Information</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Projects</td>\r\n    <td>Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence; Saima Jinnah Icon</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Location</td>\r\n    <td>Main Jinnah Avenue, Karachi; Mall and Residence opposite Malir Cantt Checkpost 5; Icon in Sector 40, near Checkpost 6, opposite Askari 5</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Developer</td>\r\n    <td>Saima Builders; Icon in collaboration with the ZSZ Group</td>\r\n  </tr