('laravel-cache-page_data_saima-new-projects-in-karachi-north-karachi', 'O:15:\"App\\Models\\Page\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:5:\"pages\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:132;s:5:\"title\";s:43:\"Saima New Projects in Karachi North Karachi\";s:4:\"slug\";s:43:\"saima-new-projects-in-karachi-north-karachi\";s:4:\"body\";s:2675:\"<h2>Why Saima Projects in North Karachi Stand Out</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>North Karachi places Saima Arabian Ranches within the Saima Arabian Villas society, near 4K Chowrangi, Surjani Town and the M-10 Karachi Northern Bypass, with a premium position inside an established community.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Facts: Saima Arabian Ranches at North Karachi</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>This table summarises the Saima new project in North Karachi.</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <th>Detail</th>\r\n    <th>Information</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Project</td>\r\n    <td>Saima Arabian Ranches</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Location</td>\r\n    <td>Within Saima Arabian Villas, near 4K Chowrangi, North Karachi</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Developer</td>\r\n    <td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Homes</td>\r\n    <td>Mainly 120 sq. yd. residential plots; villas in listings</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n    <td>Easy monthly installments</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Handover</td>\r\n    <td>Phased</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Saima Premium Apartments In Saima Arabian Ranches: Layouts and Amenities</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The homes and units are:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>120 sq. yd. residential plots</li>\r\n  <li>Villas in listings, to be confirmed for the exact unit</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Planned amenities include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Complete boundary wall with gated, controlled entry</li>\r\n  <li>Lush green public parks</li>\r\n  <li>A grand mosque</li>\r\n  <li>A school</li>\r\n  <li>Commercial shops and small markets</li>\r\n  <li>A medical complex within the wider community</li>\r\n  <li>Enhanced security</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price, Installments and Booking</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No public price list is quoted here for Saima Arabian Ranches, so confirm any Saima projects in North Karachi price in writing. The project is offered on easy monthly installments, with the exact booking amount and schedule to be confirmed in writing. Buyers asking about Saima projects on installment should request the schedule and booking amount.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For North Karachi apartments for sale, note that the Saima offering in this location is plots, so confirm the exact unit type and availability in writing before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals Before You Book</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Approvals are project-specific, so verify the NOC and society approvals independently before booking. Anyone comparing Saima new projects in Karachi North Karachi should verify every document independently.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Arabian Ranches is the main entry among Saima new projects in Karachi North Karachi. Before looking at other Saima projects in North Karachi, get the price, schedule and approvals in writing.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:0;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:77;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:59:\"Saima Arabian Ranches | Saima New Projects in North Karachi\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:158:\"Saima Arabian Ranches, one of the Saima new projects in Karachi North Karachi. View 120 sq. yd. plots, installment details, amenities and booking information.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:140:\"saima proje