levard\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793704430_6ae9c1ee25317.jpg\"}],\"unselected_ids\":[58,57,56,54,53,52,51,50,49,48,47,46,45,44,43,42,41,40,39,38,37,36,35,34]}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 07:09:28\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 10:14:41\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:4:{s:7:\"content\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"is_active\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:10:\"is_visible\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:5:\"order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:7:{i:0;s:7:\"page_id\";i:1;s:11:\"section_key\";i:2;s:12:\"section_name\";i:3;s:5:\"order\";i:4;s:9:\"is_active\";i:5;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:6;s:7:\"content\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:21:\"\0*\0excludedAttributes\";a:0:{}s:10:\"auditEvent\";N;s:14:\"auditCustomOld\";N;s:14:\"auditCustomNew\";N;s:13:\"isCustomEvent\";b:0;s:21:\"preloadedResolverData\";a:0:{}}i:3;O:22:\"App\\Models\\PageSection\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:13:\"page_sections\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:10:{s:2:\"id\";i:1083;s:7:\"page_id\";i:140;s:11:\"section_key\";s:3:\"faq\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:13:\"FAQ Accordion\";s:5:\"order\";i:3;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:2453:\"{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"1. What are the Saima ready to move projects in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Saima\'s website lists its completed developments, including residential towers and commercial centres. Availability changes, so ask the sales team which units are currently unsold.\"},{\"q\":\"2. Which Saima completed projects in Karachi are best for families?\",\"a\":\"Residential towers with reliable water, power backup, parking and security usually suit families. Visit the site and compare facilities before you decide.\"},{\"q\":\"3. Are there Saima ready to move apartments in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Yes, completed residential projects may offer apartments, but unit sizes and availability vary. Confirm floor plans and remaining units in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"4. Are Saima completed apartments in Karachi available for immediate possession?\",\"a\":\"Many completed units may be, but possession timing depends on documents, payments and utility readiness. Get the handover date confirmed in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"5. What are Saima ready possession projects in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"These are developments that have finished construction and can hand over units to buyers. Ask for a possession letter and a list of pending charges.\"},{\"q\":\"6. Is it better to buy Saima completed projects or under-construction ones?\",\"a\":\"Completed stock removes construction delay risk and lets you inspect the unit, but it may need a larger upfront payment. The right choice depends on your budget and timeline.\"},{\"q\":\"7. Can I find Saima ready to move flats in Karachi for investment?\",\"a\":\"Some may suit rental investors, but no return is guaranteed. Check the location, rental demand and maintenance costs before committing.\"},{\"q\":\"8. What is the Saima completed projects price?\",\"a\":\"It varies by project, size, floor and facilities. Request a current written price list from the sales team instead of relying on third-party listings.\"},{\"q\":\"9. How do I buy Saima ready to move apartments for sale in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Enquire with Saima\'s official sales team, select a unit, inspect it, pay the booking amount and keep a receipt and written terms. For resale units, verify the owner and transfer process.\"},{\"q\":\"10. How do I verify Saima possession ready projects in Karachi before paying?\",\"a\":\"Ask for the NOC, ownership or allotment documents, approved layout and written terms. Use only Saima\'s official contacts and visit the site yourself.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 07:09:28\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 10:14:39\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:10:{s:2:\"id\";i:1083;s:7:\"page_id\";i:140;s:11:\"section_key\";s:3:\"faq\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:13:\"FAQ Accordion\";s:5:\"order\";i:3;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:2453:\"{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"1. What are the Saima ready to move projects in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Saima\'s website lists its completed developments, including residential towers and commercial centres. Availability changes, so ask the sales team which units are currently unsold.\"},{\"q\":\"2. Which Saima completed projects in Karachi are best for families?\",\"a\":\"Residential towers with reliable water, power backup, parking and security usually suit families. Visit the site and compare facilities before you decide.\"},{\"q\":\"3. Are there Saima ready to move apartments in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Yes, completed residential projects may offer apartments, but unit sizes and availability vary. Confirm floor plans and remaining units in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"4. Are Saima completed apartments in Karachi available for immediate possession?\",\"a\":\"Many completed units may be, but possession timing depends on documents, payments and utility readiness. Get the handover date confirmed in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"5. What are Saima ready possession projects in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"These are developments that have finished construction and can hand over units to buyers. Ask for a possession letter and a list of pending charges.\"},{\"q\":\"6. Is it better to buy Saima completed projects or under-construction ones?\",\"a\":\"Completed stock removes construction delay risk and lets you inspect the unit, but it may need a larger upfront payment. The right choice depends on your budget and timeline.\"},{\"q\":\"7. Can I find Saima ready to move flats in Karachi for investment?\",\"a\":\"Some may suit rental investors, but no return is guaranteed. Check the location, rental demand and maintenance costs before committing.\"},{\"q\":\"8. What is the Saima completed projects price?\",\"a\":\"It varies by project, size, floor and facilities. Request a current written price list from the sales team instead of relying on third-party listings.\"},{\"q\":\"9. How do I buy Saima ready to move apartments for sale in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Enquire with Saima\'s official sales team, select a unit, inspect it, pay the booking amount and keep a receipt and written terms. For resale units, verify the owner and transfer process.\"},{\"q\":\"10. How do I verify Saima possession ready projects in Karachi before paying?\",\"a\":\"Ask for the NOC, ownership or allotment documents, approved layout and written terms. Use only Saima\'s official contacts and visit the site yourself.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 07:09:28\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 10:14:39\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:4:{s:7:\"content\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"is_active\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:10:\"is_visible\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:5:\"order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0: