. How does Saima under construction projects booking work?\",\"a\":\"It typically involves an enquiry, unit selection, a booking amount and documents, so get a receipt and written terms.\"},{\"q\":\"10. How do I verify saima under construction projects in Karachi before booking?\",\"a\":\"Ask for the NOC, ownership documents, approved layout and written terms, and use only Saima\\u2019s official contacts.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 07:03:59\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 07:08:52\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:10:{s:2:\"id\";i:1076;s:7:\"page_id\";i:139;s:11:\"section_key\";s:3:\"faq\";s:12:\"section_name\";s:13:\"FAQ Accordion\";s:5:\"order\";i:3;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:1;s:7:\"content\";s:2006:\"{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"1. What are the Saima under construction projects in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Saima\\u2019s website lists many under construction names, from residential towers to commercial centres, and ten are shown in the table above.\"},{\"q\":\"2. Which Saima ongoing projects in Karachi are closest to completion?\",\"a\":\"Saima\\u2019s site shows a status but not completion percentages, so ask each sales team for the stage and possession date in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"3. Are there Saima under construction apartments in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Yes, several residential names are listed, but unit types vary, so confirm sizes and floor plans first.\"},{\"q\":\"4. Are there Saima under construction flats in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Some residential projects may offer flats, so ask which units remain and check the approved plans.\"},{\"q\":\"5. Which projects suit investors?\",\"a\":\"Commercial and mixed-use names may suit investors, but confirm status, approvals and expected returns directly, because no return is guaranteed.\"},{\"q\":\"6. Why consider saima projects under construction?\",\"a\":\"They can offer staged payments and earlier entry, but you take construction and possession-timing risk.\"},{\"q\":\"7. What is the Saima under construction projects price?\",\"a\":\"It varies by project, unit and construction stage, so request a written price list from the sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"8. What is the Saima under construction projects payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Plans usually include a booking amount, instalments and possession payments, so confirm amounts and refund terms in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"9. How does Saima under construction projects booking work?\",\"a\":\"It typically involves an enquiry, unit selection, a booking amount and documents, so get a receipt and written terms.\"},{\"q\":\"10. How do I verify saima under construction projects in Karachi before booking?\",\"a\":\"Ask for the NOC, ownership documents, approved layout and written terms, and use only Saima\\u2019s official contacts.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 07:03:59\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-10 07:08:52\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:4:{s:7:\"content\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"is_active\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:10:\"is_visible\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:5:\"order\";s:7:\"integer\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:7:{i:0;s:7:\"page_id\";i:1;s:11:\"section_key\";i:2;s:12:\"section_name\";i:3;s:5:\"order\";i:4;s:9:\"is_active\";i:5;s:10:\"is_visible\";i:6;s:7:\"content\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:21:\"\0*\0excludedAttributes\";a:0:{}s:10:\"auditEvent\";N;s:14:\"auditCustomOld\";N;s:14:\"auditCustomNew\";N;s:13:\"i