('laravel-cache-page_data_stadium-view-residencia', 'O:15:\"App\\Models\\Page\":39:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:5:\"pages\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:181;s:5:\"title\";s:23:\"Stadium View Residencia\";s:4:\"slug\";s:23:\"stadium-view-residencia\";s:4:\"body\";s:3617:\"<p>Stadium View Residencia is positioned for buyers who want a modern apartment with a stadium view inside a gated township, on a 48 month installment plan. The listing describes units on floors 2 to 16, many of them park and boulevard facing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because the listing data comes from a real estate agency, buyers should treat prices, floors and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <th>Feature</th>\r\n    <th>Details</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Developer</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad (Javedan Corporation Limited, Arif Habib Group)</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Property Type</td>\r\n    <td>Residential apartments, with a commercial basement and ground-floor showrooms</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n    <td>2 bed lounge and 2 bed DD / 3 bed lounge (currently listed)</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Apartment Sizes</td>\r\n    <td>About 896 sq. ft and 1,249 sq. ft, as listed</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Price Range (listed)</td>\r\n    <td>PKR 1.61 crore to PKR 2.31 crore, subject to change</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Handover</td>\r\n    <td>Not published</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Location</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n    <td>48 month installment plan (as listed), confirm schedule with developer</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n    <td>High-rise living in a master-planned community</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Stadium View Residencia is part of the wider Naya Nazimabad community. The listing describes a tower of 18 floors with a commercial basement and ground-floor showrooms below the apartments. The tower layout and the number of units should be confirmed through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Stadium View Residencia</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The listing shows two currently available layouts:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>2 bed lounge: about 896 sq. ft, listed at PKR 1.61 crore (about PKR 18,000 per sq. ft).</li>\r\n  <li>2 bed DD / 3 bed lounge: about 1,249 sq. ft, listed at PKR 2.31 crore (about PKR 18,500 per sq. ft).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The project page also mentions 4 bed lounge layouts, but these are not in the current listing. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Stadium View Residencia should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No floor plan is published on the source page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Listings show apartments at about PKR 1.61 crore to PKR 2.31 crore, or roughly PKR 18,000 to PKR 18,500 per square foot. These are agency listings and not an official developer price list. Booking is listed as open, with one listing mentioning a 10% booking amount.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should request the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt, and should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Stadium View Residencia are published on the source page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published for Stadium View Residencia. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer’s official documentation.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:0;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:112;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:55:\"Stadium View Residencia Naya Nazimabad: 2 & 3 Bed Flats\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:156:\"Stadium View Residencia in Naya Nazimabad offers 2 bed lounge and 2 bed DD apartments with Cricket Stadium views on a 48-month plan. See sizes and location.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:123:\"Stadium View Residencia Naya Nazimabad, Stadium View Residencia Karachi, Stadium View Residencia, Naya Nazimabad apartments\";s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-16 13:07:41\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-17 06:56:14\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:16:{s:2:\"id\";i:181;s:5:\"title\";s:23:\"Stadium View Residencia\";s:4:\"slug\";s:23:\"stadium-view-residencia\";s:4:\"body\";s:3617:\"<p>Stadium View Residencia is positioned for buyers who want a modern apartment with a stadium view inside a gated township, on a 48 month installment plan. The listing describes units on floors 2 to 16, many of them park and boulevard facing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because the listing data comes from a real estate agency, buyers should treat prices, floors and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <th>Feature</th>\r\n    <th>Details</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Developer</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad (Javedan Corporation Limited, Arif Habib Group)</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Property Type</td>\r\n    <td>Residential apartments, with a commercial basement and ground-floor showrooms</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n    <td>2 bed lounge and 2 bed DD / 3 bed lounge (currently listed)</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Apartment Sizes</td>\r\n    <td>About 896 sq. ft and 1,249 sq. ft, as listed</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Price Range (listed)</td>\r\n    <td>PKR 1.61 crore to PKR 2.31 crore, subject to change</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Handover</td>\r\n    <td>Not published</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Location</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n    <td>48 month installment plan (as listed), confirm schedule with developer</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n    <td>High-rise living in a master-planned community</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Stadium View Residencia is part of the wider Naya Nazimabad community. The listing describes a tower of 18 floors with a commercial basement and ground-floor showrooms below the apartments. The tower layout and the number of units should be confirmed through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Stadium View Residencia</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The listing shows two currently available layouts:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>2 bed lounge: about 896 sq. ft, listed at PKR 1.61 crore (about PKR 18,000 per sq. ft).</li>\r\n  <li>2 bed DD / 3 bed lounge: about 1,249 sq. ft, listed at PKR 2.31 crore (about PKR 18,500 per sq. ft).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The project page also mentions 4 bed lounge layouts, but these are not in the current listing. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Stadium View Residencia should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No floor plan is published on the source page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Listings show apartments at about PKR 1.61 crore to PKR 2.31 crore, or roughly PKR 18,000 to PKR 18,500 per square foot. These are agency listings and not an official developer price list. Booking is listed as open, with one listing mentioning a 10% booking amount.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should request the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt, and should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Stadium View Residencia are published on the source page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published for Stadium View Residencia. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer’s official documentation.</p>\";s:9:\"in_navbar\";i:1;s:16:\"show_in_projects\";i:1;s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";i:0;s:12:\"navbar_order\";i:112;s:12:\"is_published\";i:1;s:6:\"status\";s:7:\"publish\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:55:\"Stadium View Residencia Naya Nazimabad: 2 & 3 Bed Flats\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:156:\"Stadium View Residencia in Naya Nazimabad offers 2 bed lounge and 2 bed DD apartments with Cricket Stadium views on a 48-month plan. See sizes and location.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";s:123:\"Stadium View Residencia Naya Nazimabad, Stadium View Residencia Karachi, Stadium View Residencia, Naya Nazimabad apartments\";s:8:\"og_image\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-16 13:07:41\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-11-17 06:56:14\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:5:{s:9:\"in_navbar\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:16:\"show_in_projects\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:18:\"show_in_commercial\";s:7:\"boolean\";s:12:\"is_published\";