(23, 'Al Ghafoor Group', 'al-ghafoor-group', 'Al Ghafoor Group', 'Discover Al Ghafoor Group, a Karachi-based builder and developer known for residential plots, apartments and industrial land across Sindh.', 'uploads/developers/1795086962_logo_al-ghafoor-logo.svg', 'uploads/developers/1795086962_cover_a-g-sky-rise-new-web-thumbnails.jpg', 'uploads/developers/1795086962_cover_a-g-sky-rise-new-web-thumbnails.jpg', '<div>Al Ghafoor Group, also known as Al Ghafoor Builders &amp; Developers, is a Karachi-based real estate development and construction company. The group says it has been active since 2002 and is known for residential plot schemes such as Al Ghafoor Green City and Al Ghafoor Grande City, apartment projects such as Al Ghafoor Pride and Al Ghafoor Vista, and an industrial zone on Main Maghopir Road.</div>', '<p>Al Ghafoor Group is a private limited company founded in Karachi, with interests in real estate development, construction and property management. Its portfolio includes residential plot schemes, apartment buildings, an industrial zone and a housing scheme outside Karachi.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In Karachi, Al Ghafoor Green City is offered in phases, including Phase 1 and an Executive Block with 120 square yard plots, located near the M10 Northern Bypass in the Scheme 45 area. Al Ghafoor Grande City in Surjani Town is listed with cottage-style units on 140 square yard plots. For apartment buyers, the group has introduced Al Ghafoor Pride, Al Ghafoor Vista in Nazimabad with 3 and 4 bedroom apartments, and Al Ghafoor Grande Tower in Gulshan-e-Maymar.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For commercial buyers, Al Ghafoor Industrial Zone is a 56-acre gated industrial project on Main Maghopir Road, offered with 1,000, 2,500 and 3,500 square yard plots. Outside Karachi, the group is also associated with Al Ghafoor Residency, a housing scheme on the Sukkur to Shikarpur Road with residential and commercial plots.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat project details from third-party sources as unverified until confirmed by the developer, and should ask for the plot or unit schedule, price list, payment plan and approval documents for each project in writing.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Al Ghafoor Group Project Portfolio</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <thead>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <th>Project Name</th>\r\n      <th>Location</th>\r\n      <th>Property Type</th>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </thead>\r\n  <tbody>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Al Ghafoor Green City</td>\r\n      <td>Scheme 45, Karachi</td>\r\n      <td>Residential plots</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Al Ghafoor Grande City</td>\r\n      <td>Surjani Town, Karachi</td>\r\n      <td>Cottage-style residential units</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Al Ghafoor Pride</td>\r\n      <td>Karachi</td>\r\n      <td>Residential apartments</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Al Ghafoor Vista</td>\r\n      <td>Nazimabad, Karachi</td>\r\n      <td>3 and 4 bedroom apartments</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Al Ghafoor Grande Tower</td>\r\n      <td>Gulshan-e-Maymar, Karachi</td>\r\n      <td>Residential apartments</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Al Ghafoor Industrial Zone</td>\r\n      <td>Main Maghopir Road, Karachi</td>\r\n      <td>Industrial plots</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Al Ghafoor Residency</td>\r\n      <td>Sukkur–Shikarpur Road</td>\r\n      <td>Residential and commercial plots</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Project Locations</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Explore Al Ghafoor Group’s developments across Karachi and Sindh through our project location details.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Al Ghafoor Green City is located in the Scheme 45 area of Karachi, near the M10 Northern Bypass. Al Ghafoor Grande City is in Surjani Town, Gadap Town. Al Ghafoor Grande Tower is in Gulshan-e-Maymar, and Al Ghafoor Vista is in Nazimabad. Al Ghafoor Industrial Zone is on Main Maghopir Road, and Al Ghafoor Residency is in Sukkur.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Al Ghafoor Group Development Locations</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Al Ghafoor Green City:</strong> Scheme 45, near M10 Northern Bypass, Karachi.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Al Ghafoor Grande City:</strong> Surjani Town, Gadap Town, Karachi.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Al Ghafoor Grande Tower:</strong> Gulshan-e-Maymar, Karachi.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Al Ghafoor Vista:</strong> Nazimabad, Karachi.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Al Ghafoor Industrial Zone:</strong> Main Maghopir Road, Karachi.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Al Ghafoor Residency:</strong> Sukkur–Shikarpur Road, Sindh.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>View project locations, explore surrounding facilities and discover the communities developed by Al Ghafoor Group.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Interested in Al Ghafoor Group Projects?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Looking to buy a residential plot, an apartment or an industrial plot in Karachi, or compare Al Ghafoor Group with other builders and developers in the city?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Connect with our property experts to learn more about Al Ghafoor Group developments, available properties, project details and current payment plans.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Register your interest today and receive professional assistance in exploring residential and commercial opportunities.</p>', 'Al Ghafoor Group: Developer of Green City & Grande City', 'Al Ghafoor Group is a Karachi developer behind Al Ghafoor Green City, Grande City, Grande Tower and Pride. Explore projects, locations and payment plans.', 'Al Ghafoor Group, Al Ghafoor Builders and Developers, Al Ghafoor projects, Al Ghafoor developer', NULL, '[]', '[{\"question\":\"Who is Al Ghafoor Group?\",\"answer\":\"Al Ghafoor Group, also known as Al Ghafoor Builders & Developers, is a Karachi-based real estate development and construction company. It is known for residential plot schemes, apartment projects and an industrial zone.\"},{\"question\":\"Which are the major projects by Al Ghafoor Group?\",\"answer\":\"Major projects include Al Ghafoor Green City, Al Ghafoor Grande City, Al Ghafoor Grande Tower, Al Ghafoor Pride, Al Ghafoor Vista and Al Ghafoor Industrial Zone in Karachi, and Al Ghafoor Residency in Sukkur.\"},{\"question\":\"Where are Al Ghafoor Group projects located?\",\"answer\":\"Most projects are in Karachi, in areas including Scheme 45, Surjani Town, Gulshan-e-Maymar, Nazimabad and Main Maghopir Road. Al Ghafoor Residency is located in Sukkur.\"},{\"question\":\"What is Al Ghafoor Green City?\",\"answer\":\"Al Ghafoor Green City is a residential plot scheme near the M10 Northern Bypass in the Scheme 45 area of Karachi. It is offered in phases, including Phase 1 and an Executive block with 120 square yard plots.\"},{\"question\":\"What is Al Ghafoor Grande City?\",\"answer\":\"Al Ghafoor Grande City is a residential project in Surjani Town, Karachi. Listings show cottage-style units on 140 square yard plots.\"},{\"question\":\"What types of properties does Al Ghafoor Group offer?\",\"answer\":\"The group offers residential plots, apartments, industrial plots and commercial plots, depending on the project. Property types and availability differ for each project, so check the individual project page.\"},{\"question\":\"What is Al Ghafoor Industrial Zone?\",\"answer\":\"Al Ghafoor Industrial Zone is a 56-acre gated industrial project on Main Maghopir Road, Karachi, offered with 1,000, 2,500 and 3,500 square yard plots.\"},{\"question\":\"Are Al Ghafoor Group projects approved?\",\"answer\":\"Approval status differs by project. Before booking, ask for the NOC, layout plan approval and ownership documents for the specific project, and confirm them with the relevant authority.\"},{\"question\":\"How can I check Al Ghafoor Group property prices and payment plans?\",\"answer\":\"You can review individual project pages to see available property types and plans. For updated prices, availability and booking details, ask an authorised property advisor or the developer for a written rate sheet and payment schedule.\"},{\"question\":\"How can I invest in Al Ghafoor Group projects?\",\"answer\":\"You can compare project locations, property types and payment plans, and register your interest to receive help from a property advisor. Returns are not guaranteed, so verify the price, payment schedule and approvals in writing before paying any amount.\"}]', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 'Got questions about Al Ghafoor Group? Find helpful answers below.', NULL, 'publish', 1, 0, '2026-11-19 11:16:02', '2026-11-19 11:16:10');
