INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `body`, `in_navbar`, `show_in_projects`, `show_in_commercial`, `navbar_order`, `is_published`, `status`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `og_image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1, 'Home', '/', '<h2>Your Trusted Guide to Property in Pakistan</h2><p>Buying a home, a plot or an investment property is rarely a small decision. For most families it is the biggest financial commitment of their lives, and in Pakistan it comes with real challenges: unclear titles, inflated prices, delayed projects and a market where rumours often travel faster than facts. FS Real Estate and Advisory exists to make that journey calmer and safer. We are a team of real estate agents in Pakistan who act as advisors first, helping buyers, sellers, tenants and investors decide with clear information and honest opinions.</p><p>Our focus is Karachi, a city of enormous energy and opportunity, but our services reach across the country. If you want to buy property in Pakistan for your family, or you are exploring real estate in Pakistan as a long-term investment, we guide you from the first question to the final transfer. Overseas Pakistanis who cannot visit sites in person can rely on us as a trusted team on the ground.</p><h2>Find Properties in Pakistan With Confidence</h2><p>Searching online can be overwhelming. Thousands of ads, conflicting prices and unverified photos make it hard to know what is real. When you find properties in Pakistan through us, each option is checked for ownership, approvals and realistic pricing before it reaches you. You see a short, honest list instead of an endless scroll.</p><p>Our clients usually begin with one of three goals:</p><ul><li>Some want properties for sale in Karachi that suit a growing family.</li><li>Others look for flats for sale in Pakistan or plots as a savings plan.</li><li>Some want commercial properties for sale in Pakistan that can earn rent from shops, offices or showrooms.</li></ul><p>We help you compare each path honestly.</p><h2>Why Karachi Buyers Need More Than a Broker</h2><p>Karachi\'s market is vast and uneven. Societies differ in development status, legal standing and infrastructure, and prices for similar plots can change from one street to the next. Without local knowledge it is easy to overpay, join a stalled scheme or miss a warning sign in the paperwork. Browsing real estate listings in Karachi is a good starting point, but a listing never tells you whether the file is clean or the society is approved.</p><p>Many property dealers in Pakistan are paid only when a deal closes, which naturally pushes the conversation toward a quick yes. Advisory works differently. We begin with your purpose, whether it is a family home, rental income or long-term growth, and we are comfortable telling you to wait, negotiate harder or walk away. Sometimes the most valuable thing we do is stop a bad purchase.</p><h2>What We Help You With</h2><ul><li>Buying: Shortlisting houses, plots, flats and commercial spaces that suit your budget.</li><li>Selling: Pricing realistically and presenting your property to serious buyers.</li><li>Renting: Matching landlords and tenants and explaining agreements clearly.</li><li>Investment planning: Comparing locations, rental demand and resale potential.</li><li>Document checks: Reviewing files, allotments, transfers and approvals before you pay.</li><li>Overseas support: Representing clients abroad from viewing to handover.</li></ul><h2>Homes, Plots and Apartments: Choosing the Right Type</h2><p>Houses suit families who want space, privacy and immediate possession. A house for sale in Karachi inside a planned society can offer parking, security and room to grow. Buyers searching houses for sale in Pakistan should compare:</p><ul><li>Plot size</li><li>Build quality</li><li>Society services</li></ul><p>Plots appeal to long-term investors and people who want to build to their own design, which is why plots for sale in Pakistan remain popular with savers.</p><p>Apartments and flats suit professionals, smaller families and landlords. Flats for sale in Pakistan are often cheaper to buy and maintain than houses, and apartments for sale in Pakistan near business districts tend to attract steady tenants.</p><h2>Understanding the Karachi Property Market</h2><p>Property values are shaped by many forces at once: inflation, interest rates, remittances from overseas Pakistanis, new road links and the pace at which societies develop their utilities. Properties in Karachi can look similar on paper yet perform very differently, and one house for sale in Karachi may cost far more than another a few streets away.</p><p>Anyone browsing properties for sale in Karachi benefits from that context before making an offer.</p><h2>Our Process: From First Conversation to Final Handover</h2><p>Our real estate advisory process is simple, transparent and built to protect you at every stage.</p><h3>Discovery</h3><p>We listen first. Your budget, timeline, family needs and return expectations shape everything that follows.</p><h3>Market Analysis</h3><p>We compare locations, pricing and rental demand using current information, not hearsay.</p><h3>Shortlisting</h3><p>You receive a small set of vetted options with clear reasons for and against each one.</p><h3>Due Diligence</h3><p>We help verify ownership documents, approvals, developer track record and payment structures before any money moves.</p><h3>Negotiation and Closing</h3><p>If you decide to buy property in Pakistan, we support you through offers, agreements and transfers so nothing is rushed or missed.</p><h3>After the Sale</h3><p>Whether you need tenants, resale advice or your next purchase, we remain available long after the paperwork is signed.</p><h2>Top Five Developers Shaping Real Estate in Karachi</h2><p>Choosing the right developer is one of the most important steps in any purchase. A trusted name does not remove the need for checks, but it does improve the odds of timely delivery, proper approvals and strong resale demand. Many of the best properties in Karachi come from the five developers below, and buyers ask us about them constantly.</p><h3>1. Saima Group</h3><p>Saima Group is a Karachi-based developer recognised for residential apartments, commercial towers and shopping destinations across the city. Projects such as Saima Arabian Villas and Saima Jinnah Avenue are popular with middle-income families who want modern amenities at accessible prices. Buyers often choose Saima for its practical layouts and well-connected locations. As with every project we shortlist, we review approvals, construction progress and payment plans before recommending anything.</p><h3>2. Bahria Town</h3><p>Bahria Town is one of the largest private developers in Pakistan. Bahria Town Karachi, located off the M-9 Motorway, is a master-planned community with wide roads, parks, mosques, entertainment venues and strong security. Its plots, villas and apartments attract overseas Pakistanis and investors who want a managed, modern lifestyle. It remains one of the most searched names in the market, although buyers should always verify files and approvals before paying.</p><h3>3. Defence Housing Authority (DHA)</h3><p>Originally developed for armed forces personnel and now open to civilians, Defence Housing Authority (DHA) is among the most trusted names in the market. DHA Karachi offers planned phases with well-maintained roads, utilities, schools, hospitals, clubs and commercial centres. Its reputation for organised development and strong resale demand makes it a benchmark for the city. Whether you want a plot, a house or an apartment, DHA offers options at many price points.</p><h3>4. Emaar</h3><p>Emaar Properties, an international developer known for large landmark projects, entered Pakistan with Crescent Bay, a waterfront mixed-use project in DHA Phase 8. The development features high-rise residences, retail and leisure spaces designed to international standards. Emaar appeals to buyers who value premium finishes, branded living and sea-facing views, and it is a natural fit for clients who want an international standard of living.</p><h3>5. Al Ghafoor Group</h3><p>Al Ghafoor Group is a Karachi-based developer known for residential and commercial buildings in well-connected parts of the city. Its projects appeal to buyers looking for practical layouts, reasonable pricing and good rental potential. Before committing to any payment plan, we help clients confirm project approvals, check construction progress and understand every installment, so that a good-looking brochure never replaces solid due diligence.</p><h2>Top 5 Best Areas to Live in Karachi</h2><p>Every neighbourhood tells a different story about lifestyle, budget and long-term value. These five areas appear on almost every shortlist we prepare. Security, commute times, schools, utilities and rental demand all affect how comfortable an area is and how well it holds its value.</p><h3>1. DHA (Defence Housing Authority)</h3><p>DHA is Karachi\'s best-known planned community, with wide roads, reliable utilities, round-the-clock security, schools, hospitals, malls and beachfront access. It suits families and investors who want a secure, organised lifestyle.</p><p>Key Features:</p><ul><li>Planned phases with gated security</li><li>Beaches, clubs and golf nearby</li><li>Strong resale value</li><li>Schools, hospitals and shopping close by</li></ul><h3>2. Clifton</h3><p>Clifton sits beside the Arabian Sea and blends upscale apartments, bungalows, cafés and shopping. It is ideal for professionals who want sea breeze, dining options and easy access to the city\'s business districts.</p><p>Key Features:</p><ul><li>Sea-view apartments and bungalows</li><li>Popular cafés, restaurants and malls</li><li>Central, well-connected location</li><li>High rental demand</li></ul><h3>3. Bahria Town</h3><p>Bahria Town Karachi is a self-contained gated community on the M-9 Motorway, offering villas, plots and apartments with parks, mosques, entertainment and round-the-clock security in a calm, modern setting.</p><p>Key Features:</p><ul><li>Gated, professionally managed community</li><li>Parks, mosques and entertainment</li><li>Plots, villas and apartments</li><li>Quick motorway access</li></ul><h3>4. KDA (Karachi Development Authority)</h3><p>KDA schemes offer established, well-connected neighbourhoods with a mix of residential and commercial plots. They appeal to buyers seeking value, space and long-term growth at more moderate prices than premium societies.</p><p>Key Features:</p><ul><li>Moderate prices and wider choice</li><li>Residential and commercial plots</li><li>Good road connectivity</li><li>Growth potential in developing schemes</li></ul><h3>5. PECHS (Pakistan Employees Cooperative Housing Society)</h3><p>PECHS is a central, long-established neighbourhood close to Shahrah-e-Faisal, with markets, restaurants, schools and hospitals. It suits residents who value everyday convenience and a lively community feel.</p><p>Key Features:</p><ul><li>Central location near main roads</li><li>Markets, eateries and services nearby</li><li>Schools and hospitals in reach</li><li>Steady rental demand</li></ul><h2>Smart Habits We Recommend for First-Time Buyers</h2><p>Even experienced buyers make avoidable mistakes, so we share a few principles with every client:</p><ul><li>Visit in person or send a trusted representative. Photos never show road access, neighbouring construction or the real condition of a site.</li><li>Treat online adverts as a start, not proof. Real estate listings in Karachi and elsewhere should always be verified on the ground.</li><li>Confirm the seller\'s right to sell. Match names, identity documents and ownership records before discussing price.</li><li>Understand the full cost. Transfer fees, taxes, society charges and maintenance all add to the price of any property for sale in Pakistan.</li><li>Be careful with intermediaries. Ask property dealers in Pakistan for written terms and verify who they represent.</li><li>Read payment plans carefully. This matters most with plots for sale in Pakistan and off-plan apartments for sale in Pakistan, where possession dates can slip.</li><li>Never rely on verbal promises. If it matters, it should be written into the agreement.</li></ul><h2>Why Clients Choose Us</h2><p>People return to FS Real Estate and Advisory because we treat property as a long-term relationship, not a one-off transaction. Among real estate agents in Pakistan, we aim to be the ones who tell you the truth even when it slows a deal. Whether you are comparing properties for sale in Pakistan or taking your first step into real estate in Pakistan, we take time to understand how a purchase fits your finances and your family\'s future.</p><h2>Conclusion</h2><p>Karachi offers something for every kind of buyer, from the structured, amenity-rich lifestyle of DHA and Bahria Town to the seaside energy of Clifton and the central convenience of PECHS and KDA. Leading developers such as Saima Group, Bahria Town, DHA, Emaar and Al Ghafoor Group give buyers a wide range of homes and budgets. Whether you are looking at properties in Karachi, comparing houses for sale in Pakistan or weighing commercial properties for sale in Pakistan, the right choice depends on your priorities: security, location, price, rental income or long-term appreciation.</p><p>The market rewards those who plan carefully and avoid decisions made under pressure. A well-chosen home or plot can protect your savings and give your family stability, while a poorly chosen one can lock up capital for years.</p><p>At FS Real Estate and Advisory, we help you cut through the noise. If you want to find properties in Pakistan with honest guidance, our team is ready to help.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 1, 1, 'publish', 'FS Real Estate and Advisory: See top Properties in Pakistan', 'Find properties for sale in Karachi and across Pakistan with FS Real Estate and Advisory. Explore properties with trusted expert guidance.', 'FS Real Estate and Advisory', NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-11-13 19:44:57'),
(2, 'About Us', 'about-us', '<h2>About Hudayriyat Island Real Estate</h2>\r\n<p>Welcome to your trusted source for exploring premier property opportunities on Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi. We connect discerning homeowners, expatriate residents, and global investors with prestigious master-planned developments built by Modon Properties.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Our Core Services</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Property Advisory:</strong> Practical guidance to help you explore residential and investment opportunities based on your personal budget and lifestyle requirements.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Exclusive Listings:</strong> Full access to premier residential properties, villas, townhouses, and waterfront apartments across Hudayriyat Island.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Market Intelligence:</strong> Transparent, updated information regarding launch dates, construction milestones, payment schedules, and capital appreciation potential.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Our Mission, Vision & Values</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Our Mission:</strong> To provide accurate property intelligence, honest advisory, and reliable assistance to buyers and investors exploring Abu Dhabi\'s emerging master destinations.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Our Vision:</strong> To become the leading advisory reference for luxury island real estate in the UAE.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Our Values:</strong> Accuracy, transparency, and client-first commitment define everything we do.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 2, 1, 'publish', 'About FS Advisory Pakistan | Real Estate & Property Investment', 'FS Advisory Pakistan, your trusted partner for real estate advisory, property investment guidance, residential and commercial property insights across Pakistan.', 'FS Advisory Pakistan', NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-11-16 07:23:16'),
(3, 'Contact Us', 'contact-us', '<h2>Let Us Help You Find the Right Property</h2><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Have questions about a property or interested in exploring real estate opportunities? </p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Direct Contact Channels</h3>\r\n<p><strong>Phone & WhatsApp:</strong> +92 332 2495575</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Schedule a Private Consultation</h3>\r\n<p>Fill out the inquiry form on this page or connect with our sales desk to receive official brochures, floor plans, and VIP priority booking.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 3, 1, 'publish', 'Contact FS Advisory Pakistan | Property Experts Karachi', 'Contact FS Advisory Pakistan for property enquiries, residential and commercial projects, real estate guidance, and investment opportunities.', 'Contact FS Advisory Pakistan', NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-11-16 07:02:27'),
(14, 'Privacy Policy', 'privacy-policy', '<p>At FS Advisory Pakistan, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your information when you visit our website, explore property projects, submit enquiries, or use our real estate advisory services in Pakistan.</p><p>By using our website, you acknowledge the practices described in this Privacy Policy.</p><h2>1. Information Collection</h2><p>We may collect personal information when you interact with our website or contact us regarding real estate projects, property listings, and investment opportunities across Pakistan.</p><p>You may provide information when you:</p><ul><li>Submit a property enquiry or contact form.</li><li>Request details about residential or commercial projects.</li><li>Register your interest in a property or development.</li><li>Contact our advisory team through phone, email, or WhatsApp.</li><li>Submit a property listing through our website.</li><li>Request assistance regarding property prices, payment plans, or investment opportunities.</li></ul><p>The information collected may include your name, phone number, email address, property preferences, and other details you voluntarily provide.</p><p>We may also collect certain technical information, such as browser type, device information, website usage data, and IP address, where applicable.</p><h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2><p>We use the information collected to understand your property requirements and provide relevant real estate information and advisory assistance.</p><p>Your information may be used to:</p><ul><li>Respond to property enquiries and customer requests.</li><li>Share relevant residential and commercial project details.</li><li>Provide information about property prices, availability, and payment plans.</li><li>Connect you with relevant property advisors.</li><li>Arrange property consultations and viewing requests.</li><li>Process property listing submissions.</li><li>Communicate important service updates and requested information.</li><li>Improve our website, services, and customer experience.</li></ul><p>We aim to use your personal information only for relevant business and service-related purposes.</p><h2>3. Information Sharing & Disclosure</h2><p>FS Advisory Pakistan respects your privacy and takes reasonable steps to protect your personal information.</p><p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties for their independent marketing purposes.</p><p>Your information may be shared where necessary with relevant property developers, authorised representatives, or service providers to respond to your enquiries, provide requested property information, or facilitate real estate-related services.</p><p>We may also disclose information where required by applicable laws, legal processes, or regulatory authorities.</p><p>Any information shared is intended to support the services you request and should be handled responsibly.</p><h2>4. Data Security & Integrity</h2><p>We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to help protect your personal information against unauthorised access, misuse, alteration, loss, or disclosure.</p><p>We aim to maintain appropriate safeguards when collecting, processing, and storing customer information.</p><p>However, no method of internet transmission or electronic storage is completely secure. While we take reasonable precautions, we cannot guarantee absolute security of information transmitted through our website or other online communication channels.</p><h2>5. Your Rights & Choices</h2><p>You have the right to make requests regarding the personal information you provide to FS Advisory Pakistan.</p><p>Depending on applicable legal requirements, you may request to:</p><ul><li>Access the personal information held about you.</li><li>Correct inaccurate or incomplete personal information.</li><li>Request deletion of your personal information, where applicable.</li><li>Withdraw consent for receiving promotional or marketing communications.</li><li>Request clarification about how your information is collected and used.</li></ul><p>If you no longer wish to receive marketing-related updates, you may contact us to request that such communications be stopped.</p><p>Requests relating to personal information can be submitted through our website\'s contact page or available communication channels.</p><h2>6. Updates to This Policy</h2><p>FS Advisory Pakistan may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our business operations, website functionality, data handling practices, or applicable legal and regulatory requirements.</p><p>Any updates or revisions will be published on this page.</p><p>We encourage visitors to review this Privacy Policy periodically to stay informed about how their personal information is handled.</p><p>Your continued use of our website after policy updates are published will be subject to the revised policy, to the extent permitted by applicable law.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 14, 1, 'publish', 'Privacy Policy | FS Advisory Pakistan', 'Read FS Advisory Pakistan\'s Privacy Policy to learn how we collect, use, protect, and manage your personal information, website data, and property enquiries.', 'Privacy Policy, FS Advisory Pakistan', NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-11-16 06:55:39'),
(15, 'Terms & Conditions', 'terms-and-conditions', '<p>Welcome to FS Advisory Pakistan. Please read these Terms & Conditions carefully before accessing or using our website. These terms explain the rules, responsibilities, and guidelines that apply when you browse our website, explore property listings, submit enquiries, or use our real estate-related services across Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>By accessing or using this website, you agree to comply with these Terms & Conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please discontinue using the website.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>1. Agreement to Terms</h2>\r\n<p>By accessing, browsing, or using the FS Advisory Pakistan website, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to these Terms & Conditions.</p>\r\n<p>These terms apply to all website visitors, property buyers, sellers, investors, and individuals who use our website to explore real estate information or submit property-related enquiries.</p>\r\n<p>If you disagree with any of these terms, you should stop using the website.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>2. Website Use</h2>\r\n<p>FS Advisory Pakistan provides general property information and real estate-related services, including residential and commercial property listings, development projects, housing societies, and investment opportunities across Pakistan.</p>\r\n<p>You agree to use this website lawfully and responsibly. You must not:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Use the website for any unlawful or fraudulent purpose.</li>\r\n<li>Submit false, misleading, or inaccurate information.</li>\r\n<li>Attempt to gain unauthorised access to the website or its systems.</li>\r\n<li>Copy, reproduce, or misuse website content without appropriate permission.</li>\r\n<li>Interfere with the website\'s functionality or security.</li>\r\n<li>Use the website in a manner that may negatively affect other users.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>We reserve the right to restrict or suspend access where misuse or a violation of these terms is identified.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>3. Property Information</h2>\r\n<p>Property listings, prices, project details, layouts, specifications, payment plans, availability, development progress, and possession timelines displayed on this website are provided for general information purposes only.</p>\r\n<p>Property-related information may be obtained from developers, property owners, marketing representatives, or other relevant sources. Although we make reasonable efforts to present accurate information, we do not guarantee that all details are complete, current, or error-free.</p>\r\n<p>Property prices, availability, project features, payment arrangements, and development schedules may change without prior notice.</p>\r\n<p>All property information should be independently verified with the relevant developer, seller, authorised representative, or applicable authority before making a booking, payment, or purchase decision.</p>\r\n<p>Information published on this website does not constitute a legally binding offer, agreement, or guarantee of property availability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>4. No Professional Advice</h2>\r\n<p>The information provided by FS Advisory Pakistan is intended for general real estate guidance and informational purposes.</p>\r\n<p>Website content, property descriptions, project details, and investment-related information should not be considered legal, financial, tax, or other professional advice.</p>\r\n<p>Users are encouraged to conduct their own research and consult qualified legal, financial, tax, and property professionals before entering into any property transaction or investment arrangement.</p>\r\n<p>FS Advisory Pakistan does not replace independent professional advice or due diligence.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>5. No Guarantee of Returns</h2>\r\n<p>Real estate investments involve financial risks, and property values may increase or decrease depending on market conditions, location, development progress, demand, and other factors.</p>\r\n<p>FS Advisory Pakistan does not guarantee future property appreciation, rental income, capital gains, resale value, or investment returns.</p>\r\n<p>Any historical property performance, market trends, projected returns, or investment estimates should not be treated as a guarantee of future results.</p>\r\n<p>Buyers and investors are responsible for evaluating the risks associated with their property decisions before making any financial commitment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>6. User Responsibilities</h2>\r\n<p>Users are responsible for ensuring that all information submitted through the FS Advisory Pakistan website is accurate, complete, and up to date.</p>\r\n<p>When using our website or submitting an enquiry, you agree to:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Provide genuine and correct personal and contact information.</li>\r\n<li>Use the website for legitimate property-related purposes.</li>\r\n<li>Avoid submitting misleading enquiries or fraudulent property information.</li>\r\n<li>Respect the intellectual property rights of the website and other content owners.</li>\r\n<li>Avoid activities that may disrupt website operations or security.</li>\r\n<li>Verify property information and documentation before making financial commitments.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Unauthorised access, fraudulent activity, impersonation, and misrepresentation are strictly prohibited.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>7. Intellectual Property</h2>\r\n<p>All website content, including text, logos, graphics, images, designs, page layouts, and other materials, is protected by applicable intellectual property and copyright laws.</p>\r\n<p>Content displayed on the FS Advisory Pakistan website belongs to FS Advisory Pakistan or its respective owners and licensors, where applicable.</p>\r\n<p>You may access and use website content for personal and informational purposes. However, you may not reproduce, distribute, modify, publish, or commercially use website materials without obtaining the appropriate permission from the relevant rights holder.</p>\r\n<p>Project names, developer logos, trademarks, and third-party materials remain the property of their respective owners.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>8. Third-Party Links</h2>\r\n<p>Our website may contain links to external websites, including property developers, housing societies, real estate organisations, service providers, and other third-party platforms.</p>\r\n<p>These links are provided for convenience and additional information.</p>\r\n<p>FS Advisory Pakistan does not control or assume responsibility for the content, accuracy, privacy practices, services, or policies of third-party websites.</p>\r\n<p>Visiting external websites or engaging with third-party services is at your own discretion. We encourage users to review the relevant terms, privacy policies, and information before sharing personal details or making transactions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>\r\n<p>FS Advisory Pakistan takes reasonable steps to provide useful and accurate property information through its website. However, we do not guarantee the completeness, accuracy, reliability, or continuous availability of all website content.</p>\r\n<p>We shall not be responsible, to the extent permitted by applicable law, for losses or damages arising from:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Errors, omissions, or outdated property information.</li>\r\n<li>Changes in property prices, availability, or payment plans.</li>\r\n<li>Decisions made based on website information without independent verification.</li>\r\n<li>Actions, services, or representations of third-party developers, sellers, or service providers.</li>\r\n<li>Temporary website interruptions, technical issues, or access limitations.</li>\r\n<li>Investment losses, changes in property values, or market conditions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Users are responsible for conducting independent research and verifying all relevant information before entering into property-related transactions.</p>\r\n<p>Nothing in these terms excludes liability where such exclusion is not permitted under applicable law.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>10. Governing Law</h2>\r\n<p>These Terms & Conditions shall be governed by and interpreted in accordance with the applicable laws of Pakistan.</p>\r\n<p>Any disputes arising from the use of this website or these Terms & Conditions shall be subject to the jurisdiction of the competent courts in Pakistan, as applicable.</p>\r\n<p>FS Advisory Pakistan reserves the right to update, revise, or modify these Terms & Conditions when necessary to reflect changes in its website, services, business operations, or applicable legal requirements.</p>\r\n<p>We encourage users to review this page periodically to stay informed about any updates.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 15, 1, 'publish', 'FS Advisory Pakistan | Terms & Conditions', 'Read FS Advisory Pakistan Terms & Conditions to understand website usage, property information, user responsibilities, legal disclaimers, and applicable UAE regulations.', 'FS Advisory Pakistan, Terms & Conditions', NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-11-16 07:06:00'),
(16, 'Disclaimer', 'disclaimer', '<h2>1. General Information Only</h2><p>The content on this website, including information about properties, property descriptions, prices, payment plans, rental yield estimates, project details, and real estate market updates, is provided for general informational purposes only. It does not constitute an offer, solicitation, or recommendation to buy, sell, or invest in any property.</p><h2>2. No Guarantee of Returns, Rental Yield or Appreciation</h2><p>Any rental yield percentage, return on investment (ROI), or capital appreciation figure mentioned on this website is an indicative estimate based on general market information available at the time of publication. It is not a forecast, promise, or guarantee of future performance. Actual returns may vary depending on market conditions, rental demand, tenancy, maintenance charges, property management, location, and the specific property purchased. Past performance of any property, housing society, or developer is not a reliable indicator of future results.</p><h2>3. Not Financial, Legal or Tax Advice</h2><p>Nothing on this website constitutes financial, legal, or tax advice. Property purchases and investments may involve financial risks, legal requirements, taxes, and other costs. You should obtain independent professional advice based on your individual circumstances before making any property or investment decision in Pakistan.</p><h2>4. Developer & Property Information</h2><p>Prices, availability, floor plans, payment plans, property specifications, possession dates, and project details are subject to change without notice. Information may be provided by property developers, builders, housing societies, real estate agents, and other available sources. We recommend verifying the latest property details, prices, payment terms, approvals, and availability directly with the relevant developer or authorized authority before making any commitment.</p><p>Buyers should independently verify the legal status of a property or housing project, including relevant approvals, ownership documents, land title, and applicable requirements from authorities such as the relevant Development Authority, local government, or other competent regulatory body.</p><h2>5. Regulatory Status</h2><p>Information provided on this website is intended for general property and real estate purposes in Pakistan. This website is not a government website and is not affiliated with or operated by any Pakistani government authority. Nothing on this website should be interpreted as official government communication, legal advice, or regulatory approval of any property, project, developer, or housing society.</p><h2>6. Testimonials</h2><p>Client testimonials published on this website reflect the individual experiences of the clients who provided them. Testimonials are not necessarily representative of the experience of every client. Previous client experiences or investment outcomes do not guarantee similar results for others.</p><h2>7. Third-Party Links</h2><p>This website may contain links to third-party websites for your convenience, including property developers, builders, housing societies, and other real estate service providers. We do not endorse and are not responsible for the content, accuracy, availability, or privacy practices of any third-party website. Users should review the relevant terms and policies before relying on information provided by third parties.</p><h2>8. Accuracy of Information</h2><p>We take reasonable care to keep the information on this website accurate and up to date. However, property prices, availability, project details, payment plans, possession dates, legal requirements, and market conditions may change without notice. We make no warranty regarding the completeness or accuracy of the information provided and accept no liability for errors or omissions to the extent permitted by applicable law.</p><p>Users are encouraged to verify all important information independently before making a property purchase, sale, or investment decision.</p><p>See also our Terms & Conditions for further information regarding the use of this website and limitations of liability.</p>', 0, 1, 0, 16, 1, 'publish', 'Disclaimer – Hudayriyat Island', 'Legal disclaimer for property information and floor plans.', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-20 06:37:08', '2026-10-28 02:05:37'),
(68, 'Jamshed road number', 'jamshed-road-number', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>About the Developers</h2>\r\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.</p>\r\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances</h2>\r\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC1.png\" alt=\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans</h2>\r\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types</h3>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC2.png\" alt=\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC3.png\" alt=\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC4.png\" alt=\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC8.png\" alt=\"Community Master Plan Overview\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC12.png\" alt=\"Milestone Payment Structure\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 26, 0, 'draft', 'Jamshed road number Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in Jamshed road number, Karachi.', 'Jamshed road number, real estate in Jamshed road number, properties for sale in Jamshed road number', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-10-27 07:01:36', '2026-10-29 04:22:01');
