(100, 'Saima Twin Tower', 'saima-twin-tower', '<p>The project is a twin-tower residential high-rise on the CDA Service Road in Capital Enclave. Among high-rise apartments in Islamabad, a twin-tower layout gives buyers a choice of studios for compact living and lounge apartments for families. For anyone reviewing Islamabad real estate projects or luxury residential projects in Islamabad, the appeal here is an expressway-corridor address and an instalment-based route to ownership, not a finished building.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The listing shows Under Construction and carries a verified badge. As a Saima Builders Islamabad project, it should be judged on its own paperwork, not on the developer’s Karachi record.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Investors weighing Saima Twin Tower Islamabad investment opportunities usually look at studios and one-bedroom apartments, but rental income and resale gains are never guaranteed. Anyone comparing apartments for investment in Islamabad should also look at finished stock, which carries less construction risk.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Group (Saima Builders)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>Studio, 1, 2 and 3-bed lounge apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Towers</td>\r\n<td>Two</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Capital Enclave, CDA Service Road, Islamabad</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Status</td>\r\n<td>Under construction</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Not announced</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Construction-linked; amounts to be confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No public master plan has been released for Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan. The listing splits the homes across two wings:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tower A offers studios and one- and two-bedroom lounge apartments (types B1 to B4 and C1 to C3).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tower B offers studios, one- and two-bedroom lounge apartments, and three-bedroom lounge apartments (Type A1).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because the towers are described as a pair, ask whether they share podium parking, lifts, security and maintenance charges. Listings mention gated security and ongoing professional management. Who will run the building, and how service charges will be set, should be agreed in writing before you pay.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: Studio, 1, 2 and 3 Bed Lounge Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments in Saima Twin Tower Islamabad, the portal’s unit selector shows studio types S1 and S2, one-bedroom lounge types C1 to C4, two-bedroom lounge types B1 to B6 and a three-bedroom lounge Type A1. Unit areas are not public, so request them in writing.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Studio Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Studios are the compact entry option and appear in both towers. Check the usable area, kitchen layout and balcony before comparing the price per square foot.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>1 Bed Lounge Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>One-bedroom lounge types suit couples, single professionals and small investors. Ask whether the lounge is separate or combined with the dining space.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2 Bed Lounge Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Two-bedroom lounge types come in the most variants, so compare layouts side by side. They suit small families and shared living.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3 Bed Lounge Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The three-bedroom lounge apartment is listed as Type A1 in Tower B. It is the family-size option, so confirm how many units exist and their covered area.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Unit-wise floor plans and unit pricing are not confirmed yet. Request the full set from Saima’s authorised sales channel, along with a unit-wise Saima Twin Tower price list and the approved building plan. Compare orientation, balcony size and lift access before choosing a floor.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Twin Tower price starts from around PKR 7.85 million to PKR 8.95 million, so treat both figures as indicative. Buyers who need Saima Twin Tower Islamabad apartment prices by unit type should ask for a written price list.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Twin Tower booking typically involves registering interest, choosing a unit, confirming the booking amount and signing written terms. Saima Twin Tower Islamabad booking details, including receipts, unit number, allocation terms and refund conditions, should be confirmed before any payment. Buyers comparing apartments for sale in Islamabad should also ask whether the Saima Twin Tower payment plan differs by tower and unit type.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The NOC and approval status of Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan is not publicly documented by Saima. Ask for the approved building plan, the NOC with its reference number and the title documents, then confirm them directly with CDA.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been announced for the project, and the listing shows Under Construction without a completion date. Secure a documented possession schedule, including delay terms, at the point of booking. Plan for a medium- to long-term investment horizon, not immediate occupancy.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 51, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Twin Tower Islamabad | Apartments Payment Plan & Price', 'Saima Twin Tower in Capital Enclave, Islamabad. View high-rise apartments, prices and payment plan details. Contact us today to book your apartment!', 'Saima Twin Tower, luxury villas, properties', '/images/projects/1793689907_hero_modern-high-rise-towers-by-the-waterfront.png', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-10 10:12:15'),
(101, 'North Nazimabad', 'north-nazimabad', '<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"saimaIntroP\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>About the Developers</h2>\r\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.</p>\r\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances</h2>\r\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity</h2>\r\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC1.png\" alt=\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans</h2>\r\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types</h3>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC2.png\" alt=\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC3.png\" alt=\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC4.png\" alt=\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle</h2>\r\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC8.png\" alt=\"Community Master Plan Overview\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan</h2>\r\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/TOC12.png\" alt=\"Milestone Payment Structure\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities</h2>\r\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 52, 1, 'publish', 'North Nazimabad Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in North Nazimabad, Karachi.', 'North Nazimabad, real estate in North Nazimabad, properties for sale in North Nazimabad', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-11-03 07:26:08', '2026-11-03 07:26:08'),
(102, 'Saima Premium Empire', 'saima-premium-empire', '<p>At its core, Saima Premium Empire Saima Builders is about elite apartment living in a neighbourhood that already works. North Nazimabad\'s markets, schools, hospitals, and transport links are established, so the project adds a newer high-rise with larger 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room layouts instead of asking buyers to wait for a new society\'s infrastructure to arrive.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Among premium luxury projects Karachi, Saima Premium Empire competes by offering more room than a typical mid-range flat without moving to DHA-style price territory. It sits naturally among high-rise luxury apartments Karachi and Saima Builders premium projects, with an address that is familiar to families and investors across the city.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Developer</td><td>Saima Builders</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Property Type</td><td>Residential</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Unit Types</td><td>4, 5 & 6-room luxury apartments</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Total Land Size</td><td>2 acres</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Handover</td><td>To be confirmed</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Location</td><td>Block A, North Nazimabad, near Saifee Hospital, Karachi</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Payment Plan</td><td>On Easy Installments</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Lifestyle</td><td>Premium family living</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Premium Empire Saima Builders is planned as one residential high-rise in Block A, organised around several apartment categories rather than a single repeated unit type, so buyers can choose according to family size and budget.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The framework emphasises practical movement and everyday comfort: elevators and stairwells positioned for convenient access, floors organised by apartment category, and spacious parking planned from the start. The Saima Premium Empire floor plan uses separate drawing and dining areas in the larger units, with bedrooms arranged for privacy and functional daily living.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 4, 5 & 6-Room Luxury Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers searching for luxury apartments Saima Premium Empire or apartments for sale Premium Empire Karachi, Saima Premium Empire Karachi offers spacious layouts in three premium categories.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Room Apartments in Saima Premium Empire</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 4-room apartments in Saima Premium Empire Saima Builders are the entry point to the project\'s elite categories, suited to families who want a larger layout and a North Nazimabad address without moving to the largest configurations.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5-Room Apartments in Saima Premium Empire</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 5-room apartments in Saima Premium Empire provide additional living space for growing families, with separate social and private areas that make daily family life more comfortable.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6-Room Apartments in Saima Premium Empire</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 6-room apartments in Saima Premium Empire are the project\'s largest residences, designed for bigger and joint families who need maximum room within a secure high-rise setting.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment category is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Premium Empire apartment price or a Saima Premium Empire floor plan should request the category-specific covered area and unit schedule, as listings vary across categories and phases.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Saima Premium Empire price varies depending on room count, covered area, floor, and facing, and current pricing is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Older listing figures should not be treated as a current rate sheet because prices and payment structures change by category.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A Saima Premium Empire booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Premium Empire payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Premium Empire Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Premium Empire apartment price before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Premium Empire Karachi buyers should also confirm whether Premium Empire apartments on installments are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Premium Empire Saima Builders buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project and its current phase.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regulations and documentation can be updated, so any approval status reported in an older listing should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Premium Empire has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and progress can differ by category and floor. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Premium Empire booking and confirm Saima Premium Empire Karachi possession timelines in writing with the developer.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 53, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Premium Empire Apartments Price, Payment Plan & Location', 'Saima Premium Empire in North Nazimabad, Karachi. Explore luxury apartments, prices and payment plan. Get project details and book your apartment!', 'Saima Premium Empire Karachi, Saima Premium Empire Saima Builders, Premium Empire Karachi,', NULL, '2026-11-03 07:26:44', '2026-11-10 10:11:37'),
