(157, 'Islamabad', 'islamabad', '<p><br></p>', 1, 1, 0, 89, 1, 'publish', 'Islamabad Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in Islamabad.', 'Islamabad, real estate in Islamabad, properties for sale in Islamabad', NULL, '2026-11-12 14:41:13', '2026-11-16 06:49:47'),
(159, 'Developers', 'developers', '<h2>Why Choose the Right Property Developer in Pakistan?</h2>\r\n<p>Choosing a property developer is one of the most important steps when researching a residential or commercial property project.</p>\r\n<p>A developer\'s experience, planning approach, documentation, and project execution can influence the overall development experience.</p>\r\n<p>Here are some important factors buyers and investors should consider before selecting a property developer.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>1. Development Experience and Track Record</h3>\r\n<p>A developer\'s previous projects can provide useful information about its experience and development capabilities.</p>\r\n<p>Review completed projects, construction quality, infrastructure delivery, and the company\'s history of fulfilling its development commitments.</p>\r\n<p>A strong development track record can help buyers understand the company\'s approach to project execution.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2. Project Approvals and Documentation</h3>\r\n<p>Legal documentation and project approvals are essential considerations when evaluating a housing society or property development.</p>\r\n<p>Check the relevant No Objection Certificate (NOC), approved layout plan, land ownership documents, and applicable permissions from the relevant development authority.</p>\r\n<p>Approval status should be verified for the specific project, phase, or block rather than relying only on the developer\'s name.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3. Quality of Infrastructure and Construction</h3>\r\n<p>Infrastructure and construction quality are important indicators of a development project\'s overall planning.</p>\r\n<p>Consider road networks, drainage systems, water supply, electricity arrangements, sewerage infrastructure, and construction standards.</p>\r\n<p>For residential communities, also review the availability and development status of parks, educational facilities, healthcare facilities, and commercial areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4. Project Development Progress</h3>\r\n<p>Understanding the current development status helps buyers evaluate the project\'s progress and expected timelines.</p>\r\n<p>Review recent construction updates, infrastructure completion, site photographs, and official project announcements.</p>\r\n<p>Different blocks and phases may have different development timelines, so verify the exact location you are considering.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>5. Transparent Pricing and Payment Plans</h3>\r\n<p>A reliable developer should provide clear information about property prices, booking requirements, instalment schedules, development charges, and applicable transfer fees.</p>\r\n<p>Review the complete financial commitment before making a booking.</p>\r\n<p>Compare payment plans across different projects and understand all contractual conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6. Customer Support and Communication</h3>\r\n<p>Effective communication can make the property purchasing process easier.</p>\r\n<p>Consider how the developer handles customer enquiries, documentation requests, payment confirmations, possession information, and project updates.</p>\r\n<p>Access to clear and consistent information can help buyers make better decisions.</p>\r\n<p>Together, these factors can help buyers and investors compare property development companies and identify projects that match their requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>How to Choose a Property Developer in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<h3>A Step-by-Step Guide to Evaluating Real Estate Developers</h3>\r\n<p>Selecting a developer requires research beyond promotional material and advertised property prices.</p>\r\n<p>Follow these steps to evaluate different companies and their development projects.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Step 01 – Identify Your Property Requirements</h3>\r\n<p>Start by identifying your preferred city, property category, and investment budget.</p>\r\n<p>Decide whether you are interested in residential plots, apartments, constructed houses, commercial projects, or large-scale housing communities.</p>\r\n<p>Having clear requirements will help narrow down relevant developers.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Step 02 – Research Developer Profiles</h3>\r\n<p>Explore different property developers and review their company background, previous projects, and development portfolios.</p>\r\n<p>Look for information about completed developments, ongoing projects, construction experience, and company operations.</p>\r\n<p>Compare developers based on their actual development history rather than marketing claims alone.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Step 03 – Verify Project Approvals</h3>\r\n<p>Check the legal status of the specific housing project with the relevant development authority.</p>\r\n<p>Review applicable NOCs, approved layout plans, land ownership records, and project permissions.</p>\r\n<p>For example, development approval requirements differ between CDA, LDA, RDA, KDA, and other relevant authorities.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Step 04 – Compare Development Projects</h3>\r\n<p>Compare projects offered by different developers according to their locations, property categories, infrastructure, development progress, and available facilities.</p>\r\n<p>Review the exact project phase or block you are interested in.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Step 05 – Review Prices and Payment Arrangements</h3>\r\n<p>Examine the complete property price and payment structure.</p>\r\n<p>Check booking amounts, down payments, instalments, development charges, transfer fees, and possession-related payments.</p>\r\n<p>Always review the written agreement and obtain official payment receipts.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Residential vs. Commercial Property Developers</h2>\r\n<h3>Explore Different Types of Real Estate Development Companies</h3>\r\n<p>Pakistan\'s real estate industry includes developers working across different property categories.</p>\r\n<p>Understanding the differences between these development segments can help buyers identify companies that match their property interests.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Residential Property Developers</h3>\r\n<p>Residential developers focus on creating homes and communities for individuals and families.</p>\r\n<p>Their projects may include residential plots, apartment buildings, villas, townhouses, and planned housing societies.</p>\r\n<p>These developers often focus on community infrastructure, residential facilities, accessibility, and neighbourhood planning.</p>\r\n<p>Explore residential developers if you are researching housing societies, family homes, residential plots, or apartment developments.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Commercial Property Developers</h3>\r\n<p>Commercial developers focus on projects designed for business and commercial activities.</p>\r\n<p>Their developments may include shopping centres, office buildings, retail outlets, commercial plazas, and mixed-use developments.</p>\r\n<p>These projects are generally designed around business accessibility, commercial infrastructure, customer activity, and professional requirements.</p>\r\n<p>Explore commercial developers if you are researching retail investments, office spaces, or commercial property opportunities.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Mixed-Use Property Developers</h3>\r\n<p>Mixed-use developers create developments that combine residential, commercial, and lifestyle facilities within a planned project.</p>\r\n<p>These developments may feature apartments, retail spaces, offices, recreational facilities, and community amenities.</p>\r\n<p>Their purpose is to integrate different activities within a coordinated development environment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Infrastructure and Housing Developers</h3>\r\n<p>Some companies specialise in large-scale infrastructure and housing development.</p>\r\n<p>Their work may involve land development, road networks, utilities, residential infrastructure, and master-planned communities.</p>\r\n<p>Understanding a developer\'s specialisation can help you identify companies with experience relevant to your intended property purchase.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Popular Real Estate Markets in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<h3>Explore Leading Property Development Locations</h3>\r\n<p>Pakistan\'s real estate development industry spans several major cities and emerging residential markets.</p>\r\n<p>Explore some of the most recognised locations where developers and housing organisations operate.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Karachi</h3>\r\n<p>Karachi is Pakistan\'s largest metropolitan city and an important residential and commercial property market.</p>\r\n<p>The city features a wide variety of development projects, including apartment complexes, residential communities, commercial buildings, and housing societies.</p>\r\n<p>Explore DHA Karachi, Bahria Town Karachi, and other residential and commercial development areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Lahore</h3>\r\n<p>Lahore is a major centre for residential development and planned housing communities.</p>\r\n<p>The city\'s real estate market includes established housing societies, modern apartment projects, commercial developments, and large-scale residential communities.</p>\r\n<p>Explore developers operating in DHA Lahore, Bahria Town Lahore, Lake City, and other residential locations.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Islamabad</h3>\r\n<p>Islamabad offers residential and commercial development opportunities across established sectors and planned housing communities.</p>\r\n<p>The market includes residential plots, apartment projects, modern housing developments, and commercial properties.</p>\r\n<p>Explore DHA Islamabad, Capital Smart City, Bahria Enclave, and other development projects.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Rawalpindi</h3>\r\n<p>Rawalpindi has an active residential development market with a range of housing communities and property development projects.</p>\r\n<p>Explore developers and projects in Bahria Town Rawalpindi, DHA Rawalpindi, and surrounding residential areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Faisalabad</h3>\r\n<p>Faisalabad is an important industrial and commercial city with residential development opportunities.</p>\r\n<p>Explore housing societies, residential projects, commercial developments, and property developers operating in the city.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Multan</h3>\r\n<p>Multan\'s real estate market includes residential communities, housing societies, apartment projects, and commercial developments.</p>\r\n<p>Explore developers offering residential opportunities and planned communities in the region.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Peshawar</h3>\r\n<p>Peshawar offers different residential and commercial property development opportunities.</p>\r\n<p>Explore housing organisations, residential communities, and development companies operating across the city.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Gwadar</h3>\r\n<p>Gwadar attracts interest from buyers and investors exploring property opportunities connected with regional infrastructure and development initiatives.</p>\r\n<p>Research the relevant developer, land ownership, project documentation, and approval status before considering a property purchase.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Leading Real Estate Developers in Pakistan</h2>\r\n<h3>Discover Recognised Property Development Companies</h3>\r\n<p>Explore some of the recognised names associated with Pakistan\'s real estate and property development industry.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Bahria Town</h3>\r\n<p>Discover large-scale residential communities, housing projects, and commercial developments across Pakistan.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Defence Housing Authority (DHA)</h3>\r\n<p>Explore residential and commercial development projects across different DHA locations. DHA is a development authority and should be distinguished from private developer companies.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Habib Rafiq Group</h3>\r\n<p>Discover the group\'s involvement in construction, engineering, infrastructure, and real estate development.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Zameen Developments</h3>\r\n<p>Explore residential and mixed-use development projects associated with Zameen Developments.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Future Developments Holdings (FDHL)</h3>\r\n<p>Discover the company associated with Capital Smart City and its planned residential and industrial development initiatives.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Royal Developers & Builders</h3>\r\n<p>Explore housing developments and planned residential communities associated with Royal Developers & Builders.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Lake City Holdings</h3>\r\n<p>Discover residential community and property development opportunities associated with Lake City in Lahore.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Compare company backgrounds, project portfolios, locations, and development information to understand the different opportunities available across Pakistan.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 90, 1, 'publish', 'Real Estate Developers in Pakistan | Top Property Developers', 'Explore leading real estate developers in Pakistan. Compare developer profiles, housing projects, residential communities, commercial developments and project portfolios.', 'Real Estate Developers in Pakistan', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-11-13 21:01:06', '2026-11-16 05:51:34'),
(160, 'Gulshan-e-Iqbal', 'gulshan-e-iqbal-25', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 91, 1, 'publish', 'Gulshan-e-Iqbal Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi.', 'Gulshan-e-Iqbal, real estate in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, properties for sale in Gulshan-e-Iqbal', NULL, '2026-11-13 21:39:26', '2026-11-20 14:15:01');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `body`, `in_navbar`, `show_in_projects`, `show_in_commercial`, `navbar_order`, `is_published`, `status`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `og_image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(161, 'AA Avenue', 'aa-avenue', '<h2>About AA Avenue</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>AA Avenue is a residential development associated with AA Builders & Developers in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi. Its location on Sehba Akhtar Road, Block 13-E, places it within an established residential and commercial area with access to everyday facilities and important city routes.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The project is listed with 3-bedroom and 4-bedroom lounge apartment options. These configurations are intended for families looking for additional living space, with separate areas for family activities and guest accommodation. Final layouts, covered areas and specifications should be confirmed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For people comparing residential projects in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, AA Avenue offers a location-focused option from an established Karachi developer. Buyers should review the latest construction status, approved building plans, unit availability and payment terms before proceeding.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>AA Builders & Developers</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Project Name</td>\r\n<td>AA Avenue</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential Apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>3-Bedroom and 4-Bedroom Lounge (listed)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Apartment Sizes</td>\r\n<td>Approximately 1,300–1,650 sq. ft. (listed)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>Not officially disclosed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Project Status</td>\r\n<td>Pre-launch information reported; confirm current status</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Target dates require developer confirmation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Sehba Akhtar Road, Block 13-E, Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Obtain the latest authorised schedule</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Residential Apartment Living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The master plan for AA Avenue should be reviewed through the developer\'s official project documentation. Detailed information about the building layout, number of floors, apartment distribution, parking levels, common areas and other development features has not been independently confirmed in the available public information.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A complete master plan will help buyers understand how residential units are arranged within the building and how shared facilities, access points and parking areas are planned.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before selecting an apartment, buyers should request the approved building plan, floor-wise unit schedule and relevant development documents from AA Builders & Developers or its authorised sales representatives.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers comparing AA Avenue with other AA Builders projects should also make sure that specifications and facilities from separate developments are not assumed to apply to this project.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: 3-Bedroom and 4-Bedroom Apartments</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>AA Avenue is listed with two main residential configurations: 3-bedroom lounge and 4-bedroom lounge apartments. These options provide different space arrangements for buyers depending on their household requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The reported apartment sizes range from approximately 1,300 to 1,650 square feet. Final covered areas, room dimensions, layouts and unit availability should be confirmed through the latest official unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Apartments in AA Avenue</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The apartment options at AA Avenue are intended for buyers looking for family-oriented residential spaces in Gulshan-e-Iqbal. The available listings identify 3-bedroom and 4-bedroom lounge configurations, offering alternatives for different family sizes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3-Bedroom Lounge Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 3-bedroom lounge option is listed at approximately 1,300 square feet. It is suitable for families looking for a multi-bedroom apartment with a separate lounge area. Buyers should request the official floor plan to review the room arrangement, kitchen, bathrooms, balcony and other specifications.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Bedroom Lounge Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 4-bedroom lounge option is listed at approximately 1,650 square feet. This configuration provides an additional bedroom compared with the 3-bedroom option and may suit larger households that require more residential space.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The final layout, covered area and included facilities should be confirmed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers searching for AA Avenue apartments for sale or flats for sale in AA Avenue Karachi should review the latest availability list before selecting a unit.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official floor plans for AA Avenue should be obtained from AA Builders & Developers or its authorised sales representatives. Buyers should request the floor plan for their preferred apartment category before making a booking decision.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A floor plan helps buyers understand the arrangement of bedrooms, lounge, kitchen, bathrooms, balconies and other internal spaces. It also allows them to compare the available apartment configurations and select a layout that meets their household requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anyone comparing an AA Avenue apartment price should review the relevant floor plan and unit schedule together, as apartment size, floor level and position may affect the final price.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>AA Avenue is being marketed as a pre-launch residential project in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi. Public property listings show different price figures and booking terms, so these should not be treated as a single confirmed developer price list.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The final price of an apartment may depend on its size, floor, position, orientation and availability. Buyers should request the latest authorised price list directly from AA Builders & Developers or its verified sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before making a payment, buyers should confirm the following details:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Official booking procedure</li>\r\n<li>Verified payment recipient</li>\r\n<li>Allotment documentation</li>\r\n<li>Payment schedule and instalment terms</li>\r\n<li>Applicable terms and conditions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Anyone searching for AA Avenue price, AA Avenue apartment price or AA Avenue booking details should verify the latest information instead of relying only on third-party advertisements.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A project-specific SBCA approval number or complete approval document for AA Avenue has not been confirmed in the available public information.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should request the relevant approval documents, sanctioned building plans and land-related records from the developer before booking an apartment. These documents should be checked with the relevant authority where applicable.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Approval information belonging to another AA Builders project should not be assumed to apply to AA Avenue. Buyers should verify that all documents clearly identify the AA Avenue project and its relevant site.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The final possession date for AA Avenue should be confirmed through the developer\'s official project documentation and booking agreement.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Some third-party property listings mention a target handover around 2031, but buyers should treat this as an indicative listing detail rather than a guaranteed possession commitment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before booking, request the following information:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Construction schedule</li>\r\n<li>Expected project completion date</li>\r\n<li>Possession terms and conditions</li>\r\n<li>Any conditions that may affect the handover timeline</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The agreed possession details should be clearly stated in the official documentation.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 92, 1, 'publish', 'AA Avenue in Gulshan e Iqbal Karachi by AA Builders', 'AA Avenue Gulshan-e-Iqbal Karachi: 3 & 4 bed lounge flats by AA Builders from PKR 2.15 Crore. Booking from Rs 625,000, 66 installments of Rs 195,000/month.', 'AA Avenue Karachi, AA Avenue Gulshan-e-Iqbal, AA Avenue apartments', NULL, '2026-11-13 21:45:52', '2026-11-16 08:59:59'),
(162, 'I.I. Chundrigar Road', 'ii-chundrigar-road', '<p><br></p>', 1, 1, 0, 93, 1, 'publish', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-13 21:54:17', '2026-11-13 21:54:17'),
(163, 'AA Central', 'aa-central', '<h2>About AA Central</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>AA Central is a commercial high-rise development by AA Builders & Developers in New Challi, Karachi. Its location on I.I. Chundrigar Road places it within an established business district associated with corporate offices, financial activity and commercial services.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The project is planned as a Ground + 34-floor tower, with 24 floors dedicated to commercial office spaces. Office sizes are listed from approximately 629 to 1,060 square feet, allowing businesses to consider different workspace requirements. The development also includes ground-floor commercial shop payment-plan listings, providing a separate retail component alongside its office spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For companies, a commercial office can provide a dedicated workplace and a professional business address. For investors, commercial property may offer opportunities related to business demand and potential rental income, although returns depend on factors such as purchase price, occupancy, location and market conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>AA Central combines its business-focused location with planned parking, lift access and rooftop facilities. Buyers should evaluate the building\'s approved specifications, construction progress, legal documentation and financial terms before committing to a purchase.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>AA Builders & Developers</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Project Name</td>\r\n<td>AA Central</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Commercial Office Tower</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Building Configuration</td>\r\n<td>Ground + 34 Floors</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Commercial Office Floors</td>\r\n<td>24 Floors</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Office Sizes</td>\r\n<td>Approximately 629–1,060 sq. ft.</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Commercial Shops</td>\r\n<td>Ground-floor shop options listed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>Not officially disclosed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Parking</td>\r\n<td>11 Dedicated Parking Floors</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Passenger Lifts</td>\r\n<td>6</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Cargo Lift</td>\r\n<td>1</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Rooftop Facilities</td>\r\n<td>Mosque, Gym, Padel Court and Business Centre</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>I.I. Chundrigar Road, New Challi, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Delivery Year</td>\r\n<td>2030, as listed by the developer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Official unit-wise schedule to be confirmed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>AA Central is planned as a Ground + 34-floor commercial tower, with a development framework focused on office spaces, retail opportunities, parking and shared facilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>According to the developer\'s published information, 24 floors are allocated to commercial office spaces. The building also incorporates 11 dedicated parking floors, providing parking capacity within the development. Six passenger lifts and one cargo lift are planned to support access and service movement throughout the building.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The commercial office inventory is listed with unit sizes ranging from approximately 629 to 1,060 square feet. This range gives businesses the opportunity to compare different workspace sizes according to their operational needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The master plan and approved building drawings should be requested from AA Builders & Developers for a complete understanding of the floor distribution, office layouts, shop locations, parking arrangements and shared facilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should review the sanctioned plans and official specifications rather than relying only on marketing illustrations or third-party property listings.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Commercial Unit Types</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>AA Central is primarily designed for commercial use, with office spaces and ground-floor shop options listed in the developer\'s project information.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The office inventory is planned for businesses, corporate teams, professional firms and investors looking for commercial property in Karachi\'s central business district.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Commercial Offices in AA Central</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>AA Central offers commercial office spaces with listed sizes ranging from approximately 629 to 1,060 square feet. These spaces are intended to accommodate different business requirements, from smaller professional offices to larger corporate workspaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The available office size can help buyers assess how much space they need for employees, workstations, meeting areas and other business activities. Final office layouts, dimensions, floor positions and availability should be confirmed through the official unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Office Spaces for Businesses</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The office spaces at AA Central are designed for companies and professionals seeking a dedicated workplace in New Challi. Businesses can review available office configurations and select a unit according to their operational requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before purchasing, buyers should examine the floor plan, usable area, access arrangements, utility provisions and applicable building management terms.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Commercial Shops at AA Central</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The developer\'s website also lists ground-floor commercial shop payment-plan options. These provide a separate retail component within the development, alongside its corporate office spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The exact shop dimensions, availability, prices and permitted commercial uses should be confirmed through the latest authorised commercial inventory.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Businesses and investors searching for AA Central commercial shops or offices for sale in AA Central Karachi should request the official inventory before making a selection.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The office and commercial floor plans for AA Central should be obtained through AA Builders & Developers or its authorised sales representatives.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The floor plans can help buyers understand the arrangement of commercial offices, shop locations, building access points and shared areas. Reviewing the plans is important when comparing office sizes and selecting a suitable workspace.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should request the floor plan for their preferred office category along with its unit number, floor level, covered area and current availability.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anyone comparing an AA Central office price should review the relevant floor plan and official unit schedule together, as the floor position, size and configuration may affect the final price.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>AA Central is marketed as a commercial office development with separate office and ground-floor shop options. The developer\'s website provides commercial and office payment-plan sections, but the latest complete unit-wise price list should be obtained directly from its authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Commercial office prices may vary according to unit size, floor level, location within the building and availability. Retail shop prices and terms may follow a separate schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Some third-party listings have advertised starting prices and per-square-foot rates for AA Central offices. However, these figures should not be treated as a guaranteed current price because availability and sales terms can change.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers searching for AA Central price, AA Central office price or AA Central booking details should request the latest authorised price list before making a decision.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before booking, confirm the selected unit number, total price, booking amount, instalment schedule, possession payment, additional charges and official payment procedure. All payment terms should be documented in the booking agreement.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The complete project-specific approval and regulatory documentation for AA Central should be obtained and verified before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The developer\'s public project page provides project specifications and building details, but it does not establish the complete regulatory approval position. Buyers should request the relevant sanctioned building plans, applicable NOCs and other required approvals from AA Builders & Developers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Where applicable, these documents should be independently checked with the relevant Karachi development and building control authorities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should also ensure that the documents identify AA Central and its exact project site. Approvals or documents belonging to another development should not be assumed to apply to this project.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>AA Builders & Developers lists 2030 as the delivery year for AA Central on its official project page.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>However, buyers should confirm the contractual completion and possession schedule directly with the developer before booking. The expected handover date should be clearly stated in the official booking documents and purchase agreement.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before committing funds, buyers should also request the latest construction progress update, development schedule and details of any conditions that may affect possession.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The final possession terms should clarify the handover procedure, outstanding payments, applicable charges and documentation required to receive the commercial unit.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 94, 1, 'publish', 'AA Central Karachi: Commercial Offices on I.I. Chundrigar Road', 'AA Central Karachi by AA Builders & Developers, a G+34 commercial tower in New Challi. Discover office sizes, business facilities, location and booking details.', 'AA Central Karachi, AA Central New Challi, AA Central I.I. Chundrigar Road', '/images/projects/1794607035_hero_aacentralimg1.jpg', '2026-11-13 21:57:15', '2026-11-13 22:03:49'),
(164, 'DHA Phase 8', 'dha-phase-8', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 95, 1, 'publish', 'DHA Phase 8 Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in DHA Phase 8, Karachi.', 'DHA Phase 8, real estate in DHA Phase 8, properties for sale in DHA Phase 8', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:07:57', '2026-11-20 13:28:32'),
(165, 'H1 Tower', 'h1-tower', '<h2>H1 Tower – Project Overview</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>H1 Tower is a signature residential development within HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi. Developed by HMR Group, the project is designed to offer modern high-rise living with a selection of residential layouts and waterfront surroundings.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The tower\'s Ground + 34-floor structure provides a range of residential options, including townhouses, 1-bedroom, 2-bedroom, 3-bedroom and 4-bedroom apartments, as well as penthouses. These configurations allow buyers to compare different layouts according to their household requirements and preferred living space.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>One of the key features of H1 Tower is its residential orientation. The official project information identifies sea-facing and boulevard-facing apartment options, allowing buyers to consider different views and unit positions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The development also includes eight parking floors, a dedicated services floor on the 15th floor, fire-life-safety lifts and a 20 × 80-foot tower swimming pool.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers exploring luxury apartments in DHA Phase 8, H1 Tower offers a residential option within the larger HMR Waterfront community. Interested buyers should review the official floor plans, unit specifications, construction progress and payment terms before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Developer</td><td>HMR Group</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Project Name</td><td>H1 Tower</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Project Type</td><td>Luxury Residential Tower</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Building Configuration</td><td>Ground + 34 Floors</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Unit Types</td><td>Townhouses, 1, 2, 3 and 4-Bedroom Apartments, Penthouses</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Apartment Views</td><td>Sea-Facing and Boulevard-Facing Options</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Total Land Size</td><td>Not separately disclosed for the tower</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Parking</td><td>8 Dedicated Parking Floors</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Tower Swimming Pool</td><td>20 × 80 Feet</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Services Floor</td><td>15th Floor</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Lifts</td><td>Fire-Life-Safety Lifts</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Location</td><td>HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Main Access</td><td>Abdul Sattar Edhi Avenue</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Payment Plan</td><td>Latest authorised schedule to be confirmed</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Possession</td><td>Confirm through the latest official agreement</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Lifestyle</td><td>Premium Waterfront Residential Living</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>H1 Tower is planned as a Ground + 34-floor residential development within the larger HMR Waterfront community. Its architectural and development framework focuses on residential accommodation, building services, parking and recreational facilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The tower offers different residential configurations, including townhouses, 1-bedroom, 2-bedroom, 3-bedroom and 4-bedroom apartments, along with penthouses. The official project page identifies sea-facing and boulevard-facing orientations for its residential units.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The building\'s published specifications include eight parking floors, a dedicated services floor on the 15th floor and fire-life-safety lifts. A dedicated tower swimming pool measuring 20 × 80 feet is also included among the main project highlights.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The wider HMR Waterfront development provides a larger residential environment with shared outdoor, recreational and community facilities. These include fitness and wellness areas, cycling networks, jogging routes, community gardens and other lifestyle spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should request the latest official H1 Tower master plan, floor distribution and approved building drawings to understand the exact layout of the tower, residential floors, services areas, parking facilities and shared amenities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The master plan and specifications of H1 Tower should be reviewed separately from other residential towers within HMR Waterfront, as each project may have different layouts and facilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types: Apartments, Townhouses and Penthouses</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>H1 Tower offers different residential configurations designed for individuals, couples and families looking for premium living spaces within HMR Waterfront.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The official project information identifies townhouses, 1-bedroom, 2-bedroom, 3-bedroom and 4-bedroom apartments, along with penthouses. These options provide flexibility for buyers with different space requirements and residential preferences.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Apartments in H1 Tower</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The apartment selection at H1 Tower includes multiple bedroom configurations. Buyers can explore the following options through the authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>1-Bedroom Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 1-bedroom apartments are designed for individuals, couples and smaller households looking for a compact residential option. These units may also interest buyers seeking a smaller property within a premium waterfront development.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2-Bedroom Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 2-bedroom apartments provide additional residential space and may suit small families or buyers who need an extra room for guests, work or personal use.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3-Bedroom Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 3-bedroom apartments are designed for families looking for multiple bedrooms and comfortable living arrangements. Buyers should review the official floor plans to understand the room distribution, lounge area and other internal features.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Bedroom Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 4-bedroom apartments provide larger residential configurations for families requiring additional space. Their layouts, covered areas and specifications should be confirmed through the official unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Townhouses in H1 Tower</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>H1 Tower also includes townhouse options within its residential offering. These units provide an alternative to conventional apartment layouts and may appeal to buyers looking for a different residential arrangement.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should request the official townhouse floor plans, covered areas, specifications and availability before selecting a unit.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Penthouses in H1 Tower</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Penthouses are included in H1 Tower\'s residential options and are positioned as premium residences within the building.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>These units may appeal to buyers seeking larger living spaces and elevated views of the surrounding waterfront and city skyline. Actual views, floor positions, layouts and specifications should be confirmed through the official penthouse inventory.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anyone searching for H1 Tower apartments for sale or penthouses in DHA Phase 8 Karachi should compare the available unit options and obtain the latest authorised inventory before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>H1 Tower offers different residential floor plans for its townhouses, apartments and penthouses. The available configurations include 1-bedroom, 2-bedroom, 3-bedroom and 4-bedroom apartments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The floor plans help buyers understand the arrangement of bedrooms, lounge areas, kitchens, bathrooms, balconies and other internal spaces. They also allow buyers to compare residential layouts according to their household requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should request the official floor plan for their preferred apartment category and confirm its covered area, floor number, unit position and view.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The project information identifies sea-facing and boulevard-facing apartment orientations. Buyers should therefore confirm the actual orientation of their selected unit rather than assuming that every apartment has an uninterrupted sea view.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anyone comparing an H1 Tower apartment price should review the relevant floor plan and unit schedule together, as the size, floor position and orientation may influence the final purchase price.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>H1 Tower offers multiple residential options, including apartments, townhouses and penthouses. The price of each unit may depend on its category, covered area, floor level, orientation, view and current availability.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Different property portals and marketing websites have published price figures for H1 Tower. However, these prices may represent older inventory or previous sales schedules and should not be treated as the current official price list.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers searching for H1 Tower price, H1 Tower apartment price or H1 Tower booking details should request the latest authorised inventory and price schedule from HMR Waterfront\'s sales centre.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before making a booking, confirm the following details:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Selected unit number and category.</li>\r\n<li>Covered area and floor position.</li>\r\n<li>Total purchase price.</li>\r\n<li>Booking amount.</li>\r\n<li>Instalment schedule.</li>\r\n<li>Possession payment.</li>\r\n<li>Additional charges and applicable fees.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>All payments should be made through the developer\'s authorised payment channels and supported by official documentation and receipts.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers interested in H1 Tower should request the project-specific regulatory and approval documents from HMR Group or its authorised sales representatives.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The relevant documentation should identify H1 Tower, its project site and the applicable building approvals. Buyers should review the sanctioned building plans, relevant NOCs and land-related records before making a purchase decision.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Where applicable, the documents should be independently verified with the relevant authorities, including DHA Karachi and other concerned regulatory bodies.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Approval information belonging to another project within HMR Waterfront should not automatically be assumed to apply to H1 Tower. Buyers should confirm that the documents specifically relate to the selected tower and its development.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The expected possession timeline for H1 Tower should be confirmed through the latest official construction update and booking agreement.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Older marketing materials and third-party property listings have mentioned different handover dates. These dates should not be treated as a confirmed current possession commitment without verification from HMR Group.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before booking, buyers should request the latest construction progress, expected completion date, handover schedule and relevant contractual conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The booking agreement should clearly state the expected possession date, payment obligations, handover procedure and any conditions that may affect the completion timeline.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should rely on the latest official documentation rather than outdated advertisements or previous payment schedules.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 96, 1, 'publish', 'H1 Tower HMR Waterfront Karachi Price & Payment Plan', 'H1 Tower HMR Waterfront Karachi: sea-facing 1 to 4 bed flats for sale in DHA Phase 8. Prices from PKR 4 Crore, 50/40/10 payment plan, possession Sep 2027.', 'H1 Tower Karachi, H1 Tower HMR Waterfront, H1 Tower DHA Phase 8, H1 Tower HMR Group', '/images/projects/1794607810_hero_project-detail-15.jpg', '2026-11-13 22:10:10', '2026-11-16 08:54:09'),
(166, 'AA-Waterfront', 'aa-waterfront', '<h2>AA Waterfront – Project Overview</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>AA Waterfront is designed for buyers seeking a combination of modern architecture, sea-facing residences, and premium lifestyle facilities. Located within HMR Waterfront, the project offers a residential environment with convenient access to important areas of Karachi.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The tower\'s residential options include apartments for individuals, couples, and families, while its duplex and triplex penthouses provide larger living spaces for buyers seeking an exclusive lifestyle.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Smart home automation, contemporary interiors, private terraces, and selected residences with private lifts add to the project\'s residential appeal.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers exploring AA Waterfront HMR Waterfront, the development offers an opportunity to consider modern coastal living in one of Karachi\'s established residential locations.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>AA Builders & Developers</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Master Community</td>\r\n<td>HMR Waterfront</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Luxury Residential Tower</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Building Structure</td>\r\n<td>Ground + 37 Floors</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>1, 2 & 3-Bedroom Apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Penthouse Types</td>\r\n<td>4-Bedroom Duplex & 6-Bedroom Triplex</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Plot #08, HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Views</td>\r\n<td>Arabian Sea and City Views</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Smart Features</td>\r\n<td>Smart Home Automation</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Amenities</td>\r\n<td>Swimming Pool, Gym, Sauna, Steam Room, and More</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Contact Authorized Sales Team</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Advertised target: 2028; confirm current schedule</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>AA Waterfront is planned as a modern residential tower within the larger HMR Waterfront master community. Its architectural concept focuses on waterfront living, contemporary design, and residential convenience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The development combines residential apartments, exclusive penthouse layouts, and lifestyle facilities within a high-rise structure. The building is designed to offer sea-facing residences, modern lift access, spacious interiors, and selected private outdoor spaces.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The master community is positioned along the Arabian Sea and includes a wider range of residential and recreational facilities. This setting provides residents with access to the coastal environment while remaining connected to the main urban areas of Karachi.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers reviewing the AA Waterfront master plan should request the latest approved drawings and project documentation through the authorized sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Unit Types and Residential Options</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>AA Waterfront offers multiple residential configurations designed to meet different space requirements and lifestyle preferences. The available layouts include 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, as well as larger duplex and triplex penthouses.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The project brochure includes individual floor plans for different apartment configurations and penthouse layouts.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in AA Waterfront</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The residential apartments at AA Waterfront are designed with modern layouts, comfortable living areas, and contemporary interior features.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>1-Bedroom Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 1-bedroom apartments offer a practical residential option for individuals and couples. These units are designed to provide comfortable living spaces, modern interiors, and access to the project\'s advertised smart home features.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>2-Bedroom Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 2-bedroom apartments are designed for small families and buyers who need additional living space. Their layouts focus on comfortable bedrooms, functional living areas, and modern residential features.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>3-Bedroom Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 3-bedroom apartments provide larger residential spaces for families seeking additional comfort and privacy. These residences feature spacious living areas, contemporary finishes, and attractive sea-facing views in selected layouts.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>4-Bedroom Duplex Penthouses</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 4-bedroom duplex penthouses offer a more spacious residential experience across two levels. Selected layouts include private lift access, terraces, and premium living spaces designed for buyers seeking an exclusive home.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>6-Bedroom Triplex Penthouses</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The 6-bedroom triplex penthouses are designed for buyers looking for expansive living spaces and a premium residential lifestyle. Their multi-level layouts provide additional room for family living, entertaining, and private relaxation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers searching for apartments for sale AA Waterfront or flats for sale AA Waterfront Karachi should review the latest available inventory, apartment sizes, and floor plans before making a booking decision.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>AA Waterfront provides individual floor plan designs for its different apartment categories and penthouse configurations. The project brochure features layouts for 1-bedroom, 2-bedroom, and 3-bedroom apartments, along with 4-bedroom duplex penthouses.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The floor plans are designed to organize living, dining, bedroom, and private spaces according to each residential category. Selected penthouse layouts also include private lifts and terrace areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers interested in an AA Waterfront floor plan should request the latest layout for their preferred apartment type, including the covered area, floor position, orientation, and available views.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The price of an apartment at AA Waterfront depends on its size, floor level, layout, location within the tower, and view. Sea-facing residences and larger penthouses may have different pricing compared with standard apartment configurations.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Market listings have advertised starting prices around PKR 4.5 Crore, but this figure should not be treated as a confirmed current price for every available unit.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers searching for an AA Waterfront apartment price or AA Waterfront booking amount should contact the authorized sales team for the latest price list, available inventory, and booking requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before making a payment, buyers should verify the following details:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Selected apartment or penthouse category.</li>\r\n<li>Unit size and covered area.</li>\r\n<li>Floor level and residential orientation.</li>\r\n<li>Latest official selling price.</li>\r\n<li>Booking amount and payment schedule.</li>\r\n<li>Additional charges and applicable fees.</li>\r\n<li>Official booking and sale documentation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>AA Waterfront is located within the HMR Waterfront master community in DHA Phase 8, Karachi. However, buyers should distinguish between the approval status of the wider master community and the project-specific documentation for the AA Waterfront tower.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before booking an apartment, buyers should request the relevant NOC, approved building plans, land documentation, and other applicable approvals from the developer or the relevant authority.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should independently verify that the documentation applies to AA Waterfront and their selected unit rather than relying only on general approval claims or third-party property listings.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The advertised handover target for AA Waterfront is 2028. However, buyers should confirm the latest construction progress, contractual possession schedule, and handover conditions directly with the developer.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The actual handover timeline may depend on construction progress, regulatory requirements, and completion of the relevant development work.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anyone considering an investment in AA Waterfront Karachi should review the possession terms mentioned in the official booking and sale documentation before making a financial commitment.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 97, 1, 'publish', 'AA Waterfront in HMR DHA Phase 8 Price & Payment Plan', 'AA Waterfront Karachi by AA Builders at HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8. Discover luxury apartments, penthouses, amenities, floor plans, and payment options.', 'AA Waterfront Karachi, AA Waterfront DHA Phase 8,  AA Waterfront HMR Waterfront, AA Waterfront price', NULL, '2026-11-13 22:19:23', '2026-11-16 08:49:04'),
