(168, 'King’s Jinnah Tower', 'kings-jinnah-tower', '<h2>Kings JS Tower Karachi: Apartments on Jinnah Avenue</h2>\r\n<p>Kings JS Tower Jinnah Avenue is positioned for buyers who want a high-rise apartment on one of Karachi’s growing residential corridors. Because most available information comes from property portals rather than an official project page, buyers should verify every detail, including the project name, location, price and unit sizes, with Kings Group directly.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Project Highlights</h3>\r\n<table>\r\n  <thead>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <th>Feature</th>\r\n      <th>Details</th>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </thead>\r\n  <tbody>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Developer</td>\r\n      <td>Kings Group</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Property Type</td>\r\n      <td>Residential apartments</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n      <td>To be confirmed by developer</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n      <td>Not disclosed</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Handover</td>\r\n      <td>To be announced</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Location</td>\r\n      <td>Jinnah Avenue, Karachi</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n      <td>Installment plan reported, to be confirmed</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n      <td>High-rise apartment living</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3>Master Plan and Development Framework</h3>\r\n<p>No official master plan has been published for Kings JS Tower. Tower count, floors and layout should be confirmed through Kings Group’s authorised channels. Buyers should not rely on figures from third-party listings alone.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Apartments in Kings JS Tower</h3>\r\n<p>Unit sizes and bedroom counts vary across third-party listings, so they cannot be treated as confirmed. Buyers looking for apartments for sale in Kings JS Tower or flats for sale in Kings JS Tower Karachi should request the official unit schedule before deciding.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Floor Plan</h3>\r\n<p>Floor plans for each unit category should be requested from the developer’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Price and Booking Status</h3>\r\n<p>Kings JS Tower price differs between listings, and no official price list has been verified here. Buyers searching for a Kings JS Tower apartment price or Kings JS Tower booking amount should obtain the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt from Kings Group. They should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>NOC and Approval Status</h3>\r\n<p>No project-specific NOC or approval documents have been verified for Kings JS Tower. Buyers should ask the developer for approval documents and confirm them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Possession Timeline</h3>\r\n<p>No possession date has been officially confirmed. Any date quoted in a listing should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer’s documentation.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 99, 1, 'publish', 'King’s Jinnah Tower | Apartments on Jinnah Avenue  by Kings Group', 'King’s Jinnah Tower Karachi by Kings Group on Jinnah Avenue. Review project status, payment plan, unit types and how to register your interest.', 'King’s Jinnah Tower, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-16 07:34:28', '2026-11-16 07:52:28'),
(169, 'Kings Dream Villas', 'kings-dream-villas', '<h2>Kings Dream Villas North Karachi: Gated Plots Near 4-K Chowrangi</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Kings Dream Villas is positioned for buyers who want to build their own home on a 120 square yard plot inside a secure, planned community. Because the project is sold as plots rather than ready-built villas, owners can design their home to suit their own needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source and confirm any figure seen on third-party listings, including price and availability, directly with Kings Group before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n    <tbody><tr>\r\n        <th>Feature</th>\r\n        <th>Details</th>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Developer</td>\r\n        <td>Kings Group</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Property Type</td>\r\n        <td>Residential Plots</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Plot Size</td>\r\n        <td>120 Sq. Yards</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n        <td>Not Disclosed</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Handover</td>\r\n        <td>Not Published</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Location</td>\r\n        <td>North Karachi, Near 4-K Chowrangi</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n        <td>Not Published</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n        <td>Gated Community Living</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No detailed master plan has been published on the project page. Buyers should request the layout and plot map from Kings Group’s authorised sales channel and should not rely on figures from third-party listings alone.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Plot Sizes in Kings Dream Villas</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Kings Dream Villas offers 120 square yard residential plots. This size gives owners the flexibility to build a compact or a spacious home, depending on their needs. Buyers seeking residential plots for sale in Kings Dream Villas should request the current availability from the developer.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Kings Dream Villas is a plot project, so no floor plan is attached to the plots. Buyers who want a house design should consult an architect and confirm any building rules or bylaws with the developer.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No official Kings Dream Villas price list is published on the project page. Buyers searching for a Kings Dream Villas plot price or booking amount should request the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt from Kings Group. They should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Kings Dream Villas are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published for Kings Dream Villas. Any date quoted in a listing should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer’s official documentation.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 100, 1, 'publish', 'Kings Dream Villas Plot North Karachi, Price & Payment Plan', 'Plots for Sale in Kings Dream Villas Karachi offers 120 sq yd residential plots in a gated community near 4-K Chowrangi, North Karachi. See features, location and how to enquire.', 'Kings Dream Villas, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-16 08:01:54', '2026-11-16 08:46:23'),
(170, 'North Karachi', 'north-karachi-29', NULL, 1, 1, 0, 101, 1, 'publish', 'North Karachi Karachi Properties | Luxury Investment & Community Guide', 'Explore luxury waterfront homes, real estate, and investment projects in North Karachi, Karachi.', 'North Karachi, real estate in North Karachi, properties for sale in North Karachi', NULL, '2026-11-16 08:02:12', '2026-11-20 13:19:03');
