(171, 'Kings Nadir Tower', 'kings-nadir-tower', '<h2>Kings Nadir Tower: Premium Apartments on Main Jinnah Avenue, Karachi</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Kings Nadir Tower is positioned for families who want a spacious apartment on Main Jinnah Avenue with parking, a gym and children’s facilities inside the project. The official page presents it as a pre-launch project, so the final specifications, pricing and handover terms may change once Kings Group announces the launch.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should rely on the developer’s official documentation and confirm any figure seen on third-party listings, including price and plan, before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n    <tbody><tr>\r\n        <th>Feature</th>\r\n        <th>Details</th>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Developer</td>\r\n        <td>Kings Group</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Property Type</td>\r\n        <td>Residential Apartments with a Commercial Area</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n        <td>3-Bedroom Lounge Apartments</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n        <td>Not Disclosed</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Handover</td>\r\n        <td>Not Published</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Location</td>\r\n        <td>Main Jinnah Avenue, Opposite Malir Cantt Check Post No. 6, Karachi</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n        <td>Not Published, Confirm with Developer</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n        <td>High-Rise Family Living</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No detailed master plan has been published on the project page. Details such as the number of floors and the tower layout should be confirmed through Kings Group’s authorised sales channel. Buyers should not rely on third-party listings alone for these figures.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Kings Nadir Tower</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists 3-bedroom lounge apartments with contemporary layouts. Apartment sizes have not been published, and sizes in third-party listings are unverified. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Kings Nadir Tower or flats for sale in Kings Nadir Tower Karachi should request the official unit schedule before deciding.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Floor plans for the apartments should be requested from the developer’s authorised sales channel together with the unit schedule. A project brochure is offered for download on the official page.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No official Kings Nadir Tower price list is published on the project page. The page mentions pre-booking discounts before the official launch, but the terms are not stated. Buyers searching for a Kings Nadir Tower apartment price or booking amount should request the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt from Kings Group. They should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Kings Nadir Tower are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published for Kings Nadir Tower. Any date quoted in a listing should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer’s official documentation.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 102, 1, 'publish', 'Kings Nadir Tower Karachi: 3 Bed Apartments on Jinnah Avenue', 'Kings Nadir Tower by Kings Group offers 3-bedroom lounge apartments on Main Jinnah Avenue, opposite Malir Cantt. See amenities, location and how to enquire.', 'Kings Nadir Tower, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-16 08:12:53', '2026-11-16 08:20:21'),
(172, 'KINGS JS TOWER', 'kings-js-tower', '<p>Kings JS Tower is positioned for families who want a spacious apartment on Main Jinnah Avenue with dedicated parking, a gym and a children’s area inside the project. The official page presents it with a pre-launch discount, so final pricing and terms may change once Kings Group announces the launch.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should rely on the developer’s official documentation and confirm any figures seen on third-party listings, including prices and unit sizes, before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <th>Feature</th>\r\n    <th>Details</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Developer</td>\r\n    <td>Kings Group</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Property Type</td>\r\n    <td>Residential apartments</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n    <td>3 and 4 bedroom apartments</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n    <td>Not disclosed</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Handover</td>\r\n    <td>Not published</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Location</td>\r\n    <td>Main Jinnah Avenue, near Complex No. 5, Malir Cantt, Karachi</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n    <td>36 month installment plan (as stated on the official page)</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n    <td>High-rise family living</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No detailed master plan has been published on the project page. Details such as the number of floors and the tower layout should be confirmed through Kings Group’s authorised sales channel. Buyers should not rely on third-party listings alone for these figures.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Kings JS Tower</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists 3 and 4 bedroom apartments designed for family living. Apartment sizes have not been published, and sizes in third-party listings vary and are unverified.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Kings JS Tower or flats for sale in Kings JS Tower Karachi should request the official unit schedule before deciding.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Floor plans for each apartment type should be requested from the developer’s authorised sales channel together with the unit schedule. A project brochure is offered for download on the official page.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No official Kings JS Tower price list is published on the project page. The page mentions a pre-launch discount, but its terms are not stated, and prices in third-party listings differ.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers searching for a Kings JS Tower apartment price or booking amount should:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Request the authorised price schedule from Kings Group.</li>\r\n  <li>Confirm the applicable pre-launch discount and its terms.</li>\r\n  <li>Obtain a written booking receipt from the developer.</li>\r\n  <li>Verify payment instructions before transferring any amount.</li>\r\n  <li>Avoid making payments to unverified agents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Kings JS Tower are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published for Kings JS Tower. Any date quoted in a listing should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer’s official documentation.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 103, 1, 'publish', 'Kings JS Tower Malir Cantt: 3 & 4 Bed Apartments Karachi', 'Kings JS Tower by Kings Group offers 3 and 4 bedroom apartments on Main Jinnah Avenue, Malir Cantt, with a 36-month plan. See amenities and how to enquire.', 'Kings JS Tower Malir Cantt', NULL, '2026-11-16 08:36:30', '2026-11-16 08:42:56'),
(173, 'Northern Bypass Karachi', 'northern-bypass-karachi', '<p><br></p>', 1, 1, 0, 104, 1, 'publish', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-11-16 08:45:47', '2026-11-16 08:45:47'),
(174, 'Kings Valley', 'kings-valley', '<p>Kings Valley is positioned for buyers who want a 120 square yard residential plot, or a commercial plot as an investment, in a planned community on the Northern Bypass corridor. Because the project is sold as plots, owners can build a home that suits their own needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page describes the amenities as planned features. Buyers should confirm the current development status and any figure seen on third-party listings with Kings Group before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Project Highlights</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <th>Feature</th>\r\n    <th>Details</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Developer</td>\r\n    <td>Kings Group</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Property Type</td>\r\n    <td>Residential and commercial plots</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Plot Types</td>\r\n    <td>120 sq. yard residential plots, commercial plots, PP plots</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n    <td>Not disclosed</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Handover</td>\r\n    <td>Not published</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Location</td>\r\n    <td>Scheme 45, M-10 Northern Bypass, Karachi</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n    <td>Up to 5-year installment plan or cash (as stated on the official page)</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n    <td>Planned community living</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h3>Master Plan and Development Framework</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No detailed master plan has been published on the project page. Block layout, plot allocation and the development schedule should be confirmed through Kings Group’s authorised sales channel. Buyers should not rely on third-party listings alone for these figures.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Plot Types in Kings Valley</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists 120 square yard residential plots, commercial plots and PP plots. Sizes for commercial and PP plots have not been published, so buyers should request the plot schedule from the developer. Buyers seeking residential plots for sale in Kings Valley should also ask for the current availability.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Floor Plan</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Kings Valley is a plot project, so no floor plan is attached to the plots. Buyers who want a house design should consult an architect and confirm any building rules or bylaws with the developer. A project brochure is offered for download on the official page.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Price and Booking Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No official Kings Valley price list is published on the project page. Buyers searching for a Kings Valley plot price or booking amount should request the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt from Kings Group. They should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>NOC and Approval Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Kings Valley are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Possession Timeline</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published for Kings Valley. Any date quoted in a listing should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer’s official documentation.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 105, 1, 'publish', 'Kings Valley Karachi: 120 Sq Yd Plots on Northern Bypass', 'Kings Valley by Kings Group offers 120 sq yd residential, commercial and PP plots in Scheme 45, Northern Bypass with up to 5-year installments. Enquire now.', 'Kings Valley, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-16 08:46:48', '2026-11-16 09:05:59'),
(175, 'Naya Nazimabad', 'naya-nazimabad', '<p><br></p>', 1, 1, 0, 106, 1, 'publish', 'Property in Naya Nazimabad: Price & Real Estate Agency', 'Property for sale in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi: flats, plots , Villa & houses with prices & payment plans. book with the best real estate agency in Naya Nazimabad.', 'Property for sale in Naya Nazimabad', NULL, '2026-11-16 10:46:51', '2026-11-16 18:35:55'),
(176, 'Peace Apartments', 'peace-apartments', '<p>Peace Apartments is positioned for families who want a modern apartment inside the master-planned Naya Nazimabad community, with parking, a gym and a community hall in the building. The official page also shows floor plans for shops and showrooms on the lower and upper ground floors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source and confirm any figure seen on third-party listings, including price and plan, with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Project Highlights</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <th>Feature</th>\r\n    <th>Details</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Developer</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Property Type</td>\r\n    <td>Residential apartments with shops and showrooms</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n    <td>2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n    <td>Not disclosed</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Handover</td>\r\n    <td>Not published</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Location</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n    <td>Plan sheets published on the official page, confirm with developer</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n    <td>High-rise living in a master-planned community</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h3>Master Plan and Development Framework</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Peace Apartments is part of the wider Naya Nazimabad community. The official page shows a location map but no detailed tower layout. The number of towers, floors and handover phases should be confirmed through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Apartments in Peace Apartments</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments in high-rise towers, with virtual tours for the 2 bedroom and 3 bedroom units. Apartment sizes are shown on the plan sheets, and sizes in third-party listings vary, so buyers seeking apartments for sale in Peace Apartments should confirm them with the developer.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Floor Plan</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page publishes floor plan images for the apartment types, along with floor plans for shops and showrooms. A project brochure is also offered for download. Buyers should request the latest unit schedule together with the floor plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Price and Booking Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Pricing appears on the official page only as part of the payment plan sheets, and no separate price list is published as text. Prices in third-party listings differ. Buyers searching for a Peace Apartments price or booking amount should request the current authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt from the developer. They should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>NOC and Approval Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Peace Apartments are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Possession Timeline</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published on the official page. Any date quoted in a listing should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer’s official documentation.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 107, 1, 'publish', 'Naya Nazimabad Peace Apartments Price & Payment Plan', 'Peace Apartments Naya Nazimabad Karachi: 2, 3 & 4 bed flats for sale from PKR 1.7 Crore, easy 1% payment plan, pay 1% monthly, possession on 70% payment.', 'Peace Apartments, Peace Apartments Naya Nazimabad', NULL, '2026-11-16 11:05:55', '2026-11-16 11:41:39'),
(177, 'Grace Tower', 'grace-tower', '<p>Grace Tower is positioned for buyers who want an apartment above retail shops in a business-centre location inside a gated, master-planned community. The mix of residential and commercial space suits both families and buyers looking at a shop.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because the official page is brief, buyers should confirm every detail with the developer and should not rely on third-party listings for sizes or prices.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Project Highlights</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <th>Feature</th>\r\n    <th>Details</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Developer</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Property Type</td>\r\n    <td>Apartments and retail shops (mixed-use)</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n    <td>Not published</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n    <td>Not disclosed</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Handover</td>\r\n    <td>Not published</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Location</td>\r\n    <td>Business Enclave, Naya Nazimabad, Karachi</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n    <td>Not published</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n    <td>Mixed-use living in a master-planned community</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h3>Master Plan and Development Framework</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No detailed master plan has been published for Grace Tower. The page states that the building rises up to four floors, with shops on the ground floor and apartments above. The number of units and the layout should be confirmed through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Apartments in Grace Tower</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page does not publish apartment sizes or bedroom counts. Listings on third-party sites mention different unit types and sizes, but these are unverified. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Grace Tower should request the official unit schedule before deciding.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Floor Plan</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No floor plan is published on the official Grace Tower page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Price and Booking Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No official Grace Tower price list is published on the project page. Prices in third-party listings differ and are unverified. Buyers searching for a Grace Tower apartment price or booking amount should request the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt from the developer. They should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>NOC and Approval Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Grace Tower are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Possession Timeline</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published for Grace Tower. Any date quoted in a listing should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer’s official documentation.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 108, 1, 'publish', 'Grace Tower Naya Nazimabad Block A: Price & Payment Plan', 'Grace Tower Naya Nazimabad Karachi: 2 & 3 bed flats for sale in Block A from PKR 1.4 Crore only 28 apartments, 2-year plan, 30% booking, possession 2028.', 'Grace Tower Naya Nazimabad', NULL, '2026-11-16 11:31:13', '2026-11-16 11:46:27'),
(178, 'Signature Tower', 'signature-tower', '<p>Signature Tower is positioned for families who want a corner apartment with open views inside a master-planned community. The official page describes the tower as having unobstructed views from its highest point, with parks on two sides.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source and confirm any figure seen on third-party listings, including price and plan, with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Project Highlights</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <th>Feature</th>\r\n    <th>Details</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Developer</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Property Type</td>\r\n    <td>Residential apartments and duplexes</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n    <td>2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments and duplexes</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n    <td>Not disclosed</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Handover</td>\r\n    <td>Not published</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Location</td>\r\n    <td>Block A, Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, adjacent to the Gymkhana</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n    <td>Plan sheets published on the official page, confirm with developer</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n    <td>High-rise living in a master-planned community</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h3>Master Plan and Development Framework</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Signature Tower is part of the wider Naya Nazimabad community. The official page describes a four-side open tower with all corner apartments, three floors of reserved parking and a dedicated amenities floor. The number of floors and units should be confirmed through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Apartments in Signature Tower</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists 2, 3 and 4 bedroom executive apartments and duplexes. Apartment sizes appear on the plan sheets, and sizes in third-party listings vary, so buyers seeking apartments for sale in Signature Tower should confirm them with the developer before deciding.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Floor Plan</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page publishes floor plan images for the 2 bedroom, 3 bedroom and 4 bedroom apartments and for the duplex. A project brochure is also offered for download. Buyers should request the latest unit schedule together with the floor plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Price and Booking Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Pricing appears on the official page only as part of the payment plan sheets, and no separate price list is published as text. Prices in third-party listings differ. Buyers searching for a Signature Tower apartment price or booking amount should request the current authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt from the developer. They should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>NOC and Approval Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Signature Tower are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Possession Timeline</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published on the official page. Any date quoted in a listing should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer’s official documentation.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 109, 1, 'publish', 'Signature Tower Naya Nazimabad: 2, 3 & 4 Bed Flats for Sale', 'Signature Tower Naya Nazimabad Karachi: 2, 3 & 4 bed flats for sale in Block A from PKR 1.88 Crore — easy installment plan, park facing, possession in 2027.', 'Signature Tower Naya Nazimabad', NULL, '2026-11-16 11:44:54', '2026-11-16 11:59:54'),
(179, 'Rahat Residency', 'rahat-residency', '<p>Rahat Residency is positioned for small and medium families who want a 2 bedroom apartment with a park view inside a master-planned community. The official page states that all apartments are single sided and park facing, with natural ventilation through a single corridor.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source and confirm any figure seen on third-party listings, including price and plan, with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Project Highlights</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <th>Feature</th>\r\n    <th>Details</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Developer</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Property Type</td>\r\n    <td>Residential apartments</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n    <td>2 bedroom DD apartments</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n    <td>Not disclosed</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Handover</td>\r\n    <td>Not published</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Location</td>\r\n    <td>Central location, Naya Nazimabad, Karachi</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n    <td>Plan sheet published on the official page, confirm with developer</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n    <td>High-rise living in a master-planned community</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h3>Master Plan and Development Framework</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Rahat Residency is part of the wider Naya Nazimabad community. The official page describes a single tower with single-sided apartments along a single corridor. The number of floors and units should be confirmed through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Apartments in Rahat Residency</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists 2 bedroom DD apartments. The apartment size appears on the plan sheet, and sizes in third-party listings vary, so buyers seeking apartments for sale in Rahat Residency should confirm them with the developer before deciding.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Floor Plan</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page publishes a floor plan image for the apartments, and a project brochure is offered for download. Buyers should request the latest unit schedule together with the floor plan.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Price and Booking Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Pricing appears on the official page only as part of the payment plan sheet, and no separate price list is published as text. Prices in third-party listings differ. Buyers searching for a Rahat Residency price or booking amount should request the current authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt from the developer. They should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>NOC and Approval Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Rahat Residency are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Possession Timeline</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published on the official page. Any date quoted in a listing should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer’s official documentation.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 110, 1, 'publish', 'Rahat Residency Naya Nazimabad: 2 Bed DD Apartments Karachi', 'Rahat Residency is a single-tower project in central Naya Nazimabad with 2 bedroom DD apartments, all park facing. See features, location and how to enquire.', 'Rahat Residency', NULL, '2026-11-16 11:52:28', '2026-11-16 12:03:33'),
(180, 'Globe Residency', 'globe-residency', '<p>Globe Residency is positioned for families who want a spacious 2 or 3 bedroom apartment inside a gated township, with the choice between a ready unit and one on an installment plan. Listings describe many units as corner and park facing, and some as boulevard or masjid facing.</p>\r\n<p>Because the listing data comes from a real estate agency, buyers should treat prices, floors and possession dates as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n<table>\r\n  <thead>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <th>Feature</th>\r\n      <th>Details</th>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </thead>\r\n  <tbody>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Developer</td>\r\n      <td>Naya Nazimabad (Javedan Corporation Limited, Arif Habib Group)</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Property Type</td>\r\n      <td>Residential apartments</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n      <td>2 bedroom DD and 3 bedroom DD apartments</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Apartment Sizes</td>\r\n      <td>About 1,249 sq. ft (2 bed DD) and 1,750 sq. ft (3 bed DD), as listed</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Price Range (listed)</td>\r\n      <td>PKR 1.88 crore to PKR 3.4 crore, subject to change</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Handover</td>\r\n      <td>Some units ready, others listed for March and June 2027</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Location</td>\r\n      <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n      <td>Installments available, confirm schedule with developer</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n      <td>High-rise living in a master-planned community</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n<p>Globe Residency is part of the wider Naya Nazimabad community. The source page does not publish a tower layout, the number of floors or the number of units. These details should be confirmed through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Globe Residency</h2>\r\n<p>The listings show 2 bedroom DD apartments of about 1,249 square feet and 3 bedroom DD apartments of about 1,750 square feet. Several are described as corner units with park views. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Globe Residency should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes and sizes should be confirmed with the developer.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n<p>No floor plan is published on the source page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n<p>Listings show apartments at roughly PKR 1.88 crore to PKR 3.4 crore, or about PKR 14,571 to PKR 19,429 per square foot, depending on the unit. These are agency listings and not an official developer price list. Buyers searching for a Globe Residency apartment price or booking amount should request the current authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt. They should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Globe Residency are published on the source page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n<p>Listings show some Globe Residency units as ready for possession and others with possession dates in March 2027 and June 2027. Possession dates differ by unit and are not an official handover schedule, so buyers should confirm the date for their specific unit in writing.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 111, 1, 'publish', 'Globe Residency | Luxury Properties', 'Explore Globe Residency. Discover luxury residences, pricing, master plan, and world-class amenities.', 'Globe Residency, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-16 12:58:49', '2026-11-16 13:06:08'),
(181, 'Stadium View Residencia', 'stadium-view-residencia', '<p>Stadium View Residencia is positioned for buyers who want a modern apartment with a stadium view inside a gated township, on a 48 month installment plan. The listing describes units on floors 2 to 16, many of them park and boulevard facing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because the listing data comes from a real estate agency, buyers should treat prices, floors and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <th>Feature</th>\r\n    <th>Details</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Developer</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad (Javedan Corporation Limited, Arif Habib Group)</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Property Type</td>\r\n    <td>Residential apartments, with a commercial basement and ground-floor showrooms</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n    <td>2 bed lounge and 2 bed DD / 3 bed lounge (currently listed)</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Apartment Sizes</td>\r\n    <td>About 896 sq. ft and 1,249 sq. ft, as listed</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Price Range (listed)</td>\r\n    <td>PKR 1.61 crore to PKR 2.31 crore, subject to change</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Handover</td>\r\n    <td>Not published</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Location</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n    <td>48 month installment plan (as listed), confirm schedule with developer</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n    <td>High-rise living in a master-planned community</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Stadium View Residencia is part of the wider Naya Nazimabad community. The listing describes a tower of 18 floors with a commercial basement and ground-floor showrooms below the apartments. The tower layout and the number of units should be confirmed through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Stadium View Residencia</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The listing shows two currently available layouts:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>2 bed lounge: about 896 sq. ft, listed at PKR 1.61 crore (about PKR 18,000 per sq. ft).</li>\r\n  <li>2 bed DD / 3 bed lounge: about 1,249 sq. ft, listed at PKR 2.31 crore (about PKR 18,500 per sq. ft).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The project page also mentions 4 bed lounge layouts, but these are not in the current listing. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Stadium View Residencia should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No floor plan is published on the source page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Listings show apartments at about PKR 1.61 crore to PKR 2.31 crore, or roughly PKR 18,000 to PKR 18,500 per square foot. These are agency listings and not an official developer price list. Booking is listed as open, with one listing mentioning a 10% booking amount.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should request the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt, and should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Stadium View Residencia are published on the source page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published for Stadium View Residencia. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer’s official documentation.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 112, 1, 'publish', 'Stadium View Residencia Naya Nazimabad: 2 & 3 Bed Flats', 'Stadium View Residencia in Naya Nazimabad offers 2 bed lounge and 2 bed DD apartments with Cricket Stadium views on a 48-month plan. See sizes and location.', 'Stadium View Residencia Naya Nazimabad, Stadium View Residencia Karachi, Stadium View Residencia, Naya Nazimabad apartments', NULL, '2026-11-16 13:07:41', '2026-11-17 06:56:14'),
(182, 'Vision Tower', 'vision-tower', '<p>Vision Tower is positioned for business owners and investors who want a shop, an office or a large hall inside a gated township with a residential population. The mix of showrooms, office space and event space suits retail, corporate and hospitality use.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because the listing data comes from a real estate agency, buyers should treat prices, sizes and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <th>Feature</th>\r\n    <th>Details</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Developer</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad (Javedan Corporation Limited, Arif Habib Group)</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Property Type</td>\r\n    <td>Commercial</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n    <td>Shops, offices, restaurant and hall spaces</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Unit Sizes</td>\r\n    <td>About 404 to 2,160 sq. ft, as listed</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Price Range (listed)</td>\r\n    <td>PKR 1.62 crore to PKR 5.4 crore, subject to change</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Handover</td>\r\n    <td>Not published</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Location</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n    <td>Installments available, confirm schedule with developer</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n    <td>Commercial tower in a master-planned community</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Vision Tower is part of the wider Naya Nazimabad community. The listing describes ground-floor showrooms, four upper floors for offices and event space, and a rooftop. The tower layout and the number of units should be confirmed through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Commercial Units in Vision Tower</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The listing shows the following layouts:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Commercial office or space: about 648 to 790 sq. ft, listed at PKR 1.62 to 1.97 crore.</li>\r\n  <li>Commercial shop: about 404 to 621 sq. ft, listed at PKR 2.57 to 3.98 crore.</li>\r\n  <li>Restaurant or hall: about 2,160 sq. ft, listed at PKR 4.43 to 4.54 crore.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers seeking shops for sale in Vision Tower or offices for sale in Naya Nazimabad should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No floor plan is published on the source page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Listings show commercial units at about PKR 1.62 crore to PKR 5.4 crore, or roughly PKR 20,500 to PKR 64,000 per square foot, depending on the unit type and floor. Shops on the lower floors are priced much higher per square foot than office space.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>These are agency listings and not an official developer price list. Buyers should request the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt, and should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Vision Tower are published on the source page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published for Vision Tower. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer’s official documentation.</p>', 1, 0, 1, 113, 1, 'publish', 'Vision Tower Naya Nazimabad: Shops, Offices & Halls Karachi', 'Vision Tower in Naya Nazimabad offers ground-floor showrooms, offices, restaurant and event halls with a rooftop, on installments. See sizes and location.', 'Vision Tower Naya Nazimabad, Vision Tower Karachi, Vision Tower, Naya Nazimabad commercial', '/images/projects/1794898860_hero_1.jpg', '2026-11-17 07:01:00', '2026-11-17 07:10:21'),
(183, 'Voco Tower', 'voco-tower', '<p>Voco Tower is positioned for business owners and investors who want commercial space inside a gated township with a residential population. The tower is described as ground plus 4 floors, and the listing is marked as pre-booking, so the project has not been presented as launched.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because the listing data comes from a real estate agency, buyers should treat prices, floors and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <th>Feature</th>\r\n    <th>Details</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Developer</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad (Javedan Corporation Limited, Arif Habib Group)</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Property Type</td>\r\n    <td>Commercial</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Building Height</td>\r\n    <td>Ground + 4 floors</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n    <td>Not published</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n    <td>Not disclosed</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Handover</td>\r\n    <td>Not published</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Location</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n    <td>17 month installment plan listed for one unit, confirm with developer</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Status</td>\r\n    <td>Pre-booking</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Voco Tower is part of the wider Naya Nazimabad community. The listing describes a ground plus 4 commercial tower. The tower layout, the number of units and the floor allocation should be confirmed through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Commercial Units in Voco Tower</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The only unit shown in the listing is a commercial floor of about 2,188.53 sq. ft on the 2nd or 3rd floor, listed at PKR 5.47 crore (about PKR 25,000 per sq. ft). Other unit types and sizes have not been published.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers seeking commercial floors or offices in Voco Tower should request the official unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No floor plan is published on the source page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The listing shows one commercial unit at about PKR 5.47 crore, or roughly PKR 25,000 per square foot. This is an agency listing and not an official developer price list. The project is marked as pre-booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should request the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt, and should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Voco Tower are published on the source page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published for Voco Tower. Because the project is at the pre-booking stage, any date quoted today should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer’s official documentation.</p>', 1, 0, 1, 114, 1, 'publish', 'Voco Tower Naya Nazimabad: Commercial Tower Pre-Booking', 'Voco Tower is a ground plus 4 commercial tower in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, listed for pre-booking on installments. See details, location and how to enquire.', 'Voco Tower Naya Nazimabad, Voco Tower Karachi, Voco Tower, Naya Nazimabad commercial', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:14:03', '2026-11-17 07:23:21'),
(184, 'S.S Vision Enclave', 'ss-vision-enclave', '<p>At present, S.S Vision Enclave exists as an announced concept rather than an open project. It is described as a flagship commercial tower of ground plus 7 floors inside Naya Nazimabad, a gated, master-planned township of roughly 1,300 acres developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). That makes it different from a project buyers can inspect, price or book today.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Until official launch documentation is published, the accurate position is that buyers can register interest and wait for confirmed details. Nothing more should be promised, and no payment should change hands against this project name.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <th>Feature</th>\r\n    <th>Details</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Developer</td>\r\n    <td>Not published</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Property Type</td>\r\n    <td>Commercial</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Building Height</td>\r\n    <td>Ground + 7 floors</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n    <td>To be announced</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n    <td>Not disclosed</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Handover</td>\r\n    <td>To be announced</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Location</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n    <td>To be announced</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Status</td>\r\n    <td>To be announced, bookings not open</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No master plan has been published for S.S Vision Enclave. The tower layout, floor allocation and unit mix will only become clear if and when official documentation is released. Buyers should not assume that details of any other Naya Nazimabad commercial project apply to this one.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Commercial Units in S.S Vision Enclave</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No unit schedule has been published. Unit types, sizes and floor allocation are not confirmed, so buyers seeking shops, offices or commercial floors in S.S Vision Enclave should register interest and wait for the official unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No floor plan has been published. Floor plans for each unit category should be requested once the project is formally launched.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>There is no official S.S Vision Enclave price, because no price list has been published. Bookings have not opened. Buyers searching for an S.S Vision Enclave price or booking amount should register interest only, and should not pay any amount to any party claiming to collect bookings before an official launch.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents specific to S.S Vision Enclave have been published. Buyers should verify the position directly with the developer or the relevant authority once the project is formally launched.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession timeline exists for S.S Vision Enclave, because the project has not been formally launched. Any date quoted today would be speculation.</p>', 1, 1, 1, 115, 1, 'publish', 'S.S Vision Enclave Naya Nazimabad: G+7 Commercial Tower', 'S.S Vision Enclave is a planned ground plus 7 commercial tower in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi. See what is confirmed and how to register interest.', 'S.S Vision Enclave, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-17 07:28:24', '2026-11-17 07:35:05');
