(185, 'Naya Nazimabad 120 Yard House for Sale', 'naya-nazimabad-120-yard-house-for-sale', '<h2>Why a 120 Yard House in Naya Nazimabad Stands Out</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A 120 yard house in Naya Nazimabad sits inside a gated, master-planned township of roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road, about 2 km from North Nazimabad. The township is developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). The Naya Nazimabad website lists community facilities such as the Gymkhana, a Jama Masjid, Ali Habib Medical Center and a cricket stadium. A 120 yard house gives you a private home with its own entrance, instead of a shared apartment tower.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Facts: 120 Yard Houses in Naya Nazimabad</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>This table summarises what recent listings show for a Naya Nazimabad 120 sq yd house for sale.</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Detail</th>\r\n<th>Information</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Plot Size</td>\r\n<td>120 square yards (about 1,080 sq. ft of land)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Typical Construction</td>\r\n<td>Ground plus one floor</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Bedrooms</td>\r\n<td>3 to 4 bedrooms, usually with attached baths</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Blocks Seen in Listings</td>\r\n<td>A, B, C, D and M</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Listed Asking Prices</td>\r\n<td>Roughly PKR 2.8 crore to PKR 4.5 crore</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Road Widths Mentioned</td>\r\n<td>30 ft to 100 ft, depending on the location</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Condition</td>\r\n<td>Brand new and pre-owned houses</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>Prices vary by block, road width, view and condition, so treat these as a guide only.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>120 Yard Houses by Block</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Recent listings for a Naya Nazimabad 120 yard villa come from these blocks:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Block A:</strong> Several houses are described as near the Gymkhana, with park, masjid and market access nearby. Asking prices in listings run around PKR 4.2 to 4.5 crore.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Block B:</strong> Park facing 120 yard villas are listed, with three bedrooms and three baths.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Block C:</strong> Houses are often described as park facing, or near a masjid or football ground. Asking prices run around PKR 3.6 to 4.25 crore.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Block D:</strong> Brand new and corner houses are listed on 30 ft and 40 ft roads, with asking prices around PKR 3.5 to 3.6 crore.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Block M:</strong> A three-bedroom 120 yard house is listed at around PKR 2.84 crore, the lowest among recent listings.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Layout and Features of a 120 Yard House</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The common layout for a 120 yard house in Naya Nazimabad is ground plus one:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Ground floor with a drawing room, lounge, kitchen and one bedroom</li>\r\n<li>First floor with two or three bedrooms and a lounge or terrace</li>\r\n<li>Parking space for one car</li>\r\n<li>Extras in some listings, such as a west-open plot, a corner plot or a park-facing position</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Corner, west-open and park-facing houses are often listed at higher asking prices than standard ones.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Payment</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Recent listings show a Naya Nazimabad 120 yard house price from about PKR 2.84 crore to PKR 4.5 crore. Most of these are resale houses sold by individual owners, so the price is negotiable and the payment terms are set between buyer and seller. Buyers comparing a 120 yards house in Naya Nazimabad price should compare similar blocks, road widths and construction quality, and should ask for the full payment terms in writing before paying any token amount.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Checks Before You Buy</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Confirm that the seller is the registered owner and that the property documents are in order</li>\r\n<li>Check the lease or transfer status with the relevant society office</li>\r\n<li>Ask whether the house is a brand new build or a pre-owned unit, and inspect the construction quality</li>\r\n<li>Confirm the exact block, plot number and road width on site</li>\r\n<li>Pay only through traceable banking channels, with a written receipt</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A Naya Nazimabad 120 yard house for sale suits families who want a ground plus one home in a gated community, with a choice of blocks and budgets. Before comparing other Naya Nazimabad houses for sale, visit the block, check the documents and get the price and payment terms in writing.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 116, 1, 'publish', 'Naya Nazimabad 120 Yard House for Sale | Prices & Blocks 2027', 'Looking for a 120 yard house for sale in Naya Nazimabad? Compare Blocks A, B, C, D and M, price ranges, layouts and what to check before you buy.', 'Naya Nazimabad 120 yard house for sale,  120 yard house for sale in Naya Nazimabad, Naya Nazimabad houses for sale,  brand new house in Naya Nazimabad', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-11-17 07:50:22', '2026-11-17 08:01:57'),
(186, 'Naya Nazimabad Apartments for Sale', 'naya-nazimabad-apartments-for-sale', '<p>Naya Nazimabad is a gated, master-planned township covering roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road in Karachi, approximately 2 km from North Nazimabad. It is developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). The township offers community facilities, including the Gymkhana, Jama Masjid, Ali Habib Medical Center and a cricket stadium. For buyers comparing flats for sale in Naya Nazimabad, the main appeal is apartment living within a secure, well-planned community rather than a standalone tower on a busy main road.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Facts: Apartments in Naya Nazimabad</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>This table summarises the key details available on the township\'s project pages and recent property listings.</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <th>Detail</th>\r\n    <th>Information</th>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Location</td>\r\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n    <td>2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments, plus duplexes in selected towers</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Common Layouts</td>\r\n    <td>2 bed lounge, 2 bed DD, 3 bed lounge</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Typical Sizes</td>\r\n    <td>Approximately 900 to 1,960 sq. ft., depending on the tower</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Listed Prices</td>\r\n    <td>2 bed: approximately PKR 1.35 to 2.15 crore; 3 bed: approximately PKR 2 to 3.3 crore</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Payment</td>\r\n    <td>Installment plans of approximately 4 to 6 years are mentioned in listings</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td>Status</td>\r\n    <td>Ready, under-construction and pre-launch units</td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p>Prices vary depending on the tower, floor, view and payment plan. These figures should be treated as general market estimates rather than confirmed prices.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Main Apartment Projects in Naya Nazimabad</h2>\r\n\r\n<h3>Peace Apartments</h3>\r\n<p>Peace Apartments features high-rise towers offering 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments. Facilities include reserved parking and an amenities floor with a gym, community hall, library and gaming room.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Signature Tower</h3>\r\n<p>Located in Block A, next to the Gymkhana, Signature Tower offers 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments and duplexes. The tower is open on four sides and includes corner apartments.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Rahat Residency</h3>\r\n<p>Rahat Residency is a single-tower project offering park-facing 2 bedroom DD apartments, with car and bike parking for each unit.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Globe Residency</h3>\r\n<p>Globe Residency offers 2 and 3 bedroom DD apartments. Some units are listed as ready for possession, while others are available through installment plans.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Stadium View Residencia</h3>\r\n<p>This project offers 2 bed lounge and 3 bed lounge apartments with views of the Naya Nazimabad Cricket Stadium. Commercial spaces are also available below the residential floors.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Grace Tower</h3>\r\n<p>Grace Tower is a mixed-use development in the Business Enclave, featuring residential apartments above ground-floor retail shops.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Property availability changes frequently, so buyers should confirm which units are currently available before arranging a visit.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartment Sizes and Layouts</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Most apartments in Naya Nazimabad follow a few common layouts, depending on the project and tower.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>2 bed lounge or 2 bed DD:</strong> Approximately 900 to 1,500 sq. ft.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>3 bed lounge or 3 bed DD:</strong> Approximately 1,250 to 1,960 sq. ft.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>4 bed and duplex units:</strong> Available in selected towers, including Peace Apartments and Signature Tower.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Many residential towers offer features such as natural light, ventilation, reserved parking, lifts and standby generators. Corner, park-facing and road-facing apartments may also command higher prices.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Payment Plans</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Recent property listings indicate that Naya Nazimabad apartment prices start at approximately PKR 1.35 crore for smaller 2 bedroom lounge units and can exceed PKR 3 crore for larger 3 bedroom apartments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Several projects advertise installment plans ranging from approximately four to six years. These plans generally include an initial booking amount and monthly installments, with a possible possession payment at the time of handover.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Rates per square foot also vary depending on the project, apartment floor and location within the tower. Buyers comparing Naya Nazimabad apartments on installments should request a complete payment schedule in writing, covering:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Initial booking amount</li>\r\n  <li>Monthly installment amounts and payment dates</li>\r\n  <li>Possession charges, if applicable</li>\r\n  <li>Development and other additional charges</li>\r\n  <li>Total apartment price</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Checks Before You Book</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Before booking an apartment in Naya Nazimabad, buyers should complete the following checks:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Confirm the exact tower, floor and apartment number. Request the official unit schedule and floor plan.</li>\r\n  <li>Compare the quoted price with the developer\'s official project information or sales office.</li>\r\n  <li>Request the complete payment schedule, including possession and development charges.</li>\r\n  <li>Verify the relevant approvals and expected handover date for the specific tower.</li>\r\n  <li>Make payments only through traceable banking channels and obtain written receipts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Naya Nazimabad apartments for sale offer buyers a choice of 2, 3 and 4 bedroom flats within a gated residential community. With multiple apartment projects, different layouts, varying views and flexible payment options, buyers can compare properties according to their budget and requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before exploring other flats for sale in Karachi, visit the shortlisted towers, compare at least two or three projects, and obtain the final apartment price, payment plan and expected handover date in writing. This will help you make a more informed property investment decision.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 117, 1, 'publish', 'Naya Nazimabad Apartments for Sale | 2 & 3 Bed Prices 2027', 'Naya Nazimabad apartments for sale 2 and 3 bedroom flats, price ranges, installment options and top projects like Peace, Rahat and Signature Tower.', 'Naya Nazimabad apartments for sale,  apartments for sale in Naya Nazimabad,  Naya Nazimabad flats for sale, Naya Nazimabad apartments price', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-11-17 09:06:43', '2026-11-17 09:16:47'),
(187, 'Naya Nazimabad Villa for Sale', 'naya-nazimabad-villa-for-sale', '<p>Naya Nazimabad is a gated, master-planned township covering roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road in Karachi, approximately 2 km from North Nazimabad. It is developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). The township\'s website lists community facilities such as the Gymkhana, Jama Masjid, Ali Habib Medical Center and a cricket stadium. A villa in Naya Nazimabad offers families a private home with its own entrance, parking and terrace within a secure residential community.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Facts: Villas in Naya Nazimabad</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>This table summarises the key details available in recent listings for villas for sale in Naya Nazimabad.</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Detail</th>\r\n<th>Information</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Villa Sizes</td>\r\n<td>120, 160, 240 and 400 sq. yards</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Blocks Seen in Listings</td>\r\n<td>A, B, C, D, K, L, M, N and P</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Typical Construction</td>\r\n<td>Ground plus one floor</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Bedrooms</td>\r\n<td>3 to 4 in smaller villas, and up to 6 or more in larger properties</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Condition</td>\r\n<td>Brand new and pre-owned villas</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Listed Prices</td>\r\n<td>Approximately PKR 3.5 crore for 120 sq. yards to PKR 13 crore for 400 sq. yards</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p>Prices vary depending on the block, road width, property view and construction condition. These figures should be treated as general market estimates.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Villa Sizes and Price Ranges</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Recent property listings indicate the following asking prices for villas in Naya Nazimabad, depending on their size and features:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>120 sq. yard villa:</strong> Approximately PKR 3.5 to 4.5 crore, generally featuring 3 to 4 bedrooms.</li>\r\n<li><strong>160 sq. yard villa:</strong> Approximately PKR 4 to 5.9 crore, generally featuring 4 bedrooms.</li>\r\n<li><strong>240 sq. yard villa or bungalow:</strong> Approximately PKR 6 to 7.8 crore, with 4 to 6 bedrooms.</li>\r\n<li><strong>400 sq. yard house:</strong> A recent listing indicates an asking price of approximately PKR 13 crore, with 4 to 8 bedrooms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>A 120 sq. yard villa can suit a family looking for a compact private home, while a 240 sq. yard bungalow offers more space for larger families or joint-family living, including additional bedrooms and lounges.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Villas by Block</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Recent listings for villas in Naya Nazimabad cover several residential blocks, each offering different property features and locations.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Block A</h3>\r\n<p>Villas in Block A are often advertised as being near the Gymkhana, park-facing or west-open. Asking prices are generally among the higher ones in the township.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Block B</h3>\r\n<p>Block B features listings for park-facing villas, particularly in the 120 sq. yard category.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Block C</h3>\r\n<p>Block C offers several brand-new and ready-to-move-in villas. Listings often highlight locations near a mosque, park or football ground, with property sizes including 120, 160 and 240 sq. yards.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Block D and Other Blocks</h3>\r\n<p>Block D features listings for brand-new villas and corner bungalows. Residential plots and houses are also available in Blocks K, L, M, N and P.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Layout and Features of a Naya Nazimabad Villa</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Most villas in Naya Nazimabad follow a ground-plus-one-floor layout, providing separate living and sleeping spaces for families.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Ground Floor:</strong> Generally includes a drawing room, dining area, lounge, kitchen and, in some villas, one bedroom.</li>\r\n<li><strong>First Floor:</strong> Usually features the remaining bedrooms, an additional lounge and a terrace or balcony.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Car Parking:</strong> Dedicated parking space within the property plot.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Property Options:</strong> Some villas offer west-open, corner or park-facing locations, while selected listings feature a one-unit design.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Corner, west-open and park-facing villas are often advertised at higher asking prices than standard properties of similar sizes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Payment</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Most villas for sale in Naya Nazimabad are resale properties offered by individual owners. Therefore, prices are generally negotiable, and payment terms are agreed upon between the buyer and seller. Some property listings also mention the possibility of bank financing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers comparing a Naya Nazimabad bungalow for sale should evaluate properties with similar plot sizes, locations and construction standards. Before paying any token amount, request written confirmation of the complete payment terms, including:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Final agreed property price</li>\r\n<li>Token or booking amount</li>\r\n<li>Payment schedule and remaining balance</li>\r\n<li>Transfer and documentation charges</li>\r\n<li>Expected possession and transfer date</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Checks Before You Buy</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Before purchasing a villa in Naya Nazimabad, complete the following checks to reduce the risk of property disputes or unexpected expenses:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Confirm that the seller is the registered owner and verify that all property documents are genuine and complete.</li>\r\n<li>Check the lease or transfer status with the relevant society office.</li>\r\n<li>Confirm whether the villa is brand new or pre-owned and inspect its construction quality.</li>\r\n<li>Verify the exact block, plot number, plot size and road width during an on-site visit.</li>\r\n<li>Inspect the property\'s structure, plumbing, electrical systems and finishing.</li>\r\n<li>Make payments only through traceable banking channels and obtain a written receipt for every transaction.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A Naya Nazimabad villa for sale can be a suitable option for families looking for a private ground-plus-one-floor home within a gated residential community. With different property sizes, residential blocks and price ranges, buyers can compare options according to their family requirements and budget.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before exploring other houses for sale in Karachi, visit your shortlisted blocks, inspect the villa, verify its ownership documents and obtain the final price and payment terms in writing. Taking these steps can help you make a more informed property purchase decision.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 118, 1, 'publish', 'Naya Nazimabad Villa for Sale | 120, 240 & 400 Yard Prices', 'Browse Naya Nazimabad villas for sale: 120, 160, 240 and 400 yard houses, price ranges by size, layouts and what to check before you buy.', 'Naya Nazimabad villa for sale, villa for sale in Naya Nazimabad, Naya Nazimabad villas for sale Karachi', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-11-17 09:33:27', '2026-11-17 09:47:33'),
(188, 'Naya Nazimabad Plots for Sale', 'naya-nazimabad-plots-for-sale', '<p>Naya Nazimabad is a gated, master-planned township covering roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road in Karachi, approximately 2 km from North Nazimabad. It is developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). The township\'s website lists community facilities such as the Gymkhana, Jama Masjid, Ali Habib Medical Center and a cricket stadium. A residential plot in Naya Nazimabad gives buyers the opportunity to build a home according to their own design within a secure community featuring planned roads and parks.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Facts: Plots in Naya Nazimabad</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>This table summarises the key details available in recent listings for plots for sale in Naya Nazimabad.</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Detail</th>\r\n<th>Information</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Plot Sizes</td>\r\n<td>120, 160, 240 and 400 sq. yards</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Blocks Seen in Listings</td>\r\n<td>A, C, D, M and N, along with other blocks in the township</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Road Widths Mentioned</td>\r\n<td>30 ft to 40 ft and wider in some blocks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Plot Positions</td>\r\n<td>Standard, corner, double corner, west-open and park-facing</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Typical Use</td>\r\n<td>Residential, subject to the society\'s approved building plan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Listed Prices</td>\r\n<td>Approximately PKR 1.4 crore for a 120 sq. yard plot in newer blocks to PKR 2.8 crore in Block A</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p>Plot prices vary depending on the block, size, road width and location within the block. These figures should be treated as general market estimates rather than confirmed selling prices.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Plot Sizes and Price Ranges</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Recent listings and area price guides indicate the following asking prices for residential plots in Naya Nazimabad:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>120 sq. yard plots:</strong> Approximately PKR 1.4 to 2.8 crore, depending on the block and plot position.</li>\r\n<li><strong>160 sq. yard plots:</strong> Approximately PKR 1.4 to 2.6 crore, according to area price guides.</li>\r\n<li><strong>240 sq. yard plots:</strong> Approximately PKR 1.55 to 3.6 crore, according to area price guides.</li>\r\n<li><strong>400 sq. yard plots:</strong> Approximately PKR 3.25 to 4.5 crore, according to area price guides.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Individual property listings may fall outside these price ranges. Buyers should compare multiple plots of similar sizes and positions within the same block before making a decision.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Plots by Block</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Recent listings for residential plots in Naya Nazimabad cover several blocks, with different price ranges and location advantages.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Block A</h3>\r\n<p>Block A features premium 120 sq. yard residential plots, with one recent listing quoting an asking price of approximately PKR 2.8 crore.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Block D</h3>\r\n<p>Block D offers 120 sq. yard plots along 40 ft roads. Recent listings include west-open and double-corner plots priced at approximately PKR 2.55 crore.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Block M</h3>\r\n<p>A 120 sq. yard west-open residential plot in Block M has been listed at approximately PKR 1.52 crore, with a 30 ft road.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Block N</h3>\r\n<p>Block N features 120 sq. yard residential plots listed at approximately PKR 1.38 crore. Some listings describe plots near the main entrance, with possession expected soon.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Block C</h3>\r\n<p>Block C offers residential plots in different sizes and locations, with some listings highlighting their convenient positioning within the township.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Newer blocks are generally advertised at lower prices than more developed areas. However, buyers should verify the development status, possession availability and expected completion dates directly with the relevant society office.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>What Affects the Price of a Plot?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Several factors influence the asking price of a residential plot in Naya Nazimabad.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Block and Development Status:</strong> More established blocks are generally priced higher than newer or less developed areas.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Plot Position:</strong> Corner, double-corner, west-open and park-facing plots often carry higher asking prices than standard plots.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Road Width:</strong> Plots located on 40 ft roads are generally listed at higher prices than comparable plots on 30 ft roads.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Dues and Possession:</strong> Fully paid plots and properties with possession available may have different asking prices from plots with outstanding payments or pending possession.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Building on Your Plot</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Residential plots in Naya Nazimabad must comply with the building plans and regulations established by the society. Before purchasing a plot, buyers should contact the society office to understand the applicable construction requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Important building regulations to confirm include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Permitted covered area and plot coverage limits</li>\r\n<li>Maximum number of floors allowed</li>\r\n<li>Required front, rear and side setbacks</li>\r\n<li>Approved building design and architectural requirements</li>\r\n<li>Construction approval and plan submission process</li>\r\n<li>Applicable construction fees and other charges</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Understanding these requirements before purchasing can help ensure that your proposed home design, construction plans and overall budget comply with the society\'s regulations.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Checks Before You Buy</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Before purchasing a residential plot in Naya Nazimabad, complete the following checks to protect your investment:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Confirm that the seller is the registered owner and verify that the plot file and ownership documents are genuine and complete.</li>\r\n<li>Check the allotment, possession and transfer status with the relevant society office.</li>\r\n<li>Confirm that all outstanding dues have been paid and request written proof of payments.</li>\r\n<li>Verify the exact block, plot number, plot size, road width and position through an on-site visit.</li>\r\n<li>Check whether the plot is ready for possession and construction.</li>\r\n<li>Make payments only through traceable banking channels and obtain written receipts for every transaction.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>Final Thoughts</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Naya Nazimabad plots for sale offer buyers an opportunity to build their own homes within a gated residential community. With different plot sizes, residential blocks, locations and price ranges, buyers can select a property according to their construction requirements and budget.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before comparing other plots for sale in Karachi, visit your shortlisted blocks, inspect the plot location, verify the ownership and possession documents, and obtain the final price and payment terms in writing. Proper research and verification can help you make a more informed property investment decision.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 119, 1, 'publish', 'Naya Nazimabad Plots for Sale | 120, 160, 240 & 400 Yard Rates', 'Browse Naya Nazimabad plots for sale: 120, 160, 240 and 400 yard plots, price ranges by block, corner and west-open options, and what to check first.', 'Naya Nazimabad Plots for Sale,  Naya Nazimabad corner plot for sale,  Naya Nazimabad Block N plots,', '/images/hero/slide-1.jpg', '2026-11-17 10:54:54', '2026-11-17 11:14:59'),
(189, 'Goldcrest Bay Sands', 'goldcrest-bay-sands', '<p>Goldcrest Bay Sands is positioned for buyers who want a sea-view apartment inside a waterfront community in DHA Phase 8. The project offers compact 1-bedroom units as well as large 2- and 3-bedroom apartments, with customisable interiors described for Goldcrest Bay Sands 2.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because the available information comes from project material rather than a single official price list, buyers should treat prices, sizes, and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Details</th></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Developer</td><td>Giga Group</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Property Type</td><td>Residential apartments and duplex townhouses</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Unit Types</td><td>1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Unit Sizes</td><td>About 862 sq. ft. to over 2,700 sq. ft., as quoted</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Price Range (Quoted)</td><td>From about PKR 3.45 crore to over PKR 8 crore, subject to change</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Handover</td><td>Not published</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Location</td><td>HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8 Extension, Karachi</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Payment Plan</td><td>About 10% down payment with 3- to 5-year installment plans; confirm with developer</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td>Lifestyle</td><td>Waterfront high-rise living</td></tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Goldcrest Bay Sands is part of the wider HMR Waterfront community. Goldcrest Bay Sands 2 is described as a 33-storey development. Different material gives different tower counts for the project, so the number of towers and the layout should be confirmed through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Goldcrest Bay Sands</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The project material shows the following layouts:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><p><strong>1-bedroom apartments:</strong> About 862 to 896 sq. ft., with partial sea views, quoted from about PKR 3.45 to 3.6 crore.</p></li>\r\n<li><p><strong>2-bedroom apartments:</strong> About 1,581 sq. ft., with a private plunge pool in Goldcrest Bay Sands 2.</p></li>\r\n<li><p><strong>3-bedroom apartments:</strong> About 2,739 sq. ft. and larger, with plunge pools and ocean views in Goldcrest Bay Sands 2.</p></li>\r\n<li><p><strong>Duplex townhouses:</strong> Quoted on a four-year plan with 10% down.</p></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Goldcrest Bay Sands should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No floor plan is published in the material reviewed here. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Quoted prices include about PKR 3.45 crore for an 862 sq. ft. 1-bedroom apartment (about PKR 40,000 per sq. ft.) and over PKR 8 crore for larger plunge-pool apartments, for example, about PKR 8.09 crore for a 2-bedroom unit.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>DHA allotment and utility connection charges are mentioned as extra in at least one source. These are not an official developer price list, so buyers should:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><p>Request a written rate sheet.</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Obtain a complete list of additional charges.</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Ask for an official booking receipt.</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Avoid paying any amount to an unverified agent.</p></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Goldcrest Bay Sands are published in the material reviewed here. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date has been published for Goldcrest Bay Sands. Any date quoted should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer’s official documentation.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 120, 1, 'publish', 'Goldcrest Bay Sands DHA Phase 8: Price & Payment Plan', 'Goldcrest Bay Sands at HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8 offers 1, 2 and 3 bed sea view apartments from 10% down. See price, plan and location.', 'Goldcrest Bay Sands, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-17 11:42:23', '2026-11-18 05:21:23'),
(190, 'Saima Marina Residence', 'saima-marina-residence', '<p>Saima Marina Residence is positioned for buyers who want a sea-view apartment or penthouse inside a gated waterfront community in DHA Phase 8. Smaller apartments suit individuals, couples and small families, while 3-bedroom apartments and 4-bedroom penthouses give larger families more space.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because most of the pricing information comes from third-party quotes rather than a published price list, buyers should treat prices, sizes and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential apartments and penthouses</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments, 4-bedroom penthouses</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>Not disclosed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Price Range (Quoted)</td>\r\n<td>From about PKR 3.4 crore (1 bed) to about PKR 11 crore (4 bed), subject to change</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Not confirmed, confirm with developer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Flexible plan described, quoted installments of about 56 to 60 months, confirm with developer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Waterfront high-rise living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Marina Residence is part of the wider HMR Waterfront community, beside the Emaar development. Some material describes the project as a 40-storey tower, but this has not been confirmed on the project page, so the floor count, layout and number of units should be confirmed through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments and Penthouses in Saima Marina Residence</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The project page lists four residence types:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><p><strong>1-bedroom apartments:</strong> Quoted at about PKR 3.4 to 3.75 crore, some west open with partial sea views.</p></li>\r\n<li><p><strong>2-bedroom apartments:</strong> From about 1,100 sq. ft., quoted at about PKR 4.34 to 5.8 crore.</p></li>\r\n<li><p><strong>3-bedroom apartments:</strong> About 2,346 sq. ft. in one quote, with 4 bathrooms.</p></li>\r\n<li><p><strong>4-bedroom penthouses:</strong> Spacious penthouse units, quoted at about PKR 11 crore for a corner seafront unit.</p></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Saima Marina Residence should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Floor plans are available for the 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments and for the 4-bedroom penthouse, together with a project brochure. Buyers should request them from the developer’s authorised sales channel along with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No official Saima Marina Residence price list is published on the project page. Quoted prices range from about PKR 3.4 crore for a 1-bedroom apartment to about PKR 11 crore for a 4-bedroom penthouse, depending on size, floor and view.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should take the following precautions before booking:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><p>Request a written and updated rate sheet.</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Confirm the total price and all additional charges.</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Obtain an official booking receipt.</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Verify the authorised sales representative.</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Do not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Saima Marina Residence are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date is published on the project page. One quote mentions immediate possession for a 2-bedroom unit, while another lists balloon payments between October 2026 and 2029.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Possession differs by unit, so buyers should get the possession date for their specific unit in writing from the developer before making a booking or payment.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 121, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Marina Residence DHA Phase 8: Price & Payment Plan', 'Saima Marina Residence by Saima Builders offers 1 to 3 bed apartments and 4 bed penthouses at HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8. See amenities and location.', 'Saima Marina Residence, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-18 05:22:19', '2026-11-18 05:30:52'),
(191, 'Saima Waterfront', 'saima-waterfront', '<p>Saima Waterfront is positioned for buyers who want a waterfront home with quick access to Clifton, Shahrah-e-Faisal and the business district. The project page lists South City Hospital, Dolmen Mall Clifton and Clifton Beach as a short drive away, and describes proximity to Shahrah-e-Faisal and I.I. Chundrigar Road for business and commercial travellers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because the available information comes from project material rather than a published price list, buyers should treat prices, sizes and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Saima Builders</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential apartments and penthouses</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments, 4-bedroom penthouses</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Total Land Size</td>\r\n<td>Not disclosed</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Price Range (Quoted)</td>\r\n<td>Varies widely by unit, from about PKR 3.3 crore for a 1-bedroom, subject to change</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Not confirmed, confirm with developer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>HMR Waterfront, Karachi, adjacent to Emaar Oceanfront</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Flexible plan described, quoted 10% down with about 53 to 60 monthly installments, confirm with developer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Waterfront high-rise living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Saima Waterfront is part of the wider HMR Waterfront community. Some material describes it as a 40-storey tower, but this has not been confirmed on the project page, so the floor count, layout and number of units should be confirmed through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments and Penthouses in Saima Waterfront</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The project page lists four residence types:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><p><strong>1-bedroom apartments:</strong> Quoted at about 1,020 sq. ft. in one listing.</p></li>\r\n<li><p><strong>2-bedroom apartments:</strong> With sea views in some listings.</p></li>\r\n<li><p><strong>3-bedroom apartments:</strong> Quoted as full sea-facing in some listings.</p></li>\r\n<li><p><strong>4-bedroom penthouses:</strong> Quoted at about 3,500 sq. ft. in one listing.</p></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Saima Waterfront should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes and quoted sizes differ.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Floor plans are available for the 1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments and the 4-bedroom penthouse, together with a project brochure. Buyers should request them from the developer’s authorised sales channel along with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No official Saima Waterfront price list is published on the project page. Quoted prices differ widely by size, floor and view. A 1-bedroom unit is quoted from about PKR 3.3 crore, and a full sea-facing 3-bedroom unit is quoted at about PKR 7.7 crore.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before booking, buyers should take the following precautions:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><p>Request a written and updated rate sheet.</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Confirm the total price and all additional charges.</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Obtain an official booking receipt.</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Verify the authorised sales representative.</p></li>\r\n<li><p>Avoid paying any amount to an unverified agent.</p></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Saima Waterfront are published on the project page. The project is described as offering freehold properties, which buyers should confirm with the developer along with the title documents.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should ask for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No possession date is published on the project page. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer’s official documentation and should get the possession date for their specific unit in writing.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 122, 1, 'publish', 'Saima Waterfront HMR Waterfront Karachi: Price & Location', 'Saima Waterfront by Saima Builders offers 1 to 3 bed apartments and 4 bed penthouses beside Emaar Oceanfront, near Clifton. See price and plan.', 'Saima Waterfront by Saima Builders', NULL, '2026-11-18 05:40:21', '2026-11-18 05:52:14'),
(192, 'H&S Residence', 'hs-residence', '<h2>H&S Residence</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>H&S Residence is positioned for buyers who want a design-led sea view apartment inside HMR Waterfront. The exterior façade follows wavy, sweeping lines inspired by the Nami concept, and the interiors follow the Shuichu concept, with wavy ceilings inspired by coral reefs and furniture colours that reflect the hues of the sea.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because pricing comes from project material rather than a published price list, buyers should treat prices, sizes and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>H&S Real Estate Group (H&S Properties)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential apartments and penthouses, with double-height retail shops</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments, penthouses</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Building</td>\r\n<td>39-storey tower</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Architect</td>\r\n<td>Nikken Sekkei (Japan)</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Starting Price (quoted)</td>\r\n<td>From about PKR 3.4 to 3.76 crore, subject to change</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Expected 2029, confirm with developer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>HMR Waterfront, Zone D, DHA Phase 8, Abdul Sattar Edhi Avenue, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>About 5% down payment, installments of about 1% per month over 5 years, confirm with developer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Waterfront high-rise living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>H&S Residence is part of the wider HMR Waterfront community and sits adjacent to other HMR Waterfront towers. The project page describes a 39-storey tower with double-height retail shops and an amenity floor. The tower layout and the number of units should be confirmed through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in H&S Residence</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The project page lists four residence types:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1 bedroom apartments: quoted from about PKR 3.4 crore</li>\r\n<li>2 bedroom apartments: with spacious layouts and private balconies</li>\r\n<li>3 bedroom apartments: with private plunge pools on the terrace</li>\r\n<li>4 bedroom apartments and penthouses: with private plunge pools on the terrace</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>All units from 1 to 4 bedrooms are described as having floor-to-ceiling windows, private balconies facing the Arabian Sea and fitted kitchens. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in H&S Residence should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Floor plans are available for the 1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments, together with a project brochure. Buyers should request them from the developer’s authorised sales channel along with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The project page quotes a starting price of about PKR 3.4 to 3.76 crore for 1 bedroom apartments. No full price list for larger units is published, so buyers should request a written rate sheet, a list of all extra charges and a booking receipt, and should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for H&S Residence are published on the project page. The project is described as offering freehold properties, which buyers should confirm with the developer along with the title documents. Buyers should ask for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The project page states that handover is expected in 2029. This is an expected date, and buyers should confirm the date for their unit in writing before relying on it.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 123, 1, 'publish', 'H&S Residence HMR Waterfront: Price & 5% Down Payment Plan', 'H&S Residence is a 39-storey tower at HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8, designed by Nikken Sekkei. See price from PKR 3.4 crore, payment plan and location.', 'H&S Residence, H&S Residence HMR Waterfront, H&S Residence DHA Phase 8, H&S Residence Karachi', NULL, '2026-11-18 06:41:48', '2026-11-18 07:07:52');
INSERT INTO `pages` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `body`, `in_navbar`, `show_in_projects`, `show_in_commercial`, `navbar_order`, `is_published`, `status`, `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `meta_keywords`, `og_image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(193, 'Beach Terraces', 'beach-terraces', '<p>Beach Terraces is positioned for buyers who want a resort-style apartment with a private plunge pool inside a gated waterfront community in DHA Phase 8. The project offers partial and full sea views, large terraces and west-open units, with amenities placed on the same floor for easy access.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because the available information comes from project material rather than a single published price list, buyers should treat prices, sizes and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Project Highlights</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n    <tbody><tr>\r\n        <th>Feature</th>\r\n        <th>Details</th>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Developer</td>\r\n        <td>Metro Group Builders and Developers (as named in project material)</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Property Type</td>\r\n        <td>Residential apartments</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n        <td>1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Building</td>\r\n        <td>Ground + 39 floors</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Price Range (quoted)</td>\r\n        <td>From about PKR 3.45 crore to over PKR 20 crore, subject to change</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Handover</td>\r\n        <td>Quoted as December 2030, confirm with developer</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Location</td>\r\n        <td>Plot 12, HMR Waterfront, Zone D, DHA Phase 8, Karachi</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n        <td>5-year flexible plan quoted (about 50 months), confirm with developer</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n        <td>Waterfront high-rise living</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h3>Master Plan and Development Framework</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Beach Terraces is part of the wider HMR Waterfront community. The tower is described as Ground + 39 floors, with amenities placed on the same floor for easy access. The tower layout and the number of units should be confirmed through the developer’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Apartments in Beach Terraces</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Project material shows the following layouts, with a private plunge pool in each unit:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>1 bedroom apartments:</strong> About 1,079 to 1,292 sq. ft, with partial sea views, quoted from about PKR 3.45 to 4.8 crore.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>2 bedroom apartments:</strong> About 1,265 sq. ft and larger, quoted from about PKR 4.34 crore, with partial and full sea view options.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>3 bedroom apartments:</strong> About 2,345 to 2,897 sq. ft, quoted from about PKR 8.9 to 11 crore.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>4 bedroom apartments:</strong> About 3,641 to 5,513 sq. ft, quoted from about PKR 13.8 to 20.9 crore.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Quoted sizes and prices differ between sources, so buyers seeking apartments for sale in Beach Terraces should request the official unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Floor Plan</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No floor plan is published in the material reviewed here. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Price and Booking Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Quoted prices range from about PKR 3.45 crore for a 1 bedroom apartment to over PKR 20 crore for a large 4 bedroom unit, depending on size, floor and view. These are not an official developer price list.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should request the following before booking:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li>A written and updated price list.</li>\r\n    <li>A detailed list of all additional charges.</li>\r\n    <li>An official payment plan.</li>\r\n    <li>A verified booking receipt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Do not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>NOC and Approval Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Beach Terraces are published in the material reviewed here. Some listings make approval claims, but these are unverified. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Possession Timeline</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The quoted handover date is December 2030. This is an expected date, and buyers should confirm the date for their unit in writing before relying on it.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 124, 1, 'publish', 'Beach Terraces by Metro HMR Waterfront: Price & Plan', 'Beach Terraces by Metro at HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8: a Ground+39 tower with private plunge pools. See price, 5-year plan and location.', 'Beach Terraces, Beach Terraces by Metro, Beach Terraces HMR Waterfront, Beach Terraces DHA Phase 8', NULL, '2026-11-18 12:01:57', '2026-11-18 12:15:20'),
(194, 'Park Grand Emaar', 'park-grand-emaar', '<p>Park Grand is positioned for buyers who want the space and privacy of a villa within a high-rise. Homes open to horizon views of the sea, with generous layouts, natural light, elegant finishes and a seamless indoor-outdoor flow. The architecture is described as having clean lines, powerful proportions and enduring materials. Park Grand sits within a gated, controlled environment at Emaar Oceanfront, which Emaar says is home to more than 1,000 families.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source, and confirm sizes, prices and plans with Emaar before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Key Project Highlights</h3>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n    <tbody><tr>\r\n        <th>Feature</th>\r\n        <th>Details</th>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Developer</td>\r\n        <td>Emaar Pakistan</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Property Type</td>\r\n        <td>Vertical villas (residential)</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Unit Types</td>\r\n        <td>2 to 5 bedroom villas in the sky</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Number of Residences</td>\r\n        <td>158</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Starting Size</td>\r\n        <td>From 2,575 sq. ft*</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Starting Price</td>\r\n        <td>From PKR 12.2 crore*</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Handover</td>\r\n        <td>Not published, confirm with developer</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Location</td>\r\n        <td>Emaar Oceanfront, Karachi</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n        <td>10% down payment, 65% in 10 quarterly installments, 25% on handover</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n    <tr>\r\n        <td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n        <td>Oceanfront gated community living</td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h3>Master Plan and Development Framework</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Park Grand is part of Emaar Oceanfront, a seafront gated community spread over 75 acres in Karachi, inspired by Dubai Marina. Emaar states that new projects at the community are set to be ready for occupancy starting 2026. The tower layout and unit allocation within Park Grand should be confirmed through Emaar’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Vertical Villas in Park Grand</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Park Grand offers 2 to 5 bedroom vertical villas, each with its own service entrance and expansive layouts. The official page quotes a starting size of 2,575 sq. ft*, and individual unit sizes, bedroom counts and floor plans should be confirmed on the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers seeking vertical villas in Karachi should request the current availability, since only 158 residences are planned.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Floor Plan</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>A project brochure is available for download on the official page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from Emaar’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Price and Booking Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists prices from PKR 12.2 crore* and states that booking is open through the \"Book Now\" and \"Register Interest\" options. The asterisk indicates that terms apply.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before booking, buyers should request the following:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li>A written and updated price list.</li>\r\n    <li>A detailed list of all additional charges.</li>\r\n    <li>Confirmation of the official payment plan.</li>\r\n    <li>An official booking receipt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>NOC and Approval Status</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Park Grand are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Emaar for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Possession Timeline</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>No handover date is published on the project page. The page shows a construction update dated October 2026, but buyers should rely only on dates given in Emaar’s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 125, 1, 'publish', 'Park Grand Emaar Oceanfront Vertical Villas Karachi', 'Park Grand by Emaar at Oceanfront Karachi offers 158 vertical villas, 2 to 5 bedrooms, from PKR 12.2 crore. See payment plan, amenities and location.', 'Park Grand Emaar, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-19 05:52:26', '2026-11-19 06:02:05'),
(195, 'Park Edge', 'park-edge', '<p>Park Edge is positioned for buyers who want an apartment with park and sea views inside a gated seafront community. The project focuses on landscape and community living, and is located at the heart of Emaar Oceanfront. Emaar says the community is home to more than 1,000 families, with new projects ready for occupancy starting 2026.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source, and confirm sizes, prices and plans with Emaar before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Emaar Pakistan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential apartments and penthouse</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>1 to 4 bedroom apartments and penthouse</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Building</td>\r\n<td>Twin tower project</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Starting Size</td>\r\n<td>From 1,400 sq. ft*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Starting Price</td>\r\n<td>From PKR 5.9 crore*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Scheduled completion 30 May 2028</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Emaar Oceanfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Flexible 3 year plan: 10% down payment, 14 installments of 6.42% each</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Gated seafront community living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Park Edge is a twin tower project at the heart of Emaar Oceanfront, a seafront gated community of about 75 acres in Karachi, inspired by Dubai Marina. The official page describes a design that focuses on landscape and community living, with two green parks at the project’s periphery. The tower layout and unit allocation should be confirmed through Emaar’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Park Edge</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Park Edge offers 1 to 4 bedroom apartments and a penthouse. The official page quotes a starting size of 1,400 sq. ft*, and individual unit sizes and layouts should be confirmed on the unit schedule. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Park Edge should request the current availability from the developer.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A project brochure is available for download on the official page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from Emaar’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists prices from PKR 5.9 crore* and states that booking is open through the “Book Now” and “Register Interest” options. The asterisk indicates that terms apply, so buyers should request the following before booking:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A written rate sheet.</li>\r\n<li>A list of all additional charges.</li>\r\n<li>A booking receipt.</li>\r\n<li>Confirmation of payment terms.</li>\r\n<li>Verification of the authorised sales agent.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Park Edge are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Emaar for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists a scheduled completion date of 30 May 2028, and shows construction updates through photographs. This is a scheduled date, and buyers should confirm the handover date for their unit in writing from Emaar.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 126, 1, 'publish', 'Park Edge Emaar Oceanfront: Apartments Karachi from 5.9 Crore', 'Park Edge by Emaar at Oceanfront, DHA Phase 8 offers 1 to 4 bed apartments and penthouses from PKR 5.9 crore on a 3-year plan. See completion and amenities.', 'Park Edge, luxury villas, properties', NULL, '2026-11-19 06:10:03', '2026-11-19 06:25:24'),
(196, 'The Views', 'the-views', '<p>The Views is positioned for buyers who want a sea-facing apartment in a gated seafront community, with views of the Arabian Sea and the city, and breathtaking sunsets. The page describes a stunning entrance, spacious interiors and sophisticated finishing. The project is located in DHA Phase 8, minutes from top schools and hospitals in Karachi.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source, and confirm sizes, prices and plans with Emaar before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Emaar Pakistan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom sea-facing apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Inventory</td>\r\n<td>Limited</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Starting Size</td>\r\n<td>From 1,320 sq. ft</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Starting Price</td>\r\n<td>From PKR 7.3 crore*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Scheduled occupancy 2026, confirm with developer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Emaar Oceanfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Not published, confirm with developer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Gated seafront community living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Views is part of Emaar Oceanfront, a seafront gated community of about 75 acres in Karachi, inspired by Dubai Marina. Emaar states that the community is home to more than 1,000 families, with new projects ready for occupancy starting 2026. The tower layout and unit allocation within The Views should be confirmed through Emaar’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in The Views</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The Views offers 1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom sea-facing apartments, in limited inventory. The official page quotes a starting size of 1,320 sq. ft, and individual unit sizes and layouts should be confirmed on the unit schedule. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in The Views should request the current availability from the developer, since only limited inventory is offered.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A project brochure is available for download on the official page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from Emaar’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists prices from PKR 7.3 crore* and states that booking is open through the “Book Now” and “Register Interest” options. The asterisk indicates that terms apply, so buyers should request the following before booking:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A written rate sheet.</li>\r\n<li>A list of all additional charges.</li>\r\n<li>A booking receipt.</li>\r\n<li>Confirmation of payment terms.</li>\r\n<li>Verification of the authorised sales agent.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for The Views are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Emaar for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists the scheduled completion as occupancy in 2026, and shows construction updates through photographs. No exact handover date is published, so buyers should rely only on dates given in Emaar’s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 127, 1, 'publish', 'The Views Emaar Oceanfront Karachi: Sea-Facing Apartments', 'The Views by Emaar at Oceanfront, DHA Phase 8 offers 1 to 4 bed sea-facing apartments from PKR 7.3 crore. See amenities, occupancy 2026 and location.', 'The Views', NULL, '2026-11-19 06:31:47', '2026-11-19 06:50:28'),
(197, 'Panorama Emaar', 'panorama-emaar', '<p>Panorama is positioned for families who want a sea-facing apartment in a high-rise within a gated seafront community. The page describes contemporary décor, expansive amenities and residences designed with the family in mind. The tower is strategically located in the heart of <a href=\"https://fsadvisory.pk/area/dha-phase-8\" target=\"_blank\">DHA Phase 8</a>, minutes away from Karachi’s top hotspots.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source, and confirm sizes, prices and plans with <a href=\"https://fsadvisory.pk/developer/emaar-pakistan\" target=\"_blank\">Emaar</a> before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody><tr>\r\n<th>Feature</th>\r\n<th>Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Developer</td>\r\n<td>Emaar Pakistan</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Property Type</td>\r\n<td>Residential apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Unit Types</td>\r\n<td>1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom sea-facing apartments</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Inventory</td>\r\n<td>Limited</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Starting Size</td>\r\n<td>From 1,547 sq. ft</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Starting Price</td>\r\n<td>From PKR 7.9 crore*</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Handover</td>\r\n<td>Scheduled occupancy 2026, confirm with developer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Location</td>\r\n<td>Emaar Oceanfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Payment Plan</td>\r\n<td>Not published, confirm with developer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>Lifestyle</td>\r\n<td>Gated seafront community living</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Panorama is part of Emaar Oceanfront, a seafront gated community of about 75 acres in Karachi, inspired by Dubai Marina. Emaar states that the community is home to more than 1,000 families, with new projects ready for occupancy starting 2026. The tower layout and unit allocation within Panorama should be confirmed through Emaar’s authorised sales channel.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Panorama</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Panorama offers 1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom sea-facing apartments, in limited inventory. The official page quotes a starting size of 1,547 sq. ft, and individual unit sizes and layouts should be confirmed on the unit schedule. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Panorama should request the current availability from the developer, since only limited inventory is offered.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Floor Plan</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A project brochure is available for download on the official page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from Emaar’s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists prices from PKR 7.9 crore* and states that booking is open through the “Book Now” and “Register Interest” options. The asterisk indicates that terms apply, so buyers should request the following before booking:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A written rate sheet.</li>\r\n<li>A list of all additional charges.</li>\r\n<li>A booking receipt.</li>\r\n<li>Confirmation of payment terms.</li>\r\n<li>Verification of the authorised sales agent.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Panorama are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Emaar for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Possession Timeline</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The official page lists the scheduled completion as occupancy in 2026, and shows a gallery of construction updates. No exact handover date is published, so buyers should rely only on dates given in Emaar’s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 128, 1, 'publish', 'Panorama Emaar Oceanfront Karachi: Sea-Facing Apartments', 'Panorama by Emaar at Oceanfront, DHA Phase 8: 1 to 4 bed sea-facing apartments from PKR 7.9 crore. See amenities, occupancy 2026 and location.', 'Panorama Emaar', NULL, '2026-11-19 06:52:34', '2026-11-20 13:00:18'),
(198, 'Creek Vista', 'creek-vista', '<p>Creek Vista is positioned as a premium residential development for buyers seeking spacious apartments in DHA Phase 8 Karachi. Its location within Creek City offers access to the wider DHA community, commercial facilities and recreational destinations.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The project features residential towers with different apartment layouts, designed to accommodate varying family requirements. Three-bedroom and four-bedroom apartments are among the commonly marketed property options.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The development also benefits from its setting near Karachi Creek and DHA Golf Club, offering selected apartments attractive surrounding views.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For buyers exploring apartments for sale in Creek Vista, factors such as apartment size, tower, floor level, orientation, condition and view should be considered before making a purchase.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Key Project Highlights</h2>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n    <thead>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <th>Feature</th>\r\n            <th>Details</th>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr><td>Project Name</td><td>Creek Vista / Creek Vistas Apartments</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Development Authority</td><td>DHA Karachi</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Project Category</td><td>Residential apartments</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Location</td><td>Khayaban-e-Shaheen and 16th Street, DHA Phase 8</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Community</td><td>Creek City</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Total Land Area</td><td>Approximately 16 acres</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Number of Towers</td><td>12</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Tower Height</td><td>16 floors each</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Total Residential Units</td><td>720</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Unit Types</td><td>3 and 4-bedroom apartments, penthouses</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Architecture and Consultancy</td><td>Meinhardt</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Parking</td><td>Two-level covered parking</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Elevators</td><td>Private high-speed lifts and service elevator</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Facilities</td><td>Clubhouse, swimming pool, gym and landscaped areas</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Project Status</td><td>Listed among DHA completed projects</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Payment Plan</td><td>Resale transactions; confirm individual seller terms</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Ownership / Transfer</td><td>Verify through DHA Karachi</td></tr>\r\n        <tr><td>Lifestyle</td><td>Premium community living</td></tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Creek Vista is part of Creek City, a larger residential development planned under the DHA Karachi framework. The community was designed around the concept of combining horizontal and vertical development with modern residential facilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>According to DHA Karachi, Creek Vista covers approximately 16 acres. Around one-quarter of the land is allocated to building structures, while the remaining area is used for water bodies, gardens and public amenities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The development comprises 12 residential towers, each featuring 16 floors. Every tower has 56 apartments and four penthouses, bringing the total residential inventory to 720 units.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The project was designed with input from Meinhardt, an international engineering and consultancy firm. Its planning emphasizes residential comfort, open spaces, security and access to shared recreational facilities.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The overall development framework makes Creek Vista a prominent residential component of Creek City in DHA Phase 8.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Apartments in Creek Vista</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Creek Vista offers spacious residential apartments designed for families looking for premium living in DHA Phase 8 Karachi.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The commonly marketed apartment categories include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><strong>3-Bedroom Apartments:</strong> Suitable for families seeking spacious bedrooms, living areas and practical residential layouts.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>4-Bedroom Apartments:</strong> Designed for larger families requiring additional bedrooms, generous living spaces and more accommodation.</li>\r\n    <li><strong>Penthouses:</strong> Exclusive upper-level residential units offering an alternative to standard apartment layouts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Available property listings indicate approximate apartment sizes of 3,249 to 3,760 sq. ft. for commonly marketed three and four-bedroom units. Actual covered areas depend on the specific apartment and its approved layout.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers considering Creek Vista apartments for sale should request the relevant floor plan, covered area, title documents and current availability before proceeding.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Creek Vista Floor Plans</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Creek Vista features multiple residential layouts designed to accommodate different family sizes and lifestyle requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The project offers three-bedroom and four-bedroom apartments, alongside penthouse residences. Layouts may include bedrooms with attached bathrooms, drawing and dining areas, family lounges, kitchens, balconies and servant quarters, depending on the unit.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Apartment layouts and covered areas can differ between towers and individual units.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should request the original floor plan and approved unit details before purchasing. They should also compare the usable area, bedroom arrangement, ventilation, orientation and views of available apartments.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Creek Vista Price and Booking Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Creek Vista is an established residential development listed among DHA Karachi\'s completed projects. Buyers generally explore available apartments through the resale market rather than a new developer launch.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Published property portal information has listed indicative prices of approximately PKR 4.7 crore to PKR 5.4 crore for selected three and four-bedroom apartments. However, individual resale advertisements also show higher asking prices, depending on size, floor, renovation, condition and view.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Therefore, these figures should be treated as indicative market advertisements, not fixed or official project prices.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers interested in purchasing an apartment in Creek Vista should request:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li>Current asking price and final negotiated price.</li>\r\n    <li>Exact apartment size and floor plan.</li>\r\n    <li>Tower and floor details.</li>\r\n    <li>Ownership and title documentation.</li>\r\n    <li>DHA transfer requirements and applicable charges.</li>\r\n    <li>Outstanding maintenance or utility dues.</li>\r\n    <li>Confirmation of vacant possession, where applicable.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>All property documents should be verified through the relevant DHA Karachi channels before making a payment.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Creek Vista NOC and Approval Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Creek Vista is listed on the official DHA Karachi website under its completed projects in Phase 8. The DHA website identifies Creek Vistas as part of Creek City and provides details about its residential development.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>DHA Karachi\'s published fee schedule also contains specific administrative provisions for Creek Vista, including mortgage NOC charges.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Buyers should nevertheless obtain and verify the relevant property-specific approval, allotment, ownership and transfer documents through DHA Karachi before purchasing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The applicable documentation should be checked against the particular apartment rather than relying solely on general project information.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Creek Vista Possession and Project Status</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Creek Vista is listed by DHA Karachi as a completed residential project.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Unlike newly launched apartment developments, Creek Vista is an established residential community where buyers can explore available resale apartments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Possession and occupancy conditions depend on the specific unit. Buyers should confirm whether an apartment is vacant, occupied or rented, and whether any outstanding dues or transfer requirements remain.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Before completing a transaction, buyers should arrange a physical inspection and obtain written confirmation of the possession and transfer arrangements.</p>', 1, 1, 0, 129, 1, 'publish', 'Creek Vista Apartments DHA Phase 8 Karachi: Price & Location', 'Creek Vista Apartments in DHA Phase 8 Karachi. Discover 3 and 4-bedroom apartments, amenities, prices, floor plans and location in Creek City.', 'Creek Vista, Creek Vista Apartments, Creek Vistas Karachi, Creek Vista DHA Phase 8', NULL, '2026-11-19 09:14:10', '2026-11-19 09:30:16'),
