(575, 76, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689203_6ae98673a6f74.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689203_6ae98673a74a7.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689203_6ae98673a78d2.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689203_6ae98673a7db0.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-29 12:04:38', '2026-11-03 07:00:03'),
(576, 76, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"saima Center Point 2 Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">saima Center Point 2 is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At present, Saima Center Point 2 M.A. Jinnah Road exists as a name in circulation rather than a launched project: it has been described as a Coming Soon development, but no dedicated official page, launch event, or documentation set has been published for it. That makes it fundamentally different from a project buyers can inspect, price, or book today.<\\/p><p>Within Saima Builders projects Karachi, the confirmed M.A. Jinnah Road project is Saima Center Point. Until Saima Builders publishes a launch announcement for Saima Center Point 2 Saima Builders, the accurate position is that buyers can register interest and monitor official channels. Nothing more should be promised, and no payment should change hands against this name.<\\/p><h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2><table><thead><tr><th>Feature<\\/th><th>Details<\\/th><\\/tr><\\/thead><tbody><tr><td>Developer<\\/td><td>Saima Builders<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Property Type<\\/td><td>To be announced<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Unit Types<\\/td><td>To be announced<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Total Land Size<\\/td><td>Not disclosed<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Handover<\\/td><td>To be announced<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Location<\\/td><td>M.A. Jinnah Road, Karachi (reported, unconfirmed)<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Payment Plan<\\/td><td>To be announced<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Lifestyle<\\/td><td>To be announced<\\/td><\\/tr><\\/tbody><\\/table><h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2><p>No master plan has been published for Saima Center Point 2. The project\'s structure, tower count, and layout will only become clear if and when the developer releases official documentation.<\\/p><p>Buyers comparing material online should be careful: details belonging to the original Saima Center Point are sometimes repeated under the Center Point 2 name. Floor plans, unit types, and schedules from the first project must not be assumed to apply to Saima Center Point 2 M.A. Jinnah Road.<\\/p><h2>Unit Types: To Be Announced<\\/h2><p>No unit schedule has been published for Saima Center Point 2 Saima Builders, so the honest position is set out below rather than a list of invented apartment types.<\\/p><h3>Apartments in Saima Center Point 2 (To Be Announced)<\\/h3><p>The unit mix for Saima Center Point 2 M.A. Jinnah Road has not been announced. Apartment sizes, bedroom counts, and floor plans will only be known when the developer publishes a unit schedule at launch, and no layout from Saima Center Point should be assumed to carry over.<\\/p><p>Buyers seeking apartments for sale Saima Center Point 2 or flats for sale Saima Center Point 2 Karachi should register interest and wait for the official unit schedule rather than relying on third-party listings.<\\/p><h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2><p>A floor plan for every unit category is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Center Point 2 price or a Saima Center Point floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel.<\\/p><h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2><p>There is no official Saima Center Point 2 price, because no price list has been published. Pricing will only become real when the developer releases an authorised schedule at launch.<\\/p><p>No Saima Center Point 2 booking is officially open. Buyers searching for a Saima Center Point 2 apartment price or Saima Center Point 2 booking amount should register interest only and should not pay any amount to any party claiming to collect bookings for this project before an official launch.<\\/p><p>Buyers who need a bookable M.A. Jinnah Road option today should instead review the confirmed Saima Center Point project through the developer\'s authorised sales channel.<\\/p><h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2><p>No NOC or approval documentation specific to Saima Center Point 2 Saima Builders has been published. Buyers should verify the position directly with the developer or the relevant authority if the project is formally launched.<\\/p><p>Approvals granted to Saima Center Point do not automatically extend to a separate project under the Center Point 2 name, and the two should never be treated as interchangeable in documentation.<\\/p><h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2><p>No possession timeline exists for Saima Center Point 2 M.A. Jinnah Road, because the project has not been formally launched. Any possession date quoted today would be speculation, and buyers should wait for the developer\'s official launch documentation.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-29 12:04:38', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(577, 76, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Center Point 2 Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<div>No payment plan has been officially released for Saima Center Point 2 Saima Builders. If the project launches, its schedule will be published through the developer\'s authorised sales channel at that time. Until then, any payment plan or booking amount quoted under this name should be treated as unverified.<\\/div><div><br><\\/div>\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-29 12:04:38', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(578, 76, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689203_6ae98673bc8f7.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-29 12:04:38', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(579, 76, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Seamless Access, Prime Location\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":null,\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689203_6ae98673c243e.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Near By Places\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"M.A. Jinnah Road\",\"time\":\"2 Minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Saddar\",\"time\":\"5 Minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Numaish Chowrangi\",\"time\":\"8 Minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-29 12:04:38', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(580, 76, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Center Point 2 Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Where is Saima Center Point 2 Karachi located?\\r\\nSaima Center Point 2 has been reported in connection with M.A. Jinnah Road, Karachi, but its exact location has not been officially confirmed or released by the developer. Buyers should treat any plot-level address in third-party listings as unverified.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Center Point 2 price?\",\"a\":\"No official Saima Center Point 2 price exists yet, because no price list has been published. Any figure quoted before an official launch should be treated as speculation, and buyers should wait for the developer\'s authorised price schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Center Point 2?\",\"a\":\"The unit mix for Saima Center Point 2 M.A. Jinnah Road has not been announced, so the number and size of apartments \\u2014 including bedroom counts \\u2014 remain unconfirmed until the developer publishes a unit schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Center Point 2 payment plan?\",\"a\":\"No Saima Center Point 2 payment plan or Saima Center Point 2 booking amount has been officially released. Buyers should not pay any amount against this project name until the developer opens booking through its authorised sales channel.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Center Point 2 NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"No project-specific approval documentation for Saima Center Point 2 Saima Builders has been published. Buyers should verify the NOC and approval status directly with the developer or the relevant authority once the project is formally launched.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Center Point 2 the same as Saima Center Point?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima Center Point is an established Saima Builders project on Main M.A. Jinnah Road near Saddar\\/Numaish with its own official project page, while Saima Center Point 2 is a separate, unconfirmed name. Buyers should confirm which project any payment or document refers to before proceeding.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Center Point 2?\",\"a\":\"The name is associated with Saima Builders, but the developer has not published a dedicated project page or launch announcement for Saima Center Point 2. Any booking claim should be verified with Saima Builders directly.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Center Point 2?\",\"a\":\"There is no official booking open for Saima Center Point 2 yet. Overseas buyers should register interest only through the developer\'s authorised channels and should not remit funds against unverified offers.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Center Point 2 Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Only as a watch-list name for buyers who specifically want the M.A. Jinnah Road corridor: the sensible step today is to register interest, follow the developer\'s official channels, and wait for confirmed launch documentation rather than acting on rumours.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-29 12:04:38', '2026-11-20 12:50:46');
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `section_key`, `section_name`, `order`, `is_active`, `is_visible`, `content`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(581, 76, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Register your interest in Saima Center Point 2 Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Center Point 2 Saima Builders, the official launch position, and private updates. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Saima Center Point 2 or seeking to buy flat in Saima Center Point 2 Karachi when it launches, our consultants can keep you informed as verified details are released.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"GET IN TOUCH\",\"heading\":\"Elevate Your Portfolio\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689203_6ae98673c709f.jpg\"}', '2026-10-29 12:04:38', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(582, 77, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Mangroves Residence Korangi Creek: Price & Payment Plan\",\"subtitle\":null,\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689048_6ae985d828f9d.webp\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Mangroves Residence Korangi Creek: Price & Payment Plan\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Mangroves Residence Korangi Creek: Price & Payment Plan\"}', '2026-10-30 06:28:14', '2026-11-16 09:06:40'),
(583, 77, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, 1, '{\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"price\":\"Coming Soon\",\"handover\":\"Q4 2028\",\"property_type\":\"Luxury Villas & Apartments\",\"bedrooms\":\"2 to 5 Bedrooms\",\"items\":[],\"highlight_0\":\"Saima Builders\",\"highlight_1\":\"AED 2,500,000\",\"highlight_2\":\"Q4 2028\",\"highlight_3\":\"Apartments\",\"highlight_4\":\"Freehold\",\"location\":\"Korangi Creek\"}', '2026-10-30 06:28:14', '2026-11-10 10:20:03'),
(584, 77, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Mangroves by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima mangrove residence is an upcoming waterfront community at Korangi Creek, Karachi, offering spacious 3, 4 and 5-bedroom apartments across a 40-acre master-planned development by Saima Builders, featuring modern residences and a successful, oversubscribed launch.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689048_6ae985d82a8d5.webp\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 06:28:14', '2026-11-12 13:17:51'),
(585, 77, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Mangroves Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi provides spaces that support everyday convenience, recreation, and family living. Residents can access a swimming pool, fitness centre, yoga room, community hall, cinema room, and a 14-acre park, alongside water sports and jogging tracks within the wider Saima Mangroves development.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 06:28:14', '2026-11-10 10:20:03'),
(586, 77, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Mangrove Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689048_6ae985d82bee0.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689048_6ae985d82c091.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689048_6ae985d82c26a.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689048_6ae985d82c58b.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 06:28:14', '2026-11-12 11:43:39'),
(587, 77, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Mangroves at Korangi Creek Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Mangroves at Korangi Creek Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>Saima Mangroves is a residential enclave within The Mangrove, a master-planned waterfront community at Korangi Creek in Karachi. The project is being executed through National Management & Consultancy (Private) Limited, a special purpose vehicle of TPL REIT Fund I, under a Development Advisory Agreement with the Zeeshan Saleem Zaki Group of Saima Builders. Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek is a development offering panoramic views of the protected mangrove belt. For buyers seeking a structured, institutionally backed entry into Karachi\'s waterfront residential market, Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi represents a distinct proposition: a planned community rather than a standalone tower.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The project is listed as \\\"Coming Soon\\\" on the developer\'s official project page and as \\\"Pre-Launch\\\" on independent property portals. The formal launch of Waterfront Apartments Korangi Creek Karachi under the Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi brand was held on 10\\u201311 October 2026 and was reported as \\\"overwhelmingly successful and heavily over-subscribed\\\" in a public disclosure. Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek is best understood as the residential brand within the larger The Mangrove master plan.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n    <tbody><tr>\\r\\n        <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n        <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>3, 4 and 5-bedroom Apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>40-acre waterfront land parcel<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Multiple phases<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Korangi Creek, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Flexible installments<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Waterfront living<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul><li>40-Acre Premium Residential & Commercial Gated Community<\\/li><li>16 Towers planned<\\/li><li>Currently, 2 Towers are ready for launch<\\/li><li>Each Tower is built on approximately 1 Acre<\\/li><li>Tower Structure: Ground + 31 Floors<\\/li><\\/ul><h3>TOWER LAYOUT<\\/h3><ul><li>Ground Floor: Commercial Showrooms<\\/li><li>1st to 4th Floors: Dedicated Covered Parking<\\/li><li>5th Floor: Exclusive Amenities Floor<\\/li><li>6th to 31st Floors: Residential Apartments<\\/li><li>14 Apartments on each residential floor<\\/li><\\/ul><h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2><p><img src=\\\"\\/uploads\\/content\\/1794493841_whatsapp-image-2026-11-12-at-44315-pm.jpeg\\\" style=\\\"display: block; max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; margin: 15px 0px; width: 100%;\\\"><\\/p><p>Saima Mangroves is the residential component of The Mangrove, a master plan prepared with an emphasis on preserving the surrounding mangrove ecosystem.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The residential offering at Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek is centred on Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi, on Korangi Creek Road near IoBM. It therefore sits within an active development programme rather than a conceptual launch. The involvement of TPL REIT Fund I, a Shariah-compliant hybrid REIT managed by a subsidiary of the publicly listed TPL Properties, introduces institutional reporting and fund-level oversight to Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi. For buyers comparing Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Karachi with other waterfront projects, the REIT-backed structure is a material differentiator.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 3, 4, and 5 Room Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for a 3 room apartment Korangi Creek Karachi, a 4 room apartment Korangi Creek Karachi, or a 5 room apartment Korangi Creek Karachi, Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek offers family-sized layouts consistent with the premium positioning of The Mangrove.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3 Room Apartment Korangi Creek Karachi<\\/h3><p><img src=\\\"\\/uploads\\/content\\/1794493867_4.jpg\\\" style=\\\"display: block; max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; margin: 15px 0px; width: 100%;\\\"><\\/p><p>The 3-room configuration includes two bedrooms, two bathrooms, a kitchen, lounge, lobby, wardrobes, and a terrace.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4 Room Apartment Korangi Creek Karachi<\\/h3><p><img src=\\\"\\/uploads\\/content\\/1794493886_3.jpg\\\" style=\\\"display: block; max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; margin: 15px 0px; width: 100%;\\\"><\\/p><p>The 4-room layout is more spacious and adds a third bedroom and bathroom, with a lounge.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>5 Room Apartment Korangi Creek Karachi<\\/h3><p><img src=\\\"\\/uploads\\/content\\/1794493932_2.jpg\\\" style=\\\"display: block; max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; margin: 15px 0px; width: 100%;\\\"><\\/p><p>The 5-room apartments are offered in multiple sub-types, with configurations ranging from three to four bedrooms and larger drawing and lounge areas.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for every unit category is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a 3 room apartment Saima Mangroves price, a 4 room apartment Saima Mangroves price, or a 5 room apartment Saima Mangroves price should request the unit schedule alongside the Saima Mangroves floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as Mangrove-facing apartment Karachi listings for Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Karachi are often incomplete.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Mangroves price is positioned competitively for waterfront living and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Mangroves payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options and construction-linked milestones available on request.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Mangroves booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Mangroves booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Mangroves payment plan. For buyers seeking a waterfront apartment on instalments Korangi Creek, the practical route to buy an apartment in Saima Mangroves Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or TPL\'s designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Mangroves payment plan before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Karachi buyers should also confirm whether apartments for sale Korangi Creek Karachi are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The developer states that Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek is NOC approved. The project has been registered with the relevant development authorities, and it meets environmental and construction requirements. The regulatory foundation for Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Karachi is the master plan approval granted by the Cantonment Board Korangi Creek to the project\'s special purpose vehicle, with building plans submitted for approval as the project progresses through its phases.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers completing booking should request both the master plan approval and the latest building-level approval documentation from the developer\'s authorised sales channel to confirm the current status for their specific tower and unit. The institutional involvement of TPL REIT Fund I adds a layer of fund-level oversight to Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi, though buyers should still independently verify all approvals before purchase.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for the Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek residential towers has not been announced as a single project-wide date. The project is being delivered in phases, and buyers should anticipate a phased handover for the Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi twin towers. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Mangroves booking. Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Karachi possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer, and buyers should plan for a medium- to long-term horizon rather than immediate occupancy.<\\/p><h3>KEY SELLING POINTS<\\/h3><ul><li>Waterfront Living \\u2013 Experience a premium lifestyle with a unique waterfront setting.<\\/li><li>Mangrove Views \\u2013 Enjoy beautiful mangrove and lagoon views from the residential towers.<\\/li><li>Swimming Pool \\u2013 Dedicated recreational space for residents.<\\/li><li>Padel Court \\u2013 Modern sports and fitness facility.<\\/li><li>Kids Play Area \\u2013 Dedicated safe space for children.<\\/li><li>Fully Equipped Gym \\u2013 Fitness facility for residents.<\\/li><li>40-Acre Gated Community \\u2013 Premium residential and commercial development.<\\/li><li>Dedicated Parking \\u2013 Four floors allocated for covered parking.<\\/li><li>Commercial Showrooms \\u2013 Commercial activity within the development.<\\/li><li>Exclusive Amenities Floor \\u2013 Dedicated lifestyle and recreational facilities.<\\/li><li>48-Months Payment Plan \\u2013 Flexible installment option.<\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 06:28:14', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(588, 77, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Mangrove Residence Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Mangrove Residence at\\u00a0<span style=\\\"font-family: inherit;\\\">Korangi Creek<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: inherit;\\\">\\u00a0payment plan<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: inherit;\\\">\\u00a0offers flexible options tailored to different buyer needs, including booking, allocation, confirmation, and construction-linked installments. Exact terms, schedules, and amounts are provided upon request through the developer\'s authorized sales channel, subject to revision.<\\/span><\\/p><p><br><\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 06:28:14', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(589, 77, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Mangroves Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794483819_6af5a66bcff47.jpeg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 06:28:14', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(590, 77, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Location on the Mangrove Belt\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"Saima Mangroves on Korangi Creek Road sits between the National Industrial Park to the north and the mangrove belt to the west, near DHA Phase VIII and IBM. The location places residents within reach of established Karachi neighborhoods while retaining a waterfront character, making Saima Mangroves a compelling choice for buyers seeking apartments for sale Korangi Creek Karachi.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794484677_6af5a9c51f8a5.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Indus Hospital\",\"time\":\"8 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Airmen Golf Club\",\"time\":\"10\\u201312 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Dolmen Mall\",\"time\":\"20\\u201325 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Jinnah International Airport\",\"time\":\"25\\u201330 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 06:28:14', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(591, 77, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Mangroves located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Mangroves is located at Korangi Creek, Karachi, within The Mangrove master plan, between the National Industrial Park and the mangrove belt. Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Karachi is easily accessible via the Korangi Creek corridor.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Mangroves price?\",\"a\":\"A public Saima Mangroves price list has not been released; pricing is available through the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel for Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek.\"},{\"q\":\"How many rooms in Saima Mangroves?\",\"a\":\"Residential units are described as up to 3 room, 4 room, and 5 rooms but inventories should be confirmed against the official Saima Mangroves floor plan for Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Mangroves payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Mangroves payment plan and Saima Mangroves booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Mangroves NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"A project-specific NOC for Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Karachi should be verified directly with the developer, who has backed the NOC; the broader master plan has been structured with institutional input.\"},{\"q\":\"When is Saima Mangroves possession?\",\"a\":\"Possession is phased and not publicly fixed; The Mangrove is a multi-year master plan, so Saima Mangroves buyers should confirm the schedule in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Mangroves?\",\"a\":\"TPL REIT Fund I is executing the project through its SPV under a Development Advisory Agreement with Saima Builders (Zeeshan Saleem Zaki Group).\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Mangroves part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"Yes, Saima Mangroves is the residential component of The Mangrove, a 40-acre mixed-use development at Korangi Creek.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Mangroves?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Mangroves sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek sits inside a REIT-backed master plan with PSX disclosures, offering a planned waterfront community rather than a standalone launch. Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi also provides a clear residential identity within the master plan.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 06:28:14', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(592, 77, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover exceptional waterfront opportunities at Saima Mangroves Korangi Creek Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Mangrove Residences Karachi, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring waterfront apartments Korangi Creek Karachi or seeking to buy apartment in Saima Mangroves Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Mangroves booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793689048_6ae985d83139c.webp\"}', '2026-10-30 06:28:14', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
