(610, 80, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Corporate Center at PIDC Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Corporate Center at PIDC Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Corporate Center is a mixed-use commercial tower with corporate offices, retail shops, showrooms, and business suites, all housed under one roof rather than scattered across separate buildings. The idea of Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders is fairly straightforward: give business owners a modern workspace that also functions as a legitimate investment property, and give investors a building with enough variety in unit types that demand does not rely on just one kind of tenant. There is a clear separation between the retail floors, which are meant to handle daily footfall and walk-in customers, and the office floors above, which are quieter and meant for people who actually work there.<\\/p><p>Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders has become one of the names that comes up fairly often in investor circles when the conversation turns to serious business addresses in Karachi, usually in the same breath as questions about location, pricing, and whether it is actually worth the money. With a known developer, a location that is not buried somewhere inconvenient, and a mix of office space, retail shops, and business suites, Saima Corporate Center offices is one of the notable commercial projects Karachi buyers compare when looking at corporate commercial towers Karachi.<\\/p><h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2><table><tbody><tr><th>Feature<\\/th><th>Details<\\/th><\\/tr><tr><td>Developer<\\/td><td>Saima Builders<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Property Type<\\/td><td>Commercial<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Unit Types<\\/td><td>Corporate offices, retail shops, showrooms and business suites<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Total Land Size<\\/td><td>Not disclosed<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Handover<\\/td><td>To be confirmed<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Location<\\/td><td>PIDC, opposite PC Hotel, Karachi<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Payment Plan<\\/td><td>Flexible installments<\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td>Lifestyle<\\/td><td>Business hub<\\/td><\\/tr><\\/tbody><\\/table><h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2><p>Saima Corporate Center offices are planned as a contemporary business hub rather than a traditional commercial plaza, with a master plan prepared with an emphasis on functionality, efficient circulation, and separating business activity by floor.<\\/p><p>The master plan of Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders reflects an attempt to balance pure functionality with something closer to an actual business district feel: dedicated parking that does not feel like an afterthought, common areas built with business use in mind rather than just decorative lobbies, and enough vertical space to comfortably fit a genuine mix of unit types without the building feeling cramped. The Saima Corporate Center floor plan follows a well-planned vertical layout that separates retail, parking, and corporate office spaces, with dedicated parking levels, premium office floors, and recreational facilities creating a complete commercial ecosystem for business offices Karachi.<\\/p><h2>Unit Types: Offices, Shops, Showrooms and Business Suites<\\/h2><p>For buyers searching for commercial offices for sale Karachi, office space for sale Karachi, or corporate offices Karachi, Saima Corporate Center offices offers commercial layouts in four unit categories.<\\/p><ul><li>Corporate offices<\\/li><li>Retail shops<\\/li><li>Showrooms<\\/li><li>Business suites<\\/li><\\/ul><h3>Corporate Offices in Saima Corporate Center<\\/h3><p>Saima Corporate Center offers premium office spaces for businesses that value a professional corporate address and a modern working environment. Saima Corporate Center offices are ideal for consultancies, corporate headquarters, branch offices, IT firms, financial institutions, and other service-based businesses looking to establish a strong presence among corporate offices Karachi.<\\/p><h3>Retail Shops in Saima Corporate Center<\\/h3><p>Ground and lower floors are generally set aside for retail, and shop owners on these floors get visibility and passing footfall that upper-floor units simply cannot compete with, no matter how nicely they are finished.<\\/p><h3>Showrooms in Saima Corporate Center<\\/h3><p>Larger-format units of Saima Corporate Center offices are meant for businesses that genuinely need display space, including furniture retailers, electronics brands, lifestyle stores, anything that benefits from a strong visual presence rather than a small storefront tucked in a corner.<\\/p><h3>Business Suites in Saima Corporate Center<\\/h3><p>Smaller, more flexible spaces are aimed at startups, freelancers, and small teams who want a legitimate business address without committing to an entire floor they do not actually need yet, which is a practical small office for sale Karachi option inside a recognised commercial tower.<\\/p><h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2><p>A floor plan for every unit category in Saima Corporate Center offices is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Corporate Center floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as office for sale Saima Corporate Center Karachi listings are often incomplete.<\\/p><h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2><p>The Saima Corporate Center price varies depending on unit type, floor, and size, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Retail shops on lower floors usually carry a premium over office units higher up, while business suites tend to sit at a more accessible price point. The Saima Corporate Center payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.<\\/p><p>A Saima Corporate Center booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Corporate Center booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Corporate Center payment plan. For buyers seeking a commercial office on installments Karachi, the practical route to buy office in Saima Corporate Center Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Corporate Center payment plan before booking. Buyers should also request the Saima Corporate Center office price per sqft for their preferred unit type and floor.<\\/p><p>Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders buyers should also confirm whether office space for sale Karachi at this project is being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p><h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2><p>Saima Corporate Center is stated to have obtained its No Objection Certificate from the relevant municipal authorities, which is a reassuring sign for anyone considering a purchase in a market where projects have run into regulatory trouble, stalled construction, and missing approvals.<\\/p><p>That said, buyers should still independently verify the current approval status directly with the developer or the authority in question before committing any money. Regulations shift, documentation gets updated, and a status that was accurate six months ago is not necessarily accurate today.<\\/p><h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2><p>A formal possession date for Saima Corporate Center offices has not been announced as a single project-wide date. The final payment is made before possession, after which buyers can take ownership of their office space. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Corporate Center booking, and Saima Corporate Center Karachi possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 06:46:11', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(611, 80, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Corporate Center Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<p>The payment plan for Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders offers flexible options tailored to different buyer needs, including booking, allocation and confirmation, monthly and quarterly installments, and construction-linked milestone payments, with the final payment made before possession. Exact terms, schedules, and amounts are provided upon request through the developer\'s authorised sales channel, subject to revision.<\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 06:46:11', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(612, 80, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Corporate Center Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688896_6ae9854097f34.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 06:46:11', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(613, 80, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Corporate Center Location at PIDC, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Corporate Center Karachi location is at PIDC, opposite Pearl Continental (PC) Hotel, placing it in the heart of Karachi\'s commercial district. Its central position provides excellent connectivity to the city\'s major business hubs, financial institutions, and upscale residential communities. Saima Corporate Center offices offer direct access to Beaumont Road and is only minutes away from Shahrah-e-Faisal, with Clifton, DHA, Saddar, and I.I. Chundrigar Road nearby, making it an ideal destination among office spaces in Karachi for corporate offices, retail businesses, and investors.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688896_6ae9854099d00.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Near By Places & Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Pearl Continental (PC) Hotel\",\"time\":\"2 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Shahrah-e-Faisal\",\"time\":\"5 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"I.I. Chundrigar Road\",\"time\":\"10 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Clifton\",\"time\":\"10 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"DHA Karachi\",\"time\":\"15 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Tariq Road\",\"time\":\"15 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"PECHS\",\"time\":\"15 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Jinnah International Airport\",\"time\":\"30 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 06:46:11', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(614, 80, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Corporate Center located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders is located at PIDC, Karachi, opposite Pearl Continental (PC) Hotel, with direct access to Beaumont Road and Shahrah-e-Faisal nearby. Saima Corporate Center Karachi is easily accessible from Clifton, DHA, Saddar, and I.I. Chundrigar Road.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Corporate Center price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Corporate Center price list has not been released; pricing varies by unit type, floor, and size and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Corporate Center Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What office sizes in Saima Corporate Center?\",\"a\":\"Office sizes vary by floor and unit type across corporate offices, retail shops, showrooms, and business suites, but exact sizes should be confirmed against the official Saima Corporate Center floor plan for Saima Corporate Center Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Corporate Center payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Corporate Center payment plan and Saima Corporate Center booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Corporate Center NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Saima Corporate Center offices is stated to have obtained its No Objection Certificate from the relevant municipal authorities; a project-specific NOC for Saima Corporate Center Karachi should still be verified directly with the developer or the authority in question before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"When is Saima Corporate Center possession?\",\"a\":\"When is Saima Corporate Center possession?\\r\\nPossession is not publicly fixed, so Saima Corporate Center Saima Builders buyers should confirm the schedule in writing at booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Corporate Center?\",\"a\":\"Saima Corporate Center is developed by Saima Group, which has built both residential communities and commercial towers across Karachi over several decades.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Corporate Center part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"No, Saima Corporate Center is a standalone mixed-use commercial tower, housing corporate offices, retail shops, showrooms, and business suites under one roof.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Corporate Center?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Corporate Center sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Corporate Center Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because Saima Corporate Center sits at PIDC opposite PC Hotel in the heart of Karachi\'s commercial district, offering a recognised business address, high rental potential, and a mix of unit types that does not rely on one kind of tenant. Saima Corporate Center Karachi also provides a clear commercial identity within Saima Builders\' portfolio.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 06:46:11', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(615, 80, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover exceptional commercial opportunities at Saima Corporate Center Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance onSaima Corporate Center Saima Builders, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring commercial offices for sale Karachi or seeking to buy office in Saima Corporate Center Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Corporate Center booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688896_6ae985409b57b.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 06:46:11', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(616, 81, 'hero', 'Hero Banner', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Main Super Highway\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore Premier Properties & Real Estate Investment in Main Super Highway, Karachi\",\"badge\":\"Prime Real Estate Destination\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 06:52:14', '2026-10-30 06:52:14'),
(617, 81, 'content', 'Table of Contents & Article', 2, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Main Super Highway Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Main Super Highway is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 06:52:14', '2026-10-30 06:52:14'),
(618, 81, 'communities', 'Project Cards', 3, 1, 1, '{\"heading\":\"Featured Projects\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore premium residential and commercial developments\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Wadeem Gardens\",\"location\":\"Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi\",\"price\":\"Launch Price: 8.7M AED\",\"delivery\":\"Delivery Date: Q2 2031\",\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"paymentPlan\":\"Flexible Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/wadeem-gardens\",\"image\":\"\\/images\\/communities\\/wadeem-gardens.png\"}],\"selected_ids\":[],\"project_ids\":[]}', '2026-10-30 06:52:14', '2026-10-30 06:52:14'),
(619, 81, 'about', 'About Main Super Highway', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"About the Community\",\"description\":\"A meticulously planned coastal sanctuary seamlessly integrating contemporary luxury living with untouched nature. Spanning scenic waterfronts, lush mangroves, and cycling corridors, the master community offers an unmatched urban lifestyle for residents and high-yield potential for global real estate investors.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"heading\":\"About the Community\",\"video_url\":\"https:\\/\\/stream.mux.com\\/A3200aZtT5Wq7VlYwQv3wP9W2hX8.m3u8\",\"poster_image\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 06:52:14', '2026-10-30 06:52:14'),
(620, 81, 'faq', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"<p>Key information and helpful answers regarding Main Super Highway and property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.<\\/p>\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Are properties in this city freehold for foreign and overseas investors?\",\"a\":\"Yes, designated luxury master developments offer 100% freehold ownership for local and international buyers with complete title deed registration.\"},{\"q\":\"What are the typical payment plans available?\",\"a\":\"Flexible installment plans are offered typically linked to construction milestones, with down payments starting from 5% to 10%.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":\"Find answers to common questions about properties, buying process, and payment plans.\"}', '2026-10-30 06:52:14', '2026-10-30 06:52:14'),
(621, 81, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 6, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest in Main Super Highway\",\"subtitle\":\"Connect with our dedicated city property advisors for personalized availability, floor plans, and VIP access.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.ae\"}', '2026-10-30 06:52:14', '2026-10-30 06:52:14'),
(622, 82, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms at Main Super Highway Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms at Main Super Highway Karachi\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688713_6ae98489e203e.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms at Main Super Highway Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms at Main Super Highway Karachi\"}', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-03 06:51:53'),
(623, 82, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, 1, '{\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"price\":\"AED 2,500,000\",\"handover\":\"Q4 2028\",\"property_type\":\"Luxury Villas & Apartments\",\"bedrooms\":\"2 to 5 Bedrooms\",\"items\":[],\"highlight_0\":\"Saima Builders\",\"highlight_1\":\"Coming Soon\",\"highlight_2\":\"Q4 2028\",\"highlight_3\":\"Residential plots\",\"highlight_4\":\"Freehold\",\"location\":\"Main Super Highway Karachi\",\"highlight_new_1793343359099\":\"\"}', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-10 10:19:02'),
(624, 82, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>ZSZ Midtown Farms is a residential gated community project by Saima Group (Saima Builders) on the Main Super Highway (Karachi-Hyderabad Highway), adjacent to Bahria Town Karachi (Bahria-2), Karachi, Pakistan, spread over 390 acres, offering residential plots of 175, 240, 500, and 1,000 square yards, with a Coming Soon status.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688713_6ae98489e4181.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-03 06:51:53'),
(625, 82, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms Karachi provides community facilities planned across its 390-acre gated layout, including CCTV surveillance, wide carpeted roads, reliable utilities covering electricity, gas, and water, a community center, mosques, play areas, jogging tracks, extensive green spaces, and dedicated commercial zones within the ZSZ Midtown Farms development.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-10 10:19:02'),
(626, 82, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688713_6ae98489e64cc.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688713_6ae98489e6c7c.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688713_6ae98489e753f.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688713_6ae98489e7d56.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-03 06:51:53');
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `section_key`, `section_name`, `order`, `is_active`, `is_visible`, `content`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(627, 82, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms at Main Super Highway Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">ZSZ Midtown Farms at Main Super Highway Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, ZSZ Midtown Farms Bahria Town Karachi is a plots-based gated community, not a tower project. Spread across 390 acres and organised as a single planned layout, it offers plots ranging from 175 square yards to 1,000 square yards. Buyers can choose from compact residential plots to large farmhouse-sized holdings within the same gated boundary. Wide carpeted roads, reliable utilities, and extensive green spaces are incorporated into the development plan.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Among Main Super Highway Karachi plots, ZSZ Midtown Farms Super Highway competes on two key factors: scale and location. A 390-acre gated community adjacent to Bahria Town Karachi (Bahria-2) offers a different proposition from a small standalone scheme, while its Super Highway frontage maintains connectivity with the city. As ZSZ Midtown Farms Super Highway is currently Coming Soon, buyers are registering interest and positioning themselves early rather than purchasing completed inventory.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr><th>Feature<\\/th><th>Details<\\/th><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Developer<\\/td><td>Saima Group (Saima Builders)<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Property Type<\\/td><td>Residential<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Unit Types<\\/td><td>Plots of 175, 240, 500 and 1,000 sq. yd.<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Total Land Size<\\/td><td>390 acres<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Handover<\\/td><td>Coming Soon<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Location<\\/td><td>Main Super Highway, adjacent to Bahria Town Karachi (Bahria-2), Karachi<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Payment Plan<\\/td><td>To be announced<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Lifestyle<\\/td><td>Gated community<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>ZSZ Midtown Farms is planned as a single 390-acre gated community featuring residential plots in four sizes, dedicated commercial zones for everyday retail and business, and community infrastructure. The planned facilities include a community centre, mosques, play areas, jogging tracks, and green spaces distributed throughout the layout.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The development framework for ZSZ Midtown Farms Super Highway focuses on community living, with a gated boundary, CCTV surveillance, wide carpeted internal roads, and utilities covering electricity, gas, and water. These essential services are incorporated into the neighbourhood plan rather than being left to develop piecemeal. The ZSZ Midtown Farms master plan also keeps commercial activities within dedicated zones, helping maintain residential streets for residential use.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 175, 240, 500 and 1,000 Sq. Yd. Plots<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for plots for sale ZSZ Midtown Farms or farmhouses for sale ZSZ Midtown Farms Karachi, the project offers residential plot options in four sizes near Bahria Town Karachi 2. These gated community plots Karachi cater to different residential requirements and investment preferences.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>175 and 240 Sq. Yd. Plots in ZSZ Midtown Farms<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 175 and 240 square yard plots in ZSZ Midtown Farms Bahria Town Karachi are the community\'s entry-level options. They are suited to families looking for a gated-community plot along the Super Highway corridor at a comparatively accessible price point, with access to the planned roads, utilities, and green spaces.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>500 Sq. Yd. Plots in ZSZ Midtown Farms<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 500 square yard plots in ZSZ Midtown Farms Bahria Town Karachi offer a middle-range option, providing space for a larger family home with additional outdoor areas while remaining within a mid-range budget category.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>1,000 Sq. Yd. Plots in ZSZ Midtown Farms<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 1,000 square yard plots in ZSZ Midtown Farms Bahria Town Karachi are the project\'s largest residential holdings. They are aimed at buyers seeking a farmhouse-sized residence with extensive private grounds within a gated and serviced community.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Plot availability and exact positioning within ZSZ Midtown Farms Super Highway will be confirmed when bookings open. Buyers seeking a ZSZ Midtown Farms plot price or plot layout should request the latest plot schedule from the developer\'s authorised sales channel at launch.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The ZSZ Midtown Farms price will vary according to plot size and location within the community. No confirmed public price list has been released yet. Buyers should obtain the latest pricing schedule for ZSZ Midtown Farms Bahria Town Karachi through the developer\'s authorised sales channel once it becomes available.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A ZSZ Midtown Farms booking is not officially open yet. Buyers searching for a ZSZ Midtown Farms plot price or ZSZ Midtown Farms booking amount should register their interest through the developer\'s authorised sales channel and wait for the official schedule. This is preferable to relying on older listings that quoted foreign-currency figures with mismatched project descriptions.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers interested in ZSZ Midtown Farms plots on installments should also confirm whether allocations will follow a priority-based system or a first-come, first-served process when bookings officially open.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should verify project-specific approvals for ZSZ Midtown Farms directly with the developer or the relevant authority before making a booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Since ZSZ Midtown Farms Super Highway is currently Coming Soon, buyers should ensure that any approval documents presented to them specifically refer to ZSZ Midtown Farms and not to a neighbouring development along the same corridor.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession date has been announced for ZSZ Midtown Farms because the project is currently Coming Soon. Once bookings open, buyers should obtain a documented possession schedule in writing at the time of booking. This should include details of phased possession across the 390-acre layout for ZSZ Midtown Farms Bahria Town Karachi.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(628, 82, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"No payment plan has been officially published for ZSZ Midtown Farms yet, as the project is Coming Soon. When booking opens, the schedule, including booking, allocation, confirmation, installments, and any possession-linked payment, will be released through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers should not act on unofficial figures or pay any amount to any party claiming to collect bookings for ZSZ Midtown Farms Super Highway before an official launch.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(629, 82, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688713_6ae98489eb4e7.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(630, 82, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms Location on Main Super Highway, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The ZSZ Midtown Farms Karachi location is on the Main Super Highway (Karachi-Hyderabad Highway), adjacent to Bahria Town Karachi (Bahria-2), which is  one of the most recognisable addresses on the corridor, so the project is easy to find and easy to explain to anyone. Being on the highway gives residents a direct route into Karachi as well as toward Hyderabad, and the Bahria Town Karachi (Bahria-2) neighbourhood next door already brings established roads, retail, and services to the same stretch.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688713_6ae98489ecddf.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions:\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"M-9 Motorway\",\"time\":\"5\\u201310 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Jinnah Avenue\",\"time\":\"20\\u201325 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Dreamworld Resort\",\"time\":\"20\\u201330 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Fiesta Family Water Park\",\"time\":\"25\\u201335 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(631, 82, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is ZSZ Midtown Farms located?\",\"a\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms is located on the Main Super Highway (Karachi-Hyderabad Highway), adjacent to Bahria Town Karachi (Bahria-2), Karachi, Pakistan. The ZSZ Midtown Farms Karachi location puts it on the city\'s main highway corridor, next to one of Karachi\'s largest planned communities.\"},{\"q\":\"What is ZSZ Midtown Farms price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public ZSZ Midtown Farms price list has not been released, and the project is listed as Coming Soon. Pricing will differ by plot size and position, and buyers should obtain the current schedule through the developer\'s authorised sales channel once booking opens.\"},{\"q\":\"What plot sizes are available in ZSZ Midtown Farms?\",\"a\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms offers plots in four sizes: 175, 240, 500, and 1,000 square yards, so buyers can choose anything from a compact residential plot to a large farmhouse-sized holding within the same 390-acre community.\"},{\"q\":\"What is ZSZ Midtown Farms payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The ZSZ Midtown Farms payment plan and booking amount have not been officially published yet, as the project is Coming Soon. Buyers should wait for the developer\'s authorised schedule rather than acting on unofficial figures.\"},{\"q\":\"Is ZSZ Midtown Farms NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for ZSZ Midtown Farms Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"When is ZSZ Midtown Farms possession?\",\"a\":\"No possession date has been announced, because ZSZ Midtown Farms is Coming Soon. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of booking once the project launches\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing ZSZ Midtown Farms?\",\"a\":\"ZSZ Midtown Farms is developed by Saima Group (Saima Builders), an established Karachi developer with a long record of residential and mixed-use projects across the city.\"},{\"q\":\"Is ZSZ Midtown Farms an apartment project?\",\"a\":\"No. ZSZ Midtown Farms is a plots-based gated community of 175 to 1,000 square yard plots on the Main Super Highway. Some older third-party listings described apartments for this name; those descriptions do not match the project\'s current published data and should not be relied on.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in ZSZ Midtown Farms?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels once booking opens, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the ZSZ Midtown Farms sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider ZSZ Midtown Farms Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because it combines a 390-acre gated layout with a highway address next to Bahria Town Karachi (Bahria-2), a full range of plot sizes, and community infrastructure, including utilities, mosques, play areas, jogging tracks, green spaces, and commercial zones  planned inside the boundary rather than added later.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(632, 82, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover gated community plots at ZSZ Midtown Farms Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on ZSZ Midtown Farms, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring plots for sale ZSZ Midtown Farms or seeking to buy plot in ZSZ Midtown Farms Karachi, our consultants can navigate the ZSZ Midtown Farms booking process once it opens\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688713_6ae98489eed08.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 06:53:44', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(639, 84, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima One Residency at Clifton Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Luxury high-rise apartments with spacious layouts and sea and city views.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688449_6ae983814ccfb.webp\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima One Residency at Clifton Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima One Residency at Clifton Karachi\"}', '2026-10-30 07:08:53', '2026-11-03 06:48:15'),
(640, 84, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, 1, '{\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"price\":\"AED 2,500,000\",\"handover\":\"Q4 2028\",\"property_type\":\"Luxury Villas & Apartments\",\"bedrooms\":\"2 to 5 Bedrooms\",\"items\":[],\"highlight_0\":\"Saima Builders\",\"highlight_1\":\"Coming Soon\",\"highlight_3\":\"Apartments\",\"location\":\"Clifton, Karachi\",\"featured\":\"Saima Builders\"}', '2026-10-30 07:08:53', '2026-11-10 10:18:14'),
(641, 84, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima One Residency by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima One Residency is a Coming Soon luxury residential tower at Clifton, Karachi, offering spacious 3 and 4-bedroom apartments in Clifton Block 5 by Saima Builders, featuring modern high-rise residences near Park Tower and a prime South Karachi address.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688449_6ae983814e5e1.webp\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":null}', '2026-10-30 07:08:53', '2026-11-03 06:48:15'),
(642, 84, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima One Residency Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima One Residency Park Tower Clifton provides spaces that support everyday convenience, recreation, and family living. Residents can access high-speed elevators and cargo lifts, multiple basement parking levels, uninterrupted power backup, biometric access control, CCTV surveillance, a modern gymnasium, indoor recreational and wellness areas, jogging areas, a children\'s play area, a community lounge, and dedicated prayer areas within the Saima One Residence Clifton development.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 07:08:53', '2026-11-10 10:18:14'),
(643, 84, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688449_6ae983814fa26.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688449_6ae983814fad5.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688449_6ae983814fb9c.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688449_6ae983814ffb1.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 07:08:53', '2026-11-03 06:48:15'),
(644, 84, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima One Residency at Clifton Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima One Residency at Clifton Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>Saima One Residency Clifton is a luxurious high-rise residence in the heart of Clifton, Karachi. Also searched as Saima One Residence Clifton, the project features modern architecture, premium living standards, and a prime location within Clifton Block 5. Saima One Residency Park Tower Clifton is best understood as a limited-inventory luxury tower rather than a standard apartment building.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima One Residence Clifton is listed as \\\"Coming Soon\\\" on the developer\'s official project page. For buyers seeking a structured entry into Karachi\'s premium residential market, Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi represents a distinct proposition: a planned luxury community in one of the city\'s most established neighbourhoods, with panoramic sea and city views, strong rental demand, and the Clifton address that continues to attract executives, expatriates, and overseas Pakistanis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>3 and 4-bedroom Apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>1 acre<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>To be announced<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Clifton Block 5, near Park Tower, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Flexible installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Luxury high-rise<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima One Residency is planned as a vertical luxury residence, with an emphasis on privacy, exclusivity, and preserving open views across Clifton.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The residential offering at Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi is centred on Saima One Residency Park Tower Clifton, in Clifton Block 5 near Boat Basin and Dolmen Mall Clifton. Several basement floors are completely reserved for the secure parking of residents and visitors. The tower rises above the parking floors with a spacious entrance lobby, followed by residential floors meticulously designed for comfort and spacious family layouts. The master plan of Saima One Residence Clifton follows a limited-inventory approach, further emphasising the exclusivity of the project. For buyers comparing Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi with other Clifton projects, the low-density planning and sea and city views are important differentiators.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 3 and 4 Bedroom Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for a 3 bed apartment Clifton Karachi, a 4 bed apartment Clifton Karachi, or luxury apartments in Clifton Karachi, Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi offers family-sized layouts consistent with the premium positioning of Clifton Block 5.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3 Bed Apartment Clifton Karachi<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 3 Bed D\\/D Type-A configuration in Saima One Residence Clifton includes three generously sized bedrooms with attached bathrooms, a formal drawing room, a large family lounge, a dining area, a modern kitchen, and servant accommodation. It is an ideal 3 bed luxury apartment near Park Tower Clifton, designed for families who want spacious living without compromising functionality.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4 Bed Apartment Clifton Karachi<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 4 Bed D\\/D Type-XL layout in Saima One Residence Clifton offers additional space for larger families seeking luxury living in Clifton, with four spacious en-suite bedrooms, a formal drawing room, a generous family lounge, a dedicated dining area, a modern kitchen, servant quarters, and ample wardrobe space. As a 4 bed sea facing apartment Clifton Karachi option, it provides privacy, comfort, and an ideal setting for both daily life and entertaining guests.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for every unit category in Saima One Residence Clifton is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima One Residency 3 bed price, a Saima One Residency 4 bed price, or a Saima One Residency floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as apartments for sale in Clifton Karachi listings for Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi are often incomplete.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima One Residency price is positioned at the premium end of the Clifton market and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima One Residency payment plan is structured to accommodate different buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options and construction-linked milestones available on request.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima One Residency booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima One Residency booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima One Residency payment plan. For buyers seeking to buy an apartment in Clifton on instalments, the practical route to book in Saima One Residency Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima One Residency payment plan before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi buyers should also confirm whether apartments for sale in Clifton Karachi at this project are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima One Residency Clifton comes under the supervision of the Sindh Building Control Authority (SBCA), and the project\'s structural planning is stated to be consistent with SBCA construction regulations and legal standards.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers completing Saima One Residency Park Tower Clifton booking should request the project-specific approval documentation from the developer\'s authorised sales channel and check the most recent NOC information on official SBCA platforms before making any booking or financial transaction. This helps confirm the current approval status for their specific unit.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima One Residency Clifton has not been announced. Saima One Residency Park Tower Clifton is at the Coming Soon stage, and buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima One Residency booking. Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer, and buyers should plan for a medium- to long-term horizon rather than immediate occupancy.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 07:08:53', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(645, 84, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima One Residency Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The payment plan for Saima One Residency Clifton offers a flexible structure for both investors and end-users, including booking, allocation, confirmation, monthly installments, quarterly installments, and construction-linked milestone payments through development. Exact terms, schedules, and amounts are provided upon request through the developer\'s authorised sales channel, subject to revision.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 07:08:53', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(646, 84, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688449_6ae9838153246.webp\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 07:08:53', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(647, 84, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima One Residency Clifton Location near Park Tower, Clifton Block 5\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"Saima One Residency Clifton Location offers residents one of the most respected and sought-after residential areas of Karachi. Saima One Residency Park Tower Clifton is situated in Clifton Block 5, close to Park Tower Clifton, which is connected with all the main arteries of the city and the nearby DHA phases. Residents can reach Boat Basin, Teen Talwar, and Do Talwar within minutes. Among Clifton Block 5 apartments, Park Tower Clifton apartments, and high-rise apartments Clifton Karachi, it stands out for its connectivity, providing access to some of the finest schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and restaurants in the city of Karachi.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688449_6ae9838153e38.webp\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"New Category\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Bagh Ibn-e-Qasim Park\",\"time\":\"4\\u20137 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Clifton Beach \\/ Sea View\",\"time\":\"5\\u20138 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Dolmen Mall Clifton\",\"time\":\"6\\u201310 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Ocean Mall\",\"time\":\"7\\u201310 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 07:08:53', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(648, 84, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima One Residency Clifton located?\",\"a\":\"Saima One Residency Clifton is located at Clifton Block 5, Karachi, near Park Tower. Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi is easily accessible via the Clifton corridor, with Boat Basin, Teen Talwar, Do Talwar, Dolmen Mall Clifton, and the DHA phases nearby.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima One Residency Clifton price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima One Residency price list has not been released; pricing is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima One Residency Clifton.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima One Residency Clifton?\",\"a\":\"Residential units are offered in 3-bedroom and 4-bedroom configurations, but inventories should be confirmed against the official Saima One Residency floor plan for Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima One Residency payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima One Residency payment plan and Saima One Residency booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima One Residency NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"A project-specific NOC for Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi should be verified directly with the developer and the Sindh Building Control Authority (SBCA), under whose supervision the project falls.\"},{\"q\":\"When is Saima One Residency possession?\",\"a\":\"Possession has not been publicly fixed; Saima One Residency Park Tower Clifton is at Coming Soon stage, so Saima One Residency buyers should confirm the schedule in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima One Residency?\",\"a\":\"Saima One Residency Clifton is developed by Saima Builders and Developers, part of the Saima Group, which has been working in Karachi real estate for nearly 40 years.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima One Residency part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"No, Saima One Residency is a standalone luxury residential tower in Clifton Block 5, planned with a limited inventory approach.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima One Residency?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima One Residency sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because Saima One Residency Clifton sits in Clifton Block 5 near Park Tower, offering limited-inventory luxury high-rise living with sea and city views in one of Karachi\'s most stable and appreciated residential locations. Saima One Residency Clifton Karachi also provides a clear luxury residential identity within Saima Builders\' portfolio.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 07:08:53', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(649, 84, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Our property specialists will contact you with VIP floor plans, pricing sheets, and private site visit bookings.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688449_6ae983815595b.webp\"}', '2026-10-30 07:08:53', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(650, 85, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Residencia Avenue at Scheme 33 Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Residencia Avenue, a gated residential development by Saima Builders at 34-A Scheme 33, Karachi. See key project details and investment potential.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688261_6ae982c51e0fa.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Residencia Avenue at Scheme 33 Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Residencia Avenue at Scheme 33 Karachi\"}', '2026-10-30 07:23:52', '2026-11-03 06:44:21'),
(651, 85, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, 1, '{\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"price\":\"AED 2,500,000\",\"handover\":\"Q4 2028\",\"property_type\":\"Scheme 33 Karachi\",\"bedrooms\":\"2 to 5 Bedrooms\",\"items\":[],\"highlight_0\":\"Saima Builders\",\"highlight_1\":\"Coming Soon\",\"highlight_2\":\"Q4 2028\",\"highlight_3\":\"Luxury Apartments\",\"highlight_4\":\"Freehold\"}', '2026-10-30 07:23:52', '2026-11-10 10:17:44'),
(652, 85, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Residencia Avenue by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Residencia Avenue is a modern residential community at 34-A Scheme 33, Karachi, offering spacious 2 and 3-bedroom apartments in a gated, master-planned development by Saima Builders, featuring landscaped surroundings, wide open spaces, and a prime location opposite Capital Cooperative Housing Society, near Safoora Chowrangi.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688261_6ae982c520d15.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 07:23:52', '2026-11-03 06:44:21'),
(653, 85, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Residencia Avenue Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Residencia Avenue Karachi provides spaces that support everyday convenience, recreation, and family living. Residents can access a gated community environment with 24-hour security, CCTV surveillance and restricted access points, backup power systems, landscaped parks, children\'s play areas, fitness facilities, community spaces, a large Jamia Mosque, and basement parking within the Saima Residencia Avenue Saima Builders development.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 07:23:52', '2026-11-10 10:17:44'),
(654, 85, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688261_6ae982c524291.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688261_6ae982c524fe9.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688261_6ae982c5259ea.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688261_6ae982c526486.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 07:23:52', '2026-11-03 06:44:21');
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `section_key`, `section_name`, `order`, `is_active`, `is_visible`, `content`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(655, 85, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Residencia Avenue at Scheme 33 Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Residencia Avenue at Scheme 33 Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>The Saima Residencia Avenue is a modern housing project that combines comfort, convenience, and quality living. Developed by Saima Group, Saima Residencia Avenue Saima Builders is an integrated solution of modern architecture and community-oriented planning, with well-designed residential towers, a landscaped environment, and wide open spaces. The Saima Residencia Avenue apartments design emphasises natural ventilation and natural light, creating a more comfortable and pleasant living experience for families.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Residencia Avenue Karachi is located in one of the most booming residential areas in Karachi and is an ideal choice for families and investors alike due to its security and connectivity. Saima Residencia Avenue apartments are available in spacious sizes with up-to-date facilities and good investment value, drawing end-users and long-term investors to property in Scheme 33, with strong rental demand from its proximity to universities, hospitals, and business districts.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>2 and 3-bedroom Apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>14.75 Acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Scheme 33, near Safoora Chowrangi, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Flexible installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Gated community<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Residencia Avenue is planned as an organised residential community, with a master plan based on organised community living and using land efficiently, prepared with an emphasis on green, family-friendly surroundings.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Residencia Avenue master plan comprises residential towers, green spaces, commercial buildings, and public spaces. Buildings were carefully planned to ensure enough cross-ventilation and daylight throughout the project, and larger green spaces provide a healthier environment for families and children. The plan for Saima Residencia Avenue Saima Builders also includes safe parking, paved walkways, exercise spaces, and religious spaces, forming a complete residential environment within one of the recognised Saima Builders residential projects Karachi.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 2 and 3 Bedroom Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Residencia Avenue, flats for sale Saima Residencia Avenue Karachi, or gated community apartments Karachi, Saima Residencia Avenue Karachi offers family-sized layouts in two configurations.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>2 Bedroom Apartment in Saima Residencia Avenue<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 2-bedroom Saima Residencia Avenue apartments are typically about 1,200 square feet. It includes generous bedrooms with en-suite bathrooms, a modern kitchen, a drawing and dining space, and balconies, in a layout that promotes natural ventilation and comfortable everyday living for small families.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3 Bedroom Apartment in Saima Residencia Avenue<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 3-bedroom Saima Residencia Avenue apartments are a little more than 1,700 square feet. These units are bigger in size, provide extra bedrooms, have larger balconies, and offer family-friendly designs, with each design promoting natural ventilation and a comfortable living experience for growing families.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for every unit category in Saima Residencia Avenue Saima Builders is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Residencia Avenue apartment price or a Saima Residencia Avenue floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as Saima Residencia Avenue apartments listings are often incomplete.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Residencia Avenue price is positioned competitively for Scheme 33 living and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Residencia Avenue payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Residencia Avenue booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Residencia Avenue booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Residencia Avenue payment plan. For buyers seeking Saima Residencia Avenue apartments on installments, the practical route to buy flat in Saima Residencia Avenue Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Residencia Avenue payment plan before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Residencia Avenue Karachi buyers should also confirm whether flats for sale Saima Residencia Avenue Karachi are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Residencia Avenue Saima Builders is stated to be approved by the appropriate authorities, such as SBCA and the Master Plan Department, and the Saima Residencia Avenue NOC is presented as assurance to buyers and investors that properties are legally compliant and allow for secure property ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers completing booking should request the project-specific approval documentation from the developer\'s authorised sales channel and confirm the current approval status for their specific tower and unit before purchase, to avoid regulatory issues in the future.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Residencia Avenue Saima Builders has not been announced as a single project-wide date. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Residencia Avenue booking. Saima Residencia Avenue Karachi possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer, and buyers should plan for a medium- to long-term horizon rather than immediate occupancy.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 07:23:52', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(656, 85, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Residencia Avenue Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The payment plan for Saima Residencia Avenue offers flexible options tailored to different buyer needs, including booking and convenient installments spread over a longer period. Exact terms, schedules, and amounts are provided upon request through the developer\'s authorised sales channel, subject to revision.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 07:23:52', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(657, 85, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688261_6ae982c52a8a9.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 07:23:52', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(658, 85, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Residencia Avenue Location in Scheme 33, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Residencia Avenue location is in 34-A Scheme 33, Karachi. The project is opposite the Capital Cooperative Housing Society and near Safoora Chowrangi. This strategic position is directly linked to major roads in Karachi, with the M-9 Motorway, Shahrah-e-Faisal, and Malir Cantt easily accessible to residents. The Saima Residencia Avenue Karachi location is also close to major educational, hospital, and shopping centres, including Karachi University, NED University, Kiran Hospital, and Memon Medical Institute, making it a compelling choice among high-rise apartments Karachi for buyers seeking a gated community in Scheme 33.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688261_6ae982c52c949.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Chase Plus Safoora\",\"time\":\"3\\u20136 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Safoora Chowrangi\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Memon Medical Institute Hospital\",\"time\":\"3\\u20136 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Metropolitan University Karachi\",\"time\":\"3\\u20136 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 07:23:52', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(659, 85, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Residencia Avenue located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Residencia Avenue is located at 34-A Scheme 33, Karachi, opposite the Capital Cooperative Housing Society and near Safoora Chowrangi. Saima Residencia Avenue Karachi is easily accessible via University Road and the M-9 Motorway corridor.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Residencia Avenue price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Residencia Avenue price list has not been released; pricing is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Residencia Avenue Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Residencia Avenue?\",\"a\":\"Residential units are offered in 2-bedroom and 3-bedroom configurations, but inventories should be confirmed against the official Saima Residencia Avenue floor plan for Saima Residencia Avenue Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Residencia Avenue payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Residencia Avenue payment plan and Saima Residencia Avenue booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Residencia Avenue NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"The project is stated to be approved by the relevant authorities, including SBCA and the Master Plan Department; a project-specific NOC for Saima Residencia Avenue Karachi should still be verified directly with the developer before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"When is Saima Residencia Avenue possession?\",\"a\":\"Possession is not publicly fixed, so Saima Residencia Avenue buyers should confirm the schedule in writing at booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Residencia Avenue?\",\"a\":\"Saima Residencia Avenue is developed by Saima Group, which has been working for over 30 years in the field of residential and commercial projects in Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Residencia Avenue part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"No, Saima Residencia Avenue is a standalone gated residential community in Scheme 33, planned with its own residential towers, green spaces, and community facilities.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Residencia Avenue?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Residencia Avenue sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Residencia Avenue Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because Saima Residencia Avenue sits in 34-A Scheme 33 near Safoora Chowrangi, offering gated community living, spacious 2 and 3-bedroom layouts, and strong connectivity to universities, hospitals, and the M-9 Motorway. Saima Residencia Avenue Karachi also provides a clear residential identity within Saima Builders\' portfolio\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 07:23:52', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(660, 85, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover exceptional gated community living opportunities at Saima Residencia Avenue Scheme 33 Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Residencia Avenue apartments, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Saima Residencia Avenue or seeking to buy flat in Saima Residencia Avenue Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Residencia Avenue booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793345656_6ae448786db8c.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 07:23:52', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(667, 87, 'hero', 'Hero Banner', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Capital Enclave\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore Premier Properties & Real Estate Investment in Capital Enclave, Islamabad\",\"badge\":\"Prime Real Estate Destination\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 07:32:48', '2026-10-30 07:32:48'),
(668, 87, 'content', 'Table of Contents & Article', 2, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Capital Enclave Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Capital Enclave is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 07:32:48', '2026-10-30 07:32:48'),
