(684, 89, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Excellency at Gulshan-e-Iqbal Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Excellency at Gulshan-e-Iqbal Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Excellency Saima Builders is a completed apartment project, which changes the buying equation completely: instead of purchasing a promise and waiting through construction, families can view finished homes in an established neighbourhood and plan an actual move. Saima Excellency apartments offer 2-bedroom and 3-bedroom apartments suited to small and growing households.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Excellency Saima Builders sits within Saima Builders luxury projects Karachi in the broader sense of the developer\'s established portfolio, and it competes in the segment of high-rise apartments Karachi buyers shortlist when they want a ready home in a proven location rather than a long construction timeline. For families, the combination of a completed building and a settled district is the main draw.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>2 & 3-bedroom apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Approximately 1-acre parcel<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Ready to move<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Ready-to-move terms<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Family living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Excellency Saima Builders was planned as a family residential development in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, with a master plan that emphasises efficient apartment layouts, shared amenities, and organised parking rather than a scattered low-rise layout.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework reflects a practical approach to urban family living: double-basement parking that keeps vehicles organised, landscaped open areas within the development, and apartment floors planned around everyday family use. The Saima Excellency floor plan keeps the living spaces functional and the bedrooms private, consistent with a completed, occupied-style residential project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 2 & 3-Bedroom Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Excellency Karachi or flats for sale Saima Excellency Karachi, Saima Excellency Karachi offers ready-to-move layouts in two categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>2-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Excellency<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 2-bedroom apartments in Saima Excellency Saima Builders suit small families, couples, and first-time buyers who want a ready home in Gulshan-e-Iqbal without a construction wait. The layout keeps the living area practical and the bedrooms comfortable for everyday family use.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Excellency<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 3-bedroom apartments in Saima Excellency Saima Builders suit larger and growing families who need an extra room for children, parents, or a home office. These units offer more living space within the same established Gulshan-e-Iqbal address.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment type is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Excellency apartment price or a Saima Excellency floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as listings for completed projects change with availability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Excellency price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and current pricing is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Excellency payment plan should be confirmed alongside pricing, as ready-to-move projects are sold on different terms from under-construction launches.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Excellency booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Excellency booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Excellency payment plan. Buyers asking about Saima Excellency apartments on installments should confirm the current terms in writing at booking, as the project is completed and ready to move. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Excellency Saima Builders is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Excellency apartment price before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders buyers should also confirm whether flats for sale Saima Excellency Karachi are available directly or through resale, as availability in a completed project changes over time.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Because Saima Excellency is a completed project listed among Saima Builders\' delivered developments, its approval documentation should be available for inspection through the developer. Buyers should still request the project-specific approval documents for their unit before purchase.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Regulations and records can be updated over time, so current documentation should be checked directly with the developer or the relevant authority rather than relying on older listings.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders is a completed project, so possession follows completion of the payment and transfer formalities rather than a future construction date. Buyers should confirm the possession and documentation process in writing at booking for their Saima Excellency apartments unit.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 07:36:33', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(685, 89, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Excellency Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"Because Saima Excellency apartments are completed , the payment terms differ from under-construction launches: the Saima Excellency payment plan, booking amount, and transfer process are confirmed in writing through the developer\'s authorised sales channel at the time of booking, and the exact terms should be obtained before committing.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 07:36:33', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(686, 89, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688006_6ae981c6cf0d0.webp\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 07:36:33', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(687, 89, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Excellency Location in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Excellency Karachi location is in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, one of Karachi\'s most established residential districts. The neighbourhood of Saima Excellency apartments offers access to University Road and the wider city, along with schools, hospitals, markets, and everyday retail that suit family living. For buyers comparing family apartments Karachi, this is a settled address rather than a developing one.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688006_6ae981c6d0377.webp\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions:\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Millennium Mall\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Aga Khan University Hospital (Main Campus)\",\"time\":\"7\\u201310 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"University Road\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Karachi University\",\"time\":\"10\\u201315 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 07:36:33', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(688, 89, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Excellency located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Excellency is located in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi, one of the city\'s most established residential districts. The Saima Excellency Karachi location offers access to University Road, with Millennium Mall and Aga Khan University Hospital nearby.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Excellency price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Excellency price list has not been released; pricing varies by unit type, size, and floor and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Excellency apartments.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Excellency?\",\"a\":\"Saima Excellency apartments offer 2-bedroom and 3-bedroom apartments, so buyers can choose a layout that matches their household size within Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Excellency payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Because Saima Excellency apartments are completed and ready to move, the Saima Excellency payment plan and Saima Excellency booking amount should be confirmed in writing through the developer\'s authorised sales channel at booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Excellency NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval documents for Saima Excellency Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Excellency?\",\"a\":\"Saima Excellency is developed by Saima Group, which has built residential communities across Karachi over several decades.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Excellency part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"No,Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders  is a standalone completed apartment project in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Excellency?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Excellency sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Excellency Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because Saima Excellency is a completed, ready-to-move project in established Gulshan-e-Iqbal, so families can move in without waiting on construction, and investors get an address in a neighbourhood with proven rental demand. Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders also provides a clear ready-home identity within Saima Builders\' portfolio.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 07:36:33', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(689, 89, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover exceptional opportunities at Saima Excellency Karachi, Saima Excellency Saima Builders. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Excellency price, payment plan, booking amount, floor plan, and private viewings. Whether exploring apartments for sale Saima Excellency Karachi or flats for sale Saima Excellency Karachi, our consultants navigate Saima Excellency apartment booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793688006_6ae981c6d1b7a.webp\"}', '2026-10-30 07:36:33', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(690, 90, 'hero', 'Hero Banner', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Gulzar-e-Hijri\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore Premier Properties & Real Estate Investment in Gulzar-e-Hijri, Karachi\",\"badge\":\"Prime Real Estate Destination\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 07:51:49', '2026-10-30 07:51:49'),
(691, 90, 'content', 'Table of Contents & Article', 2, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Gulzar-e-Hijri Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Gulzar-e-Hijri is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 07:51:49', '2026-10-30 07:51:49'),
(692, 90, 'communities', 'Project Cards', 3, 1, 1, '{\"heading\":\"Featured Projects\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore premium residential and commercial developments\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Wadeem Gardens\",\"location\":\"Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi\",\"price\":\"Launch Price: 8.7M AED\",\"delivery\":\"Delivery Date: Q2 2031\",\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"paymentPlan\":\"Flexible Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/wadeem-gardens\",\"image\":\"\\/images\\/communities\\/wadeem-gardens.png\"}],\"selected_ids\":[],\"project_ids\":[]}', '2026-10-30 07:51:49', '2026-10-30 07:51:49'),
(693, 90, 'about', 'About Gulzar-e-Hijri', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"About the Community\",\"description\":\"A meticulously planned coastal sanctuary seamlessly integrating contemporary luxury living with untouched nature. Spanning scenic waterfronts, lush mangroves, and cycling corridors, the master community offers an unmatched urban lifestyle for residents and high-yield potential for global real estate investors.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"heading\":\"About the Community\",\"video_url\":\"https:\\/\\/stream.mux.com\\/A3200aZtT5Wq7VlYwQv3wP9W2hX8.m3u8\",\"poster_image\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 07:51:49', '2026-10-30 07:51:49'),
(694, 90, 'faq', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"<p>Key information and helpful answers regarding Gulzar-e-Hijri and property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.<\\/p>\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Are properties in this city freehold for foreign and overseas investors?\",\"a\":\"Yes, designated luxury master developments offer 100% freehold ownership for local and international buyers with complete title deed registration.\"},{\"q\":\"What are the typical payment plans available?\",\"a\":\"Flexible installment plans are offered typically linked to construction milestones, with down payments starting from 5% to 10%.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":\"Find answers to common questions about properties, buying process, and payment plans.\"}', '2026-10-30 07:51:49', '2026-10-30 07:51:49'),
(695, 90, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 6, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest in Gulzar-e-Hijri\",\"subtitle\":\"Connect with our dedicated city property advisors for personalized availability, floor plans, and VIP access.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.ae\"}', '2026-10-30 07:51:49', '2026-10-30 07:51:49'),
(696, 91, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Dreams at Scheme 33 Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Dreams, 4, 5 & 6-room apartments by Saima Builders in Scheme 33, near Safoora Chowrangi, Karachi. See key details and investment potential.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687685_6ae980855dec6.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Dreams at Scheme 33 Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Dreams at Scheme 33 Karachi\"}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-03 06:34:45'),
(697, 91, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, 1, '{\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"price\":\"AED 2,500,000\",\"handover\":\"Q4 2028\",\"property_type\":\"Luxury Villas & Apartments\",\"bedrooms\":\"2 to 5 Bedrooms\",\"items\":[],\"highlight_0\":\"Saima Builders\",\"highlight_1\":\"Coming Soon\",\"highlight_2\":\"Q4 2028\",\"highlight_3\":\"Apartments\",\"highlight_4\":\"Freehold\",\"location\":\"Scheme 33 Karachi\"}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-10 10:17:06'),
(698, 91, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Dreams by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Dreams is a residential apartment project in Scheme 33, Gulzar-e-Hijri, Karachi, near Safoora Chowrangi, offering spacious 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room apartments by Saima Builders, featuring larger family layouts in one of Karachi\'s fastest-growing residential corridors.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687685_6ae98085600c3.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-03 06:34:45'),
(699, 91, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Dreams Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Dreams Karachi provides facilities that support comfortable family living, including a community swimming pool, a community gym with sauna and jacuzzi, high-speed elevators, spacious parking, a community hall, a kids\' play area, a prayer area, landscaped community lawns, a reception, 24\\/7 standby generators, and an R.O. plant water supply within the Saima Dreams Saima Builders development.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-10 10:17:06'),
(700, 91, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687685_6ae980856213d.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687685_6ae9808562b7f.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687685_6ae980856357f.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687685_6ae9808563f81.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-03 06:34:45'),
(701, 91, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Dreams at Scheme 33 Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Dreams at Scheme 33 Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Dreams Saima Builders is a family apartment project whose standout feature is sizing: 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room apartments, which is bigger than what most projects in this price bracket offer. That alone changes who Saima Dreams Saima Builders makes sense for, a joint family that has been renting a house for years and finally wants to own something with enough rooms for everyone is exactly the buyer these layouts are built for. The towers are planned as high-rise buildings, so the larger layouts come with lift access and shared facilities rather than a low-rise walk-up format.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Within Saima Builders residential projects Karachi, Saima Dreams Saima Builders represents the larger-family end of the Scheme 33 supply, and it is regularly compared with other high-rise apartments Karachi buyers shortlist in the Gulzar-e-Hijri corridor. Its position near Safoora Chowrangi, in a neighbourhood where the developer has several projects, gives it a recognisable address for both end-users and investors.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>4, 5 & 6-room apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>2 acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Scheme 33, near Safoora Chowrangi, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On easy installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Family living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Saima Dreams is planned around contemporary family living, with a master plan that balances apartment towers with shared open and recreational spaces rather than filling the entire site with built-up area.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework is designed to provide residents with a balance of comfort, convenience, and usable shared space: apartments arranged for space efficiency, natural light, and ventilation, with community areas, parking, and facilities planned into the layout. The Saima Dreams floor plan reflects this approach, keeping family living spaces generous in line with the project\'s larger room counts.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 4, 5 & 6-Room Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Dreams Karachi or flats for sale Saima Dreams Karachi, Saima Dreams Karachi offers family layouts in three categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Room Apartments in Saima Dreams<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>The Saima Dreams apartments Karachi 4-room apartments suit families who want more space than a standard compact flat, with room for a growing household while staying within the project\'s most accessible layout category.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>5-Room Apartments in Saima Dreams<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>The Saima Dreams apartments Karachi 5-room apartments suit larger families who need an additional bedroom or a flexible room for guests, parents, or a home office, without moving up to the largest category.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>6-Room Apartments in Saima Dreams<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>The Saima Dreams apartments Karachi 6-room apartments are the project\'s largest layouts, aimed at joint families who want everyone under one roof with proper living space, the category that most clearly sets this project apart from typical Scheme 33 supply.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment type in Saima Dreams Saima Builders is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Dreams apartment price or a Saima Dreams floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The Saima Dreams price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Dreams payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Dreams booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Dreams booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Dreams payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Dreams Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Dreams apartment price before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Dreams Saima Builders buyers should also confirm whether Saima Dreams apartments on installments are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Saima Dreams apartments Karachi buyers should verify the project-specific approvals for the project directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project and its phases.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Dreams has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and handover in a project of this type is normally phased by tower. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Dreams booking, and the possession timelines for Saima Dreams 4-room apartments should be confirmed in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(702, 91, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Dreams Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The payment plan for The Saima Dreams apartments Karachi is structured around booking and subsequent instalments, with the exact current schedule, amounts, and terms provided upon request through Saima Builders\' authorised sales channel. Schedules are subject to revision, so buyers should obtain the plan in writing for their specific unit.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(703, 91, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687685_6ae9808567138.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-20 12:50:46');
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `section_key`, `section_name`, `order`, `is_active`, `is_visible`, `content`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(704, 91, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Dreams Location in Scheme 33, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Dreams Karachi location is in Scheme 33, Gulzar-e-Hijri, near Safoora Chowrangi and along Saima Boulevard. The position keeps residents connected to the Superhighway corridor and the wider city, with shopping, parks, universities, and the airport all within practical reach. For buyers comparing family apartments Karachi, Scheme 33 is one of the districts where new residential supply is concentrated.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687685_6ae9808568882.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Safoora Chowrangi\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"LuckyOne Mall\",\"time\":\"18\\u201325 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Saima Mall\",\"time\":\"12\\u201318 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Safari Park\",\"time\":\"8\\u201312 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(705, 91, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Dreams?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Dreams sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Dreams Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because Saima Dreams offers larger 4, 5, and 6-room layouts that suit joint and growing families, in a Scheme 33 location near Safoora Chowrangi that keeps improving as the corridor develops. Saima Dreams Karachi also provides a clear family identity within Saima Builders\' portfolio.\"},{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Dreams Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Dreams is located in Scheme 33, Gulzar-e-Hijri, Karachi, near Safoora Chowrangi and along Saima Boulevard. The Saima Dreams Karachi location offers access to the Superhighway corridor, with Lucky One Mall, Safari Park, and Karachi University within reach.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Dreams price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Dreams price list has not been released; pricing varies by unit type, size, and floor and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Dreams Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Dreams?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Dreams apartments Karachi offers apartments in 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room layouts, which is a larger sizing range than most projects in this corridor, so buyers can choose a layout that matches their household size within Saima Dreams Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Dreams payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Dreams payment plan and Saima Dreams booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Dreams NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima Dreams Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase, and should not rely on a general portfolio-level statement.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Dreams?\",\"a\":\"Saima Dreams is developed by Saima Group, which has built residential communities across Karachi over several decades.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Dreams part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"No, Saima Dreams is a standalone residential apartment project in Scheme 33, Gulzar-e-Hijri, Karachi, although it sits in a corridor with several other Saima developments nearby.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 07:56:08', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(706, 91, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Our property specialists will contact you with VIP floor plans, pricing sheets, and private site visit bookings.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/form image.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 07:56:09', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(707, 92, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Shield Towers at Gulshan-e-Iqbal Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Shield Towers, 4 & 5-room apartments by Saima Builders in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, near Mosamiyat, Karachi. See key details and investment potential.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687426_6ae97f82f242f.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Shield Towers at Gulshan-e-Iqbal Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Shield Towers at Gulshan-e-Iqbal Karachi\"}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-03 06:30:27'),
(708, 92, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, 1, '{\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"price\":\"AED 2,500,000\",\"handover\":\"Q4 2028\",\"property_type\":\"Luxury Villas & Apartments\",\"bedrooms\":\"2 to 5 Bedrooms\",\"items\":[],\"highlight_0\":\"Saima Builders\",\"highlight_1\":\"Coming Soon\",\"location\":\"Gulshan-e-Iqbal Karachi\",\"highlight_3\":\"Apartments\"}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-10 10:15:12'),
(709, 92, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Shield Towers by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Shield Towers is a residential high-rise project in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi, near Mosamiyat, offering 4-room and 5-room apartments across multiple towers by Saima Builders, featuring modern family living in one of Karachi\'s most established residential neighbourhoods.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687426_6ae97f82f3bb2.webp\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-03 06:30:27'),
(710, 92, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Shield Towers Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders provides facilities that support secure, comfortable family living, including a gated community with controlled access, dedicated parking, an internal commercial zone for everyday shopping, community spaces, spacious balconies, and wider corridors within the Saima Shield Towers development.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-10 10:15:12'),
(711, 92, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687427_6ae97f8300dc8.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687427_6ae97f8300eb1.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687427_6ae97f8300f93.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687427_6ae97f83010b1.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-03 06:30:27'),
(712, 92, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Shield Towers at Gulshan-e-Iqbal Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Shield Towers at Gulshan-e-Iqbal Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders is high-rise living built for families, not singles or couples looking for a small flat: bigger balconies, wider corridors, and apartments finished a notch above the older buildings around Gulshan-e-Iqbal. Instead of one lone block, the project features multiple residential towers, which gives it more of a community feel, and the gated setting provides controlled access and improved security for residents.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Among high-rise towers Karachi buyers compare, Saima Shield Towers stands out for bringing a gated, planned format to an established neighbourhood rather than a developing one. It sits naturally within Saima Builders towers Karachi, and its rental logic is straightforward: universities and hospitals nearby keep demand steady in this area, which is why gated community apartments Karachi investors watch include this project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>4 & 5-room apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>3.5 acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Gulshan-e-Iqbal, near Mosamiyat, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On easy installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Gated community<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders is planned as a multi-tower gated community rather than a single apartment block, with a master plan that separates the residential towers, parking, and an internal commercial zone for everyday shopping.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework reflects an attempt to give residents a complete community inside the boundary: properly planned parking, community spaces where residents can hold a function without renting an outside venue, and towers arranged for privacy, natural ventilation, and efficient space use. The Saima Shield Towers floor plan follows this approach, with separate living and dining areas, spacious bedrooms, modern kitchens, and well-planned bathrooms in each layout.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 4 & 5-Room Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Shield Towers or flats for sale Shield Towers Karachi, Saima Shield Towers Karachi offers family layouts in two categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Room Apartments in Saima Shield Towers<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>The 4-room apartments (Types B and B1) in Saima Shield Towers include 2 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms, making them suitable for small families and professionals who want a modern layout in Gulshan-e-Iqbal at the project\'s more accessible price point.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>5-Room Apartments in Saima Shield Towers<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>The 5-room apartments (Types A and A1) in Saima Shield Towers feature 3 bedrooms and 4 bathrooms, providing additional space for larger families who need the extra room without leaving the neighbourhood.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment type is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Shield Towers apartment price or a Saima Shield Towers floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The Saima Shield Towers price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Shield Towers payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Shield Towers booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Shield Towers Karachi booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Shield Towers payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Shield Towers Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Shield Towers apartment price before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders buyers should also confirm whether Saima Shield Towers apartments on installments are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders buyers should ask for the actual NOC before paying anything, not a verbal assurance, but the document and reference number that can be verified independently with the relevant authority.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Approval status and reference details can be updated as a project moves through different phases of construction, so whatever a buyer is told should be current, not something carried over from an older listing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Shield Towers has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and the project is under construction, so handover is expected to be phased by tower. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Shield Towers booking, and Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(713, 92, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Shield Towers Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The payment plan for Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders is spread across the construction period rather than charged as one large amount, moving through booking, allocation, confirmation, monthly and quarterly installments, construction-linked milestone payments, and a final possession payment. Exact terms, schedules, and amounts are provided upon request through the developer\'s authorised sales channel, subject to revision.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(714, 92, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687427_6ae97f8303a92.webp\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(715, 92, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Shield Towers Location in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Shield Towers Karachi location is in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, near Mosamiyat, one of Karachi\'s well-connected residential areas. The project offers quick access to University Road and Rashid Minhas Road, with the Superhighway and M-9 Motorway also accessible. Leading institutions including the University of Karachi and Dow University Ojha Campus are a short drive away, along with schools, hospitals, shopping centres, and daily convenience stores.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687427_6ae97f83048d8.webp\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"University Road\",\"time\":\"2\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Rashid Minhas Road\",\"time\":\"3\\u20137 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"University of Karachi\",\"time\":\"8\\u201312 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Dow University Ojha Campus\",\"time\":\"6\\u201310 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(716, 92, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Shield Towers Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Shield Towers Saima Builders is located in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi, near Mosamiyat, at Zoramin Residency Society. The Saima Shield Towers Karachi location offers quick access to University Road and Rashid Minhas Road, with the University of Karachi and Dow University Ojha Campus a short drive away.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Shield Towers price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Shield Towers price list has not been released; pricing varies by unit type, size, and floor and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Shield Towers Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Shield Towers?\",\"a\":\"Saima Shield Towers offers 4-room apartments (Types B and B1, with 2 bedrooms) and 5-room apartments (Types A and A1, with 3 bedrooms), so buyers can choose a layout that matches their household size within Saima Shield Towers Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Shield Towers payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Shield Towers payment plan and Shield Towers Karachi booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Shield Towers NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should ask for the actual NOC document and verify the project-specific approval status for Saima Shield Towers Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before paying anything.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Shield Towers?\",\"a\":\"Saima Shield Towers is a joint development by Saima Builders & Developers and the Zeeshan Saleem Zaki Group, combining Saima Group\'s delivery record across Karachi with an established development partner.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Shield Towers part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"Saima Shield Towers is a multi-tower residential development in its own right, planned as a gated community with its own parking, commercial zone, and community spaces.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Shield Towers?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Shield Towers sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Shield Towers Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because Gulshan-e-Iqbal is about as central as this side of Karachi gets, and Saima Shield Towers adds modern high-rise living, gated security, and dedicated parking to an established neighbourhood with steady rental demand from nearby universities and hospitals. Saima Shield Towers Karachi also provides a clear tower identity among Saima Builders towers Karachi.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(717, 92, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover modern high-rise apartments at Saima Shield Towers Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Shield Towers, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Saima Shield Towers or seeking to buy flat in Saima Shield Towers Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Shield Towers booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793357161_6ae475694782d.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 10:38:19', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
