(720, 93, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Ace Residency by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Ace Residency is a residential apartment project by Saima Builders in Karachi, featuring luxury family apartments. Saima Ace Residency apartments exact location, unit mix, and launch details have not been published on an official project page and are being released through the developer\'s authorised sales channels.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c39735.webp\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-03 06:27:27'),
(721, 93, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Ace Residency Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"The facility list for Saima Ace Residency Karachi has not been published in an official brochure yet. In line with other Saima Builders residential projects Karachi, buyers can expect the project brochure to cover security arrangements, lifts, parking, and community facilities, and the confirmed list should be obtained from the authorised sales channel before booking.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-10 10:14:58'),
(722, 93, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c3b47b.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c3b662.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c3b939.jpeg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c3bcaf.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-03 06:27:27'),
(723, 93, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Ace Residency at Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Ace Residency at Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders is positioned as a luxury residential apartment project within Saima Builders residential projects Karachi. Official project documentation, like the brochure, floor plans, and price schedule, has not been published yet, so this page sets out what is known, what is still to be confirmed, and how buyers should approach a pre-launch project of this kind.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Among high-rise apartments Karachi buyers research, new announcements from established developers attract early interest because launch-stage buyers usually get the widest unit choice. Saima Ace Residency apartments sits in that category: a name to register interest in early, while keeping every commitment conditional on the official documents. It should not be confused with gated community apartments Karachi listings for other Saima projects, and it is a separate project from Saima Ace Avenue in Scheme 33.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Apartments (mix to be confirmed)<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Not publicly disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Karachi (exact location to be confirmed)<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On easy installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Family living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A detailed master plan for Saima Ace Residency apartments has not been published yet. Based on the developer\'s other residential projects, the plan is expected to organise apartment towers with parking and shared facilities, but the confirmed layout will only be available with the official brochure.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should request the approved master plan and the Saima Ace Residency floor plan together when they are released, and check that the unit they are offered matches the approved layout before paying a booking amount.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: Luxury Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Ace Residency Karachi or flats for sale Saima Ace Residency Karachi, the confirmed unit mix is still to be published, and the categories below reflect the project\'s announced positioning.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Apartments in Saima Ace Residency<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Saima Ace Residency apartments is planned as an apartment project, and the marketed positioning is luxury apartments Saima Ace Residency within the developer\'s Karachi portfolio. The confirmed unit categories and sizes will be published with the official brochure.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>New Apartments in Saima Ace Residency Karachi<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>As new apartments Saima Ace Residency Karachi are released at launch, early buyers typically get the widest choice of floors and orientations. Buyers should compare the released floor plans carefully rather than booking from pre-launch descriptions.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The official Saima Ace Residency floor plan has not been released yet. Buyers seeking a Saima Ace Residency apartment price or floor plan should register with the authorised sales channel and request the documents as soon as they are published.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The Saima Ace Residency apartments price has not been officially released, and any figures circulating in third-party listings should be treated as unverified. Confirmed pricing will be disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel at launch.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Ace Residency booking should only be processed through the developer\'s authorised sales team once official documentation is available, and the Saima Ace Residency booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Ace Residency payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Ace Residency Karachi is to register interest now and complete the booking when the official Saima Ace Residency apartment price is published.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Ace Residency apartments buyers should also confirm whether Saima Ace Residency apartments on installments will be offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis at launch.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority once the documentation is released, and should not book on the basis of a portfolio-level claim.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so approval status should be confirmed as current at the time of booking rather than assumed from an announcement.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Ace Residency apartments has not been announced. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Ace Residency booking once the project is formally launched, and confirm Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders possession timelines in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(724, 93, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Ace Residency Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The payment plan for Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders will be published through the developer\'s authorised sales channel at launch. Buyers should obtain the written schedule for their specific unit, including booking, instalment structure, and any additional charges, before committing.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(725, 93, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c3f709.webp\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(726, 93, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Ace Residency Location in Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The exact Saima Ace Residency Karachi location has not been released on an official project page, and no dedicated page for the project exists on the developer\'s website yet. Until Saima Builders publishes the confirmed address, buyers should treat third-party location claims with caution and obtain the location in writing from the authorised sales channel. This page will reflect the confirmed location once it is officially released.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c406e8.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Malir Halt\",\"time\":\"10\\u201315 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Shahrah-e-Faisal\",\"time\":\"15\\u201320 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Model Colony\",\"time\":\"10\\u201315 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Safoora Chowrangi\",\"time\":\"20\\u201325 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(727, 93, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Ace Residency located?\",\"a\":\"The exact Saima Ace Residency Karachi location has not been published on an official project page. Buyers should confirm the confirmed address directly with Saima Builders or its authorised sales channel, and should not rely on third-party listings that guess a neighbourhood.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Ace Residency price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Ace Residency price list has not been released; pricing will be disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Ace Residency Karachi once official details are published.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Ace Residency?\",\"a\":\"The official unit mix forSaima Ace Residency apartments has not been published yet, so bedroom configurations should be confirmed against the official Saima Ace Residency floor plan when it is released.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Ace Residency payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Ace Residency payment plan and Saima Ace Residency booking amount will be disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Ace Residency NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders directly with the developer or the relevant authority once documentation is released, before paying any booking amount.\"},{\"q\":\"When is Saima Ace Residency possession?\",\"a\":\"Possession is not publicly fixed, so Saima Ace Residency apartments buyers should confirm the schedule in writing at booking once the project is formally launched.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Ace Residency the same as Saima Ace Avenue?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima Ace Residency and Saima Ace Avenue are separate names: Saima Ace Avenue is the Scheme 33 project with its own official listing, while Saima Ace Residency has no dedicated official page yet. Buyers comparing Saima Ace Residency vs Saima Ace Avenue should confirm which project a listing actually refers to before paying anything.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Ace Residency?\",\"a\":\"Saima Ace Residency Saima Builders is attributed to Saima Group, which has built residential communities across Karachi over several decades.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Ace Residency?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Ace Residency sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Ace Residency Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because early registration in a new Saima Builders project can give buyers first access to unit choice and launch terms, provided they verify the project\'s documents when they are released. Saima Ace Residency Karachi should be assessed on its official brochure, not on pre-launch listings.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(728, 93, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Register your interest in Saima Ace Residency Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Ace Residency, updated pricing, and booking information as official details are released. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Saima Ace Residency Karachi or seeking to buy flat in Saima Ace Residency Karachi, our consultants can guide you through the process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793687164_6ae97e7c42718.jpeg\"}', '2026-10-30 10:52:38', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(729, 94, 'hero', 'Hero Banner', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Indus Chowrangi\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore Premier Properties & Real Estate Investment in Indus Chowrangi, Karachi\",\"badge\":\"Prime Real Estate Destination\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 11:05:47', '2026-10-30 11:05:47');
