(730, 94, 'content', 'Table of Contents & Article', 2, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Indus Chowrangi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Indus Chowrangi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 11:05:47', '2026-10-30 11:05:47'),
(731, 94, 'communities', 'Project Cards', 3, 1, 1, '{\"heading\":\"Featured Projects\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore premium residential and commercial developments\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Wadeem Gardens\",\"location\":\"Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi\",\"price\":\"Launch Price: 8.7M AED\",\"delivery\":\"Delivery Date: Q2 2031\",\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"paymentPlan\":\"Flexible Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/wadeem-gardens\",\"image\":\"\\/images\\/communities\\/wadeem-gardens.png\"}],\"selected_ids\":[],\"project_ids\":[]}', '2026-10-30 11:05:47', '2026-10-30 11:05:47'),
(732, 94, 'about', 'About Indus Chowrangi', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"About the Community\",\"description\":\"A meticulously planned coastal sanctuary seamlessly integrating contemporary luxury living with untouched nature. Spanning scenic waterfronts, lush mangroves, and cycling corridors, the master community offers an unmatched urban lifestyle for residents and high-yield potential for global real estate investors.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"heading\":\"About the Community\",\"video_url\":\"https:\\/\\/stream.mux.com\\/A3200aZtT5Wq7VlYwQv3wP9W2hX8.m3u8\",\"poster_image\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 11:05:47', '2026-10-30 11:05:47'),
(733, 94, 'faq', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"<p>Key information and helpful answers regarding Indus Chowrangi and property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.<\\/p>\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Are properties in this city freehold for foreign and overseas investors?\",\"a\":\"Yes, designated luxury master developments offer 100% freehold ownership for local and international buyers with complete title deed registration.\"},{\"q\":\"What are the typical payment plans available?\",\"a\":\"Flexible installment plans are offered typically linked to construction milestones, with down payments starting from 5% to 10%.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":\"Find answers to common questions about properties, buying process, and payment plans.\"}', '2026-10-30 11:05:47', '2026-10-30 11:05:47'),
(734, 94, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 6, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest in Indus Chowrangi\",\"subtitle\":\"Connect with our dedicated city property advisors for personalized availability, floor plans, and VIP access.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.ae\"}', '2026-10-30 11:05:47', '2026-10-30 11:05:47'),
(735, 95, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Business Park at Korangi Township Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Business Park, a commercial project by Saima Builders at Sector 19, Korangi Township, Karachi. See key details and investment potential.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686789_6ae97d058407e.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Business Park at Korangi Township Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Business Park at Korangi Township Karachi\"}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-03 06:19:49'),
(736, 95, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, 1, '{\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"price\":\"AED 2,500,000\",\"handover\":\"Q4 2028\",\"property_type\":\"Luxury Villas & Apartments\",\"bedrooms\":\"2 to 5 Bedrooms\",\"items\":[],\"highlight_0\":\"Saima Builders\",\"highlight_1\":\"Coming Soon\",\"highlight_2\":\"Q4 2028\",\"highlight_3\":\"Luxury Apartments\",\"highlight_4\":\"Freehold\",\"location\":\"Korangi, Karachi\"}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-10 10:14:22'),
(737, 95, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Business Park by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Business Park is a commercial project at Sector 19, Korangi Township, Karachi, near Singer Chowrangi, offering offices and shops by Saima Builders, featuring a planned business address inside Karachi\'s Korangi industrial and commercial corridor.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686789_6ae97d0585aef.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-03 06:19:49'),
(738, 95, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Business Park Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Business Park Karachi provides facilities that support everyday commercial operations, including dedicated parking, lift access, security arrangements, and wide internal access planned for business traffic within the Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi development, serving the surrounding Korangi Industrial Area workforce and traders.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-10 10:14:22'),
(739, 95, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686789_6ae97d0587669.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686789_6ae97d0587cd3.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686789_6ae97d05882f7.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686789_6ae97d058882b.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-03 06:19:49'),
(740, 95, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Business Park at Korangi Township Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Business Park at Korangi Township Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Business Park Korangi Township is a commercial project built for the Korangi economy: offices for the firms that run the industrial area, and shops for the traders who serve it. Unlike a high-street plaza, a business park format groups the units in one planned development with organised access and parking, which matters in a district where commercial space is usually scattered and improvised.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Among Korangi commercial projects Karachi, Saima Business Park Korangi Township stands out for carrying an established developer\'s name into a district dominated by industrial plots and older commercial buildings. As business parks in Karachi are still relatively few, a purpose-planned scheme in Korangi Township offices territory gives both end-users and investors a clearer product to evaluate among commercial hubs Karachi.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Commercial<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Offices and shops<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Not disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Korangi Township, near Singer Chowrangi, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On Easy Installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Business hub<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi is planned as a commercial development rather than a single building, with a master plan that organises office and shop units, parking, and internal access for business traffic.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework reflects the needs of an industrial district: practical unit layouts, room for loading and customer parking, and a layout that separates office activity from retail frontage where the plan allows. The Saima Business Park floor plan should be reviewed unit by unit, as sizes and frontage differ across the scheme.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: Offices and Shops<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for offices for sale Korangi Karachi, shops for sale Korangi Karachi, or commercial property Korangi Township Karachi, Saima Business Park Korangi Township offers commercial units in two categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Offices in Saima Business Park<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The offices in Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi suit the firms that operate in and around the Korangi Industrial Area, including traders, service providers, and company offices that need a planned business address in the district rather than a converted residential unit.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Shops in Saima Business Park<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The shops in Saima Business Park are aimed at retailers serving the township\'s large residential and workforce population, with frontage units positioned for passing trade within the scheme.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for each unit category is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers seeking a Saima Business Park floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Business Park price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Shops with main frontage usually carry a premium over internal units, while offices are priced by size and floor. The Saima Business Park Korangi Township payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Business Park booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Business Park payment plan. Buyers should request the Saima Business Park office price per sqft for their preferred unit, and the practical route to an office for sale Saima Business Park Korangi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Business Park Karachi buyers should also confirm whether a commercial office on installments Korangi Karachi at this project is being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project and its phases.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Business Park has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and handover in a commercial scheme of this type is normally phased. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Business Park booking, and Saima Business Park Korangi Township possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(741, 95, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Business Park Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The payment plan for Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi is structured around booking and subsequent installments, with the exact current schedule, amounts, and terms provided upon request through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Schedules are subject to revision, so buyers should obtain the plan in writing for their specific unit.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(742, 95, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686789_6ae97d058b87e.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(743, 95, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Business Park Location in Korangi Township, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Business Park Karachi location is at Sector 19, Korangi Township, near Singer Chowrangi. Korangi is one of Karachi\'s principal industrial and commercial districts, and the Sector 19 Korangi Township commercial zone places the project within reach of factories, warehouses, trading businesses, and the residential areas their workforce lives in, including Shah Faisal Colony and Landhi.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686789_6ae97d058cce5.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Singer Chowrangi (Indus Chowrangi)\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Korangi Industrial Area\",\"time\":\"3\\u20138 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Shah Faisal Colony\",\"time\":\"7\\u201315 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Shah Faisal Colony\",\"time\":\"15\\u201325 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(744, 95, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Business Park located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Business Park is located at Sector 19, Korangi Township, Karachi, near Singer Chowrangi and the Korangi Industrial Area. The Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi location serves one of the city\'s largest industrial and trading zones.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Business Park price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Business Park price list has not been released; pricing varies by unit type, size, and floor and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Business Park Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What office \\/ shop sizes in Saima Business Park?\",\"a\":\"Office and shop sizes vary by unit and floor across Saima Business Park Korangi Township, but exact sizes should be confirmed against the official Saima Business Park floor plan for Saima Business Park Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Business Park payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Business Park payment plan and booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Business Park NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima Business Park Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"When is Saima Business Park possession?\",\"a\":\"Possession is not publicly fixed, so Saima Business Park Korangi Karachi buyers should confirm the schedule in writing at booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Business Park?\",\"a\":\"Saima Business Park is developed by Saima Group, which has built residential communities and commercial projects across Karachi over several decades.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Business Park part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"No, Saima Business Park is a standalone commercial project in Korangi Township, planned as a business park with offices and shops serving the surrounding industrial area.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Business Park?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Business Park sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Business Park Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because Korangi is one of Karachi\'s biggest employment and trading zones, and a planned business park address gives small and mid-sized firms a more organised base than scattered street shops. Saima Business Park Karachi also suits investors looking at business park offices Karachi for investment in an industrial corridor with built-in demand.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(745, 95, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover commercial opportunities at Saima Business Park Korangi Township. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Business Park, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring offices for sale Korangi Karachi or a shop for sale Saima Business Park Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Business Park booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/form image.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 11:06:26', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(746, 96, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence, a mixed-use project by Saima Builders on Main Jinnah Avenue, opposite Malir Cantt, Karachi. See key details.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686486_6ae97bd6b0cfd.png\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence\"}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-03 06:14:46'),
(747, 96, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, 1, '{\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"price\":\"AED 2,500,000\",\"handover\":\"Q4 2028\",\"property_type\":\"Luxury Villas & Apartments\",\"bedrooms\":\"2 to 5 Bedrooms\",\"items\":[],\"highlight_0\":\"Saima Builders\",\"highlight_1\":\"Coming Soon\",\"highlight_2\":\"Q4 2028\",\"highlight_3\":\"Mall & Apartments\",\"highlight_4\":\"Freehold\",\"location\":\"Main Jinnah Avenue\"}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-10 10:14:07'),
(748, 96, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence is a mixed-use project on Main Jinnah Avenue, Karachi, opposite Malir Cantt Checkpost No. 5, offering 3-bed and 4-bed apartments along with shops and showrooms by Saima Builders, featuring residential living above a retail mall in the Malir corridor.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686486_6ae97bd6b4b84.png\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-03 06:14:46'),
(749, 96, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Karachi provides facilities that support secure, convenient living and trading, including 24\\/7 security, a gymnasium, modern lifts, and a mosque within the Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue development, with the retail mall component serving residents\' everyday shopping needs.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-10 10:14:07'),
(750, 96, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686486_6ae97bd6b8b6d.jpeg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686486_6ae97bd6b8e23.jpeg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686486_6ae97bd6b9254.jpeg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-03 06:14:46');
