(751, 96, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence at Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence at Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue is a mixed-use project: a retail mall component with shops and showrooms, and residential apartments above it, in one development on Main Jinnah Avenue. That structure sets Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue apart from the purely residential Saima projects \\u2014 a single buyer can choose between a shop, an apartment, or eventually both, all within the same building.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Among mixed-use developments Karachi, this project is positioned for the Jinnah Avenue corridor\'s growth: as Scheme 33 and the surrounding population keep expanding, main-road retail with a residential catchment above it has a built-in customer base. Within opposite Malir Cantt projects, Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue mall-plus-residence format is the differentiator, and it is regularly compared with other Scheme 33 Jinnah Avenue projects by both families and shop investors.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Mixed-use<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>3 & 4-bed apartments, shops and showrooms<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>4.4 acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Main Jinnah Avenue, opposite Malir Cantt Checkpost 5, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On Easy Installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Mixed-use living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Jinnah Mall Malir Karachi and Residence is planned as a mixed-use development, with a master plan that separates the retail mall floors from the residential floors above while sharing access, parking, and services within one scheme.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework reflects how such projects work in practice: retail activity concentrated at the lower levels where footfall is natural, and residences placed above with their own lift access and privacy. The Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence floor plan should be reviewed separately for shop and apartment units, as sizes and frontage differ sharply between the two.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: Apartments, Shops and Showrooms<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for shops for sale Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi, a 3 bed apartment Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi, or a 4 bed apartment Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi, Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Karachi offers mixed-use units in three categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 3-bed apartments (5-room layouts) in Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence suit families who want a main-avenue address with shopping downstairs, in the Malir\\u2013Scheme 33 corridor.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 4-bed apartments (6-room layouts) in Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue are the project\'s larger residences, aimed at bigger families who need the extra room in the same mixed-use setting.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Shops and Showrooms in Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The retail component offers shops and showrooms within the mall, aimed at traders and brands serving the Jinnah Avenue traffic and the project\'s own residents \\u2014 the mall shops for sale Karachi category within this development.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for each unit category is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence price or floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Mall shops with main-road frontage usually carry a premium, while apartment pricing follows size and floor. The Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Jinnah Mall booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the payment plan. Buyers comparing the shop for sale Saima Jinnah Mall price, 3 bed apartment Saima Jinnah Mall price, and 4 bed apartment Saima Jinnah Mall price should request all three schedules together to compare total payable.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Karachi buyers should also confirm whether units in this mixed-use project Main Jinnah Avenue Karachi are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project and, in mixed-use schemes, can differ between the commercial and residential components.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Jinnah Mall Malir Karachi and Residence has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and handover in a mixed-use project is normally phased between the retail and residential components. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence booking, confirmed in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(752, 96, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The payment plan for Saima Jinnah Mall Malir Karachi is structured around booking and subsequent installments, with separate schedules typically applying to shop and apartment units. Exact terms, amounts, and schedules are provided upon request through the developer\'s authorised sales channel and should be obtained in writing for the specific unit.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(753, 96, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686486_6ae97bd6bbd73.jpeg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(754, 96, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Location on Main Jinnah Avenue, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Karachi location is on Main Jinnah Avenue, opposite Malir Cantt Checkpost No. 5. Jinnah Avenue is the main corridor between Scheme 33 and Malir, so the project draws on both catchments: the growing residential population of Scheme 33 on one side and the established Malir Cantonment side on the other. Main Jinnah Avenue apartments \\/ shops in this position serve residents, commuters, and the cantonment community alike.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686486_6ae97bd6bd20c.jpeg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Malir Cantonment Checkpost 5\",\"time\":\"1\\u20132 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Main Jinnah Avenue\",\"time\":\"1\\u20133 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Scheme 33\",\"time\":\"5\\u201310 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Askari 5, Malir Cantt\",\"time\":\"7\\u201312 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(755, 96, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence is located on Main Jinnah Avenue, Karachi, opposite Malir Cantt Checkpost No. 5, on the Scheme 33 side of Jinnah Avenue. The Saima Jinnah Mall Malir Karachi location serves the Malir and Scheme 33 catchments.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence price list has not been released; pricing varies by unit type, size, and floor and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What shops \\/ apartments in Saima Jinnah Mall?\",\"a\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence combines a retail component of shops and showrooms with residential apartments above, offered as 3-bed apartments (5-room layouts) and 4-bed apartments (6-room layouts) in Saima Jinnah Mall Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Jinnah Mall payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Jinnah Mall payment plan and Saima Jinnah Mall booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule; the formal project name for payment documents is Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima Jinnah Mall Main Jinnah Avenue directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"When is Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence possession?\",\"a\":\"Possession is not publicly fixed, so Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence buyers should confirm the schedule in writing at booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence the same as Saima Jinnah Icon?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence (opposite Malir Cantt Checkpost No. 5) and Saima Jinnah Icon (near Checkpost 6, Sector 40) are separate projects on Main Jinnah Avenue. Buyers should confirm which project a listing refers to before paying anything.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence?\",\"a\":\"Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence is developed by Saima Group, which has built residential communities and mixed-use projects across Karachi over several decades.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because it is the Saima project on Jinnah Avenue that lets one buyer choose between a shop, an apartment, or both in the same development, opposite Malir Cantt, with the growing Scheme 33 and Malir population as its catchment. Saima Jinnah Mall Malir Karachi and Residence also provides a clear mixed-use identity within the developer\'s portfolio.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(756, 96, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover apartments and shops at Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Malir Karachi or seeking to buy shop in Saima Jinnah Mall Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Jinnah Mall and Residence booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793686486_6ae97bd6be6ce.jpeg\"}', '2026-10-30 11:22:17', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(757, 97, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Center Point at M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Center Point, 2, 3 & 4-bed apartments by Saima Builders on Main M.A. Jinnah Road, near Saddar, Karachi. See key details.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c0f926.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Center Point at M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Center Point at M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi\"}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-03 06:05:39'),
(758, 97, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, 1, '{\"developer\":\"Modon Properties\",\"price\":\"AED 2,500,000\",\"handover\":\"Q4 2028\",\"property_type\":\"Luxury Villas & Apartments\",\"bedrooms\":\"2 to 5 Bedrooms\",\"items\":[],\"highlight_0\":\"Saima Builders\",\"highlight_1\":\"Coming Soon\",\"highlight_2\":\"Q4 2028\",\"highlight_3\":\"Luxury Apartments\",\"highlight_4\":\"Freehold\",\"location\":\"M.A. Jinnah Road\"}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-10 07:23:57'),
(759, 97, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Center Point by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Center Point is a residential apartment project on Main M.A. Jinnah Road, Karachi, near Saddar and Numaish, offering 2-bed, 3-bed, and 4-bed apartments by Saima Builders, featuring central-city living on Karachi\'s most historic commercial corridor.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c127f4.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\",\"video_url\":\"\\/images\\/nawayef-park-views\\/asset_15.mp4\"}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-03 06:05:39'),
(760, 97, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Center Point Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi provides facilities that support secure, convenient city living, including modern elevators, security systems, standby power backup, and dedicated parking within the Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road development, in a location where everyday retail and services are already established along M.A. Jinnah Road.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-10 07:23:57'),
(761, 97, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c14190.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c14562.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c1492b.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c14c7a.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-03 06:05:39'),
(762, 97, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Center Point Living & Waterfront Sanctuary\",\"intro\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Saima Center Point is a premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p><p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:1rem\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road is a central-city apartment project: instead of a suburban scheme, it places 2-bed, 3-bed, and 4-bed apartments on the road that runs through the middle of Karachi\'s oldest commercial district. That positioning is the whole story \\u2014 new residential supply in Saddar is rare because land here is built up and expensive, so a developer-backed project on this corridor serves a demand that mostly relies on old buildings and resale flats.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Among Saddar Karachi luxury projects and central Karachi apartments generally, Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi competes on address rather than sprawl: established markets, hospitals, schools, and transport are already around it, and rental demand in Saddar does not depend on a new neighbourhood developing. It is one of the few Saima Builders projects aimed squarely at the old-city buyer.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>2, 3 & 4-bed apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>11-15 acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Main M.A. Jinnah Road, near Saddar, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On Easy Installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Central city living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Center Point is planned as a high-rise residential development on a central-city plot, with a master plan that has to balance apartment floors, parking, and services on a constrained Saddar site rather than a large suburban layout.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework reflects that constraint: vertical planning, lift-served floors, and organised parking instead of open sprawl. The Saima Center Point floor plan keeps family living spaces practical within city-centre plot sizes, and buyers should review the plan for their specific unit type before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 2, 3 & 4-Bedroom Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for a 2 bed apartment M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi, 3 bed apartment M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi, or 4 bed apartment M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi, Saima Center Point Karachi offers central-city layouts in three categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>2-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Center Point<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 2-bed apartments in Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road suit small families and professionals who work in Saddar or the old city and want a central address at the project\'s most accessible price point.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Center Point<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 3-bed apartments in Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road suit growing families who need an extra bedroom while keeping a central location, and they are typically the most balanced option in the project\'s mix.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Bedroom Apartments in Saima Center Point<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 4-bed apartments in Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road are the project\'s largest layouts, aimed at joint families and buyers who want maximum space in the centre of the city.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment type is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi price or floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside the floor plan from the authorised sales channel, as secondary listings are often incomplete.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Center Point price varies depending on unit type, size, and floor, and is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. The Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road payment plan is structured to accommodate various buyer profiles, with flexible instalment options available on request.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Center Point booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the Saima Center Point booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Center Point payment plan. Buyers comparing the 2 bed apartment Saima Center Point price, 3 bed apartment price, and 4 bed apartment Saima Center Point price should request all three schedules together to compare total payable.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Center Point Karachi buyers should also confirm whether units in this project are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Regulations shift and documentation gets updated, so a status reported earlier should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Center Point has not been announced as a single project-wide date. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Center Point booking, and Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi possession timelines should be confirmed in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"appt_title\":\"BOOK AN APPOINTMENT\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(763, 97, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Center Point Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The payment plan for Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi is structured around booking and subsequent instalments, with the exact current schedule, amounts, and terms provided upon request through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Schedules are subject to revision, so buyers should obtain the plan in writing for their specific unit.\",\"down_payment\":\"10%\",\"during_construction\":\"40%\",\"on_handover\":\"50%\",\"items\":[{\"milestone\":\"Down Payment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"On Booking Date\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 1\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"6 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 2\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"12 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 3\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"18 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone 4\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"due\":\"24 Months after Booking\"},{\"milestone\":\"On Handover\",\"percentage\":\"50%\",\"due\":\"100% Completion\"}],\"plan_tabs\":null,\"download_text\":\"DOWNLOAD PAYMENT PLAN\",\"download_url\":\"#\"}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(764, 97, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Master Plan\",\"description\":\"The master plan creates a harmonious, walkable enclave where residential clusters are woven naturally into open green parklands, pedestrian corridors, and scenic waterfront trails.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c17389.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(765, 97, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Center Point Location on M.A. Jinnah Road, Karachi\",\"description\":\"Conveniently located on Hudayriyat Island with direct access via modern bridges to Abu Dhabi\\u2019s key commercial, cultural, and travel hubs.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Downtown Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"20 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Emirates Palace\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque\",\"time\":\"23 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Abu Dhabi Global Financial Centre\",\"time\":\"30 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Louvre Abu Dhabi\",\"time\":\"33 mins\"},{\"place\":\"Zayed International Airport\",\"time\":\"34 mins\"}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Center Point Karachi location is on Main M.A. Jinnah Road, near Saddar and Numaish \\u2014 the centre of old Karachi. M.A. Jinnah Road apartments in this stretch sit between the commercial heart of Saddar and the residential colonies around it, including Parsi Colony, with Empress Market, the Quaid-e-Azam Mazar, and the city\'s main transport routes all close by. For buyers who work in the old city, very few addresses are more central.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c181ed.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions:\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Numaish Chowrangi\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Quaid-e-Azam Mazar (Mazar-e-Quaid)\",\"time\":\"5\\u20138 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Saddar\",\"time\":\"3\\u20137 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Parsi Colony\",\"time\":\"1\\u20133 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(766, 97, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Key information and helpful answers regarding property purchases on Hudayriyat Island.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Center Point Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Center Point is located on Main M.A. Jinnah Road, Karachi, near Saddar and Numaish Chowrangi. The Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi location places it on the city\'s central corridor, with Parsi Colony, Empress Market, and Quaid-e-Azam Mazar in the surrounding area.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Center Point price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Center Point price list has not been released; pricing varies by unit type, size, and floor and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Center Point Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Center Point?\",\"a\":\"Saima Center Point M.A. Jinnah Road offers 2-bed, 3-bed, and 4-bed apartments, so buyers can choose a layout that matches their household size within Saima Center Point Saddar Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Center Point payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Center Point payment plan and Saima Center Point booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Center Point NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima Center Point Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Center Point the same as Saima Center Point 2?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima Center Point is the established project name with an official project listing, while \'Saima Center Point 2\' has been reported as a separate upcoming name whose exact location and details are not officially confirmed. Buyers should confirm which project a listing refers to before paying anything.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Center Point?\",\"a\":\"Saima Center Point is developed by Saima Group, which has built residential communities across Karachi over several decades.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Center Point?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Center Point sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Center Point Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because very few new apartment projects come up on M.A. Jinnah Road in Saddar, and a central address here serves both end-users who work in the old city and investors relying on Saddar\'s permanent rental demand. Saima Center Point Karachi also provides a clear central-city identity among central Karachi apartments.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(767, 97, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Register Your Interest\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover central Karachi apartments at Saima Center Point Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Center Point, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Saddar Karachi or planning to buy apartment on M.A. Jinnah Road Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Center Point booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"REGISTER INTEREST\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.com\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793685916_6ae9799c197e8.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 11:41:01', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(768, 98, 'hero', 'Hero Banner', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Main Shahra-e-Faisal\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore Premier Properties & Real Estate Investment in Main Shahra-e-Faisal, Karachi\",\"badge\":\"Prime Real Estate Destination\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '2026-10-30 12:05:43', '2026-10-30 12:05:43');
