(787, 100, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Twin Tower by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan is an under-construction twin-tower project listed under Saima Group in Capital Enclave, Islamabad. It will reportedly have studio, one-, two- and three-bedroom lounge apartments split across two towers, tagged as affordable luxury, off-plan residential. It is marketed among luxury apartments in Islamabad and residential apartments in Islamabad for professionals, families and investors.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794820443_6afac95b5e1ba.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-16 09:14:03'),
(788, 100, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Twin Tower Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan lists everyday facilities for family and high-rise living. Listed amenities include 24\\/7 CCTV security, car parking, elevators, fire fighting systems, a garbage chute, a prayer area and a play area, with electricity, sweet water and maintenance as utilities. The listing also mentions wide internal corridors, dedicated electrical rooms and multiple high-speed passenger elevators.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-03 07:23:51'),
(789, 100, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":null,\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793690268_6ae98a9c354b3.jpeg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793690268_6ae98a9c359f9.jpeg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793690268_6ae98a9c35e28.jpeg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-03 07:23:51'),
(790, 100, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>The project is a twin-tower residential high-rise on the CDA Service Road in Capital Enclave. Among high-rise apartments in Islamabad, a twin-tower layout gives buyers a choice of studios for compact living and lounge apartments for families. For anyone reviewing Islamabad real estate projects or luxury residential projects in Islamabad, the appeal here is an expressway-corridor address and an instalment-based route to ownership, not a finished building.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The listing shows Under Construction and carries a verified badge. As a Saima Builders Islamabad project, it should be judged on its own paperwork, not on the developer\\u2019s Karachi record.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Investors weighing Saima Twin Tower Islamabad investment opportunities usually look at studios and one-bedroom apartments, but rental income and resale gains are never guaranteed. Anyone comparing apartments for investment in Islamabad should also look at finished stock, which carries less construction risk.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Group (Saima Builders)<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Studio, 1, 2 and 3-bed lounge apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Towers<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Two<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Capital Enclave, CDA Service Road, Islamabad<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Status<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Under construction<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Not announced<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Construction-linked; amounts to be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No public master plan has been released for Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan. The listing splits the homes across two wings:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Tower A offers studios and one- and two-bedroom lounge apartments (types B1 to B4 and C1 to C3).<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Tower B offers studios, one- and two-bedroom lounge apartments, and three-bedroom lounge apartments (Type A1).<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Because the towers are described as a pair, ask whether they share podium parking, lifts, security and maintenance charges. Listings mention gated security and ongoing professional management. Who will run the building, and how service charges will be set, should be agreed in writing before you pay.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: Studio, 1, 2 and 3 Bed Lounge Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments in Saima Twin Tower Islamabad, the portal\\u2019s unit selector shows studio types S1 and S2, one-bedroom lounge types C1 to C4, two-bedroom lounge types B1 to B6 and a three-bedroom lounge Type A1. Unit areas are not public, so request them in writing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Studio Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Studios are the compact entry option and appear in both towers. Check the usable area, kitchen layout and balcony before comparing the price per square foot.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>1 Bed Lounge Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>One-bedroom lounge types suit couples, single professionals and small investors. Ask whether the lounge is separate or combined with the dining space.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>2 Bed Lounge Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Two-bedroom lounge types come in the most variants, so compare layouts side by side. They suit small families and shared living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3 Bed Lounge Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The three-bedroom lounge apartment is listed as Type A1 in Tower B. It is the family-size option, so confirm how many units exist and their covered area.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Unit-wise floor plans and unit pricing are not confirmed yet. Request the full set from Saima\\u2019s authorised sales channel, along with a unit-wise Saima Twin Tower price list and the approved building plan. Compare orientation, balcony size and lift access before choosing a floor.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Twin Tower price starts from around PKR 7.85 million to PKR 8.95 million, so treat both figures as indicative. Buyers who need Saima Twin Tower Islamabad apartment prices by unit type should ask for a written price list.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Twin Tower booking typically involves registering interest, choosing a unit, confirming the booking amount and signing written terms. Saima Twin Tower Islamabad booking details, including receipts, unit number, allocation terms and refund conditions, should be confirmed before any payment. Buyers comparing apartments for sale in Islamabad should also ask whether the Saima Twin Tower payment plan differs by tower and unit type.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The NOC and approval status of Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan is not publicly documented by Saima. Ask for the approved building plan, the NOC with its reference number and the title documents, then confirm them directly with CDA.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession date has been announced for the project, and the listing shows Under Construction without a completion date. Secure a documented possession schedule, including delay terms, at the point of booking. Plan for a medium- to long-term investment horizon, not immediate occupancy.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(791, 100, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Twin Tower Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<p>The Saima Twin Tower Islamabad payment plan is described as an allocation payment, a confirmation payment and construction-linked installments, with the possession payment due at transfer. Amounts vary by unit type, and the portal asks buyers to register to view payment schedules.<\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(792, 100, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Twin Tower Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793690572_6ae98bcc0d49c.jpeg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(793, 100, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan Location\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"subtitle\":\"The listed address is Plot No 3, CDA Service Road, Capital Enclave, Madina Town, Islamabad. Capital Enclave sits in Zone V under CDA jurisdiction, near PWD Housing Society, Bahria Town and Soan Garden. That makes it a practical base for residential apartments in Islamabad within reach of the Expressway corridor, and for Islamabad residential apartments aimed at commuters.\\r\\nBuyers comparing luxury apartments in Islamabad should test the commute at peak hours. CDA has begun building a six-lane parallel road along the Islamabad Expressway to ease congestion. Confirm how those works will affect this site\\u2019s own service road.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793690572_6ae98bcc0e3c5.jpeg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Islamabad Expressway\",\"time\":\"2\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"PWD Housing Society\",\"time\":\"10\\u201315 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Bahria Town (Phase 7\\/8)\",\"time\":\"15\\u201325 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Soan Garden\",\"time\":\"7\\u201312 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(794, 100, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Twin Tower Islamabad located?\",\"a\":\"The listed address is Plot No 3, CDA Service Road, Capital Enclave, Madina Town, Islamabad. Capital Enclave sits in Zone V near the Islamabad Expressway, so confirm the exact entrance on site.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the price of Saima Twin Tower Islamabad?\",\"a\":\"Listings quote prices from PKR 7.85 million to PKR 8.95 million. Ask for a unit-wise price list in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is the developer of Saima Twin Tower Islamabad?\",\"a\":\"Saima Twin Tower by Saima Builders is listed under Saima Group. Saima\\u2019s official lists do not yet show an Islamabad project, so confirm directly.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the payment plan for Saima Twin Tower Islamabad?\",\"a\":\"It is described as allocation, confirmation and construction-linked instalments, with possession payment at transfer. Amounts are not public, so request the schedule for your unit.\"},{\"q\":\"How can I book an apartment in Saima Twin Tower Islamabad?\",\"a\":\"Register interest, pick a unit and confirm the amount and terms before paying. A Saima Twin Tower booking should come with a written receipt and unit number.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Twin Tower Islamabad NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Saima has not publicly disclosed the NOC or approval status of Saima Twin Tower, Islamabad. Request the approved building plan, NOC with its reference number, and title documents, then independently verify them with CDA.\"},{\"q\":\"What apartment types are available?\",\"a\":\"Apartments in Saima Twin Tower Islamabad are listed as studios, one-bedroom lounge, two-bedroom lounge and three-bedroom lounge units across two towers. Sizes are not published.\"},{\"q\":\"Is it the same as Saima Twin Tower in Karachi?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima\\u2019s official site lists a completed Saima Twin Tower in Karachi\\u2019s Mohammad Ali Society, which is a separate project.\"},{\"q\":\"How many floors does it have?\",\"a\":\"Listings disagree, with one saying ground plus 16 floors and another 20 storeys. The approved building plan will confirm it.\"},{\"q\":\"When is the possession of this project ?\",\"a\":\"No date has been announced. Get a written possession schedule and delay terms at booking.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(795, 100, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover high-rise living at Saima Twin Tower Islamabad Pakistan. Contact our advisory team for guidance on floor plans, updated pricing and approval documents. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale in Islamabad or want to buy apartment in Saima Twin Tower Islamabad, we can help you verify the project and its paperwork first.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793690572_6ae98bcc10032.jpeg\"}', '2026-11-03 07:11:47', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(796, 101, 'hero', 'Hero Banner', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"North Nazimabad\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore Premier Properties & Real Estate Investment in North Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"badge\":\"Prime Real Estate Destination\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 07:26:08', '2026-11-03 07:26:08');
