(797, 101, 'content', 'Table of Contents & Article', 2, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-11-03 07:26:08', '2026-11-03 07:26:08'),
(798, 101, 'communities', 'Project Cards', 3, 1, 1, '{\"heading\":\"Featured Projects\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore premium residential and commercial developments\",\"items\":[],\"selected_ids\":[],\"project_ids\":[]}', '2026-11-03 07:26:08', '2026-11-03 07:26:08'),
(799, 101, 'about', 'About North Nazimabad', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"About the Community\",\"description\":\"A meticulously planned coastal sanctuary seamlessly integrating contemporary luxury living with untouched nature. Spanning scenic waterfronts, lush mangroves, and cycling corridors, the master community offers an unmatched urban lifestyle for residents and high-yield potential for global real estate investors.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\",\"heading\":\"About the Community\",\"video_url\":\"https:\\/\\/stream.mux.com\\/A3200aZtT5Wq7VlYwQv3wP9W2hX8.m3u8\",\"poster_image\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 07:26:08', '2026-11-03 07:26:08'),
(800, 101, 'faq', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Are properties in this city freehold for foreign and overseas investors?\",\"a\":\"Yes, designated luxury master developments offer 100% freehold ownership for local and international buyers with complete title deed registration.\"},{\"q\":\"What are the typical payment plans available?\",\"a\":\"Flexible installment plans are offered typically linked to construction milestones, with down payments starting from 5% to 10%.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":\"Find answers to common questions about properties, buying process, and payment plans.\"}', '2026-11-03 07:26:08', '2026-11-03 07:26:08'),
(801, 101, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 6, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Connect with our dedicated city property advisors for personalized availability, floor plans, and VIP access.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.ae\"}', '2026-11-03 07:26:08', '2026-11-03 07:26:08'),
(802, 102, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Premium Empire at North Nazimabad Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Premium Empire, 4, 5 & 6-room luxury apartments by Saima Builders in Block A, North Nazimabad, Karachi. See key details.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793691225_6ae98e59402cc.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Premium Empire at North Nazimabad Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Premium Empire at North Nazimabad Karachi\"}', '2026-11-03 07:26:44', '2026-11-03 07:45:31'),
(803, 102, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, 1, '{\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 07:26:44', '2026-11-03 07:45:31'),
(804, 102, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Premium Empire by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Premium Empire is an elite residential high-rise development located in Block A, North Nazimabad, Karachi, situated on the main road right near KDA Chowrangi, offering 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room luxury apartments by Saima Builders for families seeking spacious homes in an established neighbourhood.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793691225_6ae98e5941bba.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 07:26:44', '2026-11-03 07:45:31'),
(805, 102, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Premium Empire Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Premium Empire Karachi provides facilities that support secure and comfortable family living, including round-the-clock security, high-speed elevators, spacious dedicated parking, a 24\\/7 standby generator, a gym, and a dedicated kids\' play area within the Saima Premium Empire Saima Builders development.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 07:26:44', '2026-11-03 07:45:31'),
(806, 102, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":null,\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793691225_6ae98e59438ab.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793691225_6ae98e5943ee3.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-03 07:26:44', '2026-11-03 07:45:31'),
(807, 102, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Premium Empire Saima Builders is about elite apartment living in a neighbourhood that already works. North Nazimabad\'s markets, schools, hospitals, and transport links are established, so the project adds a newer high-rise with larger 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room layouts instead of asking buyers to wait for a new society\'s infrastructure to arrive.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Among premium luxury projects Karachi, Saima Premium Empire competes by offering more room than a typical mid-range flat without moving to DHA-style price territory. It sits naturally among high-rise luxury apartments Karachi and Saima Builders premium projects, with an address that is familiar to families and investors across the city.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr><th>Feature<\\/th><th>Details<\\/th><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Developer<\\/td><td>Saima Builders<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Property Type<\\/td><td>Residential<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Unit Types<\\/td><td>4, 5 & 6-room luxury apartments<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Total Land Size<\\/td><td>2 acres<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Handover<\\/td><td>To be confirmed<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Location<\\/td><td>Block A, North Nazimabad, near Saifee Hospital, Karachi<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Payment Plan<\\/td><td>On Easy Installments<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr><td>Lifestyle<\\/td><td>Premium family living<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Premium Empire Saima Builders is planned as one residential high-rise in Block A, organised around several apartment categories rather than a single repeated unit type, so buyers can choose according to family size and budget.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework emphasises practical movement and everyday comfort: elevators and stairwells positioned for convenient access, floors organised by apartment category, and spacious parking planned from the start. The Saima Premium Empire floor plan uses separate drawing and dining areas in the larger units, with bedrooms arranged for privacy and functional daily living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 4, 5 & 6-Room Luxury Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for luxury apartments Saima Premium Empire or apartments for sale Premium Empire Karachi, Saima Premium Empire Karachi offers spacious layouts in three premium categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Room Apartments in Saima Premium Empire<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 4-room apartments in Saima Premium Empire Saima Builders are the entry point to the project\'s elite categories, suited to families who want a larger layout and a North Nazimabad address without moving to the largest configurations.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>5-Room Apartments in Saima Premium Empire<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 5-room apartments in Saima Premium Empire provide additional living space for growing families, with separate social and private areas that make daily family life more comfortable.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>6-Room Apartments in Saima Premium Empire<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 6-room apartments in Saima Premium Empire are the project\'s largest residences, designed for bigger and joint families who need maximum room within a secure high-rise setting.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A floor plan for each apartment category is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Premium Empire apartment price or a Saima Premium Empire floor plan should request the category-specific covered area and unit schedule, as listings vary across categories and phases.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Premium Empire price varies depending on room count, covered area, floor, and facing, and current pricing is disclosed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Older listing figures should not be treated as a current rate sheet because prices and payment structures change by category.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Premium Empire booking is processed through the developer\'s sales team, and the booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Premium Empire payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Premium Empire Karachi is to register interest directly with Saima Builders or its designated sales partners and obtain the current Saima Premium Empire apartment price before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Premium Empire Karachi buyers should also confirm whether Premium Empire apartments on installments are being offered through a priority allocation system or on a first-come, first-served basis.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Premium Empire Saima Builders buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project and its current phase.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Regulations and documentation can be updated, so any approval status reported in an older listing should be re-confirmed at the time of booking rather than assumed to still apply.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A formal possession date for Saima Premium Empire has not been announced as a single project-wide date, and progress can differ by category and floor. Buyers should secure a documented possession schedule at the point of Saima Premium Empire booking and confirm Saima Premium Empire Karachi possession timelines in writing with the developer.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 07:26:44', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(808, 102, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Premium Empire Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<p>The payment plan for Saima Premium Empire moves through booking and confirmation, followed by monthly or quarterly installments and a final possession-related payment. Exact terms, amounts, and schedule duration are provided upon request through the developer\'s authorised sales channel and should be obtained in writing for the specific apartment category.<\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-03 07:26:44', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(809, 102, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Premium Empire Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793691225_6ae98e5947a8b.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-11-03 07:26:44', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(810, 102, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Premium Empire Location in North Nazimabad\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Saifee Hospital\",\"time\":\"3\\u20134 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Dil Pasand Sweets (North Nazimabad)\",\"time\":\"2\\u20134 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Shahrah-e-Sher Shah Suri\",\"time\":\"2\\u20133 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"KDA Flyover (KDA Chowrangi)\",\"time\":\"3\\u20134 minutes\"}]}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Premium Empire Karachi location is in Block A, North Nazimabad, near Dil Pasand Sweets. The project sits in an established part of North Nazimabad with access to Shahrah-e-Sher Shah Suri and the KDA Flyover, and the wider area includes Hyderi Market, schools, hospitals, and long-standing commercial districts. It is a central, settled neighbourhood rather than a developing scheme on the edge of Karachi.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793691225_6ae98e5948913.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 07:26:44', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(811, 102, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Premium Empire Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Premium Empire is located in Block A, North Nazimabad, Karachi, near Dil Pasand Sweets, with Saifee Hospital in the district. The Saima Premium Empire Karachi location provides direct access to Shahrah-e-Sher Shah Suri and the KDA Flyover, with Hyderi Market nearby.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Premium Empire price?\",\"a\":\"A confirmed public Saima Premium Empire price list has not been released; pricing varies by apartment category, covered area, and floor and is available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel for Saima Premium Empire Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Premium Empire?\",\"a\":\"Saima Premium Empire Saima Builders is marketed with 4-room, 5-room, and 6-room elite apartment layouts. Room counts and covered areas vary by category and phase, so the exact bedroom configuration should be confirmed against the official Saima Premium Empire floor plan.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Premium Empire payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Premium Empire payment plan and booking amount are disclosed through sales engagement rather than a public schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Premium Empire NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima Premium Empire Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Premium Empire?\",\"a\":\"Saima Premium Empire is developed by Saima Group, also known as Saima Builders and Developers, which has delivered residential and commercial projects across Karachi over several decades.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Premium Empire part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"No, Saima Premium Empire is a standalone residential high-rise in Block A, North Nazimabad, although Saima Group has several other projects in the same neighbourhood.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Premium Empire?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Premium Empire sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Premium Empire Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because it adds newer, larger, better-equipped apartments to an established North Nazimabad neighbourhood where schools, hospitals, markets, transport, and utilities are already in place. Saima Premium Empire Karachi also provides a clear premium identity among Saima Builders premium projects.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-03 07:26:44', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(812, 102, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover luxury apartments at Saima Premium Empire Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Premium Empire, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring luxury apartments Saima Premium Empire or seeking to buy flat in Saima Premium Empire Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Premium Empire booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793691911_6ae99107ddc2e.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 07:26:44', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(813, 103, 'hero', 'Hero Banner', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"North Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore Premier Properties & Real Estate Investment in North Karachi, Karachi\",\"badge\":\"Prime Real Estate Destination\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 07:53:18', '2026-11-03 07:53:18'),
(814, 103, 'content', 'Table of Contents & Article', 2, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-11-03 07:53:18', '2026-11-03 07:53:18'),
(815, 103, 'communities', 'Project Cards', 3, 1, 1, '{\"heading\":\"Featured Projects\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore premium residential and commercial developments\",\"items\":[],\"selected_ids\":[],\"project_ids\":[]}', '2026-11-03 07:53:18', '2026-11-03 07:53:18'),
(816, 103, 'about', 'About North Karachi', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"About the Community\",\"description\":\"A meticulously planned coastal sanctuary seamlessly integrating contemporary luxury living with untouched nature. Spanning scenic waterfronts, lush mangroves, and cycling corridors, the master community offers an unmatched urban lifestyle for residents and high-yield potential for global real estate investors.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\",\"heading\":\"About the Community\",\"video_url\":\"https:\\/\\/stream.mux.com\\/A3200aZtT5Wq7VlYwQv3wP9W2hX8.m3u8\",\"poster_image\":\"\\/images\\/projects\\/poster.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 07:53:18', '2026-11-03 07:53:18'),
(817, 103, 'faq', 'Frequently Asked Questions', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Are properties in this city freehold for foreign and overseas investors?\",\"a\":\"Yes, designated luxury master developments offer 100% freehold ownership for local and international buyers with complete title deed registration.\"},{\"q\":\"What are the typical payment plans available?\",\"a\":\"Flexible installment plans are offered typically linked to construction milestones, with down payments starting from 5% to 10%.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"subtitle\":\"Find answers to common questions about properties, buying process, and payment plans.\"}', '2026-11-03 07:53:18', '2026-11-03 07:53:18'),
(818, 103, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 6, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Connect with our dedicated city property advisors for personalized availability, floor plans, and VIP access.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"+971 2 000 0000\",\"email\":\"info@hudayriyat-island.ae\"}', '2026-11-03 07:53:18', '2026-11-03 07:53:18'),
(819, 104, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Arabian Villas at Gadap Town\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Arabian Villas, a gated villa society by Saima Builders in Sector 5-A, Gadap Town, North Karachi, near 4K Chowrangi. See key details.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793692642_6ae993e295668.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Arabian Villas at Gadap Town\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Arabian Villas at Gadap Town\"}', '2026-11-03 07:53:47', '2026-11-03 08:07:58'),
