(821, 104, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Arabian Villas by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p><span id=\\\"docs-internal-guid-23433437-7fff-e431-f9e4-b3210afdca7a\\\"><\\/span><\\/p><p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\\\">Saima Arabian Villas is a gated villa and plot housing society in Sector 5-A, Gadap Town, North Karachi, near 4K Chowrangi, offering 120, 160, and 240 sq. yd. villas and residential plots by Saima Builders, featuring ground-level family living in an established, SBCA-approved society.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693117_6ae995bd39641.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 07:53:47', '2026-11-03 08:07:58'),
(822, 104, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Arabian Villas Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Arabian Villas Karachi provides facilities that support secure family living, including a gated layout with a boundary wall, 24\\/7 security with CCTV cameras and guards, a Jamia Mosque, parks and green spaces, a playground, a commercial strip for everyday shopping, broad carpeted roads, and gas, electricity, and filtered water connections within the Arabian Villas Karachi Saima society.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 07:53:47', '2026-11-03 08:07:58'),
(823, 104, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":null,\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693117_6ae995bd3d170.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693117_6ae995bd3d32b.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693117_6ae995bd3d494.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693117_6ae995bd3d5ee.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-03 07:53:47', '2026-11-03 08:07:58'),
(824, 104, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Arabian Villas is a villa-based housing society, not an apartment project, and that distinction matters: buyers get ground-level, single-family living with their own boundary wall and their own piece of land, in houses that can be renovated or extended later. The most common options are 120 sq. yd. and 160 sq. yd. houses for small and medium-sized families, with a 240 sq. yd. option for buyers who want more room.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Among villas in Karachi, this society stands out for its longevity: it has been around long enough to have a real resale and rental market, not just pre-launch bookings, and its listings circulate constantly on the major portals. Within gated villa communities Karachi, its Arabian style villas Karachi identity and its position in the North Karachi belt keep it on the shortlist of families who want a house rather than a flat.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Villas and residential plots<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>100 acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Ready in developed blocks<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Sector 5-A, Gadap Town, North Karachi, near 4K Chowrangi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Cash \\/ limited installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Gated villa community<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Arabian Villas Saima Builders is structured into multiple blocks, Block A through Block H, with different unit types across the blocks, and a master plan that connects each block through internal roads back to the main access route near 4K Chowrangi.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The society includes well-maintained wide roads, lush green parks distributed through the community, a designated commercial stretch for everyday shopping, and community facilities including a Jamia Mosque and a playground. Which block a buyer chooses genuinely affects resale value and day-to-day convenience, so the block layout should be understood before committing to a specific unit.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: Villas and Residential Plots<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for villas for sale Karachi, Arabian villas for sale Karachi, or luxury villas Karachi, Saima Arabian Villas Saima Builders offers ground-level options in four categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>120 Sq. Yd. Villas in Saima Arabian Villas<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 120 sq. yd. villas are the Arabian Villas Karachi Saima society\'s most common and accessible category, with listings showing 2-bed and 4-bed houses in single-storey and ground-plus-one formats, suited to small families.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>160 Sq. Yd. Villas in Saima Arabian Villas<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 160 sq. yd. Villas in Arabian Villas Karachi Saima give medium-sized families more covered area and breathing room than the entry category, while staying within the society\'s established blocks.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>240 Sq. Yd. Villas in Saima Arabian Villas<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 240 sq. yd. villas are the Arabian Villas Karachi Saima society\'s largest standard houses, with listings showing larger 3-bed units for buyers who want maximum space in the same gated setting.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Residential Plots in Saima Arabian Villas<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Beyond built villas, Arabian Villas Karachi Saima society also includes residential plots in 120, 160, and 240 sq. yd. sizes for buyers who would rather design and construct their own house from scratch.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Villa layouts at Saima Arabian Villas North Karachi vary across Blocks A to H, with different sq yd options. Buyers seeking a villa for sale Saima Arabian Villas Karachi should confirm block, size, and payment basis with the developer\'s authorised sales channel, as listings for Saima Arabian Villas Saima Builders are often incomplete.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Arabian Villas prices vary by size, block, position, and construction quality: corner and park-facing units carry premiums, and developed, occupied blocks price higher than those still under construction. Most figures in circulation come from resale or secondary listings, including the Arabian Villas Karachi price ranges on portals, rather than fixed developer pricing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Arabian Villas booking generally involves selecting the plot or house, submitting standard documentation, and paying the booking amount where applicable, with formal written confirmation from the developer or an authorised consultant. Buyers looking for a luxury villa on installments Karachi should confirm case by case whether their chosen unit carries an installment option or is cash-only.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before paying anything, buyers should confirm the current price, payment structure, and development charges for the exact unit, as these are itemised separately and change with availability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Arabian Villas Saima Builders is stated to be an SBCA-approved housing society, which is a reassuring baseline for buyers. That said, NOC and legal documentation should still be independently checked for the specific unit and block being purchased, even though the society as a whole is approved.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Documentation and allotment status can differ between blocks and phases, so current papers for the exact plot or house should be inspected with the developer or the relevant authority before any payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Possession status differs block to block at Arabian Villas Karachi Saima: some units, particularly in developed blocks, are ready for possession, while others remain tied to ongoing construction, especially in newer extensions. Buyers should confirm the possession status of their specific unit in writing at booking rather than assuming a society-wide timeline.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 07:53:47', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(825, 104, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Arabian Villas Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<p>The payment picture at Saima Arabian Villas has changed over time: the society previously offered flexible installment plans built around a booking amount and monthly or quarterly installments, but selected plots and villas are now offered on a cash-only basis, while limited installment options may remain on other units. Buyers should not assume a plan from an older listing applies, and should obtain the current, unit-specific Saima Arabian Villas payment plan in writing.<\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-03 07:53:47', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(826, 104, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Arabian Villas Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693117_6ae995bd42416.jpg\",\"badge\":null}', '2026-11-03 07:53:47', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(827, 104, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Arabian Villas Location in Gadap Town\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Arabian Villas Karachi location is in Sector 5-A, Gadap Town, North Karachi, near 4K Chowrangi, which works as the main access point and directional landmark for the society. It borders Surjani Town closely and is easily reachable from Gulshan-e-Maymar and New Karachi, in a comparatively quieter part of the city away from the busiest commercial stretches.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693117_6ae995bd4330a.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions:\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"4K Chowrangi\",\"time\":\"2\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Surjani Town\",\"time\":\"5\\u201310 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Gulshan-e-Maymar\",\"time\":\"10\\u201315 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"New Karachi\",\"time\":\"7\\u201312 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-11-03 07:53:47', '2026-11-20 12:50:46');
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `section_key`, `section_name`, `order`, `is_active`, `is_visible`, `content`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(828, 104, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Arabian Villas Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Villas is located in Sector 5-A, Gadap Town, North Karachi, near 4K Chowrangi. The Saima Arabian Villas Karachi location is reachable from Surjani Town, Gulshan-e-Maymar, and New Karachi, with 4K Chowrangi as the main reference point.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Arabian Villas price?\",\"a\":\"There is no single Saima Arabian Villas price: figures vary significantly by plot size, block, position, and whether the unit is a plot or a built house, and most current figures come from resale listings rather than fixed developer pricing. Buyers should obtain a current, unit-specific quote in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Arabian Villas?\",\"a\":\"Bedroom counts vary by plot size and construction type: listings show 2-bed and 4-bed houses on 120 sq. yd. plots and larger 3-bed units on 240 sq. yd. plots, in single-storey and ground-plus-one formats. The exact configuration should be confirmed for the specific unit.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Arabian Villas payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Payment terms now vary by unit: selected plots and villas are offered on a cash-only basis, while limited installment options may still be available on others. The Saima Arabian Villas payment plan for a specific unit should be confirmed in writing before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Arabian Villas NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Villas Saima Builders as a whole is stated to be SBCA-approved, but buyers should still independently check the NOC and legal documentation for the specific unit and block they are buying into before paying.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Arabian Villas?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Villas is developed by Saima Group, which has been delivering real estate projects across Karachi since the 1980s.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Arabian Villas part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Villas is the main society, organised into Blocks A through H. Its premium extension, Saima Arabian Ranches, sits within the wider society and is covered separately.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Arabian Villas?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Arabian Villas sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Arabian Villas Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because it offers actual ground-level houses and plots in a gated, established society with a real resale and rental market, rather than launch-stage promises. Saima Arabian Villas Karachi also gives buyers their own boundary wall and land, with the option to extend later.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-03 07:53:47', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(829, 104, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover villas and plots at Saima Arabian Villas Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Arabian Villas Saima Builders, current availability, and site visits. Whether you are exploring villas for sale Karachi or seeking to buy villa in Saima Arabian Villas Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Arabian Villas booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693264_6ae996502f775.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 07:53:47', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(830, 105, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Arabian Ranches at North Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Arabian Ranches, the premium phase of Saima Arabian Villas near 4K Chowrangi, North Karachi, with 120 sq. yd. plots on installments.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693822_6ae9987ec765b.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Arabian Ranches at North Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Arabian Ranches at North Karachi\"}', '2026-11-03 08:10:40', '2026-11-03 08:20:54'),
(831, 105, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, 1, '{\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 08:10:40', '2026-11-03 08:20:54'),
(832, 105, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Arabian Ranches by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Arabian Ranches is a newer residential phase within the Saima Arabian Villas society, near 4K Chowrangi, North Karachi, offering mainly 120 sq. yd. residential plots on installments by Saima Builders, featuring a premium position inside an established gated community with its own plot inventory and development plan.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693822_6ae9987ec8f34.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 08:10:40', '2026-11-03 08:20:54'),
(833, 105, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Arabian Ranches Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Arabian Ranches Karachi Saima provides facilities that support secure family living, including a complete boundary wall with gated, controlled entry, lush green public parks, a grand mosque, a school, commercial shops and small markets, a medical complex within the wider community, and enhanced security within the Saima Arabian Ranches Saima Builders phase.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 08:10:40', '2026-11-03 08:20:54'),
(834, 105, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":null,\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693822_6ae9987eca7f1.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693822_6ae9987ecacc6.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693822_6ae9987ecaec4.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693822_6ae9987ecb129.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693822_6ae9987ecb36b.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693822_6ae9987ecb5dc.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-03 08:10:40', '2026-11-03 08:20:54'),
(835, 105, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Arabian Ranches Karachi Saima is a plot phase, not a built-villa launch: the main offering is 120 sq. yd. residential plots sold on installments, inside a phase that has its own inventory and development plan while sharing the wider Arabian Villas community. That structure is the appeal, as buyers get a newer section of the society without giving up the established surroundings, occupied blocks, and facilities that already exist around it.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Among ranch communities Karachi and farmhouse projects Karachi searches, this phase appears because of its name and its open, green setting, but buyers should be clear about what is actually being sold: residential plots in a gated villa society, marketed at the premium end of that society, rather than farmhouses. Positioned among luxury ranches Karachi in name, its real value is the combination of an installment plan and an established address.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>120 sq. yd. plots; villas in listings<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>120 sq. yd.<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Phased<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Within Saima Arabian Villas, near 4K Chowrangi, North Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Easy monthly installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Gated community<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Arabian Ranches functions as a dedicated block within the wider Arabian Villas master plan, which is organised around multiple sectors and blocks, with the Ranches phase following its own development plan for plots and infrastructure.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Internal roads connect the Ranches block back to the main access route near 4K Chowrangi, tying it into the same road network as the rest of the society. Green public parks, a grand mosque, a school, and small markets are part of the community framework, and roads, boundary walls, and shared facilities are being developed as part of the phase\'s rollout.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: Plots and Villas<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for ranches for sale Karachi, farmhouses \\/ ranches Karachi, or villas \\/ ranches Saima Arabian, Arabian Ranches Karachi Saima offers options centred on one main category.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>120 Sq. Yd. Residential Plots in Saima Arabian Ranches<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 120 sq. yd. plot is the Saima Arabian Ranches Saima Builders phase\'s primary offering and its accessible entry point, giving buyers the freedom to design a personalised home, choose their own materials, and customise the interior to their own vision.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Villas and Townhouses in Saima Arabian Ranches<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Alongside plots, Saima Arabian Ranches Saima Builders listings also reference elegant villas and townhouses within the wider community, and some finished or partially finished houses appear within Ranches, although plot bookings remain the more commonly available option at this stage.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Current availability should be confirmed with the developer\'s sales office, as plot inventory in the phase changes with the rollout. Buyers seeking a ranch for sale Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi should clarify whether a listing is for a Ranches-phase plot or an older Arabian Villas section before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Plot layouts at Arabian Ranches Karachi Saima Karachi vary across multiple blocks, with 120 sq. yd. and other residential options available. Buyers seeking a plot or home in Saima Arabian Ranches Saima Builders should confirm block, size, and payment basis with the developer\'s authorised sales channel, as listings for Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi are often incomplete.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Arabian Ranches plot prices vary depending on block position, orientation such as east-open, and current market conditions, and most pricing references centre on the 120 sq. yd. size. Where finished villas or houses are available within Ranches, pricing sits higher than raw plots, reflecting the construction cost.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Arabian Ranches booking follows the standard process: select the plot, submit documentation, and pay the initial booking amount, with written confirmation from the developer or an authorised consultant. Buyers searching for a farmhouse on installments Karachi should note that the installment product here is a residential plot within a villa society, which they can later build on to their own design.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before committing, buyers should confirm the total payable including development and possession charges, as these are separate from the base plot price and are a common source of confusion in older listings.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>According to project sources, Saima Arabian Ranches operates under the same SBCA-approved NOC as the rest of Saima Arabian Villas. Buyers should still check the legal documentation for the specific plot and block they are buying into, even though the wider society is approved.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Phase-level documentation and development status can change as the rollout progresses, so current papers should be verified with the developer or the relevant authority at the time of booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Possession at Arabian Ranches Karachi Saima follows the phase\'s development rollout and completion of the installment schedule, with the final possession payment typically due before handover of the plot. Because the phase is still developing, buyers should confirm the possession timeline for their specific plot in writing at the point of Saima Arabian Ranches booking.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 08:10:40', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(836, 105, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Arabian Ranches Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<p>The payment plan for Saima Arabian Ranches Saima Builders is built around affordable installments for its 120 sq. yd. plots: a booking amount reserves the plot, a confirmation payment follows, and the remaining balance is spread across monthly or quarterly installments, with development charges and possession charges itemised separately. Specific figures change periodically, so buyers should obtain the current written schedule rather than relying on older listings.<\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-03 08:10:40', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(837, 105, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Arabian Ranches Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693822_6ae9987ed026e.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-11-03 08:10:40', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(838, 105, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Arabian Ranches Location in North Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"4K Chowrangi\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Surjani Town\",\"time\":\"5\\u201310 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"M-10 Karachi Northern Bypass\",\"time\":\"5\\u201310 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Dreamworld Resort\",\"time\":\"15\\u201320 minutes\"}]}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi location is within the Saima Arabian Villas society, near 4K Chowrangi in North Karachi \\u2014 if you know where Arabian Villas is, you know where Ranches is, as it forms part of the same overall footprint. Access runs through the 4K Chowrangi corridor via Surjani Road West and Manghopir Road, with the M-10 Karachi Northern Bypass a few minutes\' drive away and Surjani Town and Ittihad Town close by.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793693822_6ae9987ed11c3.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 08:10:40', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(839, 105, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Ranches is situated within the Saima Arabian Villas society, near 4K Chowrangi, North Karachi. The Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi location uses the same 4K Chowrangi access corridor as the wider society, with Surjani Town and the M-10 Karachi Northern Bypass nearby.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Arabian Ranches price?\",\"a\":\"There is no fixed public Saima Arabian Ranches price: plot prices vary with market conditions, block position, and orientation, and figures in older listings may not reflect the current schedule. Buyers should obtain the current Arabian Ranches Karachi price in writing from the sales office.\"},{\"q\":\"What plot \\/ villa sizes in Saima Arabian Ranches?\",\"a\":\"The primary size marketed in Saima Arabian Ranches Saima Builders  is the 120 sq. yd. residential plot. The wider 160 and 240 sq. yd. sizes belong mainly to the older sections of Saima Arabian Villas rather than the Ranches phase, so buyers should clarify which section a listing belongs to.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Arabian Ranches payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Arabian Ranches Karachi Saima is marketed on an installment plan: booking and confirmation payments, followed by monthly or quarterly installments, with development and possession charges itemised separately. The exact current schedule should be obtained in writing before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Arabian Ranches NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Ranches operates under the same SBCA-approved NOC as the wider Saima Arabian Villas society, according to project sources, but buyers should still verify the documentation for their specific plot before paying.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Arabian Ranches?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Ranches is developed by Saima Builders, the same developer behind the wider Saima Arabian Villas community in North Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Arabian Ranches part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"Yes. Saima Arabian Ranches is a distinct phase within the larger Saima Arabian Villas community, with its own plot inventory and development plan, rather than a completely separate society.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Arabian Ranches?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Arabian Ranches sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because it offers a newer-phase plot inventory on installments inside an already established, occupied society, so buyers get the wider community\'s facilities and resale market from day one instead of waiting for a new scheme to develop.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-03 08:10:40', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(840, 105, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover plots in the newest phase of Saima Arabian Villas at Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Arabian Ranches, current availability, and site visits. Whether you are exploring ranches for sale Karachi or seeking to buy ranch in Saima Arabian Ranches Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Arabian Ranches booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793694039_6ae999574561b.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 08:10:40', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(841, 106, 'hero', 'Hero Banner', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Gulistan-e-Johar\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore Premier Properties & Real Estate Investment in Gulistan-e-Johar, Karachi\",\"badge\":\"Prime Real Estate Destination\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 08:26:01', '2026-11-03 08:26:01'),
(842, 106, 'content', 'Table of Contents & Article', 2, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">A premier benchmark for luxury waterfront living, seamlessly blending contemporary architectural elegance with a tranquil coastal sanctuary. Residents enjoy fresh sea breezes, private beach access, and immediate connectivity to key metropolitan hubs.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Located along prestigious shoreline corridors, the community offers an inspired lifestyle for professionals, investors, and families seeking refined island elegance away from urban congestion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"saimaIntroP\\\">Every residence offers a harmonious blend of sophistication, security, and long-term capital appreciation, presenting an extraordinary investment opportunity in one of the most coveted coastal addresses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>About the Developers<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Crafted by premier developers renowned for shaping iconic waterfront communities across the region for decades. Buyers and international investors benefit from a celebrated track record of timely delivery, construction excellence, and sustainable urban design.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Working alongside leading international architectural consultants and market advisory firms, every aspect of the project is engineered to global standards of prestige and durability.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals &amp; Clearances<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The project holds full regulatory clearance and title approvals from all relevant municipal and developmental authorities. Complying strictly with environmental and structural guidelines, purchasers can invest with absolute peace of mind and secure freehold ownership.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Prime Location &amp; Seamless Connectivity<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Set within a scenic coastal landscape, the project offers rapid access to international airports, commercial business districts, premier private schools, and luxury retail destinations.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC1.png\\\" alt=\\\"Strategic Location &amp; Connectivity Map\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); width: 100%; margin: 15px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Surrounded by protected green reserves and pristine waters, residents wake up to panoramic coastal vistas and unpolluted air throughout the year.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Architectural Excellence &amp; Floor Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The layouts focus on space efficiency, panoramic natural lighting, and seamless indoor-outdoor living with spacious private terraces and balconies.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Curated Residences &amp; Layout Types<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC2.png\\\" alt=\\\"Luxury Layout Plan - Type C\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Featuring open-plan living rooms, floor-to-ceiling double-glazed windows, designer show kitchens, and lavish en-suite master bedrooms designed for modern family living.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC3.png\\\" alt=\\\"Executive Layout Plan - Type B\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Expansive terraces provide seamless entertaining spaces overlooking lush landscaped courtyards and the sparkling coastline.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC4.png\\\" alt=\\\"Presidential Villa Layout Plan - Type A\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Generous multi-level accommodations including private elevators, maid\'s quarters, private swimming pools, and dedicated family lounges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan &amp; Community Lifestyle<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The community master plan establishes a secure, private, and walkable residential haven. Dedicated subterranean parking ensures pedestrian safety across surface walkways, cycling trails, and waterfront boardwalks.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC8.png\\\" alt=\\\"Community Master Plan Overview\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Flexible Investment &amp; Payment Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>A buyer-friendly, construction-linked payment structure is offered with flexible milestones, making property acquisition straightforward and stress-free.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><img src=\\\"\\/TOC12.png\\\" alt=\\\"Milestone Payment Structure\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin: 10px 0;\\\"><\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>World-Class Facilities &amp; Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Enjoy infinity swimming pools, state-of-the-art fitness centres, private beach cabanas, children\'s play areas, multi-sport courts, and fine-dining waterfront restaurants just steps from your front door.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-11-03 08:26:01', '2026-11-03 08:26:01'),
