(888, 111, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Boulevard by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Boulevard is a multi-tower residential apartment project in Sector 29, Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, Karachi, by Saima Builders, offering 2-bedroom (Type B), 3-bedroom (Type A), and 4-bedroom (Type XL) apartments across a project area of 969,811.25 square feet, with a small commercial strip and shared amenities built around one master plan.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793704430_6ae9c1ee275b6.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 11:05:58', '2026-11-03 11:14:02'),
(889, 111, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Boulevard Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Boulevard Karachi provides amenities that cover most day-to-day needs inside the gate, including a swimming pool, a gymnasium, a children\'s play area, high-speed elevators, dedicated parking, 24\\/7 security with CCTV surveillance, power backup, a prayer area, retail shops in the project\'s commercial strip, and green areas within the Saima Boulevard Saima Builders scheme.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 11:05:58', '2026-11-03 11:14:02'),
(890, 111, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":null,\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793704430_6ae9c1ee29536.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793704430_6ae9c1ee2a0bc.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793704430_6ae9c1ee2ab1b.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793704430_6ae9c1ee2b41a.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-03 11:05:58', '2026-11-03 11:14:02'),
(891, 111, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Boulevard is a residential apartment project built as multiple towers rather than one single building, which gives it more of an actual community feel than a single-block apartment building usually has. A designated commercial zone and green spaces are built into the layout, and parking has been planned properly, which is a detail that sounds minor until you have lived somewhere in Karachi where finding a spot every evening becomes its own small battle.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Within Saima Builders projects Scheme 33, Saima Boulevard Saima Builders is one of the larger schemes, and among apartments in Scheme 33 Karachi it keeps coming up in conversations for three reasons: the connectivity, the developer\'s track record of occupied projects, and a payment plan that does not ask for a buyer\'s entire savings upfront. What matters most is whether it is actually built the way it is advertised, which buyers should verify on site.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>2, 3 & 4-bedroom apartments (Types B, A, XL)<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>2 acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Under construction<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Sector 29, Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On Easy Installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Family living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Boulevard Scheme 33 is structured as a multi-tower master plan around shared amenities: residential towers, a small commercial strip on the ground level, dedicated parking, and green areas woven through the layout.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework is designed so residents should not need to leave the gate for most day-to-day things: shops for everyday essentials, play areas and green spaces for families, and security within the compound. The Saima Boulevard floor plan keeps interiors consistent across types \\u2014 spacious bedrooms, modern kitchens, attached bathrooms, separate drawing rooms, private balconies, and dedicated wash areas, with large windows for natural light and ventilation.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 2, 3 & 4-Bedroom Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Boulevard or flats for sale Saima Boulevard Karachi, Saima Boulevard Scheme 33 offers family layouts in three categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>2-Bedroom Apartments (Type B) in Saima Boulevard<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 2-bedroom Type B apartments in Saima Boulevard Saima Builders are designed for young couples, small families, and first-time homebuyers, with two spacious bedrooms, a comfortable lounge and dining area, a separate drawing room, a modern kitchen, attached bathrooms, a balcony, and a dedicated wash area.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3-Bedroom Apartments (Type A) in Saima Boulevard<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 3-bedroom Type A apartments in Saima Boulevard Scheme 33 provide additional space for growing families: three well-sized bedrooms, a spacious lounge and dining area, a separate drawing room, a modern kitchen, multiple attached bathrooms, a powder room, a balcony, and a dedicated wash area.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Bedroom Apartments (Type XL) in Saima Boulevard<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 4-bedroom Type XL apartments in Saima Boulevard Saima Builders are the largest residential option, designed for large and joint families, with four spacious bedrooms, an expansive lounge and dining area, a separate drawing room, a modern kitchen, multiple attached bathrooms, a powder room, a wide balcony, and a dedicated wash area.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Floor plans for all three types are available through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers seeking a Saima Boulevard apartment price or floor plan should request the unit schedule alongside it, and verify on site what has actually been built so far.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Boulevard price scales by type: 2-bedroom units sit at the entry-level price point, 3-bedroom units come next, balancing space and affordability, and the larger Type XL units sit at the top of the pricing scale. Prices shift with construction progress and demand, so current figures should be obtained directly.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Boulevard booking is processed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel, and the Saima Boulevard booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Boulevard payment plan. The practical route to buy flat in Saima Boulevard Karachi is to register interest with Saima Builders or its authorised consultants and obtain the current Saima Boulevard apartment price before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Boulevard Karachi buyers should also confirm whether Saima Boulevard apartments on installments are being allocated through a priority system or on a first-come, first-served basis, and ask for current construction progress photos or a site visit.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Boulevard Scheme 33 buyers should check the NOC before handing over any money: ask the sales office directly for the current No Objection Certificate and the approved building plan, and get the actual document or reference number rather than a verbal assurance.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Approval status can shift as a project moves through different construction phases, so whatever a buyer is told needs to be current, not something pulled from an old listing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Boulevard Saima Builders is under construction, and no single possession date applies project-wide. Whatever timeline is given at booking should be reconfirmed periodically and secured in writing, as large residential projects can see deadlines shift. Buyers should also ask whether possession is handed over tower by tower.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 11:05:58', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(892, 111, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Boulevard Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Boulevard offers installment plans across Type A, Type B, and Type XL apartments. Each schedule begins with booking, allocation, and confirmation, continues through monthly and quarterly installments and construction milestone payments, and ends with the possession payment at handover. Additional charges apply to corner, road-facing, park-facing, and west-open apartments, and documentation, lease, and utility connection charges are separate and payable when requested by the developer. Exact amounts are provided through the developer\'s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-03 11:05:58', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(893, 111, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Boulevard Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793704430_6ae9c1ee2e38e.jpg\",\"badge\":null}', '2026-11-03 11:05:58', '2026-11-20 12:50:46');
INSERT INTO `page_sections` (`id`, `page_id`, `section_key`, `section_name`, `order`, `is_active`, `is_visible`, `content`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(894, 111, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Boulevard Location in Scheme 33, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"University Road\",\"time\":\"4\\u20137 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Main Super Highway (M-9)\",\"time\":\"5\\u201310 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Safoora Chowrangi\",\"time\":\"4\\u20137 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Gulshan-e-Iqbal\",\"time\":\"12\\u201320 minutes\"}]}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Boulevard Karachi location is in Sector 29, Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, a pocket that has picked up steam because of how well it connects to University Road, the Super Highway, and the M-9 Motorway. University Road is minutes away, the airport roughly 20 to 25 minutes, and Gulshan-e-Iqbal and Gulistan-e-Johar are both a short drive, alongside schools, hospitals, and commercial markets in the surrounding area. For the exact plot number, buyers should go straight to the sales office, as address details are sometimes refined as new phases roll out.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793704430_6ae9c1ee2f9e0.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 11:05:58', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(895, 111, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Boulevard Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Boulevard is located in Sector 29, Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, Karachi, per the developer\'s project listing. From here, University Road, the Main Super Highway, and the M-9 Motorway are all reachable without a long detour, and Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Gulistan-e-Johar, and Jinnah International Airport are a short drive away.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Boulevard price?\",\"a\":\"Current pricing for Saima Boulevard Scheme 33 differs by unit type, floor, and position, and shifts with construction progress and demand. Buyers should obtain the current price for the specific unit from the developer\'s authorised sales channel rather than relying on older listings.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Boulevard?\",\"a\":\"Saima Boulevard offers three layouts: 2-bedroom Type B apartments, 3-bedroom Type A apartments, and 4-bedroom Type XL apartments, each with a separate drawing room, lounge and dining area, attached bathrooms, a balcony, and a dedicated wash area.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Boulevard payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Boulevard payment plan begins with booking, allocation, and confirmation, continues through monthly and quarterly installments and construction milestone payments, and ends with a possession payment at handover. Exact amounts are provided through the developer\'s authorised sales channel\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Boulevard NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should ask the sales office directly for the current NOC and approved building plan forSaima Boulevard Scheme 33, including the actual document or reference number, before handing over any money, as approval status can shift across construction phases.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Boulevard?\",\"a\":\"Saima Boulevard is developed by Saima Builders & Developers, the construction arm of Saima Group, active in Karachi real estate since 1985, with a long list of completed and occupied projects behind it.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Boulevard part of a larger project?\",\"a\":\"Saima Boulevard Saima Builders is one of several Saima Group projects in Scheme 33, sitting near other Saima developments in the same pocket, so the roads and civic groundwork around it have been developing for years. It remains a distinct project with its own unit types and payment schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Boulevard?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels; booking typically requires a CNIC or passport and NICOP, photographs, and next-of-kin details, with additional remittance options for overseas buyers to confirm with the sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Boulevard Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because of the combination of a well-connected Scheme 33 location, a choice of 2, 3, and 4-bedroom layouts, amenities that reduce daily hassle, and a structured payment plan that spreads the cost across the construction timeline instead of demanding it all upfront.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-03 11:05:58', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(896, 111, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover family apartments at Saima Boulevard Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance onSaima Boulevard Saima Builders, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Saima Boulevard or seeking to buy flat in Saima Boulevard Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Boulevard booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793704430_6ae9c1ee31955.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 11:05:58', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(897, 112, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima ACE Avenue at Scheme 33 Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima ACE Avenue by Saima Builders in Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, on Main Super Highway, Karachi, with 3, 4 & 5-room apartments.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793705066_6ae9c46aec8bd.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima ACE Avenue at Scheme 33 Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima ACE Avenue at Scheme 33 Karachi\"}', '2026-11-03 11:16:30', '2026-11-03 11:53:49'),
(898, 112, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, 1, '{\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 11:16:30', '2026-11-03 11:53:49'),
(899, 112, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima ACE Avenue by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"Saima ACE Avenue is an under-construction residential high-rise in Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, Karachi, fronting the Main Super Highway, offering 3-room (Type C), 4-room (Type B), and 5-room (Type A) apartments in a ground-plus-10 structure by Saima Builders & Developers.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793705066_6ae9c46aeef49.webp\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 11:16:30', '2026-11-03 11:53:49'),
(900, 112, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima ACE Avenue Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Ace Avenue Scheme 33 provides facilities designed for families who plan to live there, including dedicated parking floors, gated access, high-speed passenger and cargo lifts, a standby generator, a community center, a reception and lobby area, a dedicated family zone, a rooftop, a landscaped park, a gym, and an RO water plant for clean drinking water, within the Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders scheme.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 11:16:30', '2026-11-03 11:53:49'),
(901, 112, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":null,\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793705066_6ae9c46af0862.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793705066_6ae9c46af0ab8.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793705066_6ae9c46af1794.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793705066_6ae9c46af196e.jpeg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-03 11:16:30', '2026-11-03 11:53:49'),
(902, 112, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima ACE Avenue is a ground-plus-10 apartment building of roughly 277,839 square feet, with work having started back in mid-2021. Structurally, the apartments are wrapped around a central lift and lobby core on every floor, which is the kind of layout meant to keep units bright and airy rather than dark and boxed in, which is still a problem in a lot of older Karachi buildings.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders does not stand alone: it is part of Saima\'s larger cluster in Scheme 33, sitting near projects like Saima Boulevard and Saima Meadows Avenue, so the roads and basic civic groundwork around it have been developing for years thanks to the group\'s earlier work in the same pocket. Among apartments on Main Super Highway Karachi, it is pitched at salaried buyers who want a home they can actually plan around.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>3-room (Type C), 4-room (Type B) & 5-room (Type A) apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>2 Acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Under construction<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, Main Super Highway, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On Easy Installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Family living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Ace Avenue Scheme 33 is planned as a single ground-plus-10 residential building: ten residential floors of roughly eight apartments each, shared amenities spread across the ground floor and rooftop, and dedicated parking floors baked into the plan.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework prioritises function over show: living areas, bedrooms, and kitchens are placed to catch as much natural light as possible, and shared spaces like community center, family zone, landscaped park are built into the scheme rather than added later. Whether any ground-floor commercial component applies specifically to Saima Ace Avenue Scheme 33 has not been pinned down in public sources, so buyers seeking commercial space should ask the developer directly.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 3, 4 & 5-Room Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima ACE Avenue or flats for sale Saima ACE Avenue Karachi, Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders offers family layouts in three categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3-Room Apartments (Type C) in Saima ACE Avenue<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 3-room Type C in Saima Ace Avenue Scheme 33 is the entry-level unit, around 850 square feet: a good fit for smaller families or first-time buyers who want into Scheme 33 without stretching too far, while still getting the full run of the building\'s shared amenities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Room Apartments (Type B) in Saima ACE Avenue<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 4-room Type B in Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders, roughly 1,100 square feet, sits neatly between Type C and Type A: usually the sweet spot for growing families who need one more room but are not ready to jump straight to the biggest unit.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>5-Room Apartments (Type A) in Saima ACE Avenue<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 5-room Type A in Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders is the largest option, around 1,300 square feet, built for bigger households or anyone who wants an extra room for a home office or guests.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The three unit types map directly to three, four, and five rooms, so matching size to family need is straightforward. Buyers seeking a Saima ACE Avenue apartment price or floor plan should request the current unit schedule from the sales office.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima ACE Avenue price depends on the floor, the unit\'s position in the building, and how far along construction is at the time of booking. Book earlier and the price is generally lower, as with almost every under-construction project in the city. Current figures are available through the developer\'s sales office.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima ACE Avenue booking is processed through Saima\'s own sales network and authorised real estate partners, and the Saima ACE Avenue booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima ACE Avenue payment plan, since offers are revised, especially during promotional periods.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima ACE Avenue Karachi buyers should also confirm current stock before making a final call, as floor allocations and unit availability change fairly often on an under-construction building.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Ace Avenue Scheme 33 buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Because the building is under construction, buyers should also confirm the current construction status directly with the sales office rather than relying on how the developer\'s other projects have progressed, since every project has its own pace.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders is under construction, and a firm, publicly confirmed completion date has not been published. Possession follows once floors are actually finished, and buyers should ask whether handover happens floor by floor or as one handover, and get any move-in timeline in writing from the developer before booking. Finishing installments and getting possession are not the same event.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"<p>At its core, Saima ACE Avenue is a ground-plus-10 apartment building of roughly 277,839 square feet, with work having started back in mid-2021. Structurally, the apartments are wrapped around a central lift and lobby core on every floor, which is the kind of layout meant to keep units bright and airy rather than dark and boxed in, which is still a problem in a lot of older Karachi buildings.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders does not stand alone: it is part of Saima\'s larger cluster in Scheme 33, sitting near projects like Saima Boulevard and Saima Meadows Avenue, so the roads and basic civic groundwork around it have been developing for years thanks to the group\'s earlier work in the same pocket. Among apartments on Main Super Highway Karachi, it is pitched at salaried buyers who want a home they can actually plan around.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>3-room (Type C), 4-room (Type B) &amp; 5-room (Type A) apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>2 Acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Under construction<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, Main Super Highway, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On Easy Installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Family living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Ace Avenue Scheme 33 is planned as a single ground-plus-10 residential building: ten residential floors of roughly eight apartments each, shared amenities spread across the ground floor and rooftop, and dedicated parking floors baked into the plan.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The framework prioritises function over show: living areas, bedrooms, and kitchens are placed to catch as much natural light as possible, and shared spaces like community center, family zone, landscaped park are built into the scheme rather than added later. Whether any ground-floor commercial component applies specifically to Saima Ace Avenue Scheme 33 has not been pinned down in public sources, so buyers seeking commercial space should ask the developer directly.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 3, 4 &amp; 5-Room Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima ACE Avenue or flats for sale Saima ACE Avenue Karachi, Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders offers family layouts in three categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3-Room Apartments (Type C) in Saima ACE Avenue<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 3-room Type C in Saima Ace Avenue Scheme 33 is the entry-level unit, around 850 square feet: a good fit for smaller families or first-time buyers who want into Scheme 33 without stretching too far, while still getting the full run of the building\'s shared amenities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Room Apartments (Type B) in Saima ACE Avenue<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 4-room Type B in Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders, roughly 1,100 square feet, sits neatly between Type C and Type A: usually the sweet spot for growing families who need one more room but are not ready to jump straight to the biggest unit.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>5-Room Apartments (Type A) in Saima ACE Avenue<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 5-room Type A in Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders is the largest option, around 1,300 square feet, built for bigger households or anyone who wants an extra room for a home office or guests.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The three unit types map directly to three, four, and five rooms, so matching size to family need is straightforward. Buyers seeking a Saima ACE Avenue apartment price or floor plan should request the current unit schedule from the sales office.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima ACE Avenue price depends on the floor, the unit\'s position in the building, and how far along construction is at the time of booking. Book earlier and the price is generally lower, as with almost every under-construction project in the city. Current figures are available through the developer\'s sales office.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima ACE Avenue booking is processed through Saima\'s own sales network and authorised real estate partners, and the Saima ACE Avenue booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima ACE Avenue payment plan, since offers are revised, especially during promotional periods.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima ACE Avenue Karachi buyers should also confirm current stock before making a final call, as floor allocations and unit availability change fairly often on an under-construction building.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Ace Avenue Scheme 33 buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Because the building is under construction, buyers should also confirm the current construction status directly with the sales office rather than relying on how the developer\'s other projects have progressed, since every project has its own pace.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders is under construction, and a firm, publicly confirmed completion date has not been published. Possession follows once floors are actually finished, and buyers should ask whether handover happens floor by floor or as one handover, and get any move-in timeline in writing from the developer before booking. Finishing installments and getting possession are not the same event.<\\/p>\"}', '2026-11-03 11:16:30', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(903, 112, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima ACE Avenue Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<p>The payment plan for Saima Ace Avenue Scheme 33 usually decides whether a buyer commits, and it is structured to spread the cost: booking, then a confirmation stage, then structured monthly installments, with a final possession-linked payment near handover. Some Saima projects tie part of the plan to quarterly construction milestones, so buyers should ask whether ACE Avenue follows something similar, and request a full cost breakdown including any development or finishing charges before signing anything.<\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-03 11:16:30', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(904, 112, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima ACE Avenue Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793705067_6ae9c46b00785.jpeg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-11-03 11:16:30', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(905, 112, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima ACE Avenue Location in Scheme 33, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Main Super Highway (M-9)\",\"time\":\"1\\u20133 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Jinnah International Airport\",\"time\":\"20\\u201330 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Malir Cantonment\",\"time\":\"15\\u201320 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Karachi Toll Plaza (M-9)\",\"time\":\"15\\u201322 minutes\"}]}],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima ACE Avenue Karachi location is in Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, fronting the Main Super Highway directly, so residents skip the narrow internal roads that make daily commuting a headache in older parts of the city. The airport is around 15 to 20 minutes by road, Malir Cantonment is close by, Main University Road is a short drive, and Shoukat Khanum Memorial Cancer Hospital and Memon Medical Institute Hospital are both within a reasonable drive.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793705067_6ae9c46b0198e.webp\"}', '2026-11-03 11:16:30', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(906, 112, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima ACE Avenue Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima ACE Avenue is located in Gulzar-e-Hijri, Scheme 33, Karachi, fronting the Main Super Highway. The Saima ACE Avenue Karachi location keeps residents close to Jinnah International Airport, Malir Cantonment, and Main University Road.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima ACE Avenue price?\",\"a\":\"Price at Saima Ace Avenue Scheme 33  depends on the unit type, floor, the unit\'s position in the building, and how far along construction is at the time of booking. A complete official price list covering every floor and type has not been published consistently, so buyers should obtain current figures from the sales office.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima ACE Avenue?\",\"a\":\"Saima ACE Avenue Saima Builders offers three configurations mapped directly to room count: the 3-room Type C (around 850 sq. ft.), the 4-room Type B (around 1,100 sq. ft.), and the 5-room Type A (around 1,300 sq. ft.), with roughly eight apartments per floor.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima ACE Avenue payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Booking at Saima ACE Avenue starts with an initial payment, followed by a confirmation stage before installments begin. Installments run on a structured monthly schedule, with a final possession-linked payment near handover; buyers should also ask whether part of the plan is tied to quarterly construction milestones and request a full cost breakdown in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima ACE Avenue NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima ACE Avenue Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima ACE Avenue the same as Saima Ace Residency?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima ACE Avenue is the Scheme 33 high-rise on the Main Super Highway listed in the developer\'s own upcoming projects, while Saima Ace Residency has no dedicated official project page. Buyers should confirm which project a listing refers to before paying anything.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima ACE Avenue?\",\"a\":\"Saima ACE Avenue is developed by Saima Builders & Developers, part of the wider Saima Group, which has a cluster of projects in Scheme 33 and is also active in Hyderabad and Sukkur.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima ACE Avenue?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima ACE Avenue sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima ACE Avenue Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because of the Super Highway frontage, dedicated parking floors that older buildings in Gulshan and Nazimabad lack, a simple three-type lineup that is easy to compare, and an under-construction stage where early buyers may access better rates than finished, move-in-ready units.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-03 11:16:30', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(907, 112, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover family apartments atSaima ACE Avenue Saima Builders. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima ACE Avenue, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Saima ACE Avenue or seeking to buy flat in Saima ACE Avenue Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima ACE Avenue booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793705067_6ae9c46b02d8e.jpeg\"}', '2026-11-03 11:16:30', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(908, 113, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments at Bagh-e-Korangi Karachi\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments by Saima Group in Bagh-e-Korangi, Shah Faisal, Karachi: five towers with 3 & 4-room apartments on installments.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793708390_6ae9d16656833.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments at Bagh-e-Korangi Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments at Bagh-e-Korangi Karachi\"}', '2026-11-03 11:57:16', '2026-11-03 12:21:05'),
