(910, 113, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments by Saima Builders\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Luxury Apartments is a residential apartment project in Bagh-e-Korangi, Shah Faisal, Karachi, by Saima Group, built as five towers of ground plus 12 floors, currently under construction, offering 3-room (Type C) and 4-room (Types B1, B, and A) apartments, distinct from the older Saima Luxury Homes villa society nearby.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793708390_6ae9d166593e6.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 11:57:16', '2026-11-03 12:21:05'),
(911, 113, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders provides facilities planned across the five-tower development, including dedicated parking, gated security, elevators serving the ground-plus-12 towers, power backup, and shared community spaces, with every apartment including a terrace, a proper drawing room, and a separate lounge within the Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal scheme.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-03 11:57:16', '2026-11-03 12:21:05'),
(912, 113, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":null,\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793708390_6ae9d1665ab3a.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793708390_6ae9d1665ad8e.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793708390_6ae9d1665aecc.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793708390_6ae9d1665b557.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-03 11:57:16', '2026-11-03 12:21:05'),
(913, 113, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>At its core, Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders is apartment living from the ground up: five towers, each ground plus 12 floors, currently under construction with limited units still available. The layout is fairly standard but well thought out, including a terrace, a proper drawing room, a separate lounge, and attached baths in the bedrooms, a real step up from the cramped, single-purpose layouts found in older, cheaper buildings around the same area.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>What actually stands out here is the payment structure, spread over 48 monthly installments, which is the real reason this project keeps coming up whenever people search for affordable installment-based apartments in this part of Karachi. Within Saima Builders projects Karachi, it is the Bagh-e-Korangi apartment offer, and among apartments in Shah Faisal Karachi it is one of the most searched projects.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>3-room (Type C) & 4-room (Types B1, B, A) apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>3.5 Acres<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Under construction<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Bagh-e-Korangi, Shah Faisal, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>On Easy Installments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Family living<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal is planned as five separate towers, each ground plus 12 floors, giving the project a genuinely multi-building footprint rather than one standalone structure, with dedicated parking and shared common areas built into the overall site plan.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Each tower carries a mix of the available unit types, so buyers have some choice in configuration within the same building instead of being locked into a single layout per tower. The framework keeps functional spaces distinct, like terrace, drawing room, lounge, attached baths, instead of merging everything into one, and shared spaces are meant to give residents a sense of community across the five towers rather than five disconnected buildings sharing a name.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types: 3-Room & 4-Room Apartments<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers searching for apartments for sale Saima Luxury Apartments or flats for sale Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi, Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders offers family layouts in two categories.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3-Room Apartments (Type C) in Saima Luxury Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Type C is the entry point at Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal: a 3-room unit positioned as the most accessible price tier in the project, built around a terrace, a separate drawing room, a lounge, and attached baths.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Room Apartments (Types B1, B & A) in Saima Luxury Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Types B1, B, and A at Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders are all 4-room configurations, differing mainly in size, positioning, and finish rather than fundamental layout, with Type A the largest of the three. Each keeps the project\'s signature layout of terrace, drawing room, lounge, and attached baths.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The exact covered area varies by unit type and has not been published consistently, so buyers should confirm it directly for the unit they are interested in. Buyers seeking a Saima Luxury Apartments apartment price or floor plan should request the current unit schedule from the authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Luxury Apartments price is set by unit type: Type C at 3 rooms is the entry point, and Types B1, B, and A, which are all 4-room units, are priced progressively higher by differences in exact size, layout, and position within the towers rather than a flat price per room count. Floor level, tower position, and construction progress at booking also affect the final price.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Saima Luxury Apartments booking is processed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel, and the Saima Luxury Apartments booking amount should be confirmed in writing alongside the Saima Luxury Apartments payment plan. Since the project is marketed as having limited units left, buyers should check current availability directly rather than trusting an older listing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Most transactions at Saima Luxury Apartments right now are pre-completion bookings rather than ready-to-move purchases, so buyers should factor the construction timeline into their decision alongside the payment schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal buyers should verify the project-specific approvals directly with the developer or the relevant authority before booking, as NOC status applies to the individual project.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Specific covered area figures have not been published consistently for every type, so buyers should confirm the exact area and documentation for the unit they are interested in at the time of booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders is under construction, and no fixed completion date has been consistently published. Possession will follow completion of each buyer\'s own payment plan alongside the construction timeline for their specific tower, so buyers with a specific timeline in mind should confirm it directly with the developer and secure it in writing.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-03 11:57:16', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(914, 113, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<p><span id=\\\"docs-internal-guid-97eeb1aa-7fff-2e67-7c71-f7584f72dfd4\\\"><\\/span><\\/p><p dir=\\\"ltr\\\" style=\\\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" face=\\\"Arial, sans-serif\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\\\">The payment plan for Saima Luxury Apartments is one of its stronger selling points: booking, then a confirmation payment formalising the allocation, then 48 monthly installments \\u2014 or a 16-quarter installment plan for buyers whose income is not fixed and predictable every month \\u2014 and a final possession payment once the installments wrap up and the unit is ready. Development charges cover shared infrastructure and are usually itemised separately from the base price. Exact amounts are provided through the authorised sales channel.<\\/span><\\/font><\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-03 11:57:16', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(915, 113, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793708390_6ae9d1665e8f6.jpg\",\"badge\":\"Click to Enlarge\"}', '2026-11-03 11:57:16', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(916, 113, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments Location in Bagh-e-Korangi, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"subtitle\":\"The Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi location is in Bagh-e-Korangi, Shah Faisal, close to Saima Luxury Homes, the airport, Shahrah-e-Faisal, and the Malir River Bridge. Korangi has grown into a genuinely established part of Karachi, and this pocket benefits from sitting close to some of the city\'s busier connecting roads: Shahrah-e-Faisal provides fairly direct access to the rest of Karachi, and Drigh Road Railway Station and the Airport Railway Station are both a few kilometres away.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793708390_6ae9d1665f41c.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks And Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Shahrah-e-Faisal\",\"time\":\"10\\u201315 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Jinnah International Airport\",\"time\":\"10\\u201315 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Malir River Bridge\",\"time\":\"8\\u201312 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Shah Faisal Colony\",\"time\":\"8\\u201312 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-11-03 11:57:16', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(917, 113, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders is located in Bagh-e-Korangi, Shah Faisal, Karachi, close to Shahrah-e-Faisal, the Malir River Bridge, and Jinnah International Airport. Shah Faisal Town, Drigh Colony, and the wider Korangi district surround the project.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Luxury Apartments price?\",\"a\":\"Pricing at Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal  differs by unit type: Type C is the entry tier, and the 4-room Types B1, B, and A are priced progressively higher by size, layout, and position. Promotional figures date quickly on a project marketed with limited units remaining, so buyers should obtain the current official price list directly.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Saima Luxury Apartments?\",\"a\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments offers 3-room and 4-room configurations: Type C is the 3-room unit, while Types B1, B, and A are all 4-room units differing mainly in size, positioning, and finish. There is no standalone 1-room or 2-room category in the current mix; room counts here follow the project\'s room-based types, with bedrooms carrying attached baths.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Luxury Apartments payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The Saima Luxury Apartments payment plan runs booking, then confirmation, then 48 monthly installments, with a 16-quarter installment alternative for buyers whose income is not fixed monthly, and a final possession payment once the schedule completes. Development charges are usually itemised separately; exact amounts are provided through the authorised sales channel.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Luxury Apartments NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Buyers should verify the project-specific NOC and approval status for Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi directly with the developer or the relevant authority before purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Luxury Apartments the same as Saima Luxury Homes?\",\"a\":\"No. Saima Luxury Apartments is the newer five-tower apartment project in Bagh-e-Korangi, still under construction, while Saima Luxury Homes is an older, established villa and house society in Sector 10, Korangi. Both are Saima Group developments in the same general belt, but they are separate projects with separate pricing and paperwork.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Luxury Apartments?\",\"a\":\"Saima Luxury Apartments Shah Faisal is developed by Saima Group, active in Karachi\'s real estate market for around four decades, with a portfolio that includes Saima Dreams, Saima Boulevard, Saima Arabian Villas, and Saima Elite Enclave.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Saima Luxury Apartments?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers can engage through authorised channels, but remittance and documentation procedures should be confirmed directly with the Saima Luxury Apartments sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Because of its long 48-month installment runway, which makes an apartment genuinely accessible to salaried buyers, its five-tower community format near Shah Faisal and the airport, and layouts with a terrace, drawing room, and lounge that are a real step up from the cramped single-purpose layouts in older buildings nearby.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-03 11:57:16', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(918, 113, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Discover installment apartments at Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi. Contact our advisory team for personalized guidance on Saima Luxury Apartments Saima Builders, updated pricing, and private viewings. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale Saima Luxury Apartments or seeking to buy flat in Saima Luxury Apartments Karachi, our consultants can navigate the Saima Luxury Apartments booking process.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1793708390_6ae9d166609f4.jpg\"}', '2026-11-03 11:57:16', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
