(952, 121, 'content', 'Content', 2, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"<p style=\\\"scrollbar-color: rgb(202, 194, 181) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\\\">Korangi Creek Road places Saima Mangroves beside a mangrove belt, near DHA Phase VIII and IoBM. Saima new projects in karachi Korangi Creek Road offer a waterfront master plan, not another central tower. For buyers following Saima projects in Karachi, that is a different kind of address.<\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<h2>Why Saima Projects in Korangi Creek Road, Karachi Stand Out<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Korangi Creek Road places Saima Mangroves beside a mangrove belt, near DHA Phase VIII and IoBM. Saima new projects in karachi Korangi Creek Road offer a waterfront master plan, not another central tower. For buyers following Saima projects in Karachi, that is a different kind of address.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Facts: Saima Mangroves at Korangi Creek<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>This table summarises the saima new project Korangi Creek Road, Karachi.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n    <tbody><tr>\\r\\n        <th>Detail<\\/th>\\r\\n        <th>Information<\\/th>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Project<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Saima Mangroves<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Land<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>About 40 acres<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Delivery<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>TPL REIT Fund-I SPV; Saima\'s ZSZ Group as development adviser<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Homes<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>3, 4 and 5-room apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Launch<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>10\\u201311 October 2026<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Phased, no single date<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Saima Premium Apartments In Saima Mangroves: Layouts and Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The residences come in three sizes.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li>The 3-room plan has two bedrooms.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>The 4-room adds a third bedroom.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>5-room units offer three to four bedrooms.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Planned amenities include:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li>A pool<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>A fitness centre<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>A yoga room<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>A community hall<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>A cinema room<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>A 14-acre park<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price, Installments and Booking<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No public price list has been released for Saima Mangroves, so confirm any Saima projects in Korangi Creek Road, Karachi price in writing. Saima Mangroves, along with any other Saima new project Korangi Creek Road, Karachi payment plan is shared by the sales team, with construction-linked milestones. Buyers asking about Saima projects on installment should request the schedule and booking amount. For Korangi Creek Road, Karachi apartments for sale, note that handover is phased. Comparing Saima projects in karachi price points? Ask for a rate sheet.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals Before You Book<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Cantonment Board Korangi Creek approved the master plan for Saima Mangroves, and the developer states the NOC is approved. Still request building-level approvals. Anyone comparing Saima new projects in Karachi Korangi Creek Road should verify every document independently.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Final Thoughts<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Mangroves is the main entry among Saima new projects in karachi Korangi Creek Road. Before looking at other Saima projects in Korangi Creek Road, Karachi, get the price, schedule and approvals in writing.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"<h2>Why Saima Projects in Korangi Creek Road, Karachi Stand Out<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Korangi Creek Road places Saima Mangroves beside a mangrove belt, near DHA Phase VIII and IoBM. Saima new projects in karachi Korangi Creek Road offer a waterfront master plan, not another central tower. For buyers f