(953, 121, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"1. Which are the Saima new projects in Karachi Korangi Creek Road?\",\"a\":\"Saima Mangroves is the current launch, a 40-acre waterfront community delivered with TPL REIT Fund-I at Korangi Creek.\"},{\"q\":\"2. Where are Saima projects in Korangi Creek Road, Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Mangroves sits on Korangi Creek Road beside the mangrove belt, near IoBM and DHA Phase VIII.\"},{\"q\":\"3. What is the Saima projects in Korangi Creek Road, Karachi price?\",\"a\":\"No price list is public yet, so ask Saima\'s authorised sales channel for a written rate sheet.\"},{\"q\":\"4. Are Korangi Creek Road, Karachi apartments for sale yet?\",\"a\":\"Saima Mangroves launched on 10\\u201311 October 2026 and was reported oversubscribed, so confirm current availability before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"5. What payment plan does Saima Mangroves offer?\",\"a\":\"It offers flexible installments with construction-linked milestones, with exact amounts shared by the sales team on request.\"},{\"q\":\"6. Can I buy Saima projects on installment?\",\"a\":\"Yes, Saima Mangroves offers installment options, but get the booking amount and full schedule in writing first.\"},{\"q\":\"What are Saima premium apartments at this project?\",\"a\":\"They are 3, 4 and 5-room residences ranging from two to four bedrooms, with a pool, gym and park planned.\"},{\"q\":\"8. Who delivers Saima projects in Korangi Creek Road, Karachi?\",\"a\":\"TPL REIT Fund-I delivers it through an SPV, with Saima\'s Zeeshan Saleem Zaki Group as development adviser.\"},{\"q\":\"When is possession for Saima new projects in karachi Korangi Creek Road?\",\"a\":\"Handover is phased and no single possession date has been announced, so get a written schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"10. Is Saima Mangroves NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"The developer states it is NOC approved, but you should still verify approvals independently before booking.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-09 06:07:49', '2026-11-10 10:05:06'),
