hting System<\\/li><li>Children\\u2019s Play Area<\\/li><li>Prayer Area<\\/li><li>Landscaped Garden<\\/li><li>BBQ Area<\\/li><\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price, Installments and Booking<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No public price list is quoted here for Saima One Residency Clifton, so confirm any Saima projects in Clifton, Karachi price in writing. Saima new project Clifton, Karachi payment plan and booking amount are to be confirmed through the developer\'s authorised sales channel. Buyers asking about Saima projects on installment should request the schedule and booking amount. For Clifton, Karachi apartments for sale, note that the Saima offering in this location is apartments, so confirm the exact unit type and availability in writing before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals Before You Book<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Approvals are project-specific, so verify the NOC and building approvals independently before booking. Anyone comparing Saima new projects in Karachi Clifton should verify every document independently.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Final Thoughts<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima One Residency Clifton is the main entry among Saima new projects in Karachi Clifton. Before looking at other Saima projects in Clifton, Karachi, get the Saima projects in karachi price, schedule and approvals in writing.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\"}', '2026-11-09 06:42:45', '2026-11-09 07:04:59'),
