(971, 126, 'content', 'Content', 2, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<h2>Why Saima Projects in Main M.A. Jinnah Road Stand Out<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Main M.A. Jinnah Road places Saima Center Point near Saddar, Numaish Chowrangi, Empress Market and Parsi Colony, with central connectivity rather than a suburban address.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Facts: Saima Center Point at Main M.A. Jinnah Road<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>This table summarises the Saima new project on Main M.A. Jinnah Road.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n  <tbody><tr>\\r\\n    <th>Detail<\\/th>\\r\\n    <th>Information<\\/th>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Project<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Saima Center Point<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Main M.A. Jinnah Road, near Saddar, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Homes<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>2, 3 and 4-bed apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>On easy installments<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>To be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Saima Premium Apartments in Saima Center Point: Layouts and Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The homes and units are:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li>2-bed apartments<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>3-bed apartments<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>4-bed apartments<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Planned amenities include:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li>Grand reception lobby<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>High-speed passenger and cargo lifts<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Secure gated setting<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Rooftop family retreat<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Gymnasium<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Landscaped park<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Community centre<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Uninterrupted power supply<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Purified water systems<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Ample parking<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price, Installments and Booking<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No public price list is quoted here for Saima Center Point, so confirm any Saima projects on Main M.A. Jinnah Road price in writing. The project is offered on easy installments, with the exact booking amount and payment schedule to be confirmed in writing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers asking about Saima projects on installment should request the payment schedule and booking amount. For Main M.A. Jinnah Road apartments for sale, note that the Saima offering in this location is apartments, so confirm the exact unit type and availability in writing before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals Before You Book<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Approvals are project-specific, so verify the NOC and building approvals independently before booking. Anyone comparing Saima new projects in Karachi on Main M.A. Jinnah Road should verify every document independently.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Final Thoughts<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Center Point is the main entry among Saima new projects in Karachi on Main M.A. Jinnah Road. Before looking at other Saima projects in Main M.A. Jinnah Road, get the price, payment schedule and approvals in writing.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\"}', '2026-11-09 10:13:02', '2026-11-09 10:19:53'),
(972, 126, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"1. Which are the Saima new projects in Karachi Main M.A. Jinnah Road?\",\"a\":\"Saima Center Point, with Saima Center Point 2 reported separately is the Saima project covered on this page for Main M.A. Jinnah Road.\"},{\"q\":\"2. Where are Saima projects in Main M.A. Jinnah Road located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Center Point is on Main M.A. Jinnah Road, near Saddar and Numaish, Karachi. Saima Center Point 2 is a separate, reported name whose exact location is not officially confirmed, so do not merge the two.\"},{\"q\":\"3. What is the Saima projects in Main M.A. Jinnah Road price?\",\"a\":\"No price list is quoted here, so ask Saima\'s authorised sales channel for a written rate sheet for the exact unit.\"},{\"q\":\"4. Are Main M.A. Jinnah Road apartments for sale yet?\",\"a\":\"The Saima offering in this location is apartments. Confirm current availability for the exact unit in writing before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"5. What payment plan does Saima Center Point offer?\",\"a\":\"The project is offered on easy installments, with exact booking and schedule to be confirmed in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"6. Can I buy Saima projects on installment?\",\"a\":\"Yes, installment options are listed for Saima projects in this location, but get the booking amount and full schedule in writing first.\"},{\"q\":\"7. What are Saima premium apartments at this project?\",\"a\":\"They are 2, 3 and 4-bed apartments.\"},{\"q\":\"8. Who delivers Saima projects in Main M.A. Jinnah Road?\",\"a\":\"Saima Builders, with project-specific delivery partners where listed in the Key Facts table above.\"},{\"q\":\"9. When is possession for Saima new projects in karachi Main M.A. Jinnah Road?\",\"a\":\"Handover is to be confirmed, so get a written schedule before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"10. Is Saima Center Point NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Approvals are project-specific, so verify the NOC and building approvals independently before booking.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-09 10:13:02', '2026-11-09 10:19:53'),
