(994, 130, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Prestige Park by Saima Group\",\"description\":\"<p style=\\\"scrollbar-color: rgb(202, 194, 181) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\\\">Saima Prestige Park is an upcoming residential and commercial plotting project associated with Saima Group, located on Memon Goth Road near Malir 15, Gadap Town, Karachi. The development is planned across approximately 24 acres, with around 300 plots according to available project information.<\\/p><p style=\\\"scrollbar-color: rgb(202, 194, 181) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\\\">The project offers residential plot categories, including 120, 175, and 240 square yards, with commercial plots also indicated in the available layout information. Its proposed development focuses on residential planning, road infrastructure, green spaces, and community facilities.<\\/p><p style=\\\"scrollbar-color: rgb(202, 194, 181) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\\\">Saima Prestige Park Karachi is positioned for buyers interested in residential land ownership and property investment through an installment-based payment structure. However, buyers should verify the latest availability, approved layout, and official documentation directly through the developer\'s authorised sales channel before making a booking decision.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794223602_6af1adf222153.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-09 10:57:57', '2026-11-11 05:42:18'),
(995, 130, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Prestige Park Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"Saima Prestige Park is planned as a residential community with infrastructure and facilities intended to support comfortable living. The available layout information identifies several proposed community features, although buyers should confirm their final specifications through the approved development plan.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-09 10:57:57', '2026-11-09 11:20:45'),
(996, 130, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":null,\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794223602_6af1adf2233e1.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794223602_6af1adf2234c2.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-09 10:57:57', '2026-11-09 11:26:42'),
(997, 130, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>Saima Prestige Park is an upcoming plotting development associated with Saima Group in the Memon Goth and Malir 15 area of Karachi. The project is situated along Memon Goth Road in Gadap Town, offering a residential land opportunity in an expanding part of Karachi.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The development is planned with different residential plot categories and a commercial component. Its proposed layout includes designated residential blocks, internal roads, green spaces, and community facilities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers exploring Saima Group projects Karachi, Saima Prestige Park presents an option to consider for future residential construction or long-term land ownership. However, buyers should review the latest project documents, plot availability, and approval status before proceeding.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Key Project Highlights<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n    <thead>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n            <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <\\/thead>\\r\\n    <tbody>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Saima Group<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Project Type<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Residential and Commercial Plots<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Approximately 24 Acres (reported)<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Total Plots<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Approximately 300 (reported)<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Residential Plot Sizes<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>120, 175 and 240 Sq. Yds.<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Commercial Plots<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Included in reported layout<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Memon Goth Road, Gadap Town, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Main Road<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>60 Feet (reported)<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>3 Years (reported)<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Booking<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Starting from PKR 5 Lakh for 120 Sq. Yds. (reported)<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Possession<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Linked with completion of payment and development<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>NOC<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Project-specific approval number not publicly verified<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Prestige Park master plan is designed around residential plot blocks, internal road networks, green spaces, and community-use areas. The reported layout identifies blocks R, R1, and A, with a 60-foot main road and internal roads ranging from approximately 30 to 40 feet.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The proposed development framework also includes a mosque, two school sites, eight parks, and a commercial area near the entrance. These elements are intended to support an organised residential environment and provide residents with access to everyday community facilities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers interested in Saima Prestige Park Karachi should request the latest authorised master plan to verify plot locations, road widths, block arrangements, and the availability of designated facilities.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Plot Types: Available Categories<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Prestige Park offers residential plot categories intended for buyers with different land requirements and investment budgets. The reported primary residential sizes are 120, 175, and 240 square yards.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Some third-party promotional listings also mention 160 and 500 square yard plots. However, these additional categories should be confirmed through the developer\'s current inventory and official plot schedule before being considered available.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Residential Plots in Saima Prestige Park<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The reported residential plot categories provide options for buyers planning to construct a family home or hold land as a property investment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The available plot sizes are:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li>120 Square Yards<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>175 Square Yards<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>240 Square Yards<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers searching for residential plots for sale Saima Prestige Park should review the official layout plan and confirm the availability of their preferred plot size, block, and location before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Plot Layout Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The Saima Prestige Park layout plan provides an overview of the proposed residential blocks, internal roads, and community facilities. It is intended to help buyers understand the development\'s overall arrangement and identify suitable plot locations.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>According to the reported layout, the development includes a 60-foot main road, 30 to 40-foot internal roads, designated parks, a mosque, school sites, and a commercial area.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should request the latest authorised layout plan from the sales office before selecting a plot. They should also confirm whether the selected plot is park-facing, road-facing, corner, or west-open, as these preferences may involve additional charges.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Saima Prestige Park Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Prestige Park has reported residential plot prices for different categories under a three-year installment structure. According to the payment schedules dated 5 November 2026, the reported prices are PKR 68.5 lakh for 120 square yards, PKR 1 crore for 175 square yards, and PKR 1.37 crore for 240 square yards.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The reported opening payment for a 120-square-yard plot starts at PKR 5 lakh, while larger plot categories require higher initial payments.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers searching for Saima Prestige Park price or Saima Prestige Park booking should obtain the latest authorised price list and plot availability before making a financial commitment. Additional charges for preferred locations, documentation, utilities, and external development may apply.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Reported Residential Plot Prices<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n    <thead>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <th>Plot Size<\\/th>\\r\\n            <th>Reported Total Price<\\/th>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <\\/thead>\\r\\n    <tbody>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>120 Sq. Yds.<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>PKR 68.5 Lakh<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>175 Sq. Yds.<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>PKR 1 Crore<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>240 Sq. Yds.<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>PKR 1.37 Crore<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Prices are based on reported Saima payment schedules dated 5 November 2026. Verify current prices and inventory with the authorised sales office.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The approval status of Saima Prestige Park should be independently verified before buyers proceed with booking or payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Some launch advertisements describe the project as NOC approved. However, the available published information does not establish a verifiable approval number, approving authority, or approval date.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should request a copy of the project-specific NOC and approved layout plan from the developer and independently verify the documents with the relevant authority.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>It is important not to rely solely on promotional statements or verbal assurances when evaluating the legal status of a residential development.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Prestige Park has a reported three-year installment structure, with possession linked to completion of the payment schedule and relevant development stages.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The available payment information includes payments associated with road development, sewerage work, demarcation, and final possession. However, buyers should obtain a written possession commitment and confirm the development milestones in their booking agreement.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Any possession timeline should be treated as subject to the developer\'s official documentation and contractual terms.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-09 10:57:57', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(998, 130, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Prestige Park Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<p>Saima Prestige Park offers a reported three-year installment payment structure for its residential plot categories. The schedule includes four opening payments, monthly installments, quarterly installments, development-stage payments, and a final payment at possession.<\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-09 10:57:57', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(999, 130, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Prestige Park Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794223602_6af1adf22670a.jpg\",\"badge\":null}', '2026-11-09 10:57:57', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1000, 130, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima Prestige Park Location on Memon Goth Road, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"subtitle\":\"Saima Prestige Park is located on Memon Goth Road in Gadap Town, Malir District, Karachi. The project is associated with the Malir 15 and Memon Goth residential corridor, providing access to different parts of the eastern side of Karachi. The location offers connectivity towards Malir Cantonment, Jinnah International Airport, and other developing residential areas. However, buyers should confirm the exact project entrance and plot location through the developer\'s official location map.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794223602_6af1adf2276bb.jpg\"}', '2026-11-09 10:57:57', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1001, 130, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Saima Prestige Park Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Prestige Park is located on Memon Goth Road in Gadap Town, Malir District, Karachi. The project is associated with the Malir 15 and Memon Goth area. Buyers should confirm the exact site location through the developer\'s authorised sales office.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Prestige Park plot price?\",\"a\":\"According to the reported payment schedule dated 5 November 2026, a 120-square-yard plot costs PKR 68.5 lakh, a 175-square-yard plot costs PKR 1 crore, and a 240-square-yard plot costs PKR 1.37 crore. Additional charges may apply depending on plot location and documentation requirements.\"},{\"q\":\"What plot sizes are available in Saima Prestige Park?\",\"a\":\"The reported primary residential plot sizes are 120, 175, and 240 square yards. Some promotional listings also mention 160 and 500 square yards. Buyers should confirm the latest inventory and available categories with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Saima Prestige Park payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Saima Prestige Park has a reported three-year installment plan. It includes four opening payments, 36 monthly installments, 12 quarterly installments, development-stage payments, and a final possession payment. The exact schedule depends on the selected plot category.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Prestige Park NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Some promotional advertisements describe Saima Prestige Park as NOC approved. However, a verifiable approval number, issuing authority, and approval date have not been established through the available published information. Buyers should obtain and independently verify the project-specific NOC before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Saima Prestige Park?\",\"a\":\"Saima Prestige Park is associated with Saima Group, a property development group operating in Karachi. Buyers should confirm the project\'s legal developer and authorised booking arrangements through official documentation.\"},{\"q\":\"How can buyers book a plot in Saima Prestige Park?\",\"a\":\"Interested buyers can contact the authorised sales channel to check plot availability, obtain the latest payment schedule, review the layout plan, and understand the booking requirements. The reported initial payment starts from PKR 5 lakh for a 120-square-yard plot, subject to confirmation.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Saima Prestige Park suitable for property investment?\",\"a\":\"Saima Prestige Park may interest buyers looking for residential land in the Memon Goth and Malir 15 area. Its proposed residential layout and installment structure may suit buyers planning future construction. However, investment decisions should consider legal approvals, development progress, location, and resale demand.\"},{\"q\":\"How many acres does Saima Prestige Park cover?\",\"a\":\"Available project information reports an approximate development area of 24 acres, with around 300 plots. Buyers should verify the final land area and approved layout through the developer\'s documentation.\"},{\"q\":\"What facilities are planned in Saima Prestige Park?\",\"a\":\"The reported layout includes eight parks, a mosque, two school sites, a commercial area, a 60-foot main road, and internal roads. Buyers should confirm the final facilities through the latest authorised master plan.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-09 10:57:57', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1002, 130, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":null,\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794223602_6af1adf22871d.jpg\"}', '2026-11-09 10:57:57', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
