(1014, 131, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Saima New Projects in Karachi Gadap Town: Saima Arabian Villas\",\"subtitle\":\"For those searching for Saima new projects in karachi Gadap Town, Saima Arabian Villas is the Saima gated community in Gadap Town, North Karachi, offering villas and residential plots in Sector 5-A, near 4K Chowrangi, rather than high-rise apartments.\",\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794290755_6af2b443229a9.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Saima New Projects in Karachi Gadap Town: Saima Arabian Villas\",\"image_alt\":\"Saima New Projects in Karachi Gadap Town: Saima Arabian Villas\"}', '2026-11-10 05:58:36', '2026-11-10 06:05:55'),
(1015, 131, 'content', 'Content', 2, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<h2>Why Saima Projects in Gadap Town, North Karachi Stand Out<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Gadap Town places Saima Arabian Villas in Sector 5-A, near 4K Chowrangi, Surjani Town, and Gulshan-e-Maymar, as a ground-level gated villa community in North Karachi.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Facts: Saima Arabian Villas at Gadap Town<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>This table summarises the Saima new project in Gadap Town, North Karachi.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Detail<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Information<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Project<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Arabian Villas<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Sector 5-A, Gadap Town, North Karachi, near 4K Chowrangi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Homes<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>120, 160 and 240 sq. yd. villas and residential plots<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Community<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Gated villa and plot housing society, SBCA-approved society as listed in the project summary<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Cash \\/ limited installments, to be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Saima Premium Apartments in Saima Arabian Villas: Layouts and Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The homes and units are:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>120 sq. yd. villas and plots<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>160 sq. yd. villas and plots<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>240 sq. yd. villas and plots<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Planned amenities include:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Gated layout with a boundary wall<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>24\\/7 security with CCTV cameras and guards<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>A Jamia Mosque<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Parks and green spaces<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>A playground<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>A commercial strip for everyday shopping<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Broad carpeted roads<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Gas, electricity, and filtered water connections<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price, Installments and Booking<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No public price list is quoted here for Saima Arabian Villas, so confirm any Saima projects in Gadap Town, North Karachi price in writing. Payment terms are cash \\/ limited installments, to be confirmed in writing for the exact villa or plot.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers asking about Saima projects on installment should request the schedule and booking amount. For Gadap Town, North Karachi apartments for sale, note that the Saima offering in this location is villas and plots, so confirm the exact unit type and availability in writing before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals Before You Book<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Approvals are project-specific, so verify the NOC and society approvals independently before booking. Anyone comparing Saima new projects in Karachi Gadap Town should verify every document independently.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Final Thoughts<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Arabian Villas is the main entry among Saima new projects in Karachi Gadap Town. Before looking at other Saima projects in Gadap Town, North Karachi, get the price, schedule, and approvals in writing.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\"}', '2026-11-10 05:58:36', '2026-11-10 06:04:03'),
(1016, 131, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"1. Which are the Saima new projects in Karachi Gadap Town?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Villas is the Saima project covered on this page for Gadap Town, North Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"2. Where are Saima projects in Gadap Town, North Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"Saima Arabian Villas is in Sector 5-A, Gadap Town, North Karachi, near 4K Chowrangi.\"},{\"q\":\"3. What is the Saima projects in Gadap Town, North Karachi price?\",\"a\":\"No price list is quoted here, so ask Saima\'s authorised sales channel for a written rate sheet for the exact unit.\"},{\"q\":\"4. Are Gadap Town, North Karachi apartments for sale yet?\",\"a\":\"The Saima offering in this location is villas and plots. Confirm current availability for the exact unit in writing before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"5. What payment plan does Saima Arabian Villas offer?\",\"a\":\"Payment terms are cash \\/ limited installments, to be confirmed in writing for the exact villa or plot.\"},{\"q\":\"6. Can I buy saima projects on installment?\",\"a\":\"Yes, installment options are listed for Saima projects in this location, but get the booking amount and full schedule in writing first.\"},{\"q\":\"7. What are saima premium apartments at this project?\",\"a\":\"They are 120, 160 and 240 sq. yd. villas and residential plots.\"},{\"q\":\"8. Who delivers saima projects in Gadap Town, North Karachi?\",\"a\":\"Saima Builders, with project-specific delivery partners where listed in the Key Facts table above.\"},{\"q\":\"9. When is possession for saima new projects in karachi Gadap Town?\",\"a\":\"Ready in developed blocks, to be confirmed for the exact villa or plot.\"},{\"q\":\"10. Is Saima Arabian Villas NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"Approvals are project-specific, so verify the NOC and society approvals independently before booking.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-10 05:58:36', '2026-11-10 06:04:03'),
