(1054, 136, 'content', 'Content', 2, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\",\"html\":\"<h2>Why Saima Projects in Main Shikarpur Road, Sukkur Stand Out<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Main Shikarpur Road places Saima Uptown Sukkur opposite the Sukkur Sports Complex and near Sukkur City Centre, as a gated community rather than a single tower.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Facts: Saima Uptown Sukkur at Main Shikarpur Road<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>This table summarises the Saima new project on Main Shikarpur Road, Sukkur.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n    <tbody><tr>\\r\\n        <th>Detail<\\/th>\\r\\n        <th>Information<\\/th>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Project<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Saima Uptown Sukkur<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Main Shikarpur Road, opposite Sukkur Sports Complex, Sukkur<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Saima Builders<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Homes<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Residential and commercial plots from 120 to 1,000 sq. yd. and ready-built villas<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Status<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Early-stage development<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>On easy installments<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Saima Premium Apartments In Saima Uptown Sukkur: Layouts and Amenities<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The homes and units are:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li>Residential plots from 120 to 1,000 sq. yd.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Commercial plots<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Ready-built villas<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Planned amenities include:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li>Wide tree-lined roads<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Dedicated parks and recreational spaces<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>A theme park and clubhouse<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Planned schools and hospitals<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Shopping areas<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>A mosque<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>24\\/7 security with controlled entry points<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price, Installments and Booking<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No public price list is quoted here for Saima Uptown Sukkur, so confirm any Saima projects in Main Shikarpur Road, Sukkur price in writing. The project is offered on easy installments, with the exact booking amount and payment schedule to be confirmed in writing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers asking about Saima projects on installment should request the following details:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li>Complete payment schedule<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Initial booking amount<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Monthly or quarterly installment amounts<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Additional charges and fees<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Expected possession timeline<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For Main Shikarpur Road, Sukkur apartments for sale, note that the Saima offering in this location includes plots and villas rather than apartments. Confirm the exact property type and availability in writing before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Approvals Before You Book<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Approvals are project-specific, so verify the NOC and relevant development approvals independently before booking. Anyone comparing Saima new projects in Sukkur Main Shikarpur Road should verify every document independently.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before making a payment, check:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li>Valid No Objection Certificate (NOC)<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Approved layout plan<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Land ownership and title documents<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Developer credentials<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>Written booking terms and payment conditions<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Final Thoughts<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Saima Uptown Sukkur is the main entry among Saima new projects in Sukkur Main Shikarpur Road. Before looking at other Saima projects on Main Shikarpur Road, Sukkur, get the price, payment schedule and approvals in writing.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\"}', '2026-11-10 06:46:20', '2026-11-10 06:52:13'),
