(1241, 159, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"What is a real estate developer?\",\"a\":\"A real estate developer is a company or organisation involved in planning, managing, and delivering property development projects. Its activities may include residential construction, housing societies, commercial developments, and infrastructure planning.\"},{\"q\":\"Who are the leading property developers in Pakistan?\",\"a\":\"Some recognised names associated with Pakistan\'s property development industry include Bahria Town, Habib Rafiq Group, Zameen Developments, Royal Developers & Builders, and other development companies and organisations.\"},{\"q\":\"How can I find property developers in Pakistan?\",\"a\":\"You can explore developer directories, official company websites, housing project information, and relevant property development resources. Compare company profiles and project portfolios to identify suitable developers.\"},{\"q\":\"How can I verify a property developer?\",\"a\":\"Review the company\'s development history, completed projects, official documentation, relevant project approvals, land ownership information, and construction progress.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the difference between a developer and a housing society?\",\"a\":\"A developer is a company or organisation responsible for planning and executing development projects. A housing society is a residential development or community that may be managed by a private developer, cooperative organisation, or public authority.\"},{\"q\":\"Are all housing societies in Pakistan approved?\",\"a\":\"No. Not every advertised housing society or development project has the necessary approvals. Buyers should verify the current NOC and approved layout plan with the relevant development authority.\"},{\"q\":\"What information should I check before choosing a developer?\",\"a\":\"Review the company\'s previous projects, legal documentation, approval status, construction quality, project progress, payment terms, and customer communication.\"},{\"q\":\"Can I compare different property developers online?\",\"a\":\"Yes. Developer directories and official company websites can help you compare company profiles, project locations, development categories, and available project information.\"},{\"q\":\"Do property developers offer instalment plans?\",\"a\":\"Many developers offer instalment-based payment arrangements for selected projects. The payment schedule, booking amount, and additional charges depend on the individual project.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas Pakistanis explore property developers in Pakistan?\",\"a\":\"Yes. Overseas Pakistanis can research developers and housing projects through online resources and official company information. They should independently verify legal documentation and use secure payment channels.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-13 21:01:06', '2026-11-13 21:04:47'),
