(1259, 161, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"AA Avenue Location on Sehba Akhtar Road, Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi\",\"description\":\"AA Avenue is listed on Sehba Akhtar Road, Block 13-E, Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi. This location is part of an established urban neighbourhood with residential buildings, commercial activity and access to important city routes.\\r\\nGulshan-e-Iqbal is connected to several major areas of Karachi, making it a familiar residential choice for families who want access to educational institutions, hospitals, shopping destinations and everyday services.\\r\\nThe project\'s location provides buyers with an opportunity to explore apartment living within an existing neighbourhood rather than an undeveloped area. Buyers should confirm the exact site address and location pin with the developer before visiting or booking.\",\"items\":[{\"place\":\"Sehba Akhtar Road\",\"time\":\"1\\u20132 min\"},{\"place\":\"Gulshan-e-Iqbal Block 13-E\",\"time\":\"1\\u20132 min\"},{\"place\":\"Hasan Square\",\"time\":\"4\\u20135 min\"},{\"place\":\"Civic Centre\",\"time\":\"4\\u20135 min\"}],\"subtitle\":null,\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794607499_6af7898b66118.jpg\"}', '2026-11-13 21:45:52', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1260, 161, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"Discover helpful answers to common questions about AA Avenue Karachi, its apartment options, location, payment information and booking process.\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is AA Avenue Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"AA Avenue is listed on Sehba Akhtar Road, Block 13-E, Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi. Buyers should confirm the exact site address and location pin with AA Builders & Developers before visiting the project.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the AA Avenue apartment price?\",\"a\":\"The final official price list has not been confirmed through the available public project information. Third-party listings show different price figures, so buyers should request the latest authorised price list from the developer before making a booking decision.\"},{\"q\":\"What apartment types are available in AA Avenue?\",\"a\":\"Available property listings identify 3-bedroom lounge and 4-bedroom lounge apartments. The reported sizes are approximately 1,300 and 1,650 square feet respectively. Buyers should confirm the final unit schedule and floor plans with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the AA Avenue payment plan?\",\"a\":\"AA Avenue is advertised with an instalment-based payment option, but public listings show differing payment details. Buyers should obtain the latest official payment schedule and confirm all booking and instalment terms before paying.\"},{\"q\":\"Is AA Avenue approved by SBCA?\",\"a\":\"A project-specific SBCA approval number has not been confirmed in the available public information. Buyers should request the relevant approval letter and sanctioned building plans and verify them with the concerned authority before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing AA Avenue?\",\"a\":\"AA Avenue is listed as a project by AA Builders & Developers, a Karachi-based real estate developer. Buyers can contact the developer\'s authorised sales channel for the latest project information and documentation.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms are available in AA Avenue apartments?\",\"a\":\"The available listings identify two apartment configurations: 3-bedroom lounge and 4-bedroom lounge. Final layouts, room dimensions and unit availability should be confirmed through the official floor plans.\"},{\"q\":\"When is the expected possession of AA Avenue?\",\"a\":\"Some third-party listings mention a target handover around 2031. However, buyers should confirm the official completion schedule and possession terms directly with the developer before making a purchase decision.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider AA Avenue Karachi?\",\"a\":\"AA Avenue may interest buyers looking for residential apartments in Gulshan-e-Iqbal, particularly those who prefer an established neighbourhood with access to everyday facilities and major roads. Buyers should assess the location, apartment layout, price, documentation and development status before deciding.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-13 21:45:52', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1261, 161, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Find Your Apartment at AA Avenue\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore residential opportunities at AA Avenue Karachi by AA Builders & Developers. Whether you are considering a 3-bedroom lounge apartment or a larger 4-bedroom option, our advisory team can help you understand the available unit configurations, location details and latest project information.\\r\\nRegister your interest to receive updates about apartment availability, official pricing, floor plans and payment details. Contact our team for guidance and make an informed decision before proceeding with a booking at AA Avenue, Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794606553_6af785d92900b.jpg\"}', '2026-11-13 21:45:52', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
