(1277, 163, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"AA Central Location on I.I. Chundrigar Road, New Challi, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Areas and Commercial Landmarks\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"State Bank of Pakistan\",\"time\":\"2\\u20133 min\"},{\"name\":\"HBL Plaza\",\"time\":\"2\\u20133 min\"},{\"name\":\"MCB Tower\",\"time\":\"2\\u20133 min\"},{\"name\":\"National Bank of Pakistan\",\"time\":\"2\\u20133 min\"}]}],\"subtitle\":\"AA Central is located on I.I. Chundrigar Road, New Challi, Karachi. This area is part of the city\'s established commercial landscape and is associated with business offices, financial services and other commercial activities.\\r\\nIts location is relevant for companies and professionals who want to operate within Karachi\'s central business district. Businesses can consider the surrounding commercial environment when assessing the convenience of the location for employees, clients and business visitors.\\r\\nFor buyers exploring commercial property in Karachi, the New Challi location offers an opportunity to consider office ownership within an established business area.\\r\\nBuyers should confirm the exact plot address, site access and location pin with AA Builders & Developers before arranging a project visit.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794607384_6af78918e5bfd.jpg\"}', '2026-11-13 21:57:15', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1278, 163, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"What is AA Central Karachi?\",\"a\":\"AA Central is a commercial development by AA Builders & Developers in New Challi, Karachi. It is planned as a Ground + 34-floor tower with 24 floors dedicated to commercial office spaces.\"},{\"q\":\"Where is AA Central located?\",\"a\":\"AA Central is located on I.I. Chundrigar Road, New Challi, Karachi. Buyers should confirm the exact project address and site access details with the developer before visiting.\"},{\"q\":\"What types of commercial units are available in AA Central?\",\"a\":\"The project is primarily marketed for commercial office spaces, with ground-floor commercial shop payment-plan options also listed by the developer. Buyers should confirm the current inventory and availability.\"},{\"q\":\"What are the office sizes available in AA Central?\",\"a\":\"The developer lists commercial office sizes ranging from approximately 629 to 1,060 square feet. Final unit dimensions and availability should be confirmed through the official office schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the AA Central office price?\",\"a\":\"The current unit-wise official price list should be obtained from AA Builders & Developers. Prices may vary according to office size, floor position, unit availability and payment terms.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the AA Central payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The developer\'s website provides separate commercial shop and office payment-plan sections. Buyers should request the latest authorised schedule for the selected unit, including booking requirements and instalment details.\"},{\"q\":\"What amenities are available at AA Central?\",\"a\":\"The developer lists 11 dedicated parking floors, six passenger lifts, one cargo lift and rooftop facilities including a mosque, gym, padel court and business centre.\"},{\"q\":\"How many floors does AA Central have?\",\"a\":\"AA Central is planned as a Ground + 34-floor commercial tower. The developer\'s published information identifies 24 floors for commercial office spaces.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the expected possession year of AA Central?\",\"a\":\"The developer\'s official project page lists 2030 as the delivery year. Buyers should confirm the contractual completion and possession schedule through the latest official documents.\"},{\"q\":\"Is AA Central approved by the relevant authorities?\",\"a\":\"The complete project-specific regulatory approval documentation has not been established through the public project information reviewed. Buyers should request and independently verify the applicable approvals and sanctioned building plans before booking.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-13 21:57:15', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
