(1301, 166, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"AA Waterfront by AA Builders & Developers\",\"description\":\"<p>AA Waterfront is a luxury residential development by AA Builders & Developers, located within the prestigious HMR Waterfront community in DHA Phase 8, Karachi. Designed to combine contemporary architecture with modern technology, the project offers an elevated residential experience along the Arabian Sea.<\\/p><p>The development features a Ground + 37-storey residential tower with a selection of 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, along with 4-bedroom duplex and 6-bedroom triplex penthouses. Each residence is designed with modern interiors, premium finishes, and smart home automation to provide comfort and convenience.<\\/p><p>With its waterfront setting, private lifts in selected residences, swimming pools, terraces, and lifestyle facilities, AA Waterfront offers a distinctive residential option for families and investors looking for luxury apartments in Karachi.<\\/p>\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794609497_6af791598fe10.webp\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-13 22:19:23', '2026-11-13 22:38:17'),
(1302, 166, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"AA Waterfront Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"AA Waterfront offers a range of modern facilities designed to support comfortable living, recreation, and everyday convenience. Residents can enjoy access to lifestyle amenities within the tower and the wider HMR Waterfront community.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-13 22:19:23', '2026-11-13 22:38:17'),
(1303, 166, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"AA Waterfront  Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794609000_6af78f6854887.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794609000_6af78f6854978.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794609000_6af78f6854a15.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794609000_6af78f6854b03.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-13 22:19:23', '2026-11-13 22:38:17'),
(1304, 166, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<h2>AA Waterfront \\u2013 Project Overview<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>AA Waterfront is designed for buyers seeking a combination of modern architecture, sea-facing residences, and premium lifestyle facilities. Located within HMR Waterfront, the project offers a residential environment with convenient access to important areas of Karachi.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The tower\'s residential options include apartments for individuals, couples, and families, while its duplex and triplex penthouses provide larger living spaces for buyers seeking an exclusive lifestyle.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Smart home automation, contemporary interiors, private terraces, and selected residences with private lifts add to the project\'s residential appeal.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>For buyers exploring AA Waterfront HMR Waterfront, the development offers an opportunity to consider modern coastal living in one of Karachi\'s established residential locations.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>AA Builders & Developers<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Master Community<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>HMR Waterfront<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Luxury Residential Tower<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Building Structure<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Ground + 37 Floors<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>1, 2 & 3-Bedroom Apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Penthouse Types<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>4-Bedroom Duplex & 6-Bedroom Triplex<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Plot #08, HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Views<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Arabian Sea and City Views<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Smart Features<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Smart Home Automation<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Amenities<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Swimming Pool, Gym, Sauna, Steam Room, and More<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Contact Authorized Sales Team<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Advertised target: 2028; confirm current schedule<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>AA Waterfront is planned as a modern residential tower within the larger HMR Waterfront master community. Its architectural concept focuses on waterfront living, contemporary design, and residential convenience.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The development combines residential apartments, exclusive penthouse layouts, and lifestyle facilities within a high-rise structure. The building is designed to offer sea-facing residences, modern lift access, spacious interiors, and selected private outdoor spaces.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The master community is positioned along the Arabian Sea and includes a wider range of residential and recreational facilities. This setting provides residents with access to the coastal environment while remaining connected to the main urban areas of Karachi.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers reviewing the AA Waterfront master plan should request the latest approved drawings and project documentation through the authorized sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Unit Types and Residential Options<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>AA Waterfront offers multiple residential configurations designed to meet different space requirements and lifestyle preferences. The available layouts include 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, as well as larger duplex and triplex penthouses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The project brochure includes individual floor plans for different apartment configurations and penthouse layouts.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Apartments in AA Waterfront<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The residential apartments at AA Waterfront are designed with modern layouts, comfortable living areas, and contemporary interior features.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>1-Bedroom Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 1-bedroom apartments offer a practical residential option for individuals and couples. These units are designed to provide comfortable living spaces, modern interiors, and access to the project\'s advertised smart home features.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>2-Bedroom Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 2-bedroom apartments are designed for small families and buyers who need additional living space. Their layouts focus on comfortable bedrooms, functional living areas, and modern residential features.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>3-Bedroom Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 3-bedroom apartments provide larger residential spaces for families seeking additional comfort and privacy. These residences feature spacious living areas, contemporary finishes, and attractive sea-facing views in selected layouts.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>4-Bedroom Duplex Penthouses<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 4-bedroom duplex penthouses offer a more spacious residential experience across two levels. Selected layouts include private lift access, terraces, and premium living spaces designed for buyers seeking an exclusive home.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>6-Bedroom Triplex Penthouses<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The 6-bedroom triplex penthouses are designed for buyers looking for expansive living spaces and a premium residential lifestyle. Their multi-level layouts provide additional room for family living, entertaining, and private relaxation.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers searching for apartments for sale AA Waterfront or flats for sale AA Waterfront Karachi should review the latest available inventory, apartment sizes, and floor plans before making a booking decision.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>AA Waterfront provides individual floor plan designs for its different apartment categories and penthouse configurations. The project brochure features layouts for 1-bedroom, 2-bedroom, and 3-bedroom apartments, along with 4-bedroom duplex penthouses.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The floor plans are designed to organize living, dining, bedroom, and private spaces according to each residential category. Selected penthouse layouts also include private lifts and terrace areas.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers interested in an AA Waterfront floor plan should request the latest layout for their preferred apartment type, including the covered area, floor position, orientation, and available views.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The price of an apartment at AA Waterfront depends on its size, floor level, layout, location within the tower, and view. Sea-facing residences and larger penthouses may have different pricing compared with standard apartment configurations.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Market listings have advertised starting prices around PKR 4.5 Crore, but this figure should not be treated as a confirmed current price for every available unit.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers searching for an AA Waterfront apartment price or AA Waterfront booking amount should contact the authorized sales team for the latest price list, available inventory, and booking requirements.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before making a payment, buyers should verify the following details:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Selected apartment or penthouse category.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Unit size and covered area.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Floor level and residential orientation.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Latest official selling price.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Booking amount and payment schedule.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Additional charges and applicable fees.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Official booking and sale documentation.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>AA Waterfront is located within the HMR Waterfront master community in DHA Phase 8, Karachi. However, buyers should distinguish between the approval status of the wider master community and the project-specific documentation for the AA Waterfront tower.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before booking an apartment, buyers should request the relevant NOC, approved building plans, land documentation, and other applicable approvals from the developer or the relevant authority.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should independently verify that the documentation applies to AA Waterfront and their selected unit rather than relying only on general approval claims or third-party property listings.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The advertised handover target for AA Waterfront is 2028. However, buyers should confirm the latest construction progress, contractual possession schedule, and handover conditions directly with the developer.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The actual handover timeline may depend on construction progress, regulatory requirements, and completion of the relevant development work.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Anyone considering an investment in AA Waterfront Karachi should review the possession terms mentioned in the official booking and sale documentation before making a financial commitment.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-13 22:19:23', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1305, 166, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"AA Waterfront Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<p>AA Waterfront has been marketed with installment-based purchasing options to make its residential units accessible through scheduled payments.<\\/p><p>A third-party project information page advertises a 66-month payment plan, including a 5% initial booking payment, three consecutive monthly payments of 5% each, and the remaining amount through 62 monthly installments.<\\/p><p>However, payment schedules may vary by apartment category, booking date, and available inventory. Buyers should request the latest authorized AA Waterfront payment plan, including the booking amount, installment dates, possession payment, and any additional charges.<\\/p><p>Do not rely on an old or unofficial installment schedule when making a booking decision.<\\/p>\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-13 22:19:23', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1306, 166, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"AA Waterfront Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794609497_6af791599780b.webp\",\"badge\":null}', '2026-11-13 22:19:23', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1307, 166, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"AA Waterfront Location in DHA Phase 8, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"subtitle\":\"AA Waterfront is located at Plot #08, HMR Waterfront, Abdul Sattar Edhi Avenue, DHA Phase 8, Karachi. Its waterfront setting places the development along the Arabian Sea, within a planned residential community.\\r\\nThe location provides connectivity to important parts of DHA and other major destinations across Karachi. Residents can access shopping, dining, recreational, and healthcare facilities within the surrounding areas.\\r\\nThe project\'s location is particularly relevant for buyers searching for sea view apartments in Karachi and luxury residential developments in DHA Phase 8.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794609497_6af7915998889.webp\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks and Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Arabian Sea\",\"time\":\"1\\u20133 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"HMR Private Beach\",\"time\":\"2\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Abdul Sattar Edhi Avenue\",\"time\":\"1\\u20132 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Do Darya\",\"time\":\"5 minutes\"}]}]}', '2026-11-13 22:19:23', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1308, 166, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is AA Waterfront Karachi located?\",\"a\":\"AA Waterfront is located at Plot #08, HMR Waterfront, Abdul Sattar Edhi Avenue, DHA Phase 8, Karachi. The residential tower is part of the HMR Waterfront community, positioned along the Arabian Sea.\"},{\"q\":\"What is AA Waterfront price?\",\"a\":\"AA Waterfront prices depend on apartment size, floor level, unit category, and views. Some market listings have advertised starting prices around PKR 4.5 Crore. Buyers should request the latest authorized price list for confirmed rates and availability.\"},{\"q\":\"What apartment types are available in AA Waterfront?\",\"a\":\"AA Waterfront offers 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, along with 4-bedroom duplex and 6-bedroom triplex penthouses. Buyers can request the latest floor plans and unit availability through the authorized sales team.\"},{\"q\":\"What is AA Waterfront payment plan?\",\"a\":\"A third-party project listing advertises a 66-month installment plan with an initial 5% booking payment, three monthly payments of 5% each, and the remaining amount through 62 installments. Buyers should confirm the current official schedule before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Is AA Waterfront DHA approved?\",\"a\":\"AA Waterfront is situated within the DHA Phase 8 HMR Waterfront community. Buyers should request and independently verify the project-specific NOC and approved building documentation before making a purchase.\"},{\"q\":\"How many floors does AA Waterfront have?\",\"a\":\"AA Waterfront is advertised by AA Builders & Developers as a Ground + 37-storey residential tower.\"},{\"q\":\"Does AA Waterfront offer sea-facing apartments?\",\"a\":\"Yes. The project brochure includes sea-facing apartment layouts and residential options designed to provide views of the Arabian Sea. Actual views depend on the selected unit and floor position.\"},{\"q\":\"What amenities are available at AA Waterfront?\",\"a\":\"Advertised facilities include a swimming pool, gymnasium, sauna, steam room, mosque, meeting room, community hall, lounge, gaming zone, children\'s play area, and parking facilities.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the possession date of AA Waterfront?\",\"a\":\"The advertised handover target is 2028. Buyers should confirm the current possession schedule and contractual handover terms directly with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas Pakistanis buy apartments in AA Waterfront?\",\"a\":\"Overseas Pakistanis interested in AA Waterfront can contact the developer or authorized sales representatives to discuss booking procedures, payment methods, documentation, and applicable purchase requirements.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-13 22:19:23', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
