(1334, 168, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"King\\u2019s Jinnah Tower by Kings Group\",\"description\":\"Kings JS Tower is a residential apartment project by Kings Group, reported on Jinnah Avenue, Karachi. Third-party listings describe it as a pre-launch development with an installment-based plan. Buyers should confirm the launch status, unit schedule and pricing directly with the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel before making any commitment.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794815533_6afab62d5b2cb.png\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-16 07:34:28', '2026-11-16 07:55:30'),
(1335, 168, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"King\\u2019s Jinnah Tower Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"No official amenity schedule has been confirmed for Kings JS Tower Karachi. Facility lists in third-party listings should be treated as unverified until Kings Group releases project documentation.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-16 07:34:28', '2026-11-16 07:55:30'),
(1336, 168, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"King\\u2019s Jinnah Tower Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794815533_6afab62d5dfde.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-16 07:34:28', '2026-11-16 07:55:30'),
(1337, 168, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<h2>Kings JS Tower Karachi: Apartments on Jinnah Avenue<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Kings JS Tower Jinnah Avenue is positioned for buyers who want a high-rise apartment on one of Karachi\\u2019s growing residential corridors. Because most available information comes from property portals rather than an official project page, buyers should verify every detail, including the project name, location, price and unit sizes, with Kings Group directly.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Key Project Highlights<\\/h3>\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n  <thead>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n      <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <\\/thead>\\r\\n  <tbody>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Kings Group<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Residential apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>To be confirmed by developer<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Not disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>To be announced<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Jinnah Avenue, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Installment plan reported, to be confirmed<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>High-rise apartment living<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>No official master plan has been published for Kings JS Tower. Tower count, floors and layout should be confirmed through Kings Group\\u2019s authorised channels. Buyers should not rely on figures from third-party listings alone.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Apartments in Kings JS Tower<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Unit sizes and bedroom counts vary across third-party listings, so they cannot be treated as confirmed. Buyers looking for apartments for sale in Kings JS Tower or flats for sale in Kings JS Tower Karachi should request the official unit schedule before deciding.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Floor Plan<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Floor plans for each unit category should be requested from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Price and Booking Status<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Kings JS Tower price differs between listings, and no official price list has been verified here. Buyers searching for a Kings JS Tower apartment price or Kings JS Tower booking amount should obtain the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt from Kings Group. They should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>No project-specific NOC or approval documents have been verified for Kings JS Tower. Buyers should ask the developer for approval documents and confirm them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Possession Timeline<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>No possession date has been officially confirmed. Any date quoted in a listing should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer\\u2019s documentation.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-16 07:34:28', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1338, 168, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"King\\u2019s Jinnah Tower Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"Listings mention an installment plan of around 36 months. This is not officially confirmed here, so buyers should get the current plan in writing from Kings Group.\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-16 07:34:28', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
