(1376, 172, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Kings JS Tower by Kings Group\",\"description\":\"Kings JS Tower is a residential apartment project by Kings Group on Main Jinnah Avenue, near Complex No. 5, Malir Cantt, Karachi. The official project page lists 3 and 4 bedroom apartments, a 36 month installment plan and a pre-launch discount. Price, booking amount, approvals and possession have not been published on that page, so buyers should confirm them directly with Kings Group.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794818563_6afac20341eb4.webp\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-16 08:36:30', '2026-11-16 08:42:43'),
(1377, 172, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Kings JS Tower Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"The official project page lists the following features:\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-16 08:36:30', '2026-11-16 08:42:43'),
(1378, 172, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Kings JS Tower Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794818563_6afac20343e31.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-16 08:36:30', '2026-11-16 08:42:43'),
(1379, 172, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>Kings JS Tower is positioned for families who want a spacious apartment on Main Jinnah Avenue with dedicated parking, a gym and a children\\u2019s area inside the project. The official page presents it with a pre-launch discount, so final pricing and terms may change once Kings Group announces the launch.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should rely on the developer\\u2019s official documentation and confirm any figures seen on third-party listings, including prices and unit sizes, before making a payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n  <tbody><tr>\\r\\n    <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n    <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Kings Group<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Residential apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>3 and 4 bedroom apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Not disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Not published<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Main Jinnah Avenue, near Complex No. 5, Malir Cantt, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>36 month installment plan (as stated on the official page)<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>High-rise family living<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No detailed master plan has been published on the project page. Details such as the number of floors and the tower layout should be confirmed through Kings Group\\u2019s authorised sales channel. Buyers should not rely on third-party listings alone for these figures.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Apartments in Kings JS Tower<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The official page lists 3 and 4 bedroom apartments designed for family living. Apartment sizes have not been published, and sizes in third-party listings vary and are unverified.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Kings JS Tower or flats for sale in Kings JS Tower Karachi should request the official unit schedule before deciding.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Floor plans for each apartment type should be requested from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel together with the unit schedule. A project brochure is offered for download on the official page.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No official Kings JS Tower price list is published on the project page. The page mentions a pre-launch discount, but its terms are not stated, and prices in third-party listings differ.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers searching for a Kings JS Tower apartment price or booking amount should:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li>Request the authorised price schedule from Kings Group.<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Confirm the applicable pre-launch discount and its terms.<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Obtain a written booking receipt from the developer.<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Verify payment instructions before transferring any amount.<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Avoid making payments to unverified agents.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Kings JS Tower are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession date has been published for Kings JS Tower. Any date quoted in a listing should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer\\u2019s official documentation.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-16 08:36:30', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1380, 172, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Kings JS Tower Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The official project page states that apartments are available on a 36 month installment plan. The booking amount, installment amounts and any change to the plan after launch are not published. Buyers should obtain the full schedule in writing from Kings Group\\u2019s authorised sales channel before paying any amount.\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-16 08:36:30', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
