(1418, 176, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Peace Apartments Location in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks and Attractions:\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Naya Nazimabad\",\"time\":\"2\\u20135 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"North Nazimabad\",\"time\":\"5\\u201310 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Naya Nazimabad Gymkhana\",\"time\":\"2\\u20134 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Grand Jama Masjid\",\"time\":\"2\\u20133 minutes\"}]}],\"subtitle\":\"Peace Apartments is located inside Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, as stated on the official project page. The page also mentions a flyover that connects North Nazimabad to Naya Nazimabad. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location and approach route with the developer before visiting.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794827760_6afae5f0406e5.jpg\"}', '2026-11-16 11:05:55', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1419, 176, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Peace Apartments Naya Nazimabad located?\",\"a\":\"Peace Apartments is located inside Naya Nazimabad, Karachi. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Peace Apartments price?\",\"a\":\"No separate price list is published as text on the official page, and prices appear on the plan sheets. Buyers should request the current authorised price schedule and treat any figure in third-party listings as unverified.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Peace Apartments?\",\"a\":\"The official page lists 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments. Sizes are shown on the plan sheets and should be confirmed with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Peace Apartments payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The official page publishes payment plan sheets for apartments and for shops and showrooms. Buyers should confirm the plan that applies to their unit and get the terms in writing before paying any amount.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Peace Apartments NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"No project-specific approval documents are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the NOC and approval details and verify them with the relevant authority.\"},{\"q\":\"What amenities are available in Peace Apartments?\",\"a\":\"The official page lists a community hall, a gaming room, a senior citizen lounge, a male and female gym, a co-working space, a library, a community garden and a children\\u2019s play area, along with parking, lifts, a standby generator and a fire fighting system.\"},{\"q\":\"Are shops and showrooms available in Peace Apartments?\",\"a\":\"The official page shows floor plans and a payment plan sheet for shops and showrooms. Buyers should confirm availability with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Are Peace Apartments the same as Rahat Residency or Globe Residency?\",\"a\":\"No. They are separate projects listed separately on the Naya Nazimabad website. Buyers should confirm which project any payment or document refers to before proceeding.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Peace Apartments?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers should deal only through the developer\\u2019s authorised channels and should not send funds against unverified offers.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Peace Apartments Naya Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"It may suit families who want a 2, 3 or 4 bedroom apartment inside a master-planned community with in-building amenities. The sensible step is to verify the price, payment plan and approvals with the developer before booking.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-16 11:05:55', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
