(1460, 180, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Globe Residency by Naya Nazimabad\",\"description\":\"Globe Residency is a high-rise apartment project inside Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, a gated, master-planned township developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). Listings from the real estate agency S.S Enterprises show 2 and 3 bedroom DD apartments, some ready for possession and others available on installments. Prices and possession dates differ by unit, so buyers should confirm them directly with the developer before booking.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794834328_6afaff98cda0c.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-16 12:58:49', '2026-11-16 13:05:28'),
(1461, 180, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Globe Residency Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"No amenity schedule for Globe Residency is published on the source page. Buyers should request the project\\u2019s amenity list from the developer. Naya Nazimabad\\u2019s community facilities, such as the Gymkhana and Jama Masjid, are listed separately on the community\\u2019s website and should not be treated as Globe Residency amenities unless the developer confirms it.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-16 12:58:49', '2026-11-16 13:05:28'),
(1462, 180, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Globe Residency Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794834328_6afaff98d00e0.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794834328_6afaff98d026d.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794834328_6afaff98d0420.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794834328_6afaff98d05bd.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-16 12:58:49', '2026-11-16 13:05:28'),
(1463, 180, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>Globe Residency is positioned for families who want a spacious 2 or 3 bedroom apartment inside a gated township, with the choice between a ready unit and one on an installment plan. Listings describe many units as corner and park facing, and some as boulevard or masjid facing.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Because the listing data comes from a real estate agency, buyers should treat prices, floors and possession dates as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n  <thead>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n      <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <\\/thead>\\r\\n  <tbody>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Naya Nazimabad (Javedan Corporation Limited, Arif Habib Group)<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Residential apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>2 bedroom DD and 3 bedroom DD apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Apartment Sizes<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>About 1,249 sq. ft (2 bed DD) and 1,750 sq. ft (3 bed DD), as listed<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Price Range (listed)<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>PKR 1.88 crore to PKR 3.4 crore, subject to change<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Some units ready, others listed for March and June 2027<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>Installments available, confirm schedule with developer<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n      <td>High-rise living in a master-planned community<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Globe Residency is part of the wider Naya Nazimabad community. The source page does not publish a tower layout, the number of floors or the number of units. These details should be confirmed through the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Apartments in Globe Residency<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>The listings show 2 bedroom DD apartments of about 1,249 square feet and 3 bedroom DD apartments of about 1,750 square feet. Several are described as corner units with park views. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Globe Residency should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes and sizes should be confirmed with the developer.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>No floor plan is published on the source page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Listings show apartments at roughly PKR 1.88 crore to PKR 3.4 crore, or about PKR 14,571 to PKR 19,429 per square foot, depending on the unit. These are agency listings and not an official developer price list. Buyers searching for a Globe Residency apartment price or booking amount should request the current authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt. They should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Globe Residency are published on the source page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n<p>Listings show some Globe Residency units as ready for possession and others with possession dates in March 2027 and June 2027. Possession dates differ by unit and are not an official handover schedule, so buyers should confirm the date for their specific unit in writing.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-16 12:58:49', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1464, 180, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Globe Residency Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"<div>Globe Residency apartments are listed as available on installments. One listing shows an upfront payment of PKR 77.5 lakh and a remaining balance of about PKR 1.1 crore against a total price of PKR 1.88 crore, but this applies to a specific unit and should not be treated as a standard plan. Buyers should get the full schedule, including the booking amount, installment amounts and duration, in writing from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel. Any plan quoted by a third party should be treated as unverified.<\\/div>\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[{\"installment\":\"On Installment\",\"percentage\":\"20\",\"milestone\":\"On Installment\"},{\"installment\":\"Handover\",\"percentage\":\"80\",\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone\"},{\"installment\":\"New Installment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone\"},{\"installment\":\"New Installment\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"milestone\":\"Construction Milestone\"}]}', '2026-11-16 12:58:49', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1465, 180, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Globe Residency Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794834328_6afaff98d6c8e.jpg\",\"badge\":null}', '2026-11-16 12:58:49', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1466, 180, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Globe Residency Location in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks and Attractions:\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Manghopir Road\",\"time\":\"6 min\"},{\"name\":\"North Nazimabad\",\"time\":\"5\\u201315 min\"}]}],\"subtitle\":\"Globe Residency is located inside Naya Nazimabad, a township of roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road in Karachi, about 2 km from North Nazimabad. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location and approach route with the developer before visiting.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794834328_6afaff98d7fa2.jpg\"}', '2026-11-16 12:58:49', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1467, 180, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Globe Residency Naya Nazimabad located?\",\"a\":\"Globe Residency is located inside Naya Nazimabad, near Manghopir Road in Karachi, about 2 km from North Nazimabad. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Globe Residency price?\",\"a\":\"Listings show prices from about PKR 1.88 crore to PKR 3.4 crore, depending on the unit. These are agency listings, so buyers should request the authorised price schedule from the developer and confirm the price of their specific unit.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Globe Residency?\",\"a\":\"Listings show 2 bedroom DD apartments of about 1,249 square feet and 3 bedroom DD apartments of about 1,750 square feet. Buyers should confirm sizes with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Globe Residency payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Apartments are listed as available on installments. The full schedule differs by unit, so buyers should get the booking amount, installment amounts and duration in writing before paying any amount.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Globe Residency NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"No project-specific approval documents are published on the source page. Buyers should ask the developer for the NOC and approval details and verify them with the relevant authority.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Globe Residency ready for possession?\",\"a\":\"Some units are listed as ready for possession, while others are listed for March and June 2027. Buyers should confirm the possession date of their specific unit in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Globe Residency available on installments?\",\"a\":\"Yes, listings describe the project as ready and available on installments. The terms differ by unit and should be confirmed with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Are Globe Residency apartments park facing?\",\"a\":\"Many listed units are described as corner and park facing, and some as boulevard or masjid facing. Buyers should confirm the view of a specific unit with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Globe Residency the same as Peace Apartments, Rahat Residency or Signature Tower?\",\"a\":\"No. They are separate projects inside Naya Nazimabad. Buyers should confirm which project any payment or document refers to before proceeding.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Globe Residency?\",\"a\":\"Overseas Pakistanis can buy through a Special Power of Attorney and a Roshan Digital Account. Buyers should confirm the process and required documents with the developer and should not send funds against unverified offers.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-16 12:58:49', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1468, 180, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":null,\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794834328_6afaff98d9ef4.jpg\"}', '2026-11-16 12:58:49', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
