(1474, 181, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Stadium View Residencia Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794898151_6afbf8e73b043.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794898151_6afbf8e73b27f.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794898151_6afbf8e73b491.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794898151_6afbf8e73b7e2.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-16 13:07:41', '2026-11-17 06:49:11'),
(1475, 181, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>Stadium View Residencia is positioned for buyers who want a modern apartment with a stadium view inside a gated township, on a 48 month installment plan. The listing describes units on floors 2 to 16, many of them park and boulevard facing.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Because the listing data comes from a real estate agency, buyers should treat prices, floors and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n  <tbody><tr>\\r\\n    <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n    <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad (Javedan Corporation Limited, Arif Habib Group)<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Residential apartments, with a commercial basement and ground-floor showrooms<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>2 bed lounge and 2 bed DD \\/ 3 bed lounge (currently listed)<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Apartment Sizes<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>About 896 sq. ft and 1,249 sq. ft, as listed<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Price Range (listed)<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>PKR 1.61 crore to PKR 2.31 crore, subject to change<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Not published<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>48 month installment plan (as listed), confirm schedule with developer<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>High-rise living in a master-planned community<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Stadium View Residencia is part of the wider Naya Nazimabad community. The listing describes a tower of 18 floors with a commercial basement and ground-floor showrooms below the apartments. The tower layout and the number of units should be confirmed through the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Apartments in Stadium View Residencia<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The listing shows two currently available layouts:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li>2 bed lounge: about 896 sq. ft, listed at PKR 1.61 crore (about PKR 18,000 per sq. ft).<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>2 bed DD \\/ 3 bed lounge: about 1,249 sq. ft, listed at PKR 2.31 crore (about PKR 18,500 per sq. ft).<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The project page also mentions 4 bed lounge layouts, but these are not in the current listing. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Stadium View Residencia should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No floor plan is published on the source page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Listings show apartments at about PKR 1.61 crore to PKR 2.31 crore, or roughly PKR 18,000 to PKR 18,500 per square foot. These are agency listings and not an official developer price list. Booking is listed as open, with one listing mentioning a 10% booking amount.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should request the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt, and should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Stadium View Residencia are published on the source page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession date has been published for Stadium View Residencia. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer\\u2019s official documentation.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-16 13:07:41', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1476, 181, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Stadium View Residencia Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"Listings describe a 48 month installment plan. For the 896 sq. ft unit, the listing shows an upfront payment of about PKR 40.32 lakh and a monthly installment of about PKR 1.32 lakh. For the 1,249 sq. ft unit, it shows about PKR 57.77 lakh upfront and about PKR 1.89 lakh monthly. These amounts do not add up to the full price, so other payments, such as balloon or possession payments, may apply. Buyers should get the complete schedule in writing from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel before paying any amount.\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[{\"installment\":\"On Booking\",\"percentage\":\"10%\",\"milestone\":\"\"},{\"installment\":\"During Construction\",\"percentage\":\"75%\",\"milestone\":\"\"},{\"installment\":\"On Possession\",\"percentage\":\"15%\",\"milestone\":\"\"}]}', '2026-11-16 13:07:41', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1477, 181, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Stadium View Residencia Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794898151_6afbf8e740622.jpg\",\"badge\":null}', '2026-11-16 13:07:41', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1478, 181, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Stadium View Residencia Location in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"subtitle\":\"Stadium View Residencia is located inside Naya Nazimabad, a township of roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road in Karachi, about 2 km from North Nazimabad. The project overlooks the Naya Nazimabad Cricket Stadium. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location and approach route with the developer before visiting.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794898382_6afbf9ce08380.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks and Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Naya Nazimabad Cricket Stadium\",\"time\":\"2\\u20135 min\"},{\"name\":\"Naya Nazimabad\",\"time\":\"2\\u20135 min\"},{\"name\":\"Manghopir Road\",\"time\":\"3\\u20138 min\"},{\"name\":\"North Nazimabad\",\"time\":\"6 min\"}]}]}', '2026-11-16 13:07:41', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1479, 181, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Stadium View Residencia located?\",\"a\":\"Stadium View Residencia is located inside Naya Nazimabad, near Manghopir Road in Karachi, with views of the Naya Nazimabad Cricket Stadium. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Stadium View Residencia price?\",\"a\":\"Listings show prices from about PKR 1.61 crore for a 896 sq. ft 2 bed lounge to about PKR 2.31 crore for a 1,249 sq. ft 2 bed DD \\/ 3 bed lounge. These are agency listings, so buyers should request the authorised price schedule from the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Stadium View Residencia?\",\"a\":\"Current listings show 2 bed lounge and 2 bed DD \\/ 3 bed lounge apartments. Buyers should confirm sizes and availability with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Stadium View Residencia payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Listings describe a 48 month installment plan with an upfront payment and monthly installments. The listed amounts do not cover the full price, so buyers should get the complete schedule in writing before paying any amount.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Stadium View Residencia NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"No project-specific approval documents are published on the source page. Buyers should ask the developer for the NOC and approval details and verify them with the relevant authority.\"},{\"q\":\"How many floors does Stadium View Residencia have?\",\"a\":\"The listing describes 18 floors of apartments above a commercial basement and ground-floor showrooms. Buyers should confirm the floor count with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Does Stadium View Residencia have commercial space?\",\"a\":\"The listing mentions a commercial basement and ground-floor showrooms. Buyers should request sizes and prices of commercial units from the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Are Stadium View Residencia apartments park facing?\",\"a\":\"Listings describe many units as park and boulevard facing, and some as corner and west open. Buyers should confirm the view of a specific unit with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Stadium View Residencia the same as Globe Residency or Signature Tower?\",\"a\":\"No. They are separate projects inside Naya Nazimabad. Buyers should confirm which project any payment or document refers to before proceeding.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Stadium View Residencia?\",\"a\":\"S.S Enterprises states that overseas Pakistanis can buy through a Special Power of Attorney and a Roshan Digital Account. Buyers should confirm the process and required documents with the developer and should not send funds against unverified offers.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-16 13:07:41', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1480, 181, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Register your interest in Stadium View Residencia Naya Nazimabad. Contact our advisory team for personalised guidance on Stadium View Residencia, the current unit availability and private updates. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale in Stadium View Residencia or want to buy a flat in Stadium View Residencia Naya Nazimabad, our consultants can keep you informed as verified details are released.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794898562_6afbfa8294a26.jpg\"}', '2026-11-16 13:07:41', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
