(1499, 183, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>Voco Tower is positioned for business owners and investors who want commercial space inside a gated township with a residential population. The tower is described as ground plus 4 floors, and the listing is marked as pre-booking, so the project has not been presented as launched.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Because the listing data comes from a real estate agency, buyers should treat prices, floors and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n  <tbody><tr>\\r\\n    <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n    <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad (Javedan Corporation Limited, Arif Habib Group)<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Commercial<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Building Height<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Ground + 4 floors<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Not published<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Not disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Not published<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>17 month installment plan listed for one unit, confirm with developer<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Status<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Pre-booking<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Voco Tower is part of the wider Naya Nazimabad community. The listing describes a ground plus 4 commercial tower. The tower layout, the number of units and the floor allocation should be confirmed through the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Commercial Units in Voco Tower<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The only unit shown in the listing is a commercial floor of about 2,188.53 sq. ft on the 2nd or 3rd floor, listed at PKR 5.47 crore (about PKR 25,000 per sq. ft). Other unit types and sizes have not been published.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers seeking commercial floors or offices in Voco Tower should request the official unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No floor plan is published on the source page. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The listing shows one commercial unit at about PKR 5.47 crore, or roughly PKR 25,000 per square foot. This is an agency listing and not an official developer price list. The project is marked as pre-booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should request the authorised price schedule and a written booking receipt, and should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Voco Tower are published on the source page. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession date has been published for Voco Tower. Because the project is at the pre-booking stage, any date quoted today should be treated as unverified until it appears in the developer\\u2019s official documentation.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-17 07:14:03', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1500, 183, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Voco Tower Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The listing for the 2,188.53 sq. ft unit mentions a 17 month installment plan. The booking amount, installment amounts and any other payments are not published. Buyers should get the full schedule in writing from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel before paying any amount, and should treat any plan quoted by a third party as unverified.\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-17 07:14:03', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1501, 183, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Voco Tower Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794900182_6afc00d6ad3b4.jpg\",\"badge\":null}', '2026-11-17 07:14:03', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1502, 183, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Voco Tower Location in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks and Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Naya Nazimabad Main Gate\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 min\"},{\"name\":\"Naya Nazimabad Cricket Stadium\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 min\"},{\"name\":\"Naya Nazimabad Gymkhana\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 min\"},{\"name\":\"Jama Masjid, Naya Nazimabad\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 min\"}]}],\"subtitle\":\"Voco Tower is located inside Naya Nazimabad, a township of roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road in Karachi, about 2 km from North Nazimabad. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location and approach route with the developer before visiting.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794900182_6afc00d6ae6a5.jpg\"}', '2026-11-17 07:14:03', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1503, 183, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Voco Tower Naya Nazimabad located?\",\"a\":\"Voco Tower is located inside Naya Nazimabad, near Manghopir Road in Karachi. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Voco Tower price?\",\"a\":\"The listing shows one commercial unit at about PKR 5.47 crore (about PKR 25,000 per sq. ft). This is an agency listing, so buyers should request the authorised price schedule from the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What type of units are available in Voco Tower?\",\"a\":\"The listing shows a commercial floor of about 2,188.53 sq. ft. Other unit types have not been published, so buyers should request the unit schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Voco Tower payment plan?\",\"a\":\"A 17 month installment plan is listed for one unit. The full schedule is not published, so buyers should get the complete terms in writing before paying any amount.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Voco Tower NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"No project-specific approval documents are published on the source page. Buyers should ask the developer for the NOC and approval details and verify them with the relevant authority.\"},{\"q\":\"How many floors does Voco Tower have?\",\"a\":\"The listing describes a ground plus 4 floor commercial tower. Buyers should confirm the floor count with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Voco Tower launched?\",\"a\":\"The listing marks the project as pre-booking. Buyers should confirm the launch status and booking terms with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Voco Tower the same as Vision Tower?\",\"a\":\"No. They are separate commercial projects in Naya Nazimabad. Buyers should confirm which project any payment or document refers to before proceeding.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Voco Tower?\",\"a\":\"S.S Enterprises states that overseas Pakistanis can buy through a Special Power of Attorney and a Roshan Digital Account. Buyers should confirm the process and required documents with the developer and should not send funds against unverified offers.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Voco Tower Naya Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"It may suit business owners and investors who want to follow a new commercial tower inside a master-planned township from the pre-booking stage. The sensible step is to verify the unit types, price, payment plan and approvals with the developer before booking.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-17 07:14:03', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1504, 183, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Register your interest in Voco Tower Naya Nazimabad. Contact our advisory team for personalised guidance on Voco Tower, the current pre-booking position and private updates. Whether you are exploring commercial floors for sale in Voco Tower or want to buy commercial space in Voco Tower Naya Nazimabad, our consultants can keep you informed as verified details are released.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794900182_6afc00d6b0797.jpg\"}', '2026-11-17 07:14:03', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1505, 183, 'communities', 'Community / Project Cards', 95, 0, 1, '{\"heading\":\"Projects\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"selected_ids\":[],\"project_ids\":[],\"items\":[],\"unselected_ids\":[75,74,73,72,71,70,69,68,67,66,65,64,63,62,61,60,59,58,57,56,55,54,53,52,51,50,49,48,47,46,45,44,43,42,41,40,39,38,37,36,35,34]}', '2026-11-17 07:14:34', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1506, 184, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"S.S Vision Enclave at Naya Nazimabad Karachi\",\"subtitle\":null,\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794900882_6afc03926c930.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"S.S Vision Enclave at Naya Nazimabad Karachi\",\"image_alt\":\"S.S Vision Enclave at Naya Nazimabad Karachi\"}', '2026-11-17 07:28:24', '2026-11-17 07:34:42'),
(1507, 184, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, 1, '{\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-17 07:28:24', '2026-11-17 07:28:24'),
(1508, 184, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"S.S Vision Enclave Naya Nazimabad\",\"description\":\"S.S Vision Enclave is a planned commercial project in Naya Nazimabad, Karachi, described as a ground plus 7 tower. Its status is \\u201cto be announced\\u201d, and bookings have not opened. No official unit schedule, price list, payment plan or possession date has been published, so location details, unit mix, price and timeline beyond the basics remain unconfirmed.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794900882_6afc03926eb0e.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-17 07:28:24', '2026-11-17 07:34:42'),
(1509, 184, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"S.S Vision Enclave Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"No amenity schedule has been published for S.S Vision Enclave. Any facility list seen in third-party material should be treated as unverified until project documentation is released.\",\"items\":[]}', '2026-11-17 07:28:24', '2026-11-17 07:34:42'),
(1510, 184, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"S.S Vision Enclave Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794900882_6afc039271108.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-17 07:28:24', '2026-11-17 07:34:42'),
(1511, 184, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>At present, S.S Vision Enclave exists as an announced concept rather than an open project. It is described as a flagship commercial tower of ground plus 7 floors inside Naya Nazimabad, a gated, master-planned township of roughly 1,300 acres developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). That makes it different from a project buyers can inspect, price or book today.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Until official launch documentation is published, the accurate position is that buyers can register interest and wait for confirmed details. Nothing more should be promised, and no payment should change hands against this project name.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n  <tbody><tr>\\r\\n    <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n    <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Not published<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Commercial<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Building Height<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Ground + 7 floors<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>To be announced<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Not disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>To be announced<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>To be announced<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Status<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>To be announced, bookings not open<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No master plan has been published for S.S Vision Enclave. The tower layout, floor allocation and unit mix will only become clear if and when official documentation is released. Buyers should not assume that details of any other Naya Nazimabad commercial project apply to this one.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Commercial Units in S.S Vision Enclave<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No unit schedule has been published. Unit types, sizes and floor allocation are not confirmed, so buyers seeking shops, offices or commercial floors in S.S Vision Enclave should register interest and wait for the official unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No floor plan has been published. Floor plans for each unit category should be requested once the project is formally launched.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>There is no official S.S Vision Enclave price, because no price list has been published. Bookings have not opened. Buyers searching for an S.S Vision Enclave price or booking amount should register interest only, and should not pay any amount to any party claiming to collect bookings before an official launch.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents specific to S.S Vision Enclave have been published. Buyers should verify the position directly with the developer or the relevant authority once the project is formally launched.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession timeline exists for S.S Vision Enclave, because the project has not been formally launched. Any date quoted today would be speculation.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-17 07:28:24', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1512, 184, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"S.S Vision Enclave Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"No payment plan has been released for S.S Vision Enclave. If the project launches, the schedule should be published through the authorised sales channel at that time. Until then, any payment plan or booking amount quoted under this name should be treated as unverified.\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-17 07:28:24', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
