(1519, 185, 'communities', 'Community / Project Cards', 3, 1, 1, '{\"heading\":\"Projects\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"selected_ids\":[71,70,75,72],\"project_ids\":[71,70,75,72],\"items\":[{\"id\":71,\"name\":\"Rahat Residency\",\"location\":\"Naya Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"price\":\"\",\"delivery\":\"\",\"developer\":\"Javedan Corporation Limited\",\"paymentPlan\":\"Flexible Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/rahat-residency\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794830593_6afaf101e35d9.jpg\"},{\"id\":70,\"name\":\"Signature Tower\",\"location\":\"Naya Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"price\":\"\",\"delivery\":\"\",\"developer\":\"Javedan Corporation Limited\",\"paymentPlan\":\"Flexible Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/signature-tower\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794829854_6afaee1e1fb1c.jpg\"},{\"id\":75,\"name\":\"Voco Tower\",\"location\":\"Naya Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"price\":\"\",\"delivery\":\"\",\"developer\":\"Javedan Corporation Limited\",\"paymentPlan\":\"Flexible Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/voco-tower\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794900182_6afc00d6a1442.jpg\"},{\"id\":72,\"name\":\"Globe Residency\",\"location\":\"Naya Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"price\":\"\",\"delivery\":\"\",\"developer\":\"Javedan Corporation Limited\",\"paymentPlan\":\"Flexible Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/globe-residency\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794834328_6afaff98cac32.jpg\"}],\"unselected_ids\":[76,74,73,69,68,67,66,65,64,63,62,61,60,59,58,57,56,55,54,53,52,51,50,49,48,47,46,45,44,43,42,41,40,39,38,37,36,35,34]}', '2026-11-17 07:50:22', '2026-11-17 08:01:25'),
(1520, 185, 'content', 'Content', 2, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"For buyers searching for a Naya Nazimabad 120 yard house for sale, the 120 sq yd villa is the size most families ask about. It gives a ground plus one home with three or four bedrooms inside a gated township. This page covers where 120 yard houses are found, what they cost in recent listings, and what to confirm in writing before you pay.\",\"html\":\"<h2>Why a 120 Yard House in Naya Nazimabad Stands Out<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A 120 yard house in Naya Nazimabad sits inside a gated, master-planned township of roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road, about 2 km from North Nazimabad. The township is developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). The Naya Nazimabad website lists community facilities such as the Gymkhana, a Jama Masjid, Ali Habib Medical Center and a cricket stadium. A 120 yard house gives you a private home with its own entrance, instead of a shared apartment tower.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Facts: 120 Yard Houses in Naya Nazimabad<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>This table summarises what recent listings show for a Naya Nazimabad 120 sq yd house for sale.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<th>Detail<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Information<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Plot Size<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>120 square yards (about 1,080 sq. ft of land)<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Typical Construction<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Ground plus one floor<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Bedrooms<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>3 to 4 bedrooms, usually with attached baths<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Blocks Seen in Listings<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>A, B, C, D and M<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Listed Asking Prices<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Roughly PKR 2.8 crore to PKR 4.5 crore<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Road Widths Mentioned<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>30 ft to 100 ft, depending on the location<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Condition<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Brand new and pre-owned houses<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Prices vary by block, road width, view and condition, so treat these as a guide only.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>120 Yard Houses by Block<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Recent listings for a Naya Nazimabad 120 yard villa come from these blocks:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><strong>Block A:<\\/strong> Several houses are described as near the Gymkhana, with park, masjid and market access nearby. Asking prices in listings run around PKR 4.2 to 4.5 crore.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Block B:<\\/strong> Park facing 120 yard villas are listed, with three bedrooms and three baths.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Block C:<\\/strong> Houses are often described as park facing, or near a masjid or football ground. Asking prices run around PKR 3.6 to 4.25 crore.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Block D:<\\/strong> Brand new and corner houses are listed on 30 ft and 40 ft roads, with asking prices around PKR 3.5 to 3.6 crore.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Block M:<\\/strong> A three-bedroom 120 yard house is listed at around PKR 2.84 crore, the lowest among recent listings.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Layout and Features of a 120 Yard House<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The common layout for a 120 yard house in Naya Nazimabad is ground plus one:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Ground floor with a drawing room, lounge, kitchen and one bedroom<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>First floor with two or three bedrooms and a lounge or terrace<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Parking space for one car<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Extras in some listings, such as a west-open plot, a corner plot or a park-facing position<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Corner, west-open and park-facing houses are often listed at higher asking prices than standard ones.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Payment<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Recent listings show a Naya Nazimabad 120 yard house price from about PKR 2.84 crore to PKR 4.5 crore. Most of these are resale houses sold by individual owners, so the price is negotiable and the payment terms are set between buyer and seller. Buyers comparing a 120 yards house in Naya Nazimabad price should compare similar blocks, road widths and construction quality, and should ask for the full payment terms in writing before paying any token amount.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Checks Before You Buy<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Confirm that the seller is the registered owner and that the property documents are in order<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Check the lease or transfer status with the relevant society office<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Ask whether the house is a brand new build or a pre-owned unit, and inspect the construction quality<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Confirm the exact block, plot number and road width on site<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Pay only through traceable banking channels, with a written receipt<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Final Thoughts<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>A Naya Nazimabad 120 yard house for sale suits families who want a ground plus one home in a gated community, with a choice of blocks and budgets. Before comparing other Naya Nazimabad houses for sale, visit the block, check the documents and get the price and payment terms in writing.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-17 07:50:22', '2026-11-17 08:01:57'),
(1521, 185, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"1. What is the price of a 120 yard house in Naya Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"Recent listings show asking prices from about PKR 2.84 crore to PKR 4.5 crore. The price depends on the block, road width, view and construction quality.\"},{\"q\":\"2. Where are 120 yard houses for sale in Naya Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"Recent listings come from Blocks A, B, C, D and M of Naya Nazimabad, Karachi.\"},{\"q\":\"3. How many bedrooms does a 120 yard house have?\",\"a\":\"Most listings show three or four bedrooms, usually in a ground plus one layout with a drawing room and lounge.\"},{\"q\":\"4. Which block is best for a 120 yard house in Naya Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"It depends on your priorities. Block A listings stress closeness to the Gymkhana, Block C listings often mention parks and masjids, and Block D and M listings are generally lower priced. Visit the blocks and compare before deciding.\"},{\"q\":\"5. Are 120 yard houses in Naya Nazimabad brand new or pre-owned?\",\"a\":\"Both are listed. Some houses are described as brand new or built in 2025 to 2026, while others are pre-owned and well maintained.\"},{\"q\":\"6. Is a park facing 120 yard house more expensive?\",\"a\":\"Park facing, corner and west-open houses are often listed at higher asking prices than standard ones, but the final price is negotiated with the seller.\"},{\"q\":\"7. Can I buy a 120 yard house in Naya Nazimabad on installments?\",\"a\":\"Most 120 yard houses are resale properties, so payment terms are agreed with the seller. Ask for any installment or bank financing option in writing before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"8. What documents should I check before buying a 120 yard house?\",\"a\":\"Check the owner\\u2019s identity, the property documents, the lease or transfer status with the society office, and any pending dues. Verify every document independently before paying.\"},{\"q\":\"9. What facilities are near Naya Nazimabad 120 yard houses?\",\"a\":\"The Naya Nazimabad website lists the Gymkhana, a Jama Masjid, Ali Habib Medical Center and a cricket stadium. Distance from a specific house depends on its block.\"},{\"q\":\"10. Is a 120 yard house in Naya Nazimabad a good option for families?\",\"a\":\"It suits families who want a private ground plus one home with three or four bedrooms in a gated community. Check the block, road width and documents before deciding, and compare more than one house.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-17 07:50:22', '2026-11-17 07:59:39'),
