(1525, 186, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Naya Nazimabad Apartments for Sale\",\"subtitle\":null,\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794906980_6afc1b646aeb8.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Naya Nazimabad Apartments for Sale\",\"image_alt\":\"Naya Nazimabad Apartments for Sale\"}', '2026-11-17 09:06:43', '2026-11-17 09:16:20'),
(1526, 186, 'content', 'Content', 2, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"For buyers searching for Naya Nazimabad apartments for sale, the township now has several high-rise projects offering 2, 3 and 4 bedroom flats. This page explains the main projects, the price ranges seen in recent listings, how installment plans usually work, and what to confirm in writing before you book.\",\"html\":\"<p>Naya Nazimabad is a gated, master-planned township covering roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road in Karachi, approximately 2 km from North Nazimabad. It is developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). The township offers community facilities, including the Gymkhana, Jama Masjid, Ali Habib Medical Center and a cricket stadium. For buyers comparing flats for sale in Naya Nazimabad, the main appeal is apartment living within a secure, well-planned community rather than a standalone tower on a busy main road.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Facts: Apartments in Naya Nazimabad<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>This table summarises the key details available on the township\'s project pages and recent property listings.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n  <tbody><tr>\\r\\n    <th>Detail<\\/th>\\r\\n    <th>Information<\\/th>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments, plus duplexes in selected towers<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Common Layouts<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>2 bed lounge, 2 bed DD, 3 bed lounge<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Typical Sizes<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Approximately 900 to 1,960 sq. ft., depending on the tower<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Listed Prices<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>2 bed: approximately PKR 1.35 to 2.15 crore; 3 bed: approximately PKR 2 to 3.3 crore<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Payment<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Installment plans of approximately 4 to 6 years are mentioned in listings<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <tr>\\r\\n    <td>Status<\\/td>\\r\\n    <td>Ready, under-construction and pre-launch units<\\/td>\\r\\n  <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Prices vary depending on the tower, floor, view and payment plan. These figures should be treated as general market estimates rather than confirmed prices.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Main Apartment Projects in Naya Nazimabad<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Peace Apartments<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Peace Apartments features high-rise towers offering 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments. Facilities include reserved parking and an amenities floor with a gym, community hall, library and gaming room.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Signature Tower<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Located in Block A, next to the Gymkhana, Signature Tower offers 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments and duplexes. The tower is open on four sides and includes corner apartments.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Rahat Residency<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Rahat Residency is a single-tower project offering park-facing 2 bedroom DD apartments, with car and bike parking for each unit.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Globe Residency<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Globe Residency offers 2 and 3 bedroom DD apartments. Some units are listed as ready for possession, while others are available through installment plans.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Stadium View Residencia<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>This project offers 2 bed lounge and 3 bed lounge apartments with views of the Naya Nazimabad Cricket Stadium. Commercial spaces are also available below the residential floors.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Grace Tower<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Grace Tower is a mixed-use development in the Business Enclave, featuring residential apartments above ground-floor retail shops.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Property availability changes frequently, so buyers should confirm which units are currently available before arranging a visit.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Apartment Sizes and Layouts<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Most apartments in Naya Nazimabad follow a few common layouts, depending on the project and tower.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li><strong>2 bed lounge or 2 bed DD:<\\/strong> Approximately 900 to 1,500 sq. ft.<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li><strong>3 bed lounge or 3 bed DD:<\\/strong> Approximately 1,250 to 1,960 sq. ft.<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li><strong>4 bed and duplex units:<\\/strong> Available in selected towers, including Peace Apartments and Signature Tower.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Many residential towers offer features such as natural light, ventilation, reserved parking, lifts and standby generators. Corner, park-facing and road-facing apartments may also command higher prices.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Payment Plans<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Recent property listings indicate that Naya Nazimabad apartment prices start at approximately PKR 1.35 crore for smaller 2 bedroom lounge units and can exceed PKR 3 crore for larger 3 bedroom apartments.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Several projects advertise installment plans ranging from approximately four to six years. These plans generally include an initial booking amount and monthly installments, with a possible possession payment at the time of handover.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Rates per square foot also vary depending on the project, apartment floor and location within the tower. Buyers comparing Naya Nazimabad apartments on installments should request a complete payment schedule in writing, covering:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li>Initial booking amount<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Monthly installment amounts and payment dates<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Possession charges, if applicable<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Development and other additional charges<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Total apartment price<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Checks Before You Book<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before booking an apartment in Naya Nazimabad, buyers should complete the following checks:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li>Confirm the exact tower, floor and apartment number. Request the official unit schedule and floor plan.<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Compare the quoted price with the developer\'s official project information or sales office.<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Request the complete payment schedule, including possession and development charges.<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Verify the relevant approvals and expected handover date for the specific tower.<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Make payments only through traceable banking channels and obtain written receipts.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Final Thoughts<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Naya Nazimabad apartments for sale offer buyers a choice of 2, 3 and 4 bedroom flats within a gated residential community. With multiple apartment projects, different layouts, varying views and flexible payment options, buyers can compare properties according to their budget and requirements.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before exploring other flats for sale in Karachi, visit the shortlisted towers, compare at least two or three projects, and obtain the final apartment price, payment plan and expected handover date in writing. This will help you make a more informed property investment decision.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\"}', '2026-11-17 09:06:43', '2026-11-17 09:16:20'),
(1527, 186, 'communities', 'Community / Project Cards', 3, 1, 1, '{\"heading\":\"Projects\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"selected_ids\":[68,72,70,73],\"project_ids\":[68,72,70,73],\"items\":[{\"id\":68,\"name\":\"Peace Apartments\",\"location\":\"Naya Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"price\":\"\",\"delivery\":\"\",\"developer\":\"Arif Habib Group\",\"paymentPlan\":\"Flexible Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/peace-apartments\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794827760_6afae5f03980b.jpg\"},{\"id\":72,\"name\":\"Globe Residency\",\"location\":\"Naya Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"price\":\"\",\"delivery\":\"\",\"developer\":\"Javedan Corporation Limited\",\"paymentPlan\":\"Flexible Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/globe-residency\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794834328_6afaff98cac32.jpg\"},{\"id\":70,\"name\":\"Signature Tower\",\"location\":\"Naya Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"price\":\"\",\"delivery\":\"\",\"developer\":\"Javedan Corporation Limited\",\"paymentPlan\":\"Flexible Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/signature-tower\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794829854_6afaee1e1fb1c.jpg\"},{\"id\":73,\"name\":\"Stadium View Residencia\",\"location\":\"Naya Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"price\":\"\",\"delivery\":\"\",\"developer\":\"Ashaab Builders & Developers\",\"paymentPlan\":\"Flexible Payment Plan\",\"href\":\"\\/stadium-view-residencia\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1794898151_6afbf8e734ace.jpg\"}],\"unselected_ids\":[76,75,74,71,69,67,66,65,64,63,62,61,60,59,58,57,56,55,54,53,52,51,50,49,48,47,46,45,44,43,42,41,40,39,38,37,36,35,34]}', '2026-11-17 09:06:43', '2026-11-17 09:16:39'),
(1528, 186, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"1. What is the price of apartments in Naya Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"Recent listings show 2 bedroom apartments from roughly PKR 1.35 to 2.15 crore and 3 bedroom apartments from roughly PKR 2 to 3.3 crore. The price depends on the tower, floor, size and view.\"},{\"q\":\"2. Which are the main apartment projects in Naya Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"Projects include Peace Apartments, Signature Tower, Rahat Residency, Globe Residency, Stadium View Residencia and Grace Tower.\"},{\"q\":\"3. How many bedrooms do Naya Nazimabad apartments have?\",\"a\":\"Apartments are offered with 2, 3 and 4 bedrooms, and some towers also offer duplexes. Common layouts are 2 bed lounge, 2 bed DD and 3 bed lounge.\"},{\"q\":\"4. What size are apartments in Naya Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"Listings show sizes from about 900 sq. ft for a 2 bed lounge to about 1,960 sq. ft for a large 3 bed. Sizes differ by tower, so confirm them on the unit schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"5. Can I buy Naya Nazimabad apartments on installments?\",\"a\":\"Yes. Several projects and listings mention installment plans of about four to six years. The terms differ by project, so get the full schedule in writing before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"6. Are there ready apartments in Naya Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"Some units are listed as ready for possession, while others are under construction or at the pre-launch stage. Confirm the possession date for your specific unit in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"7. What amenities do Naya Nazimabad apartments offer?\",\"a\":\"Depending on the tower, the township\\u2019s project pages list reserved parking, lifts, a standby generator, a gym, a community hall, a children\\u2019s play area and an amenities floor.\"},{\"q\":\"8. Are there park-facing or corner apartments in Naya Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"Yes. Rahat Residency describes park-facing units, and Signature Tower describes corner apartments with parks on two sides. These units are often priced higher.\"},{\"q\":\"9. Are there shops or commercial units in Naya Nazimabad towers?\",\"a\":\"Yes. Some towers, such as Grace Tower and Stadium View Residencia, include retail shops or showrooms alongside apartments, and separate commercial towers are also listed.\"},{\"q\":\"10. How do I choose the right apartment in Naya Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"Compare two or three towers on size, view, parking, payment plan and handover date. Visit the site, ask for the unit schedule and floor plan, and verify every figure with the developer before paying.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-17 09:06:43', '2026-11-17 09:16:20'),
