(1539, 188, 'hero', 'Hero Banner & Form', 1, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Naya Nazimabad Plots for Sale\",\"subtitle\":null,\"badge\":null,\"bg_image\":\"\\/images\\/hero\\/slide-1.jpg\",\"bg_image_alt\":\"Naya Nazimabad Plots for Sale\",\"image_alt\":\"Naya Nazimabad Plots for Sale\"}', '2026-11-17 10:54:54', '2026-11-17 11:14:10'),
(1540, 188, 'content', 'Content', 2, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"For buyers searching for Naya Nazimabad plots for sale, the township offers residential plots in 120, 160, 240 and 400 square yard sizes across several blocks. This page explains the sizes, the price ranges seen in recent listings, how blocks and plot positions affect the price, and what to confirm in writing before you pay.\",\"html\":\"<p>Naya Nazimabad is a gated, master-planned township covering roughly 1,300 acres near Manghopir Road in Karachi, approximately 2 km from North Nazimabad. It is developed by Javedan Corporation Limited (Arif Habib Group). The township\'s website lists community facilities such as the Gymkhana, Jama Masjid, Ali Habib Medical Center and a cricket stadium. A residential plot in Naya Nazimabad gives buyers the opportunity to build a home according to their own design within a secure community featuring planned roads and parks.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Facts: Plots in Naya Nazimabad<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>This table summarises the key details available in recent listings for plots for sale in Naya Nazimabad.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n<tbody><tr>\\r\\n<th>Detail<\\/th>\\r\\n<th>Information<\\/th>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Naya Nazimabad, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Plot Sizes<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>120, 160, 240 and 400 sq. yards<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Blocks Seen in Listings<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>A, C, D, M and N, along with other blocks in the township<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Road Widths Mentioned<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>30 ft to 40 ft and wider in some blocks<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Plot Positions<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Standard, corner, double corner, west-open and park-facing<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Typical Use<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Residential, subject to the society\'s approved building plan<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<tr>\\r\\n<td>Listed Prices<\\/td>\\r\\n<td>Approximately PKR 1.4 crore for a 120 sq. yard plot in newer blocks to PKR 2.8 crore in Block A<\\/td>\\r\\n<\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Plot prices vary depending on the block, size, road width and location within the block. These figures should be treated as general market estimates rather than confirmed selling prices.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Plot Sizes and Price Ranges<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Recent listings and area price guides indicate the following asking prices for residential plots in Naya Nazimabad:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><strong>120 sq. yard plots:<\\/strong> Approximately PKR 1.4 to 2.8 crore, depending on the block and plot position.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>160 sq. yard plots:<\\/strong> Approximately PKR 1.4 to 2.6 crore, according to area price guides.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>240 sq. yard plots:<\\/strong> Approximately PKR 1.55 to 3.6 crore, according to area price guides.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>400 sq. yard plots:<\\/strong> Approximately PKR 3.25 to 4.5 crore, according to area price guides.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Individual property listings may fall outside these price ranges. Buyers should compare multiple plots of similar sizes and positions within the same block before making a decision.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Plots by Block<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Recent listings for residential plots in Naya Nazimabad cover several blocks, with different price ranges and location advantages.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Block A<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Block A features premium 120 sq. yard residential plots, with one recent listing quoting an asking price of approximately PKR 2.8 crore.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Block D<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Block D offers 120 sq. yard plots along 40 ft roads. Recent listings include west-open and double-corner plots priced at approximately PKR 2.55 crore.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Block M<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>A 120 sq. yard west-open residential plot in Block M has been listed at approximately PKR 1.52 crore, with a 30 ft road.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Block N<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Block N features 120 sq. yard residential plots listed at approximately PKR 1.38 crore. Some listings describe plots near the main entrance, with possession expected soon.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Block C<\\/h3>\\r\\n<p>Block C offers residential plots in different sizes and locations, with some listings highlighting their convenient positioning within the township.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Newer blocks are generally advertised at lower prices than more developed areas. However, buyers should verify the development status, possession availability and expected completion dates directly with the relevant society office.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>What Affects the Price of a Plot?<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Several factors influence the asking price of a residential plot in Naya Nazimabad.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><strong>Block and Development Status:<\\/strong> More established blocks are generally priced higher than newer or less developed areas.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Plot Position:<\\/strong> Corner, double-corner, west-open and park-facing plots often carry higher asking prices than standard plots.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Road Width:<\\/strong> Plots located on 40 ft roads are generally listed at higher prices than comparable plots on 30 ft roads.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Dues and Possession:<\\/strong> Fully paid plots and properties with possession available may have different asking prices from plots with outstanding payments or pending possession.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Building on Your Plot<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Residential plots in Naya Nazimabad must comply with the building plans and regulations established by the society. Before purchasing a plot, buyers should contact the society office to understand the applicable construction requirements.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Important building regulations to confirm include:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Permitted covered area and plot coverage limits<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Maximum number of floors allowed<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Required front, rear and side setbacks<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Approved building design and architectural requirements<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Construction approval and plan submission process<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Applicable construction fees and other charges<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Understanding these requirements before purchasing can help ensure that your proposed home design, construction plans and overall budget comply with the society\'s regulations.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Checks Before You Buy<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before purchasing a residential plot in Naya Nazimabad, complete the following checks to protect your investment:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Confirm that the seller is the registered owner and verify that the plot file and ownership documents are genuine and complete.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Check the allotment, possession and transfer status with the relevant society office.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Confirm that all outstanding dues have been paid and request written proof of payments.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Verify the exact block, plot number, plot size, road width and position through an on-site visit.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Check whether the plot is ready for possession and construction.<\\/li>\\r\\n<li>Make payments only through traceable banking channels and obtain written receipts for every transaction.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Final Thoughts<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Naya Nazimabad plots for sale offer buyers an opportunity to build their own homes within a gated residential community. With different plot sizes, residential blocks, locations and price ranges, buyers can select a property according to their construction requirements and budget.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Before comparing other plots for sale in Karachi, visit your shortlisted blocks, inspect the plot location, verify the ownership and possession documents, and obtain the final price and payment terms in writing. Proper research and verification can help you make a more informed property investment decision.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"<p><br><\\/p>\"}', '2026-11-17 10:54:54', '2026-11-17 11:14:10'),
(1541, 188, 'communities', 'Community / Project Cards', 3, 1, 1, '{\"heading\":\"Projects\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"selected_ids\":[],\"project_ids\":[],\"items\":[],\"unselected_ids\":[76,75,74,73,72,71,70,69,68,67,66,65,64,63,62,61,60,59,58,57,56,55,54,53,52,51,50,49,48,47,46,45,44,43,42,41,40,39,38,37,36,35,34]}', '2026-11-17 10:54:54', '2026-11-17 11:14:21'),
(1542, 188, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"1. What is the price of a plot in Naya Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"Recent listings show 120 yard plots from roughly PKR 1.4 to 2.8 crore, depending on the block. Larger plots cost more, and the price also depends on the road width and position.\"},{\"q\":\"2. What plot sizes are available in Naya Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"Plots are available in 120, 160, 240 and 400 square yard sizes.\"},{\"q\":\"3. In which blocks are plots for sale in Naya Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"Recent listings come from Blocks A, C, D, M and N, and the township has other blocks as well.\"},{\"q\":\"4. Which block has the cheapest plots in Naya Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"Newer blocks such as M and N are listed at lower prices than established ones such as A and D, but prices change, so compare current listings.\"},{\"q\":\"5. Why are corner and west-open plots more expensive?\",\"a\":\"Corner and west-open plots offer extra light, ventilation and frontage, so they are often listed at higher asking prices. The final price is negotiated with the seller.\"},{\"q\":\"6. Can I build a house of my choice on a plot in Naya Nazimabad?\",\"a\":\"You can build your own design, but it must follow the building plan and rules set by the society. Confirm the rules with the society office before you design.\"},{\"q\":\"7. Are plots in Naya Nazimabad available on installments?\",\"a\":\"Most plots listed for resale are sold with agreed payment terms between buyer and seller. Ask for any installment option in writing, and confirm what has already been paid to the society.\"},{\"q\":\"8. What does \\u201call paid\\u201d mean for a plot?\",\"a\":\"It usually means the seller has cleared the dues for the plot. Buyers should ask for written proof from the society office rather than rely on the listing.\"},{\"q\":\"9. What documents should I check before buying a plot?\",\"a\":\"Check the owner\\u2019s identity, the allotment and plot documents, the transfer status with the society office, and any pending dues. Verify every document independently before paying.\"},{\"q\":\"10. Is a plot in Naya Nazimabad suitable for building a family home?\",\"a\":\"It suits buyers who want to build their own home in a gated community. Compare blocks, road widths and plot positions, and confirm the building rules and possession status before deciding.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-17 10:54:54', '2026-11-17 11:14:10'),
