(1596, 193, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Beach Terraces by Metro Group\",\"description\":\"Beach Terraces by Metro is a residential high-rise at HMR Waterfront, DHA Phase 8, Zone D, Karachi (Plot 12), described as a Ground + 39 floor tower. Project material names Metro Group Builders and Developers as the developer, and lists 1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments with private plunge pools and sea views. Prices, plans and handover are quoted in project material and may change, so buyers should confirm them directly with the developer before booking.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795004106_6afd96caa5a9f.webp\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-18 12:01:57', '2026-11-18 12:15:06'),
(1597, 193, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Beach Terraces Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"The project material mentions the following features: A full amenity schedule has not been confirmed here, so buyers should request it from the developer.\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Private plunge pool in every unit\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"Gymnasium and fitness centre\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"Swimming pool and infinity pool\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"Steam room\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"Sky viewing deck\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"Clubhouse with lounge seating\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"Community hall\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"Children\\u2019s play area\",\"icon\":null}]}', '2026-11-18 12:01:57', '2026-11-18 12:15:06'),
(1598, 193, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Beach Terraces Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795004106_6afd96caa85a5.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795004106_6afd96caa87d4.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795004106_6afd96caa8970.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"},{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795004106_6afd96caa8a4c.webp\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-18 12:01:57', '2026-11-18 12:15:06'),
(1599, 193, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>Beach Terraces is positioned for buyers who want a resort-style apartment with a private plunge pool inside a gated waterfront community in DHA Phase 8. The project offers partial and full sea views, large terraces and west-open units, with amenities placed on the same floor for easy access.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Because the available information comes from project material rather than a single published price list, buyers should treat prices, sizes and plans as subject to change and confirm them with the developer before making a payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Key Project Highlights<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n    <tbody><tr>\\r\\n        <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n        <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Metro Group Builders and Developers (as named in project material)<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Residential apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Building<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Ground + 39 floors<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Price Range (quoted)<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>From about PKR 3.45 crore to over PKR 20 crore, subject to change<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Quoted as December 2030, confirm with developer<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Plot 12, HMR Waterfront, Zone D, DHA Phase 8, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>5-year flexible plan quoted (about 50 months), confirm with developer<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n        <td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n        <td>Waterfront high-rise living<\\/td>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n<\\/tbody><\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Beach Terraces is part of the wider HMR Waterfront community. The tower is described as Ground + 39 floors, with amenities placed on the same floor for easy access. The tower layout and the number of units should be confirmed through the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Apartments in Beach Terraces<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Project material shows the following layouts, with a private plunge pool in each unit:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li><strong>1 bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> About 1,079 to 1,292 sq. ft, with partial sea views, quoted from about PKR 3.45 to 4.8 crore.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li><strong>2 bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> About 1,265 sq. ft and larger, quoted from about PKR 4.34 crore, with partial and full sea view options.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li><strong>3 bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> About 2,345 to 2,897 sq. ft, quoted from about PKR 8.9 to 11 crore.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li><strong>4 bedroom apartments:<\\/strong> About 3,641 to 5,513 sq. ft, quoted from about PKR 13.8 to 20.9 crore.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Quoted sizes and prices differ between sources, so buyers seeking apartments for sale in Beach Terraces should request the official unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Floor Plan<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No floor plan is published in the material reviewed here. Buyers should request the floor plan for each unit category from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel, together with the unit schedule.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Price and Booking Status<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Quoted prices range from about PKR 3.45 crore for a 1 bedroom apartment to over PKR 20 crore for a large 4 bedroom unit, depending on size, floor and view. These are not an official developer price list.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should request the following before booking:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n    <li>A written and updated price list.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>A detailed list of all additional charges.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>An official payment plan.<\\/li>\\r\\n    <li>A verified booking receipt.<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Do not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Beach Terraces are published in the material reviewed here. Some listings make approval claims, but these are unverified. Buyers should ask the developer for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h3>Possession Timeline<\\/h3>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The quoted handover date is December 2030. This is an expected date, and buyers should confirm the date for their unit in writing before relying on it.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-18 12:01:57', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1600, 193, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Beach Terraces Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"Project material quotes a five-year flexible payment plan, and one listing for a 2 bedroom unit mentions a 50-month plan. Plans differ by unit, so buyers should get the booking amount, installment schedule, any possession payments and the total price in writing from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel.\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-18 12:01:57', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
