(1603, 193, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Beach Terraces located?\",\"a\":\"Beach Terraces is located at Plot 12, HMR Waterfront, Zone D, DHA Phase 8, Karachi. Buyers should confirm the exact tower location with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Beach Terraces price?\",\"a\":\"Quoted prices range from about PKR 3.45 crore for a 1 bedroom apartment to over PKR 20 crore for a large 4 bedroom unit. Buyers should request a written rate sheet from the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms in Beach Terraces?\",\"a\":\"The tower offers 1, 2, 3 and 4 bedroom apartments. Sizes should be confirmed on the unit schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Beach Terraces payment plan?\",\"a\":\"A five-year flexible plan (about 50 months) is quoted. Buyers should get the full schedule in writing before paying any amount.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Beach Terraces NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"No project-specific approval documents are published in the material reviewed here. Buyers should ask the developer for the NOC and approval details and verify them with the relevant authority.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Beach Terraces?\",\"a\":\"Metro Group Builders and Developers is named as the developer in project material. Buyers should confirm this directly with the company.\"},{\"q\":\"Do all Beach Terraces apartments have a plunge pool?\",\"a\":\"Project material states that every unit has a private plunge pool. Buyers should confirm this for the specific unit they are buying.\"},{\"q\":\"How many floors does Beach Terraces have?\",\"a\":\"The tower is described as Ground + 39 floors. Buyers should confirm the floor count with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"When is the Beach Terraces handover date?\",\"a\":\"The quoted handover date is December 2030. Buyers should confirm the date for their unit in writing.\"},{\"q\":\"Why consider Beach Terraces DHA Phase 8?\",\"a\":\"It may suit buyers who want a waterfront apartment with a private plunge pool in a gated community, with a long payment plan. The sensible step is to verify the price, payment plan, handover date and approvals with the developer before booking.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-18 12:01:57', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
