(1680, 200, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Clifton Icon Location in Clifton Block 9 Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks and Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Do Talwar\",\"time\":\"2 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Ocean Mall\",\"time\":\"2 minutes\"},{\"name\":\"Emerald Tower\",\"time\":\"1 minute\"},{\"name\":\"Clifton Block 9\",\"time\":\"0\\u20132 minutes\"}]}],\"subtitle\":\"The location provides access to some of Clifton\'s established residential, commercial and recreational destinations. Its position within Block 9 makes it relevant for buyers who prefer an urban residential address with nearby shopping, dining and business facilities.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795082191_6afec7cf2af5e.jpg\"}', '2026-11-19 09:45:19', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1681, 200, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"What is Clifton Icon price?\",\"a\":\"Recent property advertisements quote approximately PKR 5.4 crore to PKR 5.7 crore for selected 3 bedroom apartments and PKR 6.5 crore to PKR 8.5 crore for selected 4 bedroom apartments. Prices depend on the unit, floor, view and payment status. Buyers should confirm the latest rate directly with the authorised sales channel.\"},{\"q\":\"How many bedrooms are available in Clifton Icon?\",\"a\":\"Clifton Icon is marketed with 3 and 4 bedroom luxury apartments. Buyers should confirm the available unit categories and layouts before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"What is the size of Clifton Icon apartments?\",\"a\":\"Selected 3 bedroom apartments are advertised at approximately 2,000 sq. ft., while selected 4 bedroom apartments are advertised at approximately 3,000 sq. ft. Actual covered areas should be confirmed through the approved floor plans.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Clifton Icon payment plan?\",\"a\":\"Payment arrangements depend on the available apartment and the applicable sales terms. Buyers should request the current written schedule, including booking amount, down payment, installments and possession charges.\"},{\"q\":\"When is Clifton Icon possession?\",\"a\":\"Recent advertisements quote February\\u2013March 2027 as the expected possession period. This is an advertised timeline, not a confirmed guaranteed handover date. Buyers should obtain written confirmation from the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What amenities does Clifton Icon offer?\",\"a\":\"Advertised amenities include a swimming pool, gymnasium, Jacuzzi, children\'s play area, walking track, prayer area, covered parking and high-speed elevators. Buyers should confirm the final approved amenities schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Clifton Icon NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"The project\'s approval status should be independently verified. A Pakistan Information Commission order dated 24 February 2021 records a request for the project\'s approved building plan, building permission or NOC and Sale NOC. Buyers should obtain and verify the actual documents with the relevant authority before booking.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Clifton Icon a residential or commercial project?\",\"a\":\"Clifton Icon is marketed as a mixed-use development combining residential apartments with commercial shops and office spaces.\"},{\"q\":\"How many floors does Clifton Icon have?\",\"a\":\"Property advertisements report different building configurations and floor counts. Buyers should obtain the latest approved building plan to confirm the exact number of floors.\"},{\"q\":\"Does Clifton Icon offer sea-facing apartments?\",\"a\":\"Selected apartments are advertised with sea-facing and city-facing views. The actual view depends on the unit\'s floor level and orientation.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-19 09:45:19', '2026-11-20 12:56:45'),
(1682, 200, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"subtitle\":\"Explore residential opportunities at Clifton Icon, Clifton Block 9 Karachi. Contact our real estate advisory team for personalised guidance on available 3 and 4 bedroom apartments, current market prices, payment arrangements and construction updates.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795082191_6afec7cf2cb64.jpg\"}', '2026-11-19 09:45:19', '2026-11-20 12:56:45'),
