(1692, 202, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise by Al Ghafoor Group\",\"description\":\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise is a premium residential project by Al Ghafoor Group at Plot No. SF-14, Block B, North Nazimabad, Karachi. The official project page describes 4 and 5 room luxury apartments with contemporary layouts, set in a development that combines modern architecture, a well-connected location and community spaces. The project is shown as open for booking. Price, sizes, handover and approvals have not been published as text on the page, so buyers should confirm them directly with Al Ghafoor Group before booking.\",\"video_poster\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795089180_6afee31c8799c.jpg\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-19 11:23:08', '2026-11-19 11:53:00'),
(1693, 202, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"The official project page lists the following features:\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Landscaped Garden\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"Roftop multipurpose court\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"Roftop Cafeteria\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"High-speed elevators\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"Community Spaces\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"Controlled entry and exit points\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"24\\/7 reception and professional security staff\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"CCTV cameras\",\"icon\":null}]}', '2026-11-19 11:23:08', '2026-11-19 11:33:10'),
(1694, 202, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795089180_6afee31c88ffe.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-19 11:23:08', '2026-11-19 11:53:00'),
(1695, 202, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>Al Ghafoor Sky Rise is positioned for families who want a spacious apartment in the established neighbourhood of North Nazimabad, with facilities placed on the rooftop and on an elevated garden level. The project page highlights an iconic modern design, spacious apartments and a sophisticated lifestyle-oriented community.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source, and confirm sizes, prices and plans with the developer before making a payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n    <thead>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n            <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <\\/thead>\\r\\n    <tbody>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Developer<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Al Ghafoor Group<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Property Type<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Residential apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Unit Types<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>4 and 5 room luxury apartments<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Floor Plans<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>7 apartment types: Saffron, Sapphire, Scarlet, Emerald, Pearl, Coral and Aqua<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Total Land Size<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Not disclosed<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Handover<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Not published, confirm with developer<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Location<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Plot No. SF-14, Block B, North Nazimabad, Karachi<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Payment Plan<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Payment schedules published as images, confirm with developer<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n        <tr>\\r\\n            <td>Lifestyle<\\/td>\\r\\n            <td>Urban high-rise living<\\/td>\\r\\n        <\\/tr>\\r\\n    <\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The project page describes elevators serving every tower, so Al Ghafoor Sky Rise is planned as a multi-tower development. The number of towers, floors and units has not been published, so buyers should confirm the layout through the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Apartments in Al Ghafoor Sky Rise<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The official page lists 4 room and 5 room luxury apartments in seven layouts: Saffron, Sapphire, Scarlet, Emerald, Pearl, Coral and Aqua. Apartment sizes and bedroom counts are shown on the plan sheets and should be confirmed with the developer. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Al Ghafoor Sky Rise should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The official page publishes an internal floor plan for each of the seven apartment types, along with a payment schedule for each. Buyers should ask the developer\\u2019s sales team which layout matches their requirement, and request the latest unit schedule with the floor plan.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No separate price list is published as text on the official page, and pricing appears only in the payment schedule sheets. The project is shown as open for booking through the \\u201cBook Now\\u201d option. Buyers should request a written rate sheet, a list of all extra charges and a booking receipt, and should not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Al Ghafoor Sky Rise are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Al Ghafoor Group for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession date has been published on the project page. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer\\u2019s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-19 11:23:08', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1696, 202, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The official page publishes a payment schedule for each apartment type, but the figures appear only as images. The plans differ by layout, so buyers should ask which plan applies to their unit and get the booking amount, installment schedule, any possession payments and the total price in writing from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel. Any plan quoted by a third party should be treated as unverified.\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[]}', '2026-11-19 11:23:08', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1697, 202, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795089180_6afee31c8c0ed.jpg\",\"badge\":null}', '2026-11-19 11:23:08', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1698, 202, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise Location in North Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"subtitle\":\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise is located at Plot No. SF-14, Block B, North Nazimabad, Karachi. The page shows the project on a map, and describes it as a prime and well-connected location. Exact distances to nearby landmarks are not published, so buyers should confirm travel times and the site address with the developer before visiting.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795089180_6afee31c8d279.jpg\",\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks and Attractions\",\"items\":[]}]}', '2026-11-19 11:23:08', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1699, 202, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Al Ghafoor Sky Rise located?\",\"a\":\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise is located at Plot No. SF-14, Block B, North Nazimabad, Karachi. Buyers should confirm the exact address with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Al Ghafoor Sky Rise price?\",\"a\":\"No separate price list is published as text on the official page, and prices appear on the payment schedule sheets. Buyers should request a written rate sheet from Al Ghafoor Group.\"},{\"q\":\"How many rooms in Al Ghafoor Sky Rise?\",\"a\":\"The project offers 4 room and 5 room luxury apartments in seven layouts. Bedroom counts and sizes should be confirmed on the unit schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Al Ghafoor Sky Rise payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The official page publishes a payment schedule for each apartment type as an image. Buyers should get the full schedule in writing before paying any amount.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Al Ghafoor Sky Rise NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"No project-specific approval documents are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the NOC and approval details and verify them with the relevant authority.\"},{\"q\":\"What amenities does Al Ghafoor Sky Rise offer?\",\"a\":\"The official page lists an elevated landscaped garden with a jogging track, a rooftop multipurpose court, a rooftop cafeteria, high-speed elevators, and safety features such as 24\\/7 security, CCTV and fire safety systems.\"},{\"q\":\"What are the apartment types in Al Ghafoor Sky Rise?\",\"a\":\"The page lists seven layouts named Saffron, Sapphire, Scarlet, Emerald, Pearl, Coral and Aqua. Buyers should request the plan sheet for each layout.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Al Ghafoor Sky Rise open for booking?\",\"a\":\"The official page shows the project as open for booking. Buyers should confirm the current availability and booking terms with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Al Ghafoor Sky Rise?\",\"a\":\"Al Ghafoor Sky Rise is a project by Al Ghafoor Group.\"},{\"q\":\"Can overseas buyers book in Al Ghafoor Sky Rise?\",\"a\":\"Overseas buyers should deal only through the developer\\u2019s authorised channels and should not send funds against unverified offers.\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-19 11:23:08', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1700, 202, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"Register your interest in Al Ghafoor Sky Rise North Nazimabad. Contact our advisory team for personalised guidance on Al Ghafoor Sky Rise, the current unit availability and private updates. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale in Al Ghafoor Sky Rise or want to buy a flat in Al Ghafoor Sky Rise Karachi, our consultants can keep you informed as verified details are released.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795089180_6afee31c8eb36.jpg\"}', '2026-11-19 11:23:08', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
