(1715, 204, 'highlights', 'Project Highlights', 2, 1, 0, '{\"items\":[{\"key\":\"highlight_0\",\"icon\":null,\"label\":\"Developer\",\"value\":\"Al Ghafoor Group\"},{\"key\":\"highlight_new_1795154598038\",\"icon\":null,\"label\":\"Launch Price\",\"value\":\"PKR 1.32 Crore\"},{\"key\":\"highlight_new_1795154598877\",\"icon\":null,\"label\":\"Handover Date\",\"value\":\"June 2029\"},{\"key\":\"highlight_new_1795154599439\",\"icon\":null,\"label\":\"Property Type\",\"value\":\"Luxury apartment\"},{\"key\":\"highlight_new_1795154600061\",\"icon\":null,\"label\":\"Bedrooms\",\"value\":\"5 and 6 Bedrooms\"}],\"highlight_0\":\"Al Ghafoor Group\",\"highlight_new_1795154598038\":\"PKR 1.32 Crore\",\"highlight_new_1795154598877\":\"June 2029\",\"highlight_new_1795154599439\":\"Luxury apartment\",\"highlight_new_1795154600061\":\"5 and 6 Bedrooms\"}', '2026-11-20 06:02:41', '2026-11-20 12:56:03'),
(1716, 204, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"Al Ghafoor Empire is a premium residential project by Al Ghafoor Group at Plot # D-12, Block A, North Nazimabad, Karachi. The official project page describes 5 and 6 room luxury apartments with contemporary layouts, corner apartments with expansive open views, and limited residences per floor for privacy. The project is shown as on booking. Price, sizes, handover and approvals have not been published as text on the page, so buyers should confirm them directly with Al Ghafoor Group before booking.\",\"video_poster\":\"\",\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-20 06:02:41', '2026-11-20 12:56:05'),
(1717, 204, 'amenities', 'Amenities & Facilities', 4, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Al Ghafoor Empire Amenities\",\"subtitle\":\"The official project page lists the following features:\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Rooftop recreation area\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"Corner apartments\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"High-speed elevators\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"Backup power generation\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"Dedicated prayer areas\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"Controlled entry and exit points\",\"icon\":null},{\"name\":\"Secure covered parking\",\"icon\":null}]}', '2026-11-20 06:02:41', '2026-11-20 13:06:23'),
(1718, 204, 'gallery', 'Project Gallery', 5, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Al Ghafoor Empire Project Gallery\",\"images\":[{\"src\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795157631_6affee7f9617a.jpg\",\"category\":\"Exterior\",\"alt\":\"Project Photo\"}]}', '2026-11-20 06:02:41', '2026-11-20 06:53:51'),
(1719, 204, 'content', 'Content', 7, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"\",\"intro\":\"\",\"html\":\"<p>Al Ghafoor Empire is positioned for larger families who want a spacious apartment in the established neighbourhood of North Nazimabad, with recreation placed on the rooftop and in an elevated garden. The project page highlights an iconic modern design, a prime and well-connected location, and landscaped surroundings.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should treat the official project page as the primary source and confirm sizes, prices, and plans with the developer before making a payment.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Key Project Highlights<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<table>\\r\\n  <thead>\\r\\n    <tr>\\r\\n      <th>Feature<\\/th>\\r\\n      <th>Details<\\/th>\\r\\n    <\\/tr>\\r\\n  <\\/thead>\\r\\n  <tbody>\\r\\n    <tr><td>Developer<\\/td><td>Al Ghafoor Group<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr><td>Property Type<\\/td><td>Residential apartments<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr><td>Unit Types<\\/td><td>5 and 6 room luxury apartments<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr><td>Layouts<\\/td><td>4 apartment types: Signature A, Signature B, Prestige, Elite<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr><td>Total Land Size<\\/td><td>Not disclosed<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr><td>Handover<\\/td><td>Not published; confirm with developer<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr><td>Location<\\/td><td>Plot # D-12, Block A, North Nazimabad, Karachi<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr><td>Payment Plan<\\/td><td>Payment schedules published as images; confirm with developer<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n    <tr><td>Status<\\/td><td>On booking<\\/td><\\/tr>\\r\\n  <\\/tbody>\\r\\n<\\/table>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Master Plan and Development Framework<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The project page describes high-speed elevators serving every tower, so Al Ghafoor Empire is planned as a multi-tower development. The number of towers, floors, and units has not been published, so buyers should confirm the layout through the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Apartments in Al Ghafoor Empire<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The official page lists 5 room and 6 room luxury apartments in four layouts: Signature A, Signature B, Prestige, and Elite. Apartment sizes and bedroom counts are shown on the plan sheets and should be confirmed with the developer.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The page says that apartments are corner units with open views and that only a limited number of residences are planned per floor. Buyers seeking apartments for sale in Al Ghafoor Empire should request the official unit schedule, since availability changes.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Floor Plan<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The official page publishes a type plan for each of the four layouts, along with a payment schedule for each. Buyers should ask the developer\\u2019s sales team which layout matches their requirement and request the latest unit schedule with the floor plan.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Price and Booking Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No separate price list is published as text on the official page, and pricing appears only in the payment schedule sheets. The project is shown as on booking through the \\u201cBook Now\\u201d option.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Buyers should request the following before booking:<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n  <li>A written rate sheet<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>A list of all additional charges<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>An official booking receipt<\\/li>\\r\\n  <li>Confirmation of payment terms from the developer<\\/li>\\r\\n<\\/ul>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Do not pay any amount to an unverified agent.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>NOC and Approval Status<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No NOC or approval documents for Al Ghafoor Empire are published on the project page. Buyers should ask Al Ghafoor Group for the approval documents and verify them with the relevant authority before booking.<\\/p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<h2>Possession Timeline<\\/h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>No possession date has been published on the project page. Buyers should rely only on dates given in the developer\\u2019s official documentation and get the handover date for their unit in writing.<\\/p>\",\"body\":\"\"}', '2026-11-20 06:02:41', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1720, 204, 'payment_plan', 'Payment Plan', 8, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Al Ghafoor Empire Payment Plan\",\"description\":\"The official page publishes a payment schedule for each apartment type, but the figures appear only as images. The plans differ by layout, so buyers should ask which plan applies to their unit and get the booking amount, installment schedule, any possession payments and the total price in writing from the developer\\u2019s authorised sales channel. Any plan quoted by a third party should be treated as unverified.\",\"down_payment\":\"\",\"during_construction\":\"\",\"on_handover\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"rows\":[],\"breakdown\":[],\"plan_images\":[],\"images\":[]}', '2026-11-20 06:02:41', '2026-11-20 12:56:05'),
(1721, 204, 'master_plan', 'Master Plan', 9, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Al Ghafoor Empire Master Plan\",\"description\":\"\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795157631_6affee7f998e4.jpg\",\"badge\":\"\"}', '2026-11-20 06:02:41', '2026-11-20 12:56:05'),
(1722, 204, 'location', 'Location & Connectivity', 10, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Al Ghafoor Empire Location in North Nazimabad, Karachi\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[],\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Nearby Landmarks and Attractions\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Florence Family Park\",\"time\":\"2\\u20134 min\"},{\"name\":\"KDA Chowrangi\",\"time\":\"3\\u20135 min\"},{\"name\":\"The North Walk\",\"time\":\"4\\u20136 min\"},{\"name\":\"Dolmen Mall Hyderi\",\"time\":\"4\\u20137 min\"}]}],\"subtitle\":\"Al Ghafoor Empire is located at Plot # D-12, Block A, North Nazimabad, Karachi. The page shows the project on a map, and describes it as a prime and well-connected location. Exact distances to nearby landmarks are not published, so buyers should confirm travel times and the site address with the developer before visiting.\",\"image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795157631_6affee7f9aea1.jpg\"}', '2026-11-20 06:02:41', '2026-11-20 12:50:46'),
(1723, 204, 'faq', 'FAQ Accordion', 11, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"description\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Where is Al Ghafoor Empire located?\",\"a\":\"Al Ghafoor Empire is located at Plot # D-12, Block A, North Nazimabad, Karachi. Buyers should confirm the exact address with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Al Ghafoor Empire price?\",\"a\":\"No separate price list is published as text on the official page, and prices appear on the payment schedule sheets. Buyers should request a written rate sheet from Al Ghafoor Group.\"},{\"q\":\"How many rooms in Al Ghafoor Empire?\",\"a\":\"The project offers 5 room and 6 room luxury apartments in four layouts. Bedroom counts and sizes should be confirmed on the unit schedule.\"},{\"q\":\"What is Al Ghafoor Empire payment plan?\",\"a\":\"The official page publishes a payment schedule for each apartment type as an image. Buyers should get the full schedule in writing before paying any amount.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Al Ghafoor Empire NOC approved?\",\"a\":\"No project-specific approval documents are published on the project page. Buyers should ask the developer for the NOC and approval details and verify them with the relevant authority.\"},{\"q\":\"What amenities does Al Ghafoor Empire offer?\",\"a\":\"The official page lists an elevated landscaped garden with a jogging track, a rooftop cricket court, a rooftop recreation area, prayer areas, backup power, covered parking and visitor parking, along with 24\\/7 security and fire safety systems.\"},{\"q\":\"What are the apartment layouts in Al Ghafoor Empire?\",\"a\":\"The page lists four layouts named Signature A, Signature B, Prestige and Elite. Buyers should request the plan sheet for each layout.\"},{\"q\":\"Are all apartments in Al Ghafoor Empire corner apartments?\",\"a\":\"The page highlights corner apartments with expansive open views. Buyers should confirm the position and view of a specific unit with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Is Al Ghafoor Empire open for booking?\",\"a\":\"The official page shows the project as on booking. Buyers should confirm the current availability and booking terms with the developer.\"},{\"q\":\"Who is developing Al Ghafoor Empire?\",\"a\":\"Al Ghafoor Empire is a project by Al Ghafoor Group\"}],\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}', '2026-11-20 06:02:41', '2026-11-20 12:56:05'),
(1724, 204, 'contact', 'Contact & Booking CTA', 12, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"subtitle\":\"Register your interest in Al Ghafoor Empire North Nazimabad. Contact our advisory team for personalised guidance on Al Ghafoor Empire, the current unit availability and private updates. Whether you are exploring apartments for sale in Al Ghafoor Empire or want to buy a flat in Al Ghafoor Empire Karachi, our consultants can keep you informed as verified details are released.\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"pretitle\":\"LET\'S CONNECT\",\"heading\":\"Invest in Your Future\",\"form_small\":\"REQUEST\",\"form_large\":\"A CALL BACK\",\"submit_button\":\"REQUEST NOW\",\"bg_image\":\"\\/uploads\\/pages\\/1795157631_6affee7f9ca84.jpg\"}', '2026-11-20 06:02:41', '2026-11-20 12:56:05'),
