(1752, 208, 'about', 'About Community', 3, 1, 1, '{\"title\":\"Al Ghafoor Grande City by Al Ghafoor Group\",\"description\":\"Al Ghafoor Grande City is a residential community by Al Ghafoor Group at Plot C-4, Sector 12, Surjani Town, Karachi, on 300 ft Road. The official project page describes 2, 3 and 4 room apartments, bungalows and cottages inside a fully walled community, and says that its facilities are already available. The project is shown as on booking. Price, sizes, handover and approvals have not been published as text on the page, so buyers should confirm them directly with Al Ghafoor Group before booking.\",\"video_poster\":null,\"video_src\":\"\"}', '2026-11-20 07:46:51', '2026-11-20 07:58:06'),
